window.CULTIVATION_CHAPTERS=(window.CULTIVATION_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1501,"title":"Chapter 1501 Yuan’s Room","paragraphs":["1501 Yuan's Room","When Wu Zao noticed the weird expression on Yan Xiaoxiao's face, he smiled and said, \"Even though we know we won't ever win, we still benefit a lot from our losses because he doesn't just spar with us. He trains us at the same time. You should give it a try later.\"","\"You want me to spar with Yuan?\" Yan Xiaoxiao wore a look of disbelief on her pretty face.","\"Why not? You're already here. Might as well get the full experience.\" Wu Zao chuckled.","Yuan smiled at this idea and agreed, \"Don't worry, it won't hurt that much.\"","\"So it'll still hurt!\" she exclaimed.","She took a deep breath and sighed, \"But you're right. I might as well get the full experience. What better way of knowing someone than to exchange blows with them?\"","Yuan and Wu Zao began their spar shortly after, with Yan Xiaoxiao capturing every moment—or at least trying to.","'He's moving too fast for me!' Yan Xiaoxiao cried inwardly. In the end, she gave up trying to follow Yuan's movements and focused on Wu Zao, who was desperately trying to defend against Yuan's relentless attacks.","The spar was one-sided, with Wu Zao barely able to do anything at first. However, Wu Zao quickly adapted and improved, allowing him to fight Yuan to a reasonable degree.","Unbeknownst to Yan Xiaoxiao, Wu Zao was being lectured by Yuan through divine sense as they fought.","Suddenly, a figure that didn't belong to either Yuan or Wu Zao appeared behind Yuan and tried to sneak attack him.","Ding!","Yuan casually blocked the sneak attack.","\"Damn it! I thought I finally got you this time!\" Wang Ming exclaimed before he was sent flying by Yuan's sword swing.","Yet, despite Wang Ming's random sneak attack that intruded on their spar, neither Yuan nor Wu Zao looked surprised or seemed bothered by it.","\"Huh? What's going on?\" Yan Xiaoxiao wore a puzzled look on her face.","\"You seem confused.\" Wang Bingbing suddenly appeared beside her and asked.","Seeing her nod, Wang Bingbing continued, \"This was encouraged by Yuan. He said that if anyone manages to sneak an attack on him successfully, he will reward that person with a powerful martial technique or spiritual weapon. Oh, we can only do this when he's in the training ground.\"","\"I see...\" Yan Xiaoxiao muttered.","\"Hey, let me join your spar!\" Wang Ming said after recovering from being thrown.","\"Sure.\" Yuan calmly nodded.","Thus, Wu Zao and Wang Ming started attacking Yuan together.","\"We can also try to take him down together. If we manage to defeat him, all of us will receive a reward.\" Wang Bingbing continued explaining.","\"I guess you haven't been able to defeat him yet?\" Yan Xiaoxiao said.","\"Nope, but I can feel that day getting close!\"","Wang Bingbing also joined Wu Zao and Wang Ming shortly later, making it a three-versus-one.","The rest of the Demon Sealing Faction members eventually joined the chaotic fight.","Chu Liuxiang was the last to show up and join the fight, turning it into a ten-versus-one spar.","Fighting so many talented individuals simultaneously while limiting himself to basic sword techniques was difficult even for Yuan, especially when Li Jinxi and her explosive growth joined the fray.","And since nobody there needed to worry about accidentally killing Yuan due to his heaven-defying regeneration ability, they were all able to go all out without holding anything back, fighting him as though their lives were on the line.","\"Heavens! Are they seriously trying to kill him?!\" Yan Xiaoxiao was terrified by what she was witnessing.","Each attack by the Demon Sealing Faction members exuded genuine killing intent, and they were all aiming for life-","threatening areas such as his neck and heart without any hesitation in their movements.","If a stranger were to stumble upon this scene without any context, they would undoubtedly think Yuan was being targeted by a group of seasoned killers.","However, despite their efforts and cooperation, Yuan defeated them and emerged victorious without a single injury to his body.","Considering the God of War's extensive fighting experience, it was only natural for him to dominate opponents who had barely twenty years of practice.","\"Oh, right. Wu Zao.\" Yuan suddenly called out to him as he lay on the ground from exhaustion.","\"Since you defeated the most players during the Faction War, you can receive the Ancient-rank technique. Do you have any specific techniques in mind?\"","\"I'd like a movement technique—something that will keep my opponents away from me.\"","Yuan nodded, \"Alright, I'll let you know when I find something suitable.\"","\"Thank you.\"","Yuan approached Yan Xiaoxiao after the spar.","\"I'm going to clean myself real quick. We can spar after the interview.\"","\"Okay! Can I have a look in your room later?\" she asked.","\"Sure. We're heading there, anyway.\"","They left the training ground while the others continued to train with each other.","As they approached Yuan's room, Yan Xiaoxiao could feel her heartbeat speeding up.","'Yuan's room! Yuan's room! I am going to enter Yuan's room!' she screamed internally.","\"It's nothing fancy, so don't expect much,\" Yuan said as he opened the door, revealing his room.","\"I won't take long.\" Yuan entered the bathroom shortly later, leaving Yan Xiaoxiao alone.","Not wanting to waste this opportunity, Yan Xiaoxiao stopped recording temporarily and retrieved her personal camera.","She proceeded to take selfies of herself in various areas in Yuan's room.","Sometime later, she turned to look at the bed and swallowed nervously.","'I really shouldn't do this, but... please forgive me for this!'","After positioning her camera and setting a timer, Yan Xiaoxiao entered the bed and began posing in various poses.","Click. Click. Click.","The camera took a picture every three seconds and didn't stop until an entire minute later.","Yan Xiaoxiao checked the results afterward and was incredibly satisfied.","\"This is definitely going into my collections!\" she giggled sheepishly.","Yuan came out of the bathroom feeling refreshed several minutes later to find Yan Xiaoxiao staring at her camera with a weird expression on her face."]},{"number":1502,"title":"Chapter 1502 End of the Interview","paragraphs":["1502 End of the Interview","\"I'm done,\" Yuan called out to Yan Xiaoxiao, startling her, who was absorbed with her new collection.","\"Eh?! Ah! Right!\" Yan Xiaoxiao hastily stowed away her personal camera and retrieved the one used for the interview.","After taking a moment to look through her notes, she asked, \"Do you have any specific goal you're chasing in Cultivation Online?\"","\"I wanted to explore the entire world of Cultivation Online when I first started. While that is true still, I have a different goal now—one that I am still trying to comprehend fully.\"","This goal was shared by all of his incarnations, so Yuan was certain that he would eventually have to face it even if he didn't know the details for now.","\"A goal you don't comprehend? Sounds complicated.\" Yan Xiaoxiao muttered.","She continued, \"What is the Demon Sealing Faction's relationship with the Eternal Lotuses? Rumors have been saying you fought the Fiery Locust Swarm for them.\"","\"We're in an alliance, and they were being bullied by the Fiery Locust Swarm, so I decided to teach them a lesson.\"","\"Oh?! Since when did you form the alliance with each other?!\" Yan Xiaoxiao's eyes flickered at his surprising news.","\"It was established only recently.\"","\"Since the Fiery Locust Swarm is under the Fiery Garden of Hell's command, is your challenge to the Fiery Garden of Hell related to the Eternal Lotuses?\"","\"No, my challenge to the Fiery Garden of Hell—or more specifically—Fiery Queen, has little to do with the Eternal Lotuses and is more personal.\"","\"I guess that confirms the rumor about you and the Fiery Queen being on bad terms. Can you tell us the reason?\" Yan Xiaoxiao asked.","\"It's nothing crazy. We had a little skirmish inside Cultivation Online. I wanted to keep our drama inside Cultivation Online, but she decided to involve my friends and family outside of Cultivation Online, so I am just responding to her provocation.\"","\"Is that so... then...\"","Time passed quickly, and it was noon before Yan Xiaoxiao was aware.","\"Okay, let's end it here. I have more than enough material to make several movies.\" Yan Xiaoxiao said with a satisfied smile.","During the interview, she asked Yuan over a hundred questions, most of which related to Cultivation Online.","\"Once again, thank you for giving me this opportunity to interview the Demon Sealing Faction!\" Yan Xiaoxiao bowed to him.","\"In the future, if there's a chance, I would like to interview your journey in Cultivation Online, too.\"","Yuan nodded, \"If there's ever an opportunity.\"","\"I will send you the interview first once I complete it. If there is anything you would like me to edit or remove, just let me know!\"","Yan Xiaoxiao stayed the night and joined them for breakfast the following day.","After breakfast, Yan Xiaoxiao went to the training ground to spar with Yuan.","Yan Xiaoxiao was only at the fifth level of Spirit Master, and she wielded a sword.","\"Please go easy on me,\" she said.","\"That's only natural. Otherwise, I would kill you in the blink of an eye.\" Yuan chuckled.","\"You know what I mean...\"","\"Then I'll assess your current level first. Come at me with everything you've got. You saw how the others sparred with me yesterday, right? Fight as if your life depends on it. Don't worry about hurting me because you won't be able to do so.\"","Hearing his provocative words at the end, Yan Xiaoxiao felt the urge to prove him wrong and quickly wore a serious expression on her face.","Once she was prepared, Yan Xiaoxiao lunged at Yuan and started attacking him with all of her power.","Yuan didn't say anything and either dodged or blocked her attacks for the first few minutes.","Once he fully understood Yan Xiaoxiao's strengths and weaknesses, he started lecturing her through divine sense, even demonstrating it through their spar.","Yan Xiaoxiao rarely engaged in combat and never had an instructor. Her inexperience was evident in her stiff and awkward movements.","'It's been a while since I last fought someone this inexperienced.' Yuan smiled inwardly.","Their spar ended quickly because Yan Xiaoxiao, despite going all out, didn't know how to utilize her energy properly and ended up wasting most of it.","\"You're a complete beginner... I didn't expect this.\" Yuan said afterward.","Yan Xiaoxiao showed an embarrassed smile and said, \"I enjoy cultivating, but I don't enjoy fighting.\"","\"It's okay to dislike fighting, but you should still prepare yourself for it. The world is becoming more dangerous, after all.\"","\"I understand. I'll start training more often now.\"","Sometime later, Yan Xiaoxiao said goodbye to the Demon Sealing Faction and left the Dragon Spiral Mountain.","\"Now that the interview is over, I'm going to return to Cultivation Online and start making my way to the Third Heaven,\" Yuan said to the others.","\"How long do you plan on staying down there?\" Shi Lang asked.","\"Not long. I am meeting up with Bai Lianhua to give her some things, that's all.\"","Chu Liuxiang then asked, \"What about us? Should we come with you?\"","\"You can stay in the Fourth Heaven and continue your training.\"","Later that night, Yuan followed Meixiu to her room to spend the night.","\"Yuan, is everything okay?\"","\"Do I look worried about something?\" Yuan raised his eyebrows in a puzzled manner.","\"Not worried, but you have something on your mind, especially when you look at me—at least that's how it feels to me.\"","She caressed his face and sighed, \"If there's anything you need to take off your chest, I am here.\"","Yuan didn't immediately answer, but after a moment of hesitation, he said in a low voice, \"I recalled all of the Evil God's memories.\"","\"All of it? How many years of experience is that?\" Meixiu stared at him with wide eyes.","\"Thousands and thousands of years of slaughter and atrocities... I don't even know where to begin...\"","\"I'm sorry... I want to understand, but I don't know how you feel, nor can I pretend to understand...\"Meixiu sighed, her heart heavy, knowing she couldn't assist him.","="]},{"number":1503,"title":"Chapter 1503 Xiu Mei","paragraphs":["?1503 Xiu Mei","Seeing Meixiu's beautiful face lying right next to him, Yuan pondered if he should tell her about her incarnation as Xiu Mei","—that they'd been together in their previous lives.","'Since Li Jinxi and Chu Liuxiang are already beginning to recall their past life memories, it wouldn't be weird if Meixiu is also doing the same...'","As far as he knew, Meixiu could've already recalled all of her memories and was simply waiting for him.","The reason he didn't outright tell Li Jinxi and Chu Liuxiang about their past lives was that he didn't want to force the memories upon them. Since they were already beginning to recall their pasts on their own, he saw no need to hasten the natural process, as it could potentially backfire.","After a moment of silence, Yuan spoke, \"During my life as the Evil God, I had a wife...\"","\"We've known each other and been together since childhood. We had a child. She was my everything, and her name was Xiu Mei. Unfortunately, I was unable to protect her, and she was murdered, along with our unborn child.\"","\"Because of her death, I went on a rampage and killed countless people, not to mention the atrocities I've committed. When I get the chance, I am going to apologize to her.\"","Meixiu felt a weird sensation in her chest when she heard the name Xiu Mei.","\"When you get the chance? I thought she passed away?\" Meixiu asked in a puzzled tone.","\"Reincarnation is not unique to me. Unless their soul is shattered, everyone who dies will eventually be reincarnated. The only difference between them and me is our ability to remember our past lives, and there are other people other than me who can remember their past.\"","\"There are others? How do you know that?\"","\"Because two of them live among us.\"","\"Huh? Who?\" Meixiu was surprised to hear this and immediately became curious.","\"Li Jinxi and Lulu, but they don't remember everything and are still in the process. They also don't know that I know, so keep this a secret for me until they decide to tell us.\"","Meixiu nodded and mumbled, \"So they also recall their past life... I wonder what my past life was like.\"","Yuan smiled and asked, \"Do you want to know?\"","\"Hm? You know my past life?\" she stared at him with wide eyes.","He silently acknowledged with a nod.","Meixiu swallowed nervously and spoke, \"Don't tell me... Xiu Mei...\"","\"What makes you think that?\" Yuan was slightly surprised by her intuition.","\"Just a feeling. I was right?\"","He nodded, \"Yes... you were my wife when I was still the Evil God.\"","Meixiu fell silent.","'To think things would turn out like this... is this a coincidence, or are we bound by fate?' she wondered inwardly, feeling blissful knowing that she was also with Yuan in their past life.","\"Are you okay?\" Yuan asked when she remained silent, wondering if it was too shocking for her.","\"Yes... I am just a little surprised by this information, and I'm not sure how to respond to it. However, I can say that I am very happy that you told me. Even if I might never remember it myself, I bet the time I spent with you was incredibly blissful. By the way, how do you know that it was my past life?\"","\"For starters, you look exactly the same as Xiu Mei. Moreover, those around me in this life seem to have a close connection with me in my past life.\"","\"Hm? Does this mean Lulu is also...?\"","\"Yes. Li Jinxi, too. However, they are not related to the Evil God but my other incarnations instead.\"","Meixiu wore a bewildered look on her face. This information shocked her more than her own reincarnation.","\"Exactly how many past lives have you lived?\" she couldn't help but ask.","\"I don't know, but I have memories of seven so far.\"","\"S-seven?! That's a lot!\"","\"If you consider how long this universe has existed, living seven lives isn't that shocking.\" Yuan chuckled.","\"Any questions?\"","After a moment of silence, she asked, \"What was our daily life like?\"","\"Before our marriage or after?\"","\"Both.\"","\"Then I'll start from when we first met. Prepare yourself since this will take the entire night.\"","Thus, Yuan spent the rest of the night recalling his memories with Xiu Mei to Meixiu.","Meixiu would ask questions here and there.","\"Was Xiu Mei on birth control pills? Why did it take so long for her to become pregnant?\"","\"Not that I was aware of. It's unlikely, though, since she was always excited to have a child. Also, things work differently for female cultivators in general when it comes to giving birth. Due to the spiritual energy in their body, not only is it harder to become pregnant, but the time it takes for the child to come out also differs. So, while a mortal typically gives birth after nine months of pregnancy, it could take years for a female cultivator to give birth. The difference is even larger for cultivators with a stronger cultivation.\"","\"Is that so...\" Meixiu muttered with a pondering look on her face.","\"Are you interested? In having a child...\" Yuan suddenly asked her.","\"Eh? N-no!\" Meixiu hastily responded before continuing, \"I mean... I don't particularly care. Do you want one? Considering that you never saw your child in your past life, I wouldn't be surprised if you have the desire for one. So... if you want one... I won't refuse...\"","Yuan chuckled, \"While it's true that I have the desire to have a child, that desire belongs to Tian Xian. As for myself... I still think I am too young for one, not to mention all of the ongoing changes in the world. Perhaps once everything settles down...\"","\"If you say so.\" Meixiu nodded.","The following day, Yuan returned to Cultivation Online. Meanwhile, Meixiu went to find Wang Xiuying.","\"How can I help you, Meixiu?\"","\"You're an Alchemist, correct? Do you know if there are any pills for birth control?\"","\"Huh? Birth control pills? Of course. Why are you—\" A cheeky smile appeared on Wang Xiuying's face as she came to a realization.","\"Do you want me to concoct you some? A single one will last for an entire year.\"","\"They last that long?\" Meixiu said in a surprised tone. \"How effective are they?\"","\"Pretty much one hundred percent effectiveness. However, there is an extremely tiny chance that one could still be impregnated. That said, it's so small that it can be ignored.\"","\"Do you mind making me some? I'll pay for them,\" Meixiu said, as she was getting tired of consuming the typical birth control pills that required her to eat them daily, causing her to leave Cultivation Online constantly.","In fact, she missed a few days because she was too absorbed in her training in Cultivation Online. Fortunately, it had been some time since she last embraced Yuan.","'If I want to train properly without any distractions, these pills are a necessity.' Meixiu thought to herself.","\"You don't need to pay me. These pills are cheap and easy to make. I'll have them ready in an hour.\" Wang Xiuying said.","Meixiu nodded.","\"Thank you.\"","After Meixiu left her room, Wang Xiuying mumbled to herself, \"Should I make some for Chu Liuxiang as well?\""]},{"number":1504,"title":"Chapter 1504 Leaving the Shadow Realm","paragraphs":["1504 Leaving the Shadow Realm","After returning to the Shadow Realm, Yuan summoned his Soul Weapons and asked the immortals, \"Do you know the way out of here? Last time, I was teleported out of here by the Great One. I doubt he'd be willing to do it again since I refused to be his disciple.\"","\"Huh? The Great One wanted you to be his disciple?\" Yu Ning's voice was filled with a profound, almost incredulous, shock.","\"That's the Supreme Being who stood at the apex of the cultivation world even during the Primordial Realm! It was an existence that not even the Celestial Emperor dared to approach, much less covet!\"","\"For such a great existence to take an interest in you... I guess you're even more talented than I had ever dared to imagine.\" Ji Ran spoke, his voice tinged with awe.","\"You're awake. Are you okay? How do you feel right now?\" Yuan asked after hearing Ji Ran's voice.","\"Besides feeling a little tired, I feel perfectly fine. The spiritual energy in your world is much worse than I'd anticipated. I could barely breathe there.\" Ji Ran sighed.","Yu Ning then said, \"Our Young Master's potential is beyond even your imagination, Ji Ran.\"","\"Huh? Young Master? Since when did you start addressing him that?\" Ji Ran asked.","\"His identity is also far beyond your wildest imaginations. It's only natural for someone as lowly in comparison to show this level of respect.\"","Since Ji Ran was slumbering when Yuan revealed his identity as the Immortal Monarch's reincarnation, he had no clue why Yu Ning was being so respectful. Additionally, unless he possessed Yuan's body like Yu Ning, Ji Ran would have no idea how heaven-defying Yuan's body was.","Moreover, unless Yuan summoned the Soul Weapon they were occupying on Earth, neither Ji Ran nor Yu Ning would be able to see or hear anything from Earth. After Ji Ran fell asleep from exhaustion, Yuan sent him back to Cultivation Online to recover.","As for Yu Ning, while Yuan has kept the Empyrean Overlord summoned for his entire stay on Earth, Yu Ning sealed her senses within the Soul Weapon when Yuan entered Meixiu's room for their privacy, so she also wasn't aware of their conversation last night.","\"Anyways... several exits could be found in the Shadow Realm, but they are not in a fixed position and always move around. The closest one I can sense is about ten thousand miles to the south.\" Ji Ran said.","\"Alright.\"","Yuan immediately flew toward the south.","\"How long do I have before it moves?\" he asked as he traveled.","\"The time each exit moves varies.\"","Sometime later, Yuan arrived at his destination, where a massive black portal was surrounded by a massive sea of Banished Souls.","He didn't immediately leave the Shadow Realm since he still had to prepare for the sword spirit waiting for him outside.","As he spectated the situation before him from a safe distance, Yuan watched as the Banished Souls attempted to enter the black portal, only to be bounced off it, almost as though they had run into an invisible wall right before the exit.","\"Only those with a physical body may leave through that exit, hence why we've been stuck in here since the Primordial Realm.\" Yu Ning sighed when she saw this familiar scene. Once upon a time, she had been among the Banished Souls in this place, relentlessly attempting to escape the Shadow Realm. She mindlessly bashed against the invisible wall for hundreds—","even thousands of years before she finally gave up and accepted her fate to rot within the Shadow Realm.","Ji Ran suffered a similar fate. In fact, every Banished Soul within the Shadow Realm had attempted to escape at least once. Though none had succeeded on their own, it didn't deter the others from trying.","\"Um... What are you waiting for?\" Ji Ran asked when Yuan hadn't tried to leave for many minutes.","Yuan explained the situation to them.","\"There is a formidable spirit waiting for me outside. I am just taking a moment to prepare myself.\"","\"By the way, this exit will take me to the Vanishing Valley, where I originally entered the Shadow Realm, correct? I know there are multiple entrances to the Shadow Realm throughout the Nine Heavens, so how can I be sure this exit will lead me back to the Vanishing Valley and not somewhere else?\" he asked.","\"I don't think you need to worry about that, Young Master. The Shadow Realm tracks where you entered from and will automatically take you back there.\" Yu Ning said.","\"Is that so?\"","Yuan remained still for a few more minutes before making a move.","He unleashed his cultivation to the maximum, causing the surroundings to tremble. Then, he flew toward the black portal.","The Banished Souls were immediately alerted by Yuan's presence. Upon seeing that he had a physical body, they rushed at him like a group of starving beasts.","\"HUMAN!!!\"","\"PHYSICAL BODY!!!\"","\"ESCAPE!!!\"","The strength of the Banished Souls varied greatly. Some were weak, while others were as powerful as Immortals.","Yuan didn't dare to underestimate them and unleashed his Soul Strength. Unlike before, he wasn't just trying to scare them; he was determined to destroy them.","\"Scram!\"","He activated Dragon's Gaze at its full power.","When the Banished Souls were struck by Dragon's Gaze, most were destroyed before they could even utter a sound. The stronger Banished Souls were momentarily stunned, overwhelmed by the fear of their souls being shattered.","Yuan didn't pause for a split second and continued shooting toward the black portal, disappearing from the Shadow Realm a second later.","After exiting the Shadow Realm, Yuan didn't stop moving and even accelerated his movement technique.","Meanwhile, before Yuan could even leave the Shadow Realm fully, the sword spirit resting above the Giant's Sword immediately sensed the change in the atmosphere and turned to look at the location that was causing the disturbance.","'He's back!'","The sword spirit clenched her fists in anticipation and prepared to seize him the moment he appeared."]},{"number":1505,"title":"Chapter 1505 Sword Spirit","paragraphs":["1505 Sword Spirit","After leaving the Shadow Realm, Yuan didn't stop to see where he'd exited and continued speeding forward. He wasn't sure if the sword spirit could leave the Giant's Sword or how far he had to travel before her attacks could no longer reach him, so he could only pray for the best.","The moment he returned to the Vanishing Valley, he could immediately sense the sword spirit's gaze on him, sending chills throughout his entire being.","\"What a powerful spirit! I have never felt such a profound cultivation before, either!\" Yu Ning cried out loud after seeing the sword spirit with her own eyes.","\"Heavens! If such a being existed during the Primordial Era, it could've easily slaughtered the Celestial Emperor and his army by itself!\" Ji Ran was left in awe by her almighty presence.","The sword spirit narrowed her gaze on the sword majestic sword in Yuan's grasp.","After confirming that it was indeed the Empyrean Overlord, she muttered in a trembling voice, \"I have been looking for you—\"","However, she suddenly frowned, and her expression turned grim.","Her entire body trembled in anger, and her body seethed with immense killing intent.","\"WHO THE FUCK IS THAT BITCH?!\"","The sword spirit's voice, infused with her immense cultivation base, boomed, creating a profound ripple that swept through the entire Vanishing Valley and beyond, resounding throughout the entire Fourth Heaven in the blink of an eye.","The sword spirit boasted a profound cultivation at the peak of the God Ascension Realm, essentially the apex of the cultivation world, just below a Cultivation God. With so few people achieving Cultivation God status since the Primordial Era, those who reached the ninth level of the God Ascension Realm were considered the pinnacle of power.","The presence of God Ascension Realm cultivators should not exist within the Fourth Heaven, so her aura enveloping the world sent it into turmoil, shocking and terrifying all the experts there. Normally, the Heavens would intervene and try to restrict cultivators who did not belong there or force them to ascend, but the Vanishing Valley was a unique location that ignored the laws of Heaven, so as long as the sword spirit remained inside its space, it was essentially untouchable.","As for Yuan, who was the closest to the sword spirit, his movements were immediately suppressed, and a crushing sensation forced him to his knees.","This overwhelming pressure was a new experience for Yuan, even with the Evil God's memories. His peak was only at the sixth level of the God Ascension Realm during the Evil God's prime, and he did not have to fight anyone at the peak of the God Ascension Realm.","'So this is what it's like to be at the top of the cultivation world!' Instead of fearing for his life, an excited smile appeared on Yuan's face.","However, even with all of his powerful treasures and the Golden Immortal Physique, Yuan found himself unable to stand up, much less run away.","The difference between the God Ascension Realm and his current level was simply too vast and insurmountable.","Meanwhile, the sword spirit leaped off the Giant's Sword and landed right in front of Yuan a split second later.","Yuan had to use all his strength just to lift his head high enough to look at the sword spirit's face.","She was a woman of unparalleled beauty, standing tall with an elegant, slender frame that exudes noble grace. Her hair is a cascade of obsidian black, falling in silky waves that shimmered subtly even when surrounded by darkness.","Her eyes are a striking contrast, gleaming with the richness of molten gold. They hold a depth and intensity that can captivate anyone who meets her gaze. Besides her aura, the sword spirit was indistinguishable from a human being.","Although this was Yuan's first time seeing her, an uncanny sense of familiarity washed over him, as if he had encountered her in another lifetime.","While Yuan gazed at her face, which exuded coldness that could freeze an entire continent, the sword spirit's eyes were fixed on the Empyrean Overlord in his grasp.","\"You... how dare you permit another presence within my body","—especially a woman!\" the sword spirit muttered in a grim voice, laden with killing intent, as if she was on the verge of strangling him.","\"What do you mean—\" Yuan's eyes widened at her unexpected words.","\"Silence, you unfaithful bastard! I didn't spend thousands of years in this gloomy place for this nonsense!\" she interrupted, raising her hand in a chopping gesture.","\"You deserve death for this betrayal!\"","The sword spirit's entire being gushed with killing intent, and she swung her arm before Yuan could even utter another word.","\"Brother Yuan!\"","Xiao Hua's voice suddenly resounded as her body, in the form of a cloud of purple mist, emerged from his body and carried him out of the path of the sword spirit's attack.","Sha!","The path cleaved by the sword spirit's strike split in half, birthing a long and profound earth fissure that could easily swallow entire cities with ease.","Yuan swallowed nervously when he saw the result. The sword spirit definitely acted with the intent to kill him.","'Heavens! She wasn't joking about killing me!' he cried inwardly.","He then noticed the sword spirit preparing for a second strike. Seeing this, he hastily said, \"Wait! You're the Empyrean Overlord's spirit, right?!\"","The sword spirit suddenly halted her movements.","Just as Yuan thought that she had calmed down, the sword spirit began trembling again, her body seething with uncontrollable rage.","\"So you don't even recognize me anymore, huh?!\"","An unfathomable aura exuded from her body, and it was strong enough to completely obliterate anything in its path if released through a martial technique.","'My lord! It's going to destroy the Fourth Heaven at this rate!' Ji Ran cried out loud.","'You must do something to stop this spirit, Young Master!' Yu Ning also cried, her voice filled with dread.","Sensing the desperate situation, the Empyrean Overlord began trembling, and from deep within, a memory long concealed emerged, surfacing in Yuan's mind."]},{"number":1506,"title":"Chapter 1506 Three Major Paths","paragraphs":["1506 Three Major Paths","\"Have you heard? The Sword Saint, Ju Mingye, met his demise when his weapon shattered mid-battle against the Spear Devil, Lei Zhen.\"","Yuan could hear the people around him mumbling as he casually enjoyed his food in a noodle shop.","\"How is that possible? He wielded the Heaven Splitter, a Mythic-grade spiritual treasure, a creation of the Heaven and Earth Blacksmith, Han Bing! Such a formidable weapon would be unbreakable even by a True Immortal!\"","\"Well, the Spear Devil has the Heaven Piercer, an Empyrean-","grade spiritual treasure created by the Eternal Blacksmith, and it specializes in breaking weapons.\"","\"The Heavenly Blacksmith and the Eternal Blacksmith, huh? They've been rivals since they were mere Apprentice Blacksmiths thousands of years ago, fighting for the title of God of Creation. Now, they both stand at the top of the world as Divine Blacksmiths, being one step behind their goal. However, the Eternal Blacksmith managed to create an Empyrean-grade treasure first, so I guess he's better.\"","\"They may be amazing, but are they worthy of the God of Creation title? Only those who can create Celestial-grade treasures should be worthy of that position.\"","There are three major secondary paths a cultivator can pursue.The first and most popular involves studying medicine to support the world with their pills. They are Alchemists.","The second path belongs to Array Masters, whose formations and arrays can influence the world on a grand scale. The most common and sought-after formations are defensive ones, typically established around Sects and powerful family households.","The third and final path, which is also the least popular and most difficult to master, is that of the Blacksmiths. They are responsible for crafting the weapons and artifacts that aid cultivators in battle.","There are other paths one could take, but those are considered niche when compared to the major three.","While one could argue which of these three major paths benefits cultivators the most, it is undeniable that all are foundational to the cultivation world and even the mortal world. The world would look vastly different if even one of these paths were missing.","Suddenly, someone spoke up, \"The Heaven and Earth Blacksmith and Eternal Blacksmith are impressive, no doubt, but their names are already well-known. I've heard rumors of a rising Blacksmith with a mysterious background. They say that he'd crafted a Spirit-grade weapon that could outshine even peak quality Earth-grade weapons.\"","\"Huh? What kind of nonsense is that? As if a weapon like that could exist! Unlike cultivation, a treasure's grade is absolute, so if a Spirit-grade weapon can outshine an Earth-grade weapon, it should be classified as Earth-grade!\"","\"Who even is this mysterious Blacksmith? I consider myself quite knowledgeable in this field, but how come I've never heard of him?\"","People immediately doubted this information.","\"I don't know much about him. All I know is that he appeared out of thin air with weapons of unparalleled perfection that make everything else look fragile and imperfect in comparison.\"","Yuan, who had been silently listening to their conversation this entire time, suddenly spoke, \"That Blacksmith's name is Tian Qiyuan! You better weld that name into your soul because he'll eventually conquer the world with unrivaled treasures!\"","Everyone in the store turned to look at him with raised eyebrows.","\"Tian Qiyuan? Never heard of him. What about you?\"","\"Nope.\"","\"He's definitely a nobody.\"","Hearing their words, Yuan stood up and approached their table. With a nonchalant expression, he retrieved a sword from his storage pouch and placed it on the table before them.","\"T-this is—!\"","As the doubters beheld the perfect sword before them, their eyes widened in shock. They swallowed nervously, and their hands subconsciously reached out to touch it.","However, before any of them could touch it, Yuan reclaimed the sword and tossed it inside his storage pouch.","\"T-that sword! Where did you get it?! I have never seen such a perfect sword before!\"","\"Please! Let me see it again! Just for a few more seconds!\"","\"I-I'll buy it off you! How much do you want?!\"","This noodle shop was frequented by the city's Blacksmiths, and they were all experienced enough to gauge a weapon's quality with a single glance. Despite the sword being a mere Heaven-grade treasure, it surpassed all expectations, transcending even the pinnacle of peak-quality treasures they had encountered before.","\"That sword was crafted by none other than Tian Qiyuan!\" Yuan announced proudly.","\"And where did you find him?! I must confirm his skills with my own eyes!\"","Yuan shook his head and said, \"Unfortunately, Tian Qiyuan is a wandering Blacksmith, so you'll have a hard time tracking him. When I encountered him by chance, he gave me the sword, asking me to spread his name in exchange.\"","\"T-then I'll buy the sword off you! I'll pay you what a peak-","quality Divine-grade weapon would cost for it!\" Someone there offered.","\"I'll pay you enough to purchase any low-quality Ancient-","grade treasure!\"","It quickly turned into a bid, as if they were at an auction house.","However, Yuan merely shook his head and said, \"Sorry, the sword's not for sale.\"","And before any of the Blacksmiths could utter another word, he vanished from the store like a ghost, leaving everyone speechless.","Rumors of Tian Qiyuan began spreading like wildfire among blacksmiths worldwide after that event, which took place at Starforged Sanctuary, a renowned city dedicated to training blacksmiths and where countless famous blacksmiths were created. It was also the birthplace of the Heaven and Earth Blacksmith and the Eternal Blacksmith.","Shortly after Tian Qiyuan's name became widespread, his weapons started showing up in auction houses.","At first, only Spirit-grade treasures were sold, but the quality and grade of the treasure gradually increased throughout the years. These treasures were highly sought after not only by cultivators but also by blacksmiths eager to study them. However, despite countless attempts at analysis, nobody was able to replicate their craftsmanship.","Even peak blacksmiths, such as the Heaven and Earth Blacksmith and the Eternal Blacksmith, were unable to replicate Tian Qiyuan's creations. This further skyrocketed his fame and reputation to heights most blacksmiths could only dream of."]},{"number":1507,"title":"Chapter 1507 Tian Qiyuan","paragraphs":["1507 Tian Qiyuan","In an auction house somewhere in Eighth Heaven, a tall figure wearing a fiery red mask approached one of the workers there and said, \"I have a weapon that I would like to sell here.\"","Without turning his head, the worker glanced at this figure and gave him a quick assessment. The figure, shrouded in a ragged cloak that seemed to have been scorched by fire, stood there with an air of mystery. His cultivation, a mere Golden Immortal, didn't seem to match the unique aura that emanated from him, leaving the worker perplexed.","\"If you want to sell your trash, you can go elsewhere. This place isn't a place for beggars either, so scram.\" The worker sneered.","\"...\"","The masked figure's voice rang out, clear and defiant, in response to the worker's mocking words, \"Oh? So, this place is so grand that it deems a weapon crafted by the Exalted Blacksmith, Tian Qiyuan, to be trash? I suppose I'll heed your advice and find a more appreciative place elsewhere.\"","The masked figure's voice was loud enough for everyone in the room to hear.","\"What? A weapon crafted by the Exalted Blacksmith? Is that true?!\"","\"The last one was sold over five hundred years ago! And it was an Ancient-grade treasure that fetched a price that rivals even peak-quality Empyrean-grade treasures!\"","\"Who called a weapon crafted by the Exalted Blacksmith trash?! Get over here, and let me give you a good beating!\"","\"Every time a treasure related to the Exalted Blacksmith is revealed, it sends ripples through the Nine Heavens, igniting fervor and awe. Even the most successful auction house, the Mystic Jade Auction Pavilion, would get on its knees and beg for one to be sold there! Yet, in this tiny place, they dare to call one useless.\"","The worker standing before the masked figure immediately turned pale upon hearing the people around him, his body trembling uncontrollably.","\"W-why didn't you say it was a weapon created by the Exalted Blacksmith in the first place?! You must be lying to save face!\" The worker refused to believe the person in front of him would have something so valuable.","The masked man didn't utter another word and retrieved a beautiful purple sword. The moment the sword appeared, the atmosphere in the auction house shifted, as if it were in the presence of something extraordinary.","The worker choked on his own saliva after seeing the sword, and loud gasps of shock could be heard in every direction.","\"I-it's a Mythic-grade weapon!\"","\"This refined aura! That flawless appearance and the distinctive signature on the blade—it's undeniably a treasure crafted by the one and only Exalted Blacksmith, Tian Qiyuan!\"","\"It's finally happened! The Exalted Blacksmith has finally stepped into the rank of Grand Blacksmith! He's only one step away from becoming a Divine Blacksmith like Heaven and Earth Blacksmith and Eternal Blacksmith!\"","To advance in rank as a blacksmith, one must successfully craft a treasure corresponding to the desired rank. For example, crafting a Spirit-grade treasure earns the title of Apprentice Blacksmith, while crafting Earth-grade treasures elevates one to Expert Blacksmith.","\"Please! Let me buy it off you! I will pay you as much as you want!\"","The people in the auction house surrounded him and started offering to buy the sword, all of them offering unbelievable amounts of money for it.","However, the masked figure merely shook his head and said, \"If you want it, fight for it.\"","The people there exchanged glances with each other and prepared to turn the auction house into a battlefield.","Seeing this, the masked man quickly continued, \"I mean with your money—in a proper setting. It was going to happen in this auction house, but it will have to be delayed due to circumstances. But this is a good opportunity to spread the news more.\"","\"P-please wait a moment, esteemed guest!\"","Someone suddenly approached him in a hasty manner, his body soaked in sweat.","\"I am the manager of this auction house! Please do not leave! I will execute this useless fool who doesn't have eyes! Please give us another chance! We won't disappoint you again!\"","The masked man looked at the manager and, without saying a word, turned around and walked out of the building, leaving the manager utterly devastated.","\"Any auction house blessed by the Exalted Blacksmith's treasure would inevitably acquire a massive amount of reputation, but this place actually dared to chase such an opportunity away. What a pity.\"","The other customers also started walking out of the auction house shortly after, as they did not want to be associated with the auction house.","News of this event quickly spread like wildfire throughout the Nine Heavens. In order to save whatever face and reputation they had left, the auction house forced the worker who chased away the masked man to kneel on the streets until his inevitable death.","Meanwhile, the Mystic Jade Auction Pavilion extended a public invitation to the masked man, imploring him to grace their auction house with the sale of his extraordinary weapon.","The masked man accepted their invitation and scheduled the auction to begin in one month, allowing people worldwide some time to prepare.","Once news spread, not only did people flock to the Mystic Jade Auction Pavilion, but even powerhouses from the Ninth Heaven made the journey to the Eighth Heaven solely to participate in the auction.","From renowned families to powerful sects to individual collectors, a sea of people made their way to the Mystic Jade Auction Pavilion the moment they heard about the auction.","While the rest of the world was scrambling to gather enough money for the auction, Tian Qiyuan spent his time strolling through the street like a tourist, stuffing his mouth with all sorts of food.","A month passed in the blink of an eye, and so many people showed up to the auction that the Mystic Jade Auction Pavilion had to hastily change its location just to accommodate more participants. Yet, there was not enough space for everyone, so many had to participate from afar through treasures."]},{"number":1508,"title":"Chapter 1508 Violet Dream","paragraphs":["1508 Violet Dream","\"Look over there! That's the Heaven and Earth Blacksmith!\"","\"The Eternal Blacksmith is here, as well!\"","These two renowned Divine Blacksmiths were quickly identified within the crowd.","While the participants of the auction grew increasingly excited for the upcoming auction, Tian Qiyuan himself just arrived at the Mystic Jade Auction Pavilion while wearing his red mask.","\"Welcome, esteemed guest. I am Qing Ling'er, the manager of the Mystic Jade Auction Pavilion. Allow me to extend our deepest gratitude for entrusting us with the honor of auctioning your precious treasure.\" Qing Ling'er bowed to him in a respectful manner, not daring to repeat the other auction house's mistake.","\"If you have any requests, don't hesitate to ask.\"","Tian Qiyuan nodded and said, \"Then I would like to have a word with the participants before we begin auctioning my sword.\"","\"Of course, that can be arranged. Anything else?\"","\"No, that's all for now.\"","\"May I ask for the esteemed guest's name? If you wish to remain anonymous, that is fine as well.\"","\"You'll know my name once the auction begins,\" he said.","\"I understand.\" Qing Ling'er didn't question him any further.","The auction began sometime later.","However, as the main event, Tian Qiyuan's weapon would be sold last, with over a hundred treasures being sold before it.","There were a lot of enticing treasures and even miracle elixirs, but none of the powerhouses even bothered to pay attention, as they were only at the auction for one thing.","Several hours later, it was finally Tian Qiyuan's weapon's turn to be sold.","\"Thank you all for visiting our Mystic Jade Auction Pavilion today. We will start the bid for the Exalted Blacksmith's Mythic-grade treasure soon, but first, the seller would like to have a few words with everyone.\" Qing Ling'er announced to the participants.","Tian Qiyuan approached the stage after receiving the signal.","Countless gazes immediately fell upon him, most of them filled with curiosity as they wondered about his identity and how he acquired Tian Qiyuan's treasure.","After a moment of silence to build up the tension, Tian Qiyuan spoke, \"Hello, everyone. This is my first time appearing publicly like this. My name is Tian Qiyuan, and some of you might know me as the Exalted Blacksmith.\"","\"What?! That's Tian Qiyuan?!\"","\"The Exalted Blacksmith in the flesh?! Is this real?!\"","Many people stood up in shock after hearing this revelation.","\"I am aware that many of you are skeptical of my identity and are expecting me to show my face next. Unfortunately, I wish to keep my face a secret, so I won't be removing my mask or anything today.\" Tian Qiyuan spoke in a calm voice.","He proceeded to retrieve the purple sword he'd planned on selling today, instantly causing the audience to gasp in shock and awe.","\"This is my first Mythic-grade treasure. I call it the Violet Dream. Although it's only a Mythic-grade treasure, it has the prowess to rival even Empyrean-grade treasures. It has a special effect that can create illusions, and anyone below God Ascension Realm struck by it will enter a deep slumber that can only be reversed with the sword.\"","The audience immediately began mumbling to each other about the sword's ability.","\"What a powerful-sounding ability.\"","\"Too bad it only works against those below the God Ascension Realm.\"","\"Are you hearing yourself? How many people are in the God Ascension Realm at this moment? This is a priceless treasure with an extremely powerful effect! I must get my hands on it even if I have to sell all of my belongings and become homeless!\"","However, Tian Qiyuan was not finished speaking, and he continued, \"Now, with the introduction out of the way, I have a special announcement to make.\"","\"Starting today, after this auction, I will be accepting weapon crafting commissions, and whoever purchases my Violet Dream today will receive priority.\"","The entire place fell silent as everyone digested this information. Once they realized what it meant, the auction house erupted into a crazed frenzy.","\"The Exalted Blacksmith will accept commissions?! Heavens! I never thought this day would come!\"","\"Hahaha! I cannot wait to have my dream weapon crafted by him!\"","A few moments later, Tian Qiyuan continued, \"For the payment, I will only accept two methods of payment. The first is Spirit Jades. The second is any material that is on this list.\"","Tian Qiyuan retrieved a scroll and revealed a long list of rare materials written on it.","\"If you have any material on this list, I will accept that as payment, and you'll also receive priority. In fact, I would like to purchase it from you.\"","The experienced blacksmiths instantly recognized that the list of materials was intended for crafting treasures.","\"Heavens... how many—or what kind of ridiculous treasures is he trying to create with that many rare materials? Even a single material on that list would make a weapon priceless.\" Eternal Blacksmith muttered to himself with a pondering face.","\"Not even Celestial-grade treasures would require that many rare materials... Is he trying to create something that surpasses Celestial-grade? Not even a God of Creation would have such ambitions.\" Heaven and Earth Blacksmith sighed out loud.","Sometime later, Tian Qiyuan said, \"Then I will stop delaying the auction and take my leave now.\"","He turned around and walked away, leaving the Violet Dream behind.","The auction commenced shortly, and a frenzied battle for the treasure began.","While the treasure itself was highly sought after, it paled in comparison to the value of securing priority for Tian Qiyuan's commission.","Tian Qiyuan didn't stay to watch the auction and spent his time in the VIP room drinking tea and listening to music performed by beautiful experts.","In the end, the Violet Dream sold for the price of a Celestial-","grade treasure, a shocking amount that left even the auction house speechless.","\"Here are your earnings after deducting our house fees.\" Qing Ling'er handed him a spatial ring loaded with enough spirit jade to create a large sect and fund it for a hundred thousand years."]},{"number":1509,"title":"Chapter 1509 Sword Goddess","paragraphs":["1509 Sword Goddess","\"Who won the auction?\" Tian Qiyuan asked after storing away the money.","\"That would be the Sword Goddess of the Unrivaled Nine Swords Sect,\" said Qing Ling'er.","\"Sword Goddess? Never heard of her before.\" Tian Qiyuan casually commented.","\"She is a prodigious Swordmaster in the Supreme Heaven, renowned for being the first to achieve a level of Sword Aura that surpasses even the Enhanced Sword Aura. I believe she named it Supreme Sword Aura. Do you wish to speak with her? She's still at the auction house.\"","Tian Qiyuan nodded, \"Sure.\"","\"Then I'll go inform her right now. Please wait a little, Senior Exalted Blacksmith.\"","After learning of Tian Qiyuan's identity, the Mystic Jade Auction Pavilion's attitude toward him changed. While they showed him respect at first, it wasn't directed at the person himself but the weapon he was carrying until they realized his true identity as the Exalted Blacksmith.","Sometime later, Qing Ling'er returned with another individual by her side.","She was an exceedingly beautiful woman. With a tall and slender body, long black hair, and golden eyes, she exuded an aura of dominance and pride.","\"It's a pleasure to finally meet you, Senior Tian. I am Zi Xuan, one of nine Unrivaled Swords from the Unrivaled Nine Swords Sect.\" Zi Xuan bowed to him with the Violet Dream in her grasp.","Tian Qiyuan nodded, \"The Violet Dream already suits you very much, Miss Zi. If you wish to commission me for a treasure, you will always have priority for a single commission.\"","\"Then I would immediately like to commission you for another sword,\" she quickly said without an ounce of hesitation in her voice.","\"Is this sword for yourself or someone else?\" he asked.","\"For myself.\"","\"Alright. Here are my terms. First, you'll give me a brief description of what you're looking for in your sword. If you don't have any idea, I can make it based on your current abilities.\"","\"Two, you'll supply me with all of the materials for the sword.\"","\"Three, I will need half of the payment upfront and the other half once the sword is completed. If you're paying me with one of the materials on my list, I won't need any upfront payment.\"","\"Lastly, I will only make one weapon per commission.\"","\"Also, I won't accept any deadlines or tolerate being rushed. And don't even think about scamming me because you'll regret it dearly. Do you agree with my terms?\"","Zi Xuan then said, \"I agree. As for the payment, I have two of the materials you want. What kind of sword can I get with them?\"","\"Which two materials?\" he inquired.","\"The Empyrean Gold and Tempered Glacial Steel.\"","Tian Qiyuan pondered for a moment before responding, \"For these two materials, I am willing to create a peak-quality Mystic-grade sword for you.\"","\"Deal.\" Zi Xuan quickly agreed.","\"Then I'll visit the Unrivaled Nine Swords Sect in a month for the details of your sword unless you have another preferred meeting spot.\"","\"You can come here.\"","As if prepared beforehand, Zi Xuan retrieved a jade slip that contained information about a specific location and handed it to him.","After checking the information inside the jade slip, Tian Qiyuan nodded and said, \"Then I will see you exactly a month from today. Thank you for purchasing my Violet Dream.\"","Just as Tian Qiyuan turned around to leave, Zi Xuan suddenly said, \"Before you go, can I get your autograph?\"","\"Sure.\" Tian Qiyuan had no reason to refuse such a simple request.","Zi Xuan took out a piece of black cloth and asked, \"Can you sign this?\"","Tian Qiyuan raised an eyebrow when he saw the cloth's unique shape.","\"Um... this is...\"","\"My underwear. It's my favorite, too.\"","Qing Ling'er's eyes widened with disbelief when she heard Zi Xuan's shocking words. She thought it was a joke, but when she saw Zi Xuan's dead serious expression, Qing Ling'er began doubting if she was in reality or inside an illusion.","\"You're serious?\" Tian Qiyuan had to make sure she wasn't messing with him.","\"Of course.\" Zi Xuan confirmed with a confident head nod, leaving him speechless.","\"...\"","After a long moment of silence, Tian Qiyuan asked, \"How do you want me to sign it?\"","\"You can just write your name on it using spiritual energy. I don't care if it's damaged.\"","\"O-okay...\"","Tian Qiyuan began writing his name on the piece of cloth by scribbling on it with his finger, which was imbued with spiritual energy, essentially engraving his name on the cloth.","After fulfilling her request, Tian Qiyuan cleared his throat and spoke in a stiff tone, \"Then I will take my leave now...\"","He disappeared into thin air the next moment.","Zi Xuan stared at the signed underwear with a profound smile on her face.","\"...\"","Qing Ling'er's body trembled at the sight. To her knowledge, Zi Xuan was an unfeeling, aloof figure who had never opened her heart to anyone, dedicating every fiber of her being to the mastery of the sword. However, Zi Xuan's actions just now contradicted everything Qing Ling'er knew about her.","\"Then I'll take my leave, as well.\" Zi Xuan calmly said a moment later, acting like nothing strange had happened.","In the following days, Tian Qiyuan sought information about the Sword Goddess, Zi Xuan. However, he wasn't inquiring about her because of her weird request or because he was interested in her. Since he was going to make a sword for her, he was simply doing his due diligence as a blacksmith. After all, how could he possibly craft a sword tailored to someone he knows nothing about?","Until their meeting, Tian Qiyuan learned everything he could about Zi Xuan through public knowledge. Her demeanor, nature, habits, and whatnot. However, some of the information he gathered contradicted the Zi Xuan he met. Although their meeting wasn't long, it was enough for him to understand her character a little.","\"Zi Xuan, huh? What a peculiar woman.\" Tian Qiyuan chuckled.","Once it was time for their scheduled meeting, Tian Qiyuan made his way to the location inside the jade slip Zi Xuan gave him."]},{"number":1510,"title":"Chapter 1510 A Dangerous Obsession","paragraphs":["1510 A Dangerous Obsession","Since Tian Qiyuan has never been to the Supreme Heaven, Zi Xuan arranged for their meeting somewhere in the Eighth Heaven.","Upon arriving at their designated meeting spot, Tian Qiyuan looked around with his divine sense but couldn't see any buildings or Zi Xuan's presence in a thousand-mile radius. Even weirder, he was in the middle of nowhere.","However, just as he prepared to look around, the empty space before him began to rend apart, as though the very fabric of reality had been cleaved by an unseen force. From this spatial rift, a figure emerged, stepping into the world with an air of otherworldly authority and a face of peerless beauty.","Zi Xuan showed a gentle smile and said, \"I created an entrance to my humble world here before I returned to the Supreme Heaven. Please, come inside.\"","Tian Qiyuan nodded and followed her to her world.","Much like Senior Bai's realm, accessible through the Myriad of Techniques, Zi Xuan's world resided in a separate dimension, far removed from the Ninth Heaven.","But compared to Senior Bai's somewhat empty realm, which consisted entirely of flying pavilions, Zi Xuan's world was a realm of countless swords and a single floating island that housed a solitary building.","The swords hovered in the air like scattered clouds, forming a path that led to the building in the distance.","As Tian Qiyuan followed Zi Xuan, he inspected the swords with his divine sense. Their grades varied from Spirit-grade to Empyrean-grade, yet one thing remained consistent—their excellent quality, all being peak quality swords.","\"This is a unique way to display your collection. It's an impressive collection, as well.\" Tian Qiyuan casually commented on it.","To his surprise, Zi Xuan said, \"I'm not actually displaying them. They used to be stored in my vault, but after I learned of the existence of your swords and acquired one for my collection, I couldn't bear to keep them in the same space. So, I tossed them out here.\"","\"Is that so...\" Tian Qiyuan mumbled, unsure whether to feel honored by her appreciation for his creations or to sympathize with the unknown maker of the swords she had discarded in such a fashion because of him.","Upon reaching the island, Zi Xuan led him straight to the building and said, \"This is my private living quarters. You're the first one ever to visit this place.\"","\"To bring me to such a personal place even though we're practically strangers. I feel honored.\"","\"I don't see you as a stranger,\" she quickly said.","\"I have collected many of your swords and spent many years with them. They say a blacksmith's creation embodies a fragment of their creator's soul, so in a way, we've known each other for a very long time.\"","The next moment, they stepped into the building. Its interior was opulent yet understated, exuding a sense of luxury without extravagance. The atmosphere was cozy, with a natural soothing aura permeating the air.","Though the building appeared sizable from the outside, it housed only a small living room and a bedroom, with the remainder of the space dedicated to her extensive sword collection—at least before most of them were tossed out and replaced by Tian Qiyuan's swords.","\"Please, have a seat.\" Zi Xuan gestured at the couch by the purple-fired fireplace.","Once they were both seated, Tian Qiyuan asked, \"So, what kind of sword do you want me to make for you?\"","\"I will let you decide.\"","\"Are you sure?\"","She nodded solemnly and spoke, \"I commissioned you not out of necessity but out of desire. I do not wish to defile your creation with my ideas, so I don't care what I want. Just like your other creations, I want this sword crafted solely by you, but I want you to think of me when you make it.\"","Despite Zi Xuan's enigmatic demeanor, Tian Qiyuan accepted her request with determination.","\"I understand. I will craft a sword that I believe will be perfect for you, and I will only think of you during the process,\" he affirmed.","Although Tian Qiyuan was wearing a mask, Zi Xuan could feel his intense stare through the mask. Additionally, when the words that she would only hear in her dreams were uttered in reality by the person in her dreams, a profound change occurred within her, causing her body to tremble in delight.","Zi Xuan's breath quickened, and her eyes locked onto Tian Qiyuan with a deep sense of yearning.","'Should I just make him mine right here and now?' she pondered inwardly.","Little did Tian Qiyuan know, Zi Xuan was an ardent admirer of his creations to extreme levels. Despite possessing numerous Empyrean-grade and even Celestial-grade swords, Zi Xuan had found herself utterly charmed by one of Tian Qiyuan's creations, despite it being only of Spirit-grade quality at the time. Such was the allure of his craftsmanship that it transcended the boundaries of material worth, capturing her heart with its unique charm.","As Tian Qiyuan's skill refined and his creations became even more exquisite with each creation, Zi Xuan's admiration for his work only deepened.","Eventually, her infatuation soon morphed into a dangerous obsession, reaching a point where she was willing to go to extreme lengths, even resorting to violence, to obtain his coveted creations.","Her crazed obsession quickly earned her the nickname of Exalted Blacksmith Fanatic. However, since she was always disguised, nobody knew her true identity as the Sword Goddess. If the world somehow learned of this, not even the Heavens would be able to predict their reaction.","Zi Xuan was an expert at the seventh level of the God Ascension Realm, while Tian Qiyuan was only a Golden Immortal. If she were to force herself upon him in this secluded world, there was nothing he could do about it.","However, Zi Xuan quickly regained control of her emotions and refrained from doing something so barbaric for now.","\"Now then, can you tell me more about yourself? For example, your hobbies, your likes and dislikes, and even habits. I will also need to examine your swordsmanship later.\" Tian Qiyuan said to her a moment later, unaware of the dangerous thoughts flowing through Zi Xuan's mind.","\"With pleasure.\" Zi Xuan responded with a profound smile on her beautiful face."]},{"number":1511,"title":"Chapter 1511 Zi Xuan","paragraphs":["1511 Zi Xuan","Upon Tian Qiyuan's request to learn more about her, Zi Xuan did not hesitate to reveal everything about herself to him, including personal information that one usually wouldn't reveal even to their loved ones.","\"I enjoy reading scriptures every now and then, and my hobby is collecting swords. I haven't eaten anything in the last hundred years, but if I were to eat something right now, it would be a spicy dish.\"","\"I like swords, and there are too many things I dislike to list, but if I had to name a few, it would be pesky people and men who only think with their lower swords.\"","\"I don't mind perverted men as I am quite perverted myself, but there is a difference between lustful and being lecherous. When I am feeling lustful, I like to use the swords in my collection to relieve myself. By the way, your swords are the best. They make me go crazy, something other swords cannot replicate.\"","\"...\"","Behind his mask, Tian Qiyuan's eyes widened in surprise, his disbelief evident. Was she toying with him, or was she genuinely like this? He had always known Zi Xuan to be eccentric, but this was a whole new level.","He cleared his throat and said, \"W-why don't you tell me about your background? How did you grow up and become the person you are today.\"","Zi Xuan pondered for a moment before responding, \"I was born in the Unrivaled Nine Swords Sect. My mother was a Sect Elder, so I spent the majority of my life there. I touched my first sword when I was one year old and started training with one when I was only five years old.\"","\"I learned Sword Aura ten years later, Enhanced Sword Aura after another hundred years, and attained Sword Body at three thousand years old. I became an official disciple of the Unrivaled Nine Swords Sect at 10 years old and was promoted to Inner Disciple three years later. On my eighteenth birthday, I became a Core Disciple. Ten years later, I became a Sect Elder. After another fifty years, I replaced one of the Nine Unrivaled Swords by defeating him in an official match.\"","\"Since then, I began working toward a level that surpasses Enhanced Sword Aura. It took a hundred thousand years, but I've managed to achieve just that, and I named it Supreme Sword Aura. Oh, I started collecting swords when I was sixteen years old.\"","Tian Qiyuan listened to her history with interest. This was his first time encountering someone as talented as Zi Xuan when it came to the sword.","To achieve a Sword Body at two thousand years old was incredibly gifted, a talent seen once every hundred million years.","After telling him her entire life story, Zi Xuan suddenly stood up and asked, \"Want to see my sword collection? It's mostly your swords, though.\"","\"Sure. It would help me understand your taste for swords a little more.\" Tian Qiyuan nodded and followed her to the collection.","Sometime later, they arrived before a sealed door.","\"I called this the Sword Vault, and once again, you're the first person besides myself to see it.\"","Zi Xuan removed the seal and opened the door, revealing the room on the other side.","The room was huge, taking up most of the building, but fewer than a hundred swords were on display, even though it could easily hold hundreds of thousands.","\"This room used to be more crowded, but as you saw, they're all outside now.\" Zi Xuan said.","Tian Qiyuan took a quick look at the swords with his divine sense. There were seventy-nine swords on display, with sixty-","nine of them being his own creation.","\"You've managed to collect 69 out of the 90 treasures I've sold to the public?\" Tian Qiyuan marveled at her unwavering dedication and extraordinary collection. To obtain even a single treasure crafted by his hand was a formidable feat, yet she had amassed 69 of them as a single individual.","He was aware of the high cost of his treasures, but he couldn't fathom the extent of resources she must have sacrificed to acquire these 69 weapons.","\"I never thought I would collect weapons that were not swords, but your creations changed me,\" Zi Xuan said as she caressed a blue-bladed dagger with her slender fingers.","While some blacksmiths specialize in a single type of weapon since it's much easier to advance in their career, a true master crafts all kinds of weapons with equal excellence.","Tian Qiyuan crafted every type of weapon, but his favorite was the sword; thus, half of his creations were swords.","Zi Xuan walked over to a particular sword on display and said, \"This is the first of your creations that appeared in public, and it's the sword that changed my life.\"","It was a mere Spirit-grade sword, but it was just as flawless as the Violet Dream in terms of quality and could easily be mistaken as a Heaven-grade—even Divine-grade treasure.","\"When I first laid eyes on this sword, it made me feel emotions that I didn't know existed in me, and I knew I had to acquire it.\"","She grabbed the sword off the display and handed it to Tian Qiyuan.","\"If you don't mind, can you hold it for me? I want to see it with its creator.\"","Tian Qiyuan accepted her request and held the sword in his hand. Instantly, the sword began exuding an aura that had never manifested for anyone else, not even Zi Xuan.","This left Zi Xuan bewildered.","\"Ah...\" she muttered in a trembling voice, her body shaking in excitement.","\"I have tried, but I could never imagine it being any more perfect than it already is... but now... with it in your hands... this is true perfection!\" Zi Xuan exclaimed with a crazed expression on her face, as if a switch had been flipped inside her.","She approached him and grabbed his hands, \"I was only 99% convinced you were the real Exalted Blacksmith, but I am now 100 percent convinced!\""]},{"number":1512,"title":"Chapter 1512 Unrivaled Sword Art","paragraphs":["1512 Unrivaled Sword Art","\"You weren't certain I was the real deal? What if I had been an imposter?\" Tian Qiyuan asked her out of curiosity.","Hearing this question, Zi Xuan's expression darkened, looking incredibly grim, and she responded in a chilling voice, \"If you had dared to impersonate the Exalted Blacksmith, then I would've tortured you until the end of time.\"","Her gaze exuded real killing intent that sent shivers down Tian Qiyuan's body.","\"Alright, then, let's take a look at your swordsmanship now,\" he said a moment later.","Zi Xuan nodded her head and said, \"Let's go outside.\"","Before leaving the vault, Zi Xuan took the Spirit-grade sword with her.","Once they were outside, Zi Xuan brought him to the empty field behind the building.","\"I will now perform my main sword technique, Unrivaled Sword Arts. It consists of nine stages, each several times stronger than the last.\"","Instead of wielding a powerful sword like the Violet Dream, Zi Xuan opted to use the Spirit-grade sword for her performance. She was more comfortable with it due to spending countless hours with it, allowing her to display her best abilities.","\"Unrivaled Sword Art, first stage, Unrivaled Spirit.\"","Zi Xuan then gave Tian Qiyuan a sword performance that could only be described as flawless, even otherworldly. Each movement was precise and fluid, flowing as naturally as water in a river, without a trace of hesitation or stiffness.","After watching her otherworldly performance, Tian Qiyuan fully understood why people called her the Sword Goddess.","Sometime later, Zi Xuan stopped after the third stage and asked him, \"Are you able to understand my swordsmanship?\"","Once a swordsman attains a certain level of mastery, their movements transcend ordinary understanding, and this effect intensifies as the individual's skill level increases. Since Tian Qiyuan was mainly a blacksmith, Zi Xuan was worried that he lacked the ability to understand her swordsmanship, which would hinder his ability to craft a suitable sword that matched her abilities.","Tian Qiyuan could tell what was on Zi Xuan's mind based on the worried frown on her face, and he said, \"Don't worry, I can understand your swordsmanship. I may be a blacksmith, but I am also a swordmaster. In order to create a weapon, I believe you must understand the weapon itself first, and what better way to understand a weapon than to master it?\"","Some of Zi Xuan's worries went away after hearing his words, but there was still some doubt in her heart. After all, to fully comprehend her swordsmanship, Tian Qiyuan would need to be near her level or even surpass it, which was very unlikely.","However, she didn't say anything else and continued her performance.","\"This is the fourth stage, Unrivaled Earth.\"","Then, the fifth stage.","\"Unrivaled Heaven.\"","The sixth stage.","\"Unrivaled Divine.\"","The seventh stage.","\"Unrivaled Saint.\"","She stopped after the seventh stage to look at Tian Qiyuan again.","\"Are you still following?\"","\"Yes, 100 percent.\"","\"...\"","Despite her profound respect for him, she couldn't bring herself to believe his words. Not even the other eight Unrivaled Swords could claim with such certainty that they comprehended the seventh stage of her swordsmanship.","Seeing the doubt on her face, Tian Qiyuan said, \"Just keep going. I'll prove to you that I am capable of understanding your swordsmanship later.\"","Zi Xuan silently nodded and proceeded to perform the eighth stage.","\"Unrivaled Void.\"","Finally, the last stage.","\"This is the ninth stage, Unrivaled Sword God.\"","There was a saying in the Unrivaled Nine Swords Sect: mastering the ninth stage of their technique would inevitably make one a Sword God. And within the entire sect, only Zi Xuan has managed to reach such a level.","It was widely known within their sect that Zi Xuan surpassed even the Sect Master in power. However, she had no desire to shoulder the responsibilities of leadership, and thus, she chose not to ascend to the position, remaining as a guardian of the sect.","As Zi Xuan commenced the final stage, the atmosphere in their secluded world shifted, and the very air trembled in awe.","If Zi Xuan had infused her spiritual energy into her swordsmanship, their world would've been destroyed long before she could even reach the fifth stage, much less the ninth stage.","\"What do you think?\" Zi Xuan asked him afterward while being slightly out of breath.","Tian Qiyuan nodded, \"It was amazing.\"","\"Are you saying that because you couldn't comprehend it or...?\"","Tian Qiyuan smiled and gestured for the sword.","\"As promised, I will now prove to you that I am fully capable of understanding your swordsmanship.\"","Zi Xuan handed him the sword and asked, \"What are you going to do?\"","\"You'll see in just a moment. Please give me some space.\"","Once Zi Xuan was far enough, Tian Qiyuan closed his eyes and recalled Zi Xuan's performance with the Unrivaled Sword Art.","After a moment of silence, he started moving his body and performing the Unrivaled Sword Art.","\"?!?!\"","Zi Xuan's eyes widened in shock as she watched Tian Qiyuan flawlessly replicate her sect's most revered and challenging sword technique. However, as impressive as it seemed at a glance, anyone with enough experience could replicate the first three stages of the technique.","A few minutes later, Tian Qiyuan began performing the fourth stage. His movements were just as impeccable as if he was still doing the first stage, leaving Zi Xuan speechless.","However, little did she know that was just the beginning.","After performing the fourth stage, Tian Qiyuan went on to the fifth stage and then the sixth stage.","Even more remarkable than his effortless replication of the sword technique was Tian Qiyuan's seamless performance, flawlessly executing each stage without the slightest pause, almost as if he'd practiced the sword technique for thousands of years.","As Tian Qiyuan reached the ninth stage of the sword technique, Zi Xuan fell back in shock, her expression mirroring disbelief as if she had seen a ghost.","\"I-impossible!\" she uttered in a terrified voice, and she began doubting whether she was a true sword prodigy or a fake one."]},{"number":1513,"title":"Chapter 1513 Exalted Blacksmith’s Store","paragraphs":["1513 Exalted Blacksmith's Store","\"You... what the hell are you?\" Zi Xuan stared at Tian Qiyuan with her eyes as wide as saucers. It'd taken her thousands of years to master the Unrivaled Sword Arts. Yet, it only took a glance for Tian Qiyuan to master the sword technique completely. She has never heard of anything like this before, much less witnessing it with her own eyes.","\"Are you secretly a disciple of our Unrivaled Nine Swords Sect?\" she asked with a suspicious look on her face.","If he were truly a disciple of her sect, it would explain his knowledge of the Unrivaled Sword Arts. However, even within her sect, fewer than five individuals had learned all nine stages, and she was the only one to master all nine stages. So, how could he flawlessly execute all nine stages?","\"No, I am not a disciple of the Unrivaled Nine Swords Sect.\"","\"Then are you telling me that you actually learned the technique on the spot after watching me perform it once? Do you really expect me to believe such a thing?\"","\"I don't expect you to believe me, but that's the truth. Anyways, have I cleared your doubt about my ability to comprehend your swordsmanship?\"","\"Don't try to change the subject! Only disciples of the Unrivaled Nine Swords Sect are allowed to learn the sword technique! If they learn that an outsider has managed to do so, they'll hunt you down!\"","\"That's only if they learn it, right? You're the only one who knows about it, so unless you tell them, I will be safe. Moreover, I learned the technique from watching you, who willingly showed it to me, so you also bear some responsibility.\"","\"T-that's—!\" Zi Xuan was left speechless by his argument.","In fact, even if she knew that he had the capability to learn the technique beforehand, she would still be willing to perform the sword technique for him for the sake of her sword.","She sighed in a defeated manner and said, \"You're right. Since you learned the sword technique from me, I am technically responsible for it. Anyway, I have no intention of revealing this to my sect, so you do your job and don't go around flaunting it.\"","Tian Qiyuan smiled and said, \"I have no interest in the Unrivaled Sword Arts. I have my own sword technique.\"","\"Anyway, I have a good understanding of your capabilities, and I already have an image of what kind of sword I will be making for you. I just need some time to think about it.\"","\"Will it take long?\" she asked.","\"No, I'll be done in a few days.\"","\"Okay.\"","\"Then I'll begin now.\"","He sat on the ground and closed his eyes. It looked like he was cultivating, but he was actually forging Zi Xuan's sword inside his mind, and he was doing it more than once.","To craft the perfect sword for her, Tian Qiyuan needed to experiment with various materials and combinations. A blacksmith of his caliber possesses the ability to forge treasures within their mind as vividly as if they were doing it in reality. This extraordinary skill allows them to save both resources and time.","Time passed in the blink of an eye for Tian Qiyuan. As for Zi Xuan, she sat right in front of him and stared at him the entire time.","A few days later, when Tian Qiyuan opened his eyes, he was startled by Zi Xuan, whose face was so close to his mask that they were almost touching.","\"Uhh... I am finished,\" he said in a somewhat stiff voice.","Realizing that he'd finished, Zi Xuan calmly distanced herself from him and asked, \"Why are you hiding your identity?\"","\"I like peace and freedom. If the world knows my face, I will never be able to walk in public without being stopped by people,\" he calmly said.","\"A fair reason.\"","\"Anyway, I know exactly what kind of sword I'll make for you.\"","He proceeded to write down a list of materials needed for the sword and handed it to her.","\"How long do you think it'll take you to collect them?\" he asked.","Zi Xuan looked at the list with a pondering face. After a moment of silence, she said, \"It shouldn't take too long. I already have half of these materials. I can probably acquire the other half in a few months.\"","\"Then I'll return to the place that I came in here from exactly one year from now.\"","\"Okay. What are you going to do in the meantime?\"","\"What a blacksmith typically does—make things.\"","Tian Qiyuan left Zi Xuan's world shortly after and disappeared from the world for an entire year.","News of the Exalted Blacksmith accepting commissions spread throughout the Nine Heavens after the auction house. Many people wanted to request a commission immediately, but all of them quickly came to the same realization that stopped them from doing so.","\"How the hell do we contact the Exalted Blacksmith when we don't even know his identity or where to find him?\"","Indeed, Tian Qiyuan had departed the auction house so quickly that he forgot to mention the store he had opened in the Eighth Heaven, where he would be accepting requests.","Tian Qiyuan found it weird that nobody approached him even though many months had passed, and he was beginning to doubt his own popularity.","\"Ah! I forgot to tell them about this store!\" he suddenly came to this realization one day.","Upon realizing his mistake, he immediately began spreading information about his store. Not even half a day after he began spreading the news, experts from around the world flocked to his store like hungry pigeons.","His store was situated in the middle of nowhere, standing alone in an open, empty grassland. It was almost impossible to miss once someone entered its vicinity, but without knowledge of its existence, nobody would go out of their way to visit such a desolate place.","However, once news of his store spread, the once-empty grassland quickly became crowded with people."]},{"number":1514,"title":"Chapter 1514 The Pinnacle of Swords","paragraphs":["1514 The Pinnacle of Swords","Before people arrived at his store, Tian Qiyuan created a large sign that read, \"Those who have my desired materials may enter the store immediately. Those who do not have priority must wait outside until their number is called.\"","\"There are jade slips with numbers on it beside this sign. Take the number in the front and wait for your turn. I will have at most 10 customers at a time, excluding those with priority and with my desired materials.\"","\"Every customer will only be allowed one commission request in their lifetime.\"","\"Fighting is not allowed near the store, or you will be put on the blacklist. Those on the blacklist will not be able to receive my service.\"","\"Those with a jade slip may sell their slot, but others are prohibited from threatening those with a jade slip to sell. If you pressure or force someone to sell their jade slip, you will be put on the blacklist.\"","When the first customer arrived, he grabbed the jade slip that read 'one' and waited for his turn. Seconds later, another individual showed up.","In less than one minute, all ten jade slips had been acquired with the people who came after feeling dejected. However, they didn't immediately leave and tried to purchase the jade slip from those who had one.","Unsurprisingly, none of the 10 individuals with a slot were willing to sell it, so the others quickly gave up and waited for the next day's slots.","Tian Qiyuan waited half a day for someone with his desired materials to show up. When nobody did, he called in the first customer.","\"What kind of weapon do you want?\" Tian Qiyuan asked.","\"I would like a spear.\"","\"Do you have a specific design in mind? What about its grade and quality?\"","\"I do. It's right here. How much would it cost for one at the peak-quality Ancient-grade?\"","After taking a look at the design, Tian Qiyuan gave the man an estimate of the price.","\"I understand. I have the money and materials right here. When will you begin the commission?\"","\"I will start right now. You can expect the spear to be ready in an hour.\"","\"That fast?!\" The man almost couldn't believe his ears.","Most blacksmiths would require months of work to craft an Ancient-grade weapon, after all.","\"Yes, it'll be done in an hour.\" Tian Qiyuan reaffirmed.","The man nodded and left the store, which consisted of one small reception room and the rest being a smithy.","An hour later, Tian Qiyuan called the man back into the store and showed him the finished product.","\"A-amazing...\" The man was at a loss for words.","\"C-can I touch it?\" he then asked.","\"That depends. Do you accept this result? If you do, you'll need to pay the full amount before you can have it.\"","\"I accept!\" The man retrieved the rest of the payment and handed it to Tian Qiyuan.","\"It's all yours.\" Tian Qiyuan gestured at the beautiful red spear.","The man grabbed the spear with trembling hands and muttered, \"This is exactly what I envisioned! No... it's even better than I imagined!\"","Tian Qiyuan then said, \"It doesn't have a name yet, and that will be your responsibility.\"","After completing his first commission, Tian Qiyuan walked outside and showed everyone the jade slip with the number 'one' in his grasp and said, \"If you want this, you can go get it.\"","He proceeded to flick the jade slip, shooting it into the distance.","Those who reacted the fastest were the first to chase after it, with the others following behind, quickly emptying the place beside the other nine already with a jade slip.","\"Number two, you may follow me inside.\" Tian Qiyuan said a moment later.","Over the next several months, Tian Qiyuan focused on his commissions, amassing a tremendous amount of wealth.","He also accepted several priority commissions from those who offered him the material that he was looking for.","Once a year had passed since his meeting with Zi Xuan, Tian Qiyuan closed the store down temporarily.","\"If you already have a jade slip, you can keep it with you until I reopen the store.\"","Tian Qiyuan disappeared after saying these words.","He made his way to the same location as last time and waited for Zi Xuan to invite him to her world.","Zi Xuan showed up shortly after his arrival, but she looked a little grumpy for some reason.","\"Is something wrong?\" he asked her.","\"I thought I would be your first, but you ended up creating other treasures before mine even started!\" she said, displeased that she wasn't the first to have a custom weapon by him.","\"While I didn't complete your sword first, you are still my first customer, and your sword was my first custom design, so it's still technically my first custom creation,\" he said.","Zi Xuan fell silent when she couldn't argue with his logic, eventually bringing him into her world.","\"Here are all of the materials you requested.\" Zi Xuan pointed at the materials neatly placed outside her living quarters.","\"Where are you going to make the weapon?\"","\"For Mystic-grade treasures, I have to do it inside my world,\" he said.","\"Oh? Do you think I can come watch?\" she asked out of curiosity, but she was prepared to be refused.","Tian Qiyuan did not immediately respond and pondered for a moment.","Seeing this as an opportunity, Zi Xuan quickly continued, \"I actually have another material that was on your list. I'll give it to you for free if you let me watch.\"","\"Alright, I'll let you watch.\" Tian Qiyuan nodded.","\"Why are you collecting so many precious materials anyway?\"","\"Since you are my first customer, I'll tell you.\" Tian Qiyuan smiled behind his mask and said, \"I am planning on creating a masterpiece—a sword that surpasses even Celestial-grade treasures! The pinnacle of all swords!\"","\"T-the pinnacle of all swords...?\" Zi Xuan swallowed nervously as she stared at him with a dazed expression on her face."]},{"number":1515,"title":"Chapter 1515 Tian Qiyuan’s World","paragraphs":["1515 Tian Qiyuan's World","As a sword enthusiast, the mere mention of Tian Qiyuan's plan to craft the pinnacle of swords sent a thrill through Zi Xuan, igniting a spark of excitement in her.","The fact that she was essentially giving him the resources to craft the weapon made it seem like she contributed to the creation of the sword.","'Ah... I'm wet...' she thought to herself with a europhic expression on her face.","Tian Qiyuan ignored the weird expression on Zi Xuan's face and collected the materials.","\"I'm going to return to my world right now, but I won't begin the smithing for a few more days,\" he said afterward.","\"I'll follow you there,\" she snapped out of it and said.","\"Okay.\"","They left Zi Xuan's world shortly after.","A few days later, Tian Qiyuan arrived at the entrance to his world, which was located near a river in the middle of a mountain valley.","Tian Qiyuan's world consisted of three areas. The first one to enter Zi Xuan's view was a floating island that had a majestic golden mountain and a golden waterfall.","The next appeared to be a floating island with a volcano that appeared ordinary at a glance, but when Zi Xuan tried to take a deep look into it, she found an unfathomable existence living within.","Unfortunately, this presence was too powerful for even an expert like Zi Xuan to perceive fully. Not wanting to offend such a formidable entity, she immediately withdrew her divine sense the moment she became aware of its existence.","The third area was a simple floating island with two buildings. One appeared to be his living quarters, and the other a smithy.","\"You're the first human ever to visit this place.\" Tian Qiyuan suddenly said to her.","\"The first human, huh...\" Zi Xuan glanced at the volcano.","\"Do you want a tour of the place while we're here?\" he suddenly asked.","\"Sure!\"","Tian Qiyuan proceeded to lead Zi Xuan to the golden mountain with the waterfall and said, \"This entire mountain is made of Primordial Gold, and the water is all liquid from the Golden Celestial Tree that you see growing around the river.","Sure enough, dozens of Golden Celestial Trees were growing along the river, each of them at least a million years old. A single Golden Celestial Tree could sell for the price of several Mystic-grade treasures.","\"This is the first time I've seen so many Golden Celestial Trees in one place...\" Zi Xuan swallowed nervously at the marvelous sight. However, they still weren't as impressive as the golden mountain that was completely made of Primordial Gold.","Primordial Gold was more valuable than Empyrean Gold, and a small fist-sized chuck could easily sell for the price of a Mystic-grade treasure. Yet, there was a whole mountain of it in Tian Qiyuan's world.","\"Why do you need so much Primordial Gold and Golden Celestial Tree?\" Zi Xuan asked him out of curiosity.","\"I'll be using most of it for my masterpiece,\" he calmly said.","\"M-most of it?! You can easily craft a dozen Celestial-grade treasures with this much material!\" she exclaimed in shock.","\"Even if it can craft a hundred Celestial-grade treasures, it wouldn't be able to compare to my masterpiece.\" Tian Qiyuan said in a confident tone.","\"Just what kind of sword are you trying to craft? Do you intend on slaying gods or something?\" Zi Xuan shook her head. Since she didn't have any idea what kind of sword he was creating, she couldn't help but consider it a waste of resources.","\"Let's head to the next island. By the way, I call this place the Golden Valley.\"","Tian Qiyuan led her to the second island with the volcano, but he didn't enter its territory and merely inspected it from outside.","\"You should have already noticed its existence by now, but I do not live in this world alone. My companion isn't human, either. It resides inside the mountain, where all sorts of precious ores and jewelry can be found, especially those that grow in extremely hot conditions.\"","\"What kind of entity lives here? Since it can withstand the immense heat in this place, it's most likely a Yang Element beast, right?\" Zi Xuan inquired.","\"Indeed, it's a Yang Element beast. I would introduce you now, but it only comes out when I work on profound treasures that require unique flames. That said, you'll meet it once I begin working on your sword.\"","\"It even assists you with your creation? I cannot imagine what kind of beast has the capabilities to do that...\"","With that said, Zi Xuan could think of one entity that could produce flames, but it seemed so farfetched that she didn't even consider it possible and quickly tossed that thought aside.","Since he didn't want to disturb the entity any longer, Tian Qiyuan led Zi Xuan to the final island.","\"This is my living quarter, and the other building is my workshop.\" Tian Qiyuan said, confirming Zi Xuan's speculations earlier.","He invited her into his living quarters and served her tea.","As she sipped on the tea, Zi Xuan's eyes remained fixated on Tian Qiyuan's mask.","When her curiosity could no longer be contained, she asked him, \"Would you be willing to show me your face? I promise I won't tell anyone. I can even swear on my soul if that would reassure you.\"","Without waiting for Tian Qiyuan's response, Zi Xuan raised her hand and swore, \"With heaven as my witness, I swear upon my soul that I would not reveal your identity to anyone you don't want me to.\"","\"You didn't have to do that. I would've shown you my face even without needing the oath, but it does make it more easy for me to reveal my face.\"","Tian Qiyuan wasn't worried that she might recognize him because his true identity, besides being the Exalted Blacksmith, was a nobody who belonged to no background.","He removed his mask the following moment, revealing his handsome face to Zi Xuan."]},{"number":1516,"title":"Chapter 1516 Vulgar Presence","paragraphs":["1516 Vulgar Presence","\"You're... much more handsome than I expected,\" Zi Xuan muttered in a dazed voice as she stared at Tian Qiyuan's handsome face.","She had braced herself in case Tian Qiyuan had an ugly face because he always wore a mask. Even though he claimed that it was because he didn't want to be recognized in public, there was no way to really tell if he was being truthful. However, after seeing his handsome facial features, Zi Xuan no longer doubted his claims of wanting to remain anonymous.","In fact, he was so handsome that Zi Xuan subconsciously reached for his face, gently caressing his cheeks.","Tian Qiyuan would've been able to avoid it if it was a surprise attack, but Zi Xuan's actions were so random that he simply froze from bewilderment, which allowed her to caress his cheeks.","\"Ah, sorry. My hands moved on its own just now.\" Zi Xuan quickly pulled back her hand once she realized what she was doing and slightly blushed.","Tian Qiyuan chuckled and responded in a joking manner, \"It's fine. I don't blame you, as I am very handsome, after all.\"","He continued, \"Anyway, I'll be spending the next several days preparing the materials, so until then, make yourself at home.\"","To ensure the process goes as smoothly as possible, all of the materials are typically refined or combined before the weapon crafting begins.","\"You don't mind me taking a look around? Aren't you worried that I might steal from you?\" Zi Xuan asked.","He chuckled at her words and said, \"Unless you want to provoke my neighbor, I don't see why you would do such a thing.\"","Zi Xuan's gaze shifted to the volcano and smiled.","\"Then I'll have some fun in your living quarters.\"","Zi Xuan entered his living quarters the next moment while Tian Qiyuan immediately began refining the materials.","Upon entering Tian Qiyuan's home, Zi Xuan immediately began exploring the place. It was a simple home with four rooms.","There was a bathroom, a kitchen, a living room, and a bedroom. The atmosphere resembled that of a mortal home since Immortal cultivators did not need to use the bathroom or eat.","The living room was simply furnished with a leather chair, framed displays on the walls showcasing precious materials that even Zi Xuan did not recognize, and a fireplace.","The bathroom and kitchen looked ordinary.","Zi Xuan visited Tian Qiyuan's bedroom last. Once she was inside, she took a deep breath through her nose and mouth at the same time.","She kept the air in her lungs for a long moment before breathing out again.","\"What a wonderful smell~\"","Zi Xuan muttered as she focused her gaze on the bed in the corner. Then, without hesitation, she jumped on the bed and started rolling around like some kind of bug.","'Ahh... why am I so attracted to him? Is it because he can craft amazing swords? No, there's something more to him, but I cannot pinpoint it...'","Zi Xuan's excitement continued to rise as she lay on his bed. Eventually, she could no longer control herself and reached underneath her clothes and started playing with herself.","Meanwhile, Tian Qiyuan was completely focused on the materials and did not even bother to check on Zi Xuan.","Days passed in the blink of an eye.","Once he was finished with the preparations, Tian Qiyuan went inside his home to call Zi Xuan. He quickly found her sleeping peacefully on his bed with a satisfied expression on her face. There was also a unique smell in the air that he did not recognize.","Tian Qiyuan went to wake her up after staring at the sleeping beauty for a brief moment.","\"Mmm...\" Zi Xuan slowly opened her eyes to see Tian Qiyuan standing before her.","\"Are we going for another round?\" she muttered in a dazed voice, almost as if she believed that she was still dreaming.","\"Another round of what?\" Tian Qiyuan asked with raised eyebrows.","\"...\"","Zi Xuan quickly realized that she was no longer dreaming and swiftly sat up.","\"Nothing,\" she responded in a stiff voice.","\"I'm going to start crafting the weapon now, so come with me,\" he then said.","Zi Xuan nodded and fixed her robes before following him outside. She thought they were going to enter the smithy, but Tian Qiyuan went behind it, where a gold anvil was located.","\"We'll be doing it out here since we'll be using unique flames,\" he said.","\"For your safety, please watch from outside the island.\"","Zi Xuan nodded and flew away, stopping right outside the island.","Tian Qiyuan proceeded to remove the upper part of his robes, revealing his otherworldly physique that had been refined to perfection.","Zi Xuan nearly began drooling upon seeing his bare upper body.","\"Feng Feng!\" Tian Qiyuan suddenly called out.","Zi Xuan's expression immediately stiffened when the unfathomable presence she sensed from the volcano returned.","She turned to gaze at the island just as the volcano erupted. From the fiery chaos, a colossal figure emerged, its flaming wings unfurling to shroud half the sky.","\"A phoenix!?\" Zi Xuan cried out loud.","She had initially speculated the beast to be a phoenix when she first heard about it, but the likelihood of a phoenix collaborating with a human seemed so improbable that she dismissed it as a mistake.","'What kind of phoenix is it? I have seen phoenixes before, but none of them were covered in golden flames like this one! It's presence is also incomparably stronger!' Zi Xuan pondered inwardly as the phoenix flew to Tian Qiyuan, hovering above the entire island like a roof.","\"I'll be relying on you again for the next few days, Feng Feng.\" Tian Qiyuan said.","The phoenix did not respond; its gaze fixed intently on Zi Xuan.","Zi Xuan's entire being trembled upon sensing its stare. She had a feeling that she was not being regarded favorably.","'You are dirtying our sacred home with your vulgar presence, human.'","A cold voice suddenly resounded in Zi Xuan's head.","\"...\"","It was undoubtedly the phoenix's voice, but Zi Xuan could not respond. She feared that it might obliterate her if she did."]},{"number":1517,"title":"Chapter 1517 Feng Feng","paragraphs":["1517 Feng Feng","'Not only did you disturb my slumber, you even dared to dirty his room with your filthy bodily fluid! I should turn you into roasted meat!' The phoenix continued, even threatening to kill her.","Zi Xuan eventually snapped out of her daze and gritted her teeth before responding, 'As if a beast would understand human love! Once we become lovers, I will dirty his room with my bodily fluid every day!'","The phoenix's golden flames suddenly flared up, turning it into a bright sun that colored the entire world golden.","\"YOU AND I CANNOT COEXIST! ONE OF US WILL PERISH TODAY, AND IT WILL BE YOU!\" It screamed in a chilling voice, causing the entire world to tremble.","Seeing this, Tian Qiyuan spoke up, \"Don't be rude to our guest, Feng Feng.\"","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, the phoenix slowly calmed down. Yet, Zi Xuan could still feel its killing intent being directed at her.","\"Feng Feng.\" Tian Qiyuan called her out again.","\"Hmph.\"","The phoenix eventually stopped caring about Zi Xuan.","Zi Xuan's entire back was soaked in sweat after her confrontation with the phoenix.","Seeing her nervous expression, Tian Qiyuan said, \"Her name's Feng Tianru, but I call her Feng Feng since it has a nice ring to it. She was just a baby phoenix when I first found her, and she was injured, so I treated her. Since then, she's been following me like a pet. I think we were destined to meet.\"","\"Don't call me a pet!\" Feng Tianru shouted at him.","\"As you have experienced yourself, her temper is as fiery as her body of flames.\" Tian Qiyuan chuckled.","\"Anyway, enough chitchat. There's a lot of work to be done. Feng Feng, let's get started.\"","Tian Qiyuan walked to the anvil before using Qi Manifestation to place one of the materials on it.","He retrieved a black and golden hammer and said, \"Whenever you're ready.\"","A few moments later, Feng Tianru flapped her wings, spewing a waterfall of golden flames not just on the anvil but on Tian Qiyuan's figure as well, engulfing him in flames.","\"What the fu—?!\"","Zi Xuan's heart nearly jumped out of her chest when she saw this scene. However, she quickly realized that Tian Qiyuan was unharmed when she started hearing the sound of a hammer striking metal.","Clang. Clang. Clang.","A rhythmic sound filled the world with ripples appearing after every sound.","Before Zi Xuan realized it, her heartbeat had synchronized with the rhythm of Tian Qiyuan's hammering, filling her very existence with a sense of harmony.","Feng Tianru continued to shower Tian Qiyuan and the anvil with golden flames.","A few hours later, Tian Qiyuan moved another material to the anvil without stopping his hammer even a split second.","Ten hours... twenty hours... fifty hours...","Zi Xuan stood transfixed, her eyes glued to Tian Qiyuan's handsome figure, her heart swelling with a sense of wonder as the hours ticked by.","Seven days passed in a blur, and the sound of metal being hammered never stopped. Not even for a second.","\"You can stop now.\" Tian Qiyuan said to Feng Tianru, who immediately stopped producing flames for the first time in seven days.","Once the flames dispersed and Tian Qiyuan's figure emerged, his entire body was drenched in sweat, but there was not a single injury on his body. In fact, his physique looked even better than before.","He turned to look at Zi Xuan, who looked like she was on the verge of lunging at him like a rabbit in heat.","If it weren't for Feng Tianru's presence that kept her sanity in check, she would've definitely defiled every inch of his body.","\"Your sword is done.\"","Tian Qiyuan extended the sword in her direction; its gleaming blade held steady in his hand. Zi Xuan hastened to his side, her eyes flickering at the sight of the weapon as she hesitated, reluctant to touch it, her gaze lingering on its beauty.","The sword radiated an aura of a peak-quality Mystic-grade treasure, but its aura was so intense that Zi Xuan initially believed it to be an Empyrean-grade treasure. Its potency was so overwhelming that it eclipsed her usually sharp senses.","\"This sword will increase the potency of all your sword techniques, especially the Unrivaled Sword Art. Its blade was forged with naturally poisonous materials. While it won't kill your opponent, it will paralyze them, and depending on their cultivation, it may be indefinite. It's also incredibly durable—","near indestructive. Only a peak-quality Celestial-grade treasure would be able to damage it, and even that requires tremendous effort.\"","\"Go ahead and give it a few swings.\"","Zi Xuan's eyes locked onto the sword as she nodded, her hands moving with precision as she began performing the first three stages of the Unrivaled Sword Art. The moment she did, she felt a profound improvement in her technique, as if the sword's energy had awakened a deeper connection within her, and her movements became more fluid and effortless than she had ever imagined possible.","The sensation was so intoxicating that Zi Xuan found herself unable to stop. Her fingers moved with a life of their own as she seamlessly transitioned from the third stage to the next, each subsequent step revealing a deeper understanding of the technique as if the sword was guiding her through the motions, her proficiency growing with each passing moment.","Once she finished her performance, Zi Xuan's gaze remained fixated on the sword, seemingly unable to take her eyes off it.","\"What do you think? Do you like it?\" Tian Qiyuan suddenly asked.","Zi Xuan finally stopped looking at the sword and shifted her gaze to him.","With a beautiful smile, she nodded her head and said, \"I love it!\"","\"Then I will mark this commission fulfilled.\"","Zi Xuan retrieved the rare materials he wanted and gave them to him as payment.","\"What else from the list are you missing?\" she asked.","He showed her the list and said, \"This many.\"","\"Alright. I'll help you find them for more swords.\"","\"You want more already?\"","\"Am I not allowed to have more?\" she raised an eyebrow.","\"You can request as many commissions as you want as long as you bring me one of the listed materials. Otherwise, I am only creating one weapon for every individual.\"","\"I understand. I was planning on doing that, anyway.\" Zi Xuan said."]},{"number":1518,"title":"Chapter 1518 Exalted Blacksmith Fanatic","paragraphs":["1518 Exalted Blacksmith Fanatic","After Zi Xuan left Tian Qiyuan's world, she returned to her sect with her new sword, which she named Heaven's Intoxication due to how every sword crafted by Tian Qiyuan inevitably makes her feel heated and dazed, almost as though she was intoxicated.","The first thing she did when she returned to the Unrivaled Nine Swords Sect was to test the sword on someone, so she challenged another Unrivaled Sword to a match.","Despite the reluctance of the individual she chose to spar with, there was no room for refusal. The power and authority Zi Xuan commanded was undeniable, and he knew that she would not hesitate to attack him if he dared to refuse.","\"W-wait! What in heaven's name is that sword?!\"","Her opponent was immediately taken aback by the sword's overwhelming presence in Zi Xuan's grasp, a presence that seemed to radiate with a life of its own.","\"Heaven's Intoxication. It's my new favorite sword,\" she calmly said.","\"Ignoring the weird name, where did you acquire such a marvelous treasure?!\"","\"Exalted Blacksmith,\" she replied, her voice carrying a sense of pride.","\"Oh, I remember now. You won that auction a year ago with our sect's resources. Do you have any idea how much that hurt our finances? That amount could've supported our sect for another hundred fifty thousand years. The Sect Master would still cry even at the slightest mention of it.\"","\"Stop complaining. I only borrowed it, so I plan on paying it back. After all, it wouldn't truly be mine if I used another's wealth to buy it.\" Zi Xuan said in a nonchalant voice.","\"And how do you plan on doing that? Even if you sold your body, it wouldn't cover half of the costs!\"","\"I will be visiting the Primordial Chaos shortly to familiarize myself with Heaven's Intoxication by hunting Chaotic Beasts.\"","\"The Primordial Chaos?! That's reckless behavior, even by your standards! Do you have any idea how many God Ascension Realm cultivators perished in that place?!\"","\"You're worried about me? I don't need it.\"","\"I'm worried that the debt you owe to the sect will disappear with your pointless death!\"","\"That's none of your business. Anyway, let's get started. I have a lot of work to do.\"","After another warning, Zi Xuan attacked her opponent.","The fight was incredibly one-sided, with Zi Xuan dominating her opponent.","Their spar lasted half as long as it typically does, and after the spar, Zi Xuan immediately left the sect to start earning money at the Primordial Chaos, one of the most dangerous places in the Supreme Heaven.","Meanwhile, Tian Qiyuan continued to accept commissions for the next decade.","Once his fame had reached its peak and his reputation was unshakable, Tian Qiyuan stopped accepting normal commissions and only accepted commissions from those who could provide him with rare materials.","Although this sudden change upset many individuals, nobody dared complain, as it was already a miracle that he had accepted commissions from pretty much anybody with enough money for the last decade.","In the last decade, Tian Qiyuan managed to acquire seven more of the materials he needed for his masterpiece. However, he still needed dozens of materials, and it could take hundreds, if not thousands, of years before he had enough material to finally craft his masterpiece.","Zi Xuan returned to her sect after spending 50 years straight hunting Chaotic Beasts from the Primordial Chaos.","With the number of Chaotic Beasts she slew, she acquired a tremendous amount of fortune from selling the Chaotic Beasts' materials. However, a majority of her earnings went to pay back her debt to the Unrivaled Nine Swords Sect.","Then, with the rest of her money, she spent it on hiring scouts to search the Nine Heavens for the materials Tian Qiyuan needed.","If the materials were available, she would've spent it on purchasing them directly, but Tian Qiyuan could've done that already.","Eventually, she found several individuals who had one of these materials, but none of them were for sale.","Knowing that Tian Qiyuan had tried and failed, Zi Xuan opted to acquire them through other means. Thus, the Exalted Blacksmith Fanatic, who hasn't appeared in over 50 years, started causing havoc around the Nine Heavens once again.","\"Fuck! Why are you doing this?! Did the Exalted Blacksmith send you to rob me because I refused to sell it to him?!\" One of her victims cried out loud.","\"No, I am doing this on my own accord because I find it ridiculous.\"","\"The only thing ridiculous here is your existence!\"","\"Why are you hogging the material even though you don't plan on using it? Frankly, it's a waste of resources. If you ask me, it should be given to the Exalted Blacksmith, who will refine them into their purest form and craft the most beautiful treasures out of it.\"","\"This is a warning to the others. Either sell your materials and let them serve their purpose, or let me take them from you. I recommend the former since it'll earn you some money at the very least.\"","The Exalted Blacksmith Fanatic's warning would spread throughout the world like wildfire, terrifying the other collectors who had refused to sell their material.","When Tian Qiyuan heard the news, he couldn't help but laugh out loud, \"I don't know who this fanatic of mine is, but I truly appreciate it!\"","While he wouldn't stoop to the level of theft, he had no issue with someone doing it for him as long as he didn't personally encourage it.","He also agreed with the fanatic's words and believed that materials should serve their purpose instead of collecting dust.","After another twenty years, Zi Xuan appeared before him with a material that was on his list.","\"I'm here for my second sword!\" she greeted him with a wide smile.","It only took a glance for Tian Qiyuan to immediately recognize the material she brought as one of the materials he had failed to purchase.","\"So you're the Exalted Blacksmith Fanatic, huh?\" he smiled after coming to this realization."]},{"number":1519,"title":"Chapter 1519 Divine Blacksmith","paragraphs":["1519 Divine Blacksmith","\"E-Exalted Blacksmith Fanatic? Are you suggesting a connection between me and that enigmatic figure? What led you to such a conclusion?\" Zi Xuan swiftly retorted, her innocence a well-crafted facade.","\"So you're not the Exalted Blacksmith Fanatic? How did you acquire that material, then? I can remember and identify any material I've seen once, and that piece of Cold Stellar Iron was stolen from Gu Guming a few years ago.\" Tian Qiyuan spoke in a calm voice.","\"Is that so? I had no idea. I acquired this from the black market last month. So it was stolen by the Exalted Blacksmith Fanatic, huh? A fascinating revelation, but does it truly matter where it originated? It's in your possession now.\" Zi Xuan's words flowed as smoothly as her breath.","Seeing how stubborn she was to keep her identity a secret, Tian Qiyuan no longer tried to expose her and said, \"You're right. It doesn't matter where it came from.\"","Zi Xuan was slightly taken aback by how readily he accepted the situation. She was certain that he had a strict policy against accepting stolen materials, a rule that would have challenged her persuasive skills. But she was relieved that it wasn't the case.","\"You're a lot more open-minded than I'd anticipated. I know many blacksmiths who would not craft anything with materials acquired through unethical means,\" she expressed her surprise.","\"Would you rather I not accept the material, then? It's not like I don't have any standards or pride. I obviously won't steal anything myself, but how another individual acquires their material is none of my business. Of course, I'm not encouraging such actions, either. Moreover, how can one tell for sure their material wasn't acquired through unethical means?\"","In the cultivation world, where the pursuit of power and longevity often led to questionable ethics, murder was a common occurrence. Given this, Tian Qiyuan's acceptance of the stolen material was hardly unusual. For him, it was just another aspect of the cutthroat world he lived in.","\"Anyway, what kind of sword do you want this time?\" Tian Qiyuan asked.","\"I don't know, so I'll let you decide.\"","\"The same grade?\"","\"How many materials would it take for you to craft an Empyrean-grade treasure?\" she asked.","\"Well, I'll need at least five. However, I have yet to craft one, so you'll need to wait a little longer if you really want one.\"","\"Five, huh? Alright. I have four here.\" Zi Xuan retrieved three more materials. Naturally, all of them were stolen from their owners in the last few years.","\"Let me guess... you got them from the black market?\" Tian Qiyuan smiled at her nonchalant action.","\"Yup! It was sold to me as a bundle,\" she calmly nodded with an innocent smile on her face.","\"Give me two... no, one hundred years. I'll become a Divine Blacksmith by then.\"","\"Okay. I'll look for more materials in the meantime.\"","Zi Xuan left shortly afterward. Although she wanted to stay a little longer, she didn't want to delay his promotion to Divine Blacksmith even for a second.","After Zi Xuan left, Tian Qiyuan immediately began working toward Empyrean-grade treasures inside his world.","Most blacksmiths struggle to advance to the next level due to a lack of materials. Crafting treasures requires a significant amount of resources, which can be expensive, especially high-","grade treasures that require rare materials. Even recycling the materials afterward isn't enough to create something new, making it a major hurdle for those seeking to upgrade.","However, Tian Qiyuan didn't have to worry about lacking rare resources since his world had an abdunance of them. This is also how he managed to become a Grand Blacksmith in just a few thousand years, while most would take hundreds of thousands of years to reach that level.","While Tian Qiyuan entered seclusion to focus on his craft, Zi Xuan returned to collecting materials for him as the Exalted Blacksmith Fanatic.","Her existence has become such a menace that people form alliances and groups to hunt her down. However, Zi Xuan wasn't one of the strongest cultivators in the world for nothing. Even without revealing her true strength, she could easily deal with any adversaries.","A hundred years later, Tian Qiyuan emerged from his seclusion to auction off his newest creation and to let the world know of his advancements.","\"Did you hear? The Exalted Blacksmith has finally created an Empyrean-grade treasure, officially becoming a Divine Blacksmith!\"","\"Heavens! He's a Divine Blacksmith already!? He'd become a Grand Blacksmith not too long ago! How the hell is he progressing so fast?!\"","\"I call bullshit! There's no way that's possible!\"","\"It's true! He's auctioning off his Empyrean-grade treasure as we're speaking!\"","At the auction, Tian Qiyuan gave a quick speech before the battle, just like previously.","\"Although I've managed to craft an Empyrean-grade treasure, I can only do swords at the moment, so I do not consider myself a real Divine Blacksmith just yet. I will wait until I can craft other weapons of similar quality before I dare claim that title.\"","His humble demeanor left a favorable impression on many blacksmiths, including the Divine Blacksmiths out there.","\"And once again, I will accept a personal commission from the winner of this auction.\"","Once Tian Qiyuan left, the auction began shortly after.","The auction for the Empyrean-grade treasure was a frenzied mess, even more chaotic than the last Mystic-grade auction.","Sure enough, Zi Xuan was at this auction as well. Unfortunately, there were too many powerhouses present in this auction and she was unable to win this auction due to a lack of funds. While she had managed to win the last auction, it was mostly due to the treasure being mere Mystic-grade, and most of the truly wealthy bidders already possessed Empyrean-grade and above treasures, so they weren't as willing as her to spend a fortune on it.","In the end, the ancestor of the Holy Sword Monastery won the bid.","Zi Xuan was frustrated that she lost, but she did not despair, as there were opportunities to acquire it in the future."]},{"number":1520,"title":"Chapter 1520 Advancing Grades","paragraphs":["1520 Advancing Grades","After the auction ended, Tian Qiyuan had a quick meeting with the ancestor of the Holy Sword Monastery, a powerhouse that rivals the Unrivaled Nine Sword Sect and may even surpass it slightly.","The ancestor was a handsome young man with cultivation at the 8th level of the God Ascension Realm. Despite his young appearance, his eyes were filled with ancient wisdom acquired over hundreds of thousands of years.","\"It's a pleasure to meet you, Exalted Blacksmith. I am the ancestor of the Holy Sword Monastery, Sheng Qiu. We may have never met before, but you've crafted a sword for one of my disciples. When I saw his sword, I knew that I had to get one for myself sooner or later.\"","\"I am honored to have someone as revered as you to take interest in my humble creations. Are you going to request a commission from me?\" Tian Qiyuan asked.","\"Yes, but not right now. Can I save this commission for the future when you can give birth to Celestial-grade treasures?\"","\"Of course, but it might take some time before I reach that level.\"","\"Hahaha! By your words, you are essentially claiming to become the next God of Creation! Not even the Heaven and Earth Blacksmith or the Eternal Blacksmith would so boldly proclaim they possess what it takes to become the next God of Creation!\" Sheng Qiu laughed heartily at his audacious claim.","He continued, \"You act humble in public, but you're actually an egotistical bastard! I like you!\"","Naturally, Tian Qiyuan did not find any offense in his words despite being called an egotistical bastard.","\"If anyone can become the next God of Creation, it's you, Exalted Blacksmith. I eagerly look forward to the day your creations reach that level.\"","Sheng Qiu ended their conversation there and left the next moment.","\"If you ever need to sell anything, our Mystic Jade Auction Pavilion would be honored to serve you again, esteemed Exalted Blacksmith.\" Qing Ling'er bowed to him on his way out.","Tian Qiyuan made his way back to his world. However, someone had arrived before him.","\"You're here already?\" Tian Qiyuan smiled at Zi Xuan's presence.","\"You can craft Empyrean-grade treasures now, right? I also have the last material, so I'm here for my own Empyrean-","grade sword. It's a pity that I couldn't win that auction, but there's nothing I can do about it. There are many who are much wealthier than me.\" Zi Xuan sighed.","\"Let's go inside first.\"","Tian Qiyuan opened the entrance to his world and entered it, with Zi Xuan following behind.","Once inside, Zi Xuan asked, \"Have you thought about what kind of sword you'll make me next?\"","\"Of course. I had plenty of time to do so. However, do you really want a new sword? I can upgrade the last sword to Empyrean-grade, too. It'll retain the same appearance and have enhanced abilities.\"","\"Really? You can do that?\" Zi Xuan wore a surprised expression on her face.","In their world, upgrading weapons was a common practice, but advancing weapon grades was a more challenging task. The process required a high level of skill and craftsmanship, as well as a deep understanding of the materials and techniques involved. Only the most experienced and skilled blacksmiths could successfully advance a weapon's grade without significantly altering its original appearance and abilities.","As the grade of a weapon increased, the process of advancing it to the next level became progressively more challenging. In fact, only the Heaven and Earth Blacksmith, one of the top blacksmiths in the world, has managed to advance a Divine-","grade treasure to Ancient-grade before. Advancing Mystic-","grade to Empyrean-grade was literally unheard of and deemed impossible by even Divine Blacksmiths. Yet, Tian Qiyuan claimed that he had the ability without any hesitation in his voice.","Seeing the doubt and hesitation on Zi Xuan's face, Tian Qiyuan spoke, \"If I mess it up, I'll make you the exact same sword free of charge, as well as the Empyrean-grade sword.\"","\"Deal!\" All of Zi Xuan's hesitation was tossed out of the window after getting insurance for her sword.","\"What materials do you need from me?\" she asked as they approached his living quarters.","He pointed at the Golden Valley and said, \"I already have them.\"","\"Huh? But those are your materials.\"","\"I know. Consider it part of the deal. You're giving me five materials, after all. Also, it's easier to upgrade a sword than to create a new one.\"","\"It's easier to advance a sword than create one...? If other blacksmiths could hear your voice right now, they would be coming at you with their hammers raised, you know.\" Zi Xuan almost couldn't believe what she'd just heard.","Tian Qiyuan silently smiled at her words.","Once they arrived at the anvil, he extended his hand and said, \"Let me borrow your sword.\"","\"Alright.\"","Zi Xuan handed him the Heaven's Intoxication.","\"It'll be done in a few hours. Feng Feng!\"","When Feng Tianru emerged from the volcano, Zi Xuan hastily left the island, fearing that Feng Tianru would engulf her in flames.","Sure enough, Feng Tianru started spewing flames long before she even reached the island.","'That fucking phoenix really wanted to burn me!' Zi Xuan cursed inwardly after seeing this.","However, Feng Tianru didn't even spare her a gaze and focused on working with Tian Qiyuan.","A few hours later, Tian Qiyuan revealed the new and improved Heaven's Intoxication with barely any changes to its appearance at a glance.","\"Heavens... You really advanced it from Mystic-grade to Empyrean-grade...\" Zi Xuan was bewildered by the results.","If the world were to find out Tian Qiyuan could advance weapon grades like this, his fame and reputation would pierce the heavens.","\"Satisfied?\" he asked her.","\"Yes!\"","Zi Xuan wielded the sword in her grasp. While it felt the same as before, she sensed a much more profound energy coursing through it, allowing her to channel her own energy with far greater ease.","\"Thank you for the business again.\" Tian Qiyuan smiled."]},{"number":1521,"title":"Chapter 1521 Success Rate","paragraphs":["1521 Success Rate","\"So... when do you think you'll start crafting Celestial-grade treasures?\" Zi Xuan asked Tian Qiyuan shortly after putting away her sword.","\"You're asking me that when I just achieved Empyrean-grade not long ago? It'll probably take me thousands of years before I can achieve Celestial-grade.\"","\"Only thousands of years? You're actually more arrogant than I thought.\" Zi Xuan looked at him with wide eyes.","There were around 7 Divine Blacksmiths in the Nine Heavens at their current time, not including Tian Qiyuan. All seven of them are considered prodigies in their field of expertise, yet it took all of them hundreds of thousands of years to reach the level of Celestial-grade treasure.","In order to be acknowledged as the God of Creation, one must be able to craft Celestial-grade treasures and have at least a 25 percent success rate when doing so.","The blacksmith with the highest success rate at this moment was Eternal Blacksmith, who has an incredible 15 percent success rate after almost half a million years of being a Divine Blacksmith.","The next highest success rate was 10 percent by Heaven and Earth Blacksmith, who had 300,000 years of experience under his belt as a Divine Blacksmith.","\"By the way, what's your success rate with Mystic-grade treasures? Even Eternal Blacksmith only has a 70 percent success rate.\"","\"I've never failed before, so I guess 100 percent?\"","\"Y-you what?\" Zi Xuan's eyes widened with disbelief at his ridiculous claims.","\"I have crafted over a hundred Mystic-grade treasures by now and have not failed once. In fact, I've never destroyed a treasure before.\"","\"T-that's literally impossible!\" Zi Xuan exclaimed.","\"I always craft the treasure in my head first, and I won't begin if I cannot guarantee its success. If you don't believe me, I have nothing else to say. Or do you want me to prove myself by crafting a dozen Mystic-grade treasures for you?\" Tian Qiyuan casually shrugged.","Zi Xuan swallowed nervously. She really wanted to believe him, but this claim was simply too hard to believe.","If another blacksmith were here to hear such claims, they would laugh their assess off and immediately brand him as a liar and crazy, regardless of his prior fame and reputation.","\"Alright, I'll believe you.\" Zi Xuan eventually said.","But she was not finished and continued, \"But I won't stop you if you want to prove yourself. Of course, even if you manage to prove yourself to me, it won't really mean anything since I am just a single individual. Moreover, I really don't care if you prove yourself or not since I already said I believe you.\"","Tian Qiyuan remained silent for a moment before speaking, \"You can stay here a little longer if you want. I am going to craft a few more Empyrean-grade treasures to solidify my foundation.\"","\"Then I won't be humble!\" Zi Xuan, who was prepared to leave, immediately decided to stay a little longer.","Tian Qiyuan quickly went back to work and started crafting his next Empyrean-grade treasure.","However, he didn't immediately start the craft and instead sat down to cultivate.","\"Why are you suddenly cultivating?\" Zi Xuan asked with a puzzled face.","\"It helps me with my mental visualization,\" he said.","\"What...? Won't that have the opposite effect since cultivation requires more attention?\"","\"Is that how it works for you? It works differently for me, I guess.\"","Zi Xuan was speechless, and then she realized that he was speaking to her and cultivating at the same time, even acting very casually about it, like it was as natural as breathing.","'Just what kind of talent does he possess? It's too ridiculous...' she thought to herself.","Not wanting to disturb him, Zi Xuan silently watched him work over the next several months.","Before he started working on the first treasure, he had spent two days practicing inside his mind. Once he started, his first Empyrean-grade treasure required almost three weeks to complete. The next one only took two weeks.","After nearly three months of practice, he reduced that time to one week. However, his crafting speed wasn't anywhere near as ridiculous as his success rate. In three months, he crafted five Empyrean-grade treasures without failing a single one. Meanwhile, even the most experienced Divine Blacksmiths would fail at least three out of five.","Then, over the next three months, Tian Qiyuan made 12 Empyrean-grade treasures, succeeding in every attempt.","In half a year, he'd successfully crafted 17 Empyrean-grade treasures without wasting any materials. If the world knew of his achievements, it wouldn't surprise Zi Xuan if people started declaring him to be the new God of Creation even without needing to create any Celestial-grade treasures first.","\"What are you going to do with so many treasures? Sell them? I don't think the world is prepared to see 17 Empyrean-grade treasures half a year after you sold your first one.\" Zi Xuan said.","\"I'm going to recycle them to make more treasures,\" he casually said.","\"Seriously...? That seems like such a waste of resources. Even if you can recycle 90 percent of its original material, you'll still lose 10 percent every time. You might as well sell it and use that money to buy more resources. Who knows, you might even make a profit.\"","\"That will take too much time and effort. I am fine even if I lose some resources. It's only natural, after all.\"","Sometime later, Zi Xuan said goodbye to Tian Qiyuan.","\"It's about time for me to return to my sect. Thank you for letting me stay here to watch you train. It definitely opened my eyes and broadened my view.\"","\"See you next time.\" Tian Qiyuan bid her farewell.","Once Zi Xuan left, Tian Qiyuan reopened his store and returned to collecting materials while he continued to hone his skills.","Zi Xuan would often visit him to chat or simply hang around him. Tian Qiyuan did not mind her company, even enjoying it.","Five hundred years later, Zi Xuan suddenly appeared before him with this crucial information, \"Tian Qiyuan, I've found the Void Meteoroid Core! Or, more precisely, where to find it! They say it's at least a hundred million years old, too!\"","Hearing this, Tian Qiyuan halted whatever he was doing to look at her.","\"Where?\" he asked with a serious expression."]},{"number":1522,"title":"Chapter 1522 Void Meteoroid Core","paragraphs":["1522 Void Meteoroid Core","The Void Meteoroid Core is an extremely rare and sought-","after material that Tian Qiyuan planned to use as one of the cores for his masterpiece. As its name implies, it originates from the Void Meteoroid, an indestructible rock that traverses the starry sky. Since it is indestructible, the only way to access the core, its most valuable part, is to wait for it to break down naturally until only its core remains.","However, this process could take millions of years, and the longer it takes for the Void Meteoroid to complete it, the more valuable its core will be.","The last time a Void Meteoroid Core appeared in the world was seven million years ago, igniting a war that spread across the starry sky. This time would be no different.","\"I can take you to it, but there's already an ongoing battle between several powerhouses for it. How do you plan on participating? You're only a True Immortal. You'll die before you realize it.\" Zi Xuan said.","\"I'll try to get it for you, so just sit here and prepare your body for my return,\" she said with a passionate smile.","Tian Qiyuan chuckled at her words and said, \"I cannot risk losing it. Who knows how long it'll take for the next one to show up? Also, who said I am only a True Immortal?\"","Before Zi Xuan could even question his words, Tian Qiyuan released his suppressed cultivation and entered the God Ascension Realm.","His aura continued to surge, ascending swiftly through the levels of the God Ascension Realm, only stopping when his cultivation reached the ninth level of the God Ascension Realm.","This revelation shocked Zi Xuan speechless.","\"Y-you were at the peak of God Ascension Realm this entire time?!\" she cried out loud.","\"Of course,\" he smiled at her reaction.","'Fuck! I am really glad that I didn't force myself upon him at that time, or I would've ended up embarrassing myself!' she cried inwardly.","\"Can you bring me to the location? I'll compensate you later.\" Tian Qiyuan said a moment later.","\"Alright. Follow me.\"","Zi Xuan led Tian Qiyuan into the starry sky. The two of them traveled for three months straight without any breaks until they reached their destination. Long before their arrival, they could sense powerful ripples in the starry sky caused by cultivators engaged in fierce battles.","Upon arriving, they could see a dozen powerful experts engaged in several battles at once. Not far away from the battlefield was a beautiful black orb contained in a formation to prevent it from floating away or being stolen.","Tian Qiyuan did not immediately join the fight and watched for a little. The others noticed his presence even before he arrived, but seeing how he didn't join the fight, they didn't bother him. Of course, they still kept some of their attention on him, just in case.","Eventually, Tian Qiyuan approached them and spoke, his voice resounding in their minds, \"My name is Tian Qiyuan, also known as the Exalted Blacksmith. Just like you, my purpose here is the Void Meteoroid Core.\"","The experts temporarily halted their movements to look at Tian Qiyuan, who was hiding behind his usual mask. If he had been a nobody, they wouldn't have given him any attention, but Tian Qiyuan's fame is so widespread that they couldn't afford to ignore him.","Seeing that he'd acquired their attention, Tian Qiyuan continued, \"I do not want to resolve this with violence, so I have a suggestion—an offer for all of you who are fighting for the Void Meteoroid Core.\"","\"If all of us fought, there would only be one winner and many deaths. Instead, I will offer each of you a Celestial-grade treasure crafted by yours truly in exchange for letting me have the Void Meteoroid Core. This way, all of us win.\"","\"Celestial-grade treasure crafted by you? As enticing as that may sound, I know you only became a Divine Blacksmith several hundred years ago. Are you asking us to wait for hundreds of thousands of years? Even if we agree, we can't ensure that you'll keep your word in the future.\" One of them proclaimed his skepticism.","\"I mean no disrespect when I say this, but Exalted Blacksmith, even a Celestial-grade treasure crafted by you will not be as valuable as this Void Meteoroid Core.\"","\"If you want it, you'll have to fight for it like the rest of us.\"","After hearing their responses, Tian Qiyuan said, \"Indeed, even a Celestial-grade treasure would not be as valuable as this Void Meteoroid Core. However, I am not only offering the treasure.\"","After a slight pause, he continued in a cold tone, \"I am also letting you leave with your life. Is the Void Meteoroid Core worth more than your life? Instead of losing your life to me and losing the Void Meteoroid Core, you can leave with your life and a Celestial-grade treasure in the near future. If that's not good enough, I will have no other choice but to fight for it.\"","None of the experts there expected Tian Qiyuan to threaten all of them suddenly, Zi Xuan included.","\"All that fame must've gotten into your head, Exalted Blacksmith! You should stick to what you're good at—","hammering iron!\"","\"You should get the fuck out of here while we are still being nice! If you think we won't kill you just because you are a Divine Blacksmith, you need to think again!\"","Tian Qiyuan was one of the most popular and revered blacksmiths in the world. These experts knew that killing him would provoke the wrath of many powerful factions, as it would mean the end of not only his life but also all his future masterpieces.","In fact, it was an unspoken rule never to kill individuals of immense significance to the world if it was avoidable, such as top pill masters and blacksmiths, as their deaths would have unimaginable repercussions on the world.","With that said, there were several other Divine Blacksmiths besides Tian Qiyuan, and the world would still function properly, albeit a little worse, even if he were gone, and it wasn't as though he was irreplaceable.","\"It's clear that not all of you will accept my offer, but my offer is to each of you individually, so you can still individually accept my offer and leave this battlefield. I will give you ten seconds to decide. Once that time has run out, I will immediately begin killing everyone who refused to leave!\" Tian Qiyuan declared in a domineering manner, sending chills down Zi Xuan's entire being."]},{"number":1523,"title":"Chapter 1523 Hidden Strength","paragraphs":["1523 Hidden Strength","After the warning, Tian Qiyuan began counting down from ten.","\"Ten!\"","\"Nine!\"","\"This bastard's truly gone insane! What does he think he can do to us with his measly True Immortal cultivation?!\"","\"Eight!\"","\"Don't force our hands, Exalted Blacksmith!\"","\"Seven!\"","\"Six!\"","\"I'll accept your offer!\" One of them suddenly raised his hand before departing from the battlefield. In his eyes, it wasn't worth offending Tian Qiyuan for the Void Meteoroid Core, especially when he was already on the verge of giving up.","Tian Qiyuan acknowledged the person who accepted his offer with a nod and continued counting down.","\"Five!\"","\"Do you really think he'll live long enough to fulfill his promise to you?! He'll be killed by us long before then!\"","\"Four!\"","\"I'll also accept your offer, Exalted Blacksmith.\" Another person agreed to withdraw from the fight. In his eyes, even if Tian Qiyuan is killed in this battle, he could simply pretend that nothing happened and return to fighting for the Void Meteoroid Core afterward.","\"Three!\"","\"Two!\"","\"One!\"","In the end, only two people accepted Tian Qiyuan's offer and left the battlefield. However, they didn't completely leave and spectated their fight from a distance.","\"And zero. Starting now, whoever dares to block my path to the Void Meteoroid Core will be killed!\"","Tian Qiyuan spoke in a grim voice before releasing his suppressed cultivation.","His cultivation base immediately soared to the peak of the God Ascension Realm, shocking the others, as they were only between the 7th level and the 8th level of the God Ascension Realm.","\"This bastard has been hiding his cultivation this entire time?!\"","\"Fuck! We need to fight him together!\"","The people there quickly formed a temporary alliance to get rid of Tian Qiyuan, who was the biggest threat, not to mention his earlier provocation. This made it easier for them to work together.","Seeing this, Tian Qiyuan retrieved an Empyrean-grade sword and laughed out loud, \"This will make things move quicker!\"","His body suddenly surged with Sword Aura before turning into Enhanced Sword Aura. Then, after another push, it became Supreme Sword Aura, something only Zi Xuan had been able to achieve until now.","\"Y-you can use Supreme Sword Aura?!\" Zi Xuan was just as shocked as everyone else there, perhaps even more, as nobody there was more familiar with Supreme Sword Aura than her.","She had only discovered Supreme Sword Aura several thousand years ago, so it was quite shocking for a blacksmith who spends the majority of their time with a hammer to achieve Supreme Sword Aura.","Even the most talented Swordmasters, only slightly behind her, were nowhere near achieving Supreme Sword Aura.","While his enemies were in a daze, Tian Qiyuan swung his sword at them.","\"Endless Sword Domain.\"","Tens of thousands of swords enhanced with Supreme Sword Aura rushed at the small group of individuals before him.","They had been fighting for months before Tian Qiyuan's arrival without any clear winners. Yet, after showing up for less than an hour and with a single sword technique, Tian Qiyuan destroyed the bodies of half of the people there, forcing their souls to be homeless.","Tian Qiyuan did not immediately launch another attack. Instead, he casually approached the Void Meteoroid Core in the distance while ignoring the people around him.","The others were so stunned by what had just happened and his audacity to covet the material before he even finished killing a single one of them.","However, before any of them could act, Tian Qiyuan spoke in a cold voice, \"That was my last warning. I can guarantee that all of you will perish in the next attack.\"","Despite his bold and arrogant words, nobody there doubted it. They exchanged glances with each other to see if they were going to continue fighting Tian Qiyuan, which would undoubtedly lead to their death.","Suddenly, two more presences appeared in the distance, fast approaching from two different directions.","These two figures appeared almost at the same time.","Zi Xuan immediately recognized the newcomers as none other than the Eternal Blacksmith and Heaven and Earth Blacksmith! Since the Void Meteoroid Core was akin to a holy grail for blacksmiths, it wasn't weird for these two powerhouses to show up.","Tian Qiyuan halted his movements upon their arrival. Like him, they were both at the peak of the God Ascension Realm.","\"You... Exalted Blacksmith? Since when did you have such a profound cultivation base?\"","Both of them were shocked when they sensed Tian Qiyuan's cultivation base that rivaled them. Even though Tian Qiyuan caught up to them in terms of crafting skills, neither of them was too bitter or envious because of his low cultivation base. However, it turned out Tian Qiyuan had been hiding his cultivation base this entire time!","'How old is he, anyway? He only started making his presence known a few thousand years ago, but there's no way he's only that old! Both his cultivation base and smithing capabilities have already reached the peak of this world!' Eternal Blacksmith wore a pondering frown on his face.","Heaven and Earth Blacksmith also wore a similar look on his face. Both of them thought Tian Qiyuan was their junior, but with this new information, he might very well be their senior!","\"I don't want to fight to death with my fellow Divine Blacksmiths, but I really need that Void Meteoroid Core. Is there any way for me to convince you two to step back?\" Heaven and Earth Blacksmith was the first to speak, breaking the silence.","\"What a coincidence. I also really need the Void Meteoroid Core.\" Eternal Blacksmith said.","Tian Qiyuan narrowed his eyes at them.","After a moment of silence, he proposed, \"How about this? Instead of a deathmatch, let's fight as blacksmiths should. The three of us will compete against each other through our smithing skills, and the winner will take the Void Meteoroid Core.\"","\"Oh? What do you have in mind?\" Eternal Blacksmith's interest was immediately piqued, as this was also an opportunity to see which of them was the best.","\"I'm also listening.\" Heaven and Earth Blacksmith said."]},{"number":1524,"title":"Chapter 1524 Smithing Competition","paragraphs":["1524 Smithing Competition","\"I'm glad you both agree. Let's do something that won't take too long and is fair across the board.\" Tian Qiyuan said.","He continued, \"Before I give my suggestion, let me hear yours first.\"","The two of them began pondering.","A few moments later, Eternal Blacksmith spoke up, \"How about each of us craft five Empyrean-grade treasures with the same materials? The one with the most success wins. If there's a tie, the quality will determine the outcome.\"","\"That will take too long. Let's just see which of us can craft the highest grade and quality weapon.\" Heaven and Earth Blacksmith proposed.","Both tried to gain a slight advantage over each other, as Eternal Blacksmith was confident in his higher success rate, and Heaven and Earth Blacksmith was confident in his slightly superior quality.","Tian Qiyuan, after carefully listening to their suggestions, took ideas from both and proposed, \"How about we craft a weapon of every grade from Spirit-grade to Empyrean-grade? We will all receive the same material for every weapon, but how we use it will be dependent on our own expertise.\"","Heaven and Earth Blacksmith and Eternal Blacksmith exchanged glances with each other before nodding their heads.","\"Let's schedule this match half a year from now. For the time being, we can give the Void Meteoroid Core to someone trustworthy to hold. If they dare covet it, we'll work together to destroy them. How does that sound?\" Tian Qiyuan said a moment later.","\"Who can we trust the Void Meteoroid Core to?\" Heaven and Earth Blacksmith asked.","\"I will do it!\" Zi Xuan suddenly spoke up.","\"I am Zi Xuan, one of nine Unrivaled Swords from the Unrivaled Nine Swords Sect.\" Zi Xuan quickly volunteered to hold it.","\"The Sword Goddess, huh? I trust the Unrivaled Nine Swords Sect enough, so I have no problem.\" Eternal Blacksmith said.","\"If you're okay with them, I don't mind letting them hold the Void Meteoroid Core.\" Heaven and Earth Blacksmith agreed.","\"Then it's settled.\"","Tian Qiyuan grabbed the Void Meteoroid Core before tossing it to Zi Xuan.","\"What about the location?\" Eternal Blacksmith suddenly asked.","\"I'll let you two decide.\" Tian Qiyuan said.","\"How about the Grand Elder Summit? It's a hotspot for blacksmiths with plenty of competitions around the year.\" Heaven and Earth Blacksmith suggested.","\"That sounds good. Let's use the Grand Elder Summit for our competition.\" Eternal Blacksmith agreed with the location.","He continued, \"What about the materials?\"","\"I'll supply them.\" Tian Qiyuan calmly said.","\"I will also throw in some materials.\" Heaven and Earth Blacksmith said.","\"In that case, I will do the same.\"","\"Good, then I'll see you both at the Grand Elder Summit in half a year.\" Tian Qiyuan left the scene with Zi Xuan shortly after.","Eternal Blacksmith and Heaven and Earth Blacksmith disappeared soon after, leaving the others utterly dumbfounded and dispirited, feeling as though their existences didn't even matter.","The upcoming match between the top three Divine Blacksmiths quickly spread through the Nine Heavens like wildfire, especially among blacksmiths.","Matches between Divine Blacksmiths were rare events, so one could imagine the excitement when news spread of a three-","way competition between the three most famous Divine Blacksmiths of their era.","Moreover, this match would finally answer a question that had been debated for thousands of years: which of them was the best?","Soon, the Grand Elder Summit became immensely crowded with people eager to witness the upcoming match. It was to the point where it became nearly impossible to walk in the streets without bumping into others or being bumped in every direction.","Even major sects and many famous families showed up just to spectate the match.","Half a year later, Tian Qiyuan made his way to the Grand Elder Summit.","When he arrived, Heaven and Earth Blacksmith and Eternal Blacksmith were already waiting at the peak of the summit, where the match would take place. Zi Xuan was also there with the Void Meteoroid Core, but she was not alone. The Sect Master of the Unrivaled Nine Swords Sect was also there to represent the sect, as well as the other eight Unrivaled Swords.","Since Zi Xuan gave their sect this opportunity to shine, it would be a waste not to take advantage of it.","The number of spectators was massive, enough to make Tian Qiyuan's previous auction look tiny in comparison. Moreover, influential figures from most of the top families and sects in the Eighth Heaven and Ninth Heaven were present, something that rarely happens.","In the center was a large arena with all of the necessary equipment for the competitors to craft their treasures.","Not far away were three large piles of materials, enough to craft a treasure of each grade with some leftovers.","\"Thank you all for coming to witness this historic event.\" Eternal Blacksmith spoke in a loud voice shortly after Tian Qiyuan arrived.","\"Over the next few weeks, the three of us will be showcasing our smithing experience to the whole world and, at the same time, competing with each other for the Void Meteoroid Core.\"","\"We will be crafting one weapon for each grade, all the way up to Empyrean-grade. We all have the same amount and type of materials, but how we distribute and utilize these materials will be entirely at our discretion.\"","\"We will be judged on our speed, success rate, and quality, and we must successfully create a weapon of every grade in order to be judged, so failing to create a single treasure means an automatic disqualification.\"","\"Before we begin, we shall give a brief introduction of our background and experience.\"","Eternal Blacksmith began talking about his background. He spoke of his earlier days as an apprentice blacksmith, what caused him to choose such a path, how long it'd taken him to reach his current level, and all sorts of personal achievements that were unknown to the public until today.","Despite calling it a brief introduction, Eternal Blacksmith ended up talking for two hours straight. However, nobody minded, as this was valuable information about one of the most respected and skilled blacksmiths in the entire Nine Heavens."]},{"number":1525,"title":"Chapter 1525 Uncle Chen’s Weapon Store","paragraphs":["1525 Uncle Chen's Weapon Store","Heaven and Earth Blacksmith stepped forward and began introducing himself once Eternal Blacksmith ended his introduction.","Not wanting to fall behind Eternal Blacksmith, Heaven and Earth Blacksmith also talked about his personal achievements that were never made public. He also spoke of his childhood, where he trained to become the blacksmith he is today and many more. In the end, his introduction lasted three full hours.","Tian Qiyuan nearly fell asleep by the end. Once it was his turn, he stepped forward and cleared his throat before speaking, \"My name is Tian Qiyuan, and I was born within the Sixth Heaven. The first thing I did when I became a proper cultivator was find a weapon. I purchased my first weapon from Uncle Chen's Weapon Store, which was just down the block. Uncle Chen's Weapon store was quite popular in my city, and they boasted of having near-indestructible weapons.\"","\"With Uncle Chen's weapon in my grasp, I felt safe, as if no harm could come to me as long as I had it. Unfortunately, Uncle Chen's weapon broke on my very first experience with it, and I nearly died in the process. I was devastated—to the point where I vowed to become a blacksmith who can create truly indestructible weapons.\"","\"I don't know who this Uncle Chen is, but I'm glad he made trash. If it weren't for him, the Exalted Blacksmith might not exist today...\" Zi Xuan muttered to herself after learning this information.","Tian Qiyuan continued, \"I started my journey as a blacksmith a few years later, but with no guidance or knowledge of smithing, I decided to join a sect. I approached the Fiery Hill of Fire Mountain in hopes of becoming their disciple, but alas, they deemed me unworthy and didn't even let me participate in their entrance exam.\"","\"Fiery Hill of Fire Mountain?\"","Upon hearing this familiar name, many people there suddenly turned to look at a certain individual in the audience.","This individual wore an expression on his face that made it seem like he'd swallowed a live fly. He was the current Sect Master of the Fiery Hill of Fire Mountain, a very reputable sect that produced many genius blacksmiths throughout the years.","Sensing countless unfriendly and disappointed gazes directed at him, the Sect Master of the Fiery Hill of Fire Mountain hastily stood up and said, \"I-I had no idea about this! I will find the blind bastard who turned you away and skin him alive, even if it's the last I do!\"","Tian Qiyuan turned to look at the Sect Master and smiled, \"Don't worry about it. It happened thousands of years ago. I was just a nobody back then, after all.\"","\"Huh?\"","Many in the audience suddenly raised an eyebrow, as if they had collectively realized something.","This included Eternal Blacksmith and Heaven and Earth Blacksmith.","\"H-hey... Exalted Blacksmith... how old are you, exactly?\" The Heaven and Earth Blacksmith was the first to voice the question that had been on everyone's mind for a while now.","\"Hm? I stopped counting long ago, but I should be around 11 thousand years old,\" Tian Qiyuan casually responded.","\"ONLY ELEVEN THOUSAND YEARS OLD?!?!\"","Both Eternal Blacksmith and Heaven and Earth Blacksmith exclaimed out loud, their voice in sync with each other.","\"Heavens...\" Zi Xuan covered her mouth in a shocked manner.","\"You're lying! There's no way you're only 11,000 years old!\" Eternal Blacksmith pointed at him and shouted, rejecting his claims.","\"You're telling us to believe that you'd managed to reach the peak of God Ascension Realm and become a Divine Blacksmith in 11,000 years?! Are you mocking us right now?\"","Tian Qiyuan shrugged in response, \"Whether you believe me or not is none of my business.\"","\"Anyway, we're getting off track. After being rejected by the Fiery Hill of Fire Mountain, I tried several more sects only to be refused by them.\"","Tian Qiyuan quickly brushed off the matter of his age and continued his story while ignoring the audience's stare.","\"In the end, I decided to study alone. I purchased a book that taught the basics and started my journey to become a blacksmith from there.\"","\"N-now you're claiming to have self-taught yourself...? That kind of fucking bullshit is this...?\" Eternal Blacksmith almost lost all of his respect for Tian Qiyuan after his seemingly bogus claims.","Heaven and Earth Blacksmith was in a similar position. He was so enraged that his face became red, and his entire body was trembling. If there weren't so many people around them, he would've already started throwing fists at Tian Qiyuan.","Noticing the heavy atmosphere around him, Tian Qiyuan ended his introduction and said, \"Well, that's about it. Let's get the competition started, shall we?\"","\"...\"","Although Tian Qiyuan's introduction lasted only several minutes, its impact on the audience was greater than that of Eternal Blacksmith and Heaven and Earth Blacksmith combined.","'He must've done that on purpose so he could mess with our heads, which will affect our performance during the competition! What a crafty son of a bitch!' Eternal Blacksmith suddenly had a revelation, which helped him calm down almost immediately.","Heaven and Earth Blacksmith took a little longer to realize this, but he started laughing once he did.","\"Hahaha! Fuck! You almost got me there, Exalted Blacksmith! You're much more cunning than I'd thought!\"","\"Huh? What are you talking about?\" Tian Qiyuan questioned with a genuinely puzzled face.","\"Still trying to deny it? Alright, let's have it your way.\"","When the audience witnessed their conversation, they quickly came to the same conclusion as Eternal Blacksmith and Heaven and Earth Blacksmith.","\"Oh, so the Exalted Blacksmith was only trying to mess with their minds to have an upper hand during the competition? I thought he was being serious at first. Now that I think about it, it was silly of me to believe him even for a second.\"","Tian Qiyuan eventually understood their misunderstanding, but he had no reason to correct them, so he remained silent.","Sometime later, the three Divine Blacksmiths approached their anvil, starting the competition shortly after."]},{"number":1526,"title":"Chapter 1526 Divine Blacksmith Competition","paragraphs":["1526 Divine Blacksmith Competition","\"Let the competition for the Void Meteoroid Core begin!\" Zi Xuan declared shortly after the three Divine Blacksmiths arrived at their workstations.","When the competition began, the three Divine Blacksmiths used their divine sense to check the materials. Each of them brought their own material, and none of them knew what the other would bring until the day of the competition. This made it so they couldn't spend half a year preparing for the competition.","Once they identified all of the materials, they sat down and closed their eyes to run simulations within their mind.","\"What are they doing?\" Someone who wasn't knowledgeable about the process asked out loud.","The person next to him, a renowned blacksmith, explained, \"They are currently crafting the weapons in their mind. An experienced blacksmith has the ability to recreate the process of creation inside their head, and the more skillful they are, the more accurate it'll be.\"","\"Since they're not just crafting a single weapon but seven weapons, each with a different grade, they need to allocate the materials for each weapon properly, or they might not have enough materials.\"","Four days later, Eternal Blacksmith was the first one to emerge from his meditation and immediately got to work. He retrieved several materials from the pile and started refining them.","\"Judging by the materials he picked, he's going to start crafting an Ancient-grade treasure. It's not too easy and not too difficult—perfect for a warmup.\" One of the blacksmiths there explained.","Heaven and Earth Blacksmith emerged from his meditation six hours after Eternal Blacksmith and immediately went to work.","\"Looks like Heaven and Earth Blacksmith plans on starting at Spirit-grade, working up the grades one by one.\"","Tian Qiyuan remained in meditation, seemingly unaffected and undisturbed by the noises coming from the other two.","A few hours after Heaven and Earth Blacksmith began his work, he finished his first creation, a shortbow, and placed it on a display rack with seven slots.","Heaven and Earth Blacksmith was renowned for crafting the finest bows, daggers, and gauntlets in the Nine Heavens and was expected by many to focus on creating these weapons during the competition.","\"Oh! Even though it's only a Spirit-grade treasure, its aura is stronger than many Earth-grade treasures!\" The audience inspected the result with their divine sense.","Heaven and Earth Blacksmith immediately proceeded to work on the second treasure, which, as someone had anticipated, appeared to be Earth-grade.","Three more days passed in the blink of an eye, and Eternal Blacksmith had just finished his first creation. It was an Ancient-grade spear.","Just like Heaven and Earth Blacksmith, Eternal Blacksmith appeared to be focused on his strengths, which were spears, swords, sabers, and anything with a similar shape.","Meanwhile, Heaven and Earth Blacksmith was already on his fourth creation at Divine-grade.","As for Tian Qiyuan, he was still meditating.","\"Exalted Blacksmith may produce higher quality treasures, but his speed is lagging behind the other two, and it's not by a small margin, either.\"","\"I wonder what's taking him so long.\"","\"Only time will tell.\"","Meanwhile, Eternal Blacksmith began working his way down to Divine-grade.","Sometime later, as Heaven and Earth Blacksmith finished his Divine-grade treasure and began working on his Ancient-","grade treasure, Tian Qiyuan finally emerged from his meditation and walked to his pile of materials.","Both Heaven and Earth Blacksmith and Eternal Blacksmith gave him a quick glance that lasted half a second before ignoring him again.","Once Tian Qiyuan picked his materials, it was clear that he intended to follow Heaven and Earth Blacksmith's path by working his way up from the lowest grade.","The moment Tian Qiyuan started refining the materials, his skills also became clear. Although his mental simulations appeared slower than the other two, his craftsmanship was clearly superior. Each time his hammer struck the material, it produced a harmonic sound that soothed the heart.","When the audience heard this noise, several individuals there suddenly closed their eyes and began cultivating. They quickly realized that it was easier to cultivate while listening to the sound of Tian Qiyuan's hammering, feeling as if they were being guided by it.","In fact, even the other two Divine Blacksmiths found themselves hammering to Tian Qiyuan's rhythm, as though they were hypnotized by it.","'Fuck! Why does the hammer feel so much better in my grasp when I follow his rhythm?!' Heaven and Earth Blacksmith gritted his teeth in frustration when he realized this.","Eternal Blacksmith also sighed inwardly. He'd been a blacksmith for hundreds of thousands of years by this point, but he'd never felt such peace when hammering at the anvil.","'What's so different between the way he hammers and the way I do it?! I cannot tell!'","What frustrated him the most was his inability to comprehend their difference. This sort of phenomenon only happens when one's skill is drastically superior to the other.","Both Heaven and Earth Blacksmith and Eternal Blacksmith felt defeated by the sound of Tian Qiyuan's hammering alone, but they couldn't afford to mess up in this competition and told themselves that this competition was more than just about quality. Moreover, no matter how high-quality Tian Qiyuan's treasures may come out, there was always the chance he would mess up at the very end.","'Let's see if he can keep this up for the rest of the competition!' Eternal Blacksmith started hammering his weapon more fiercely, creating a separate rhythm that directly clashed with Tian Qiyuan's.","Not wanting to lose to either of them, Heaven and Earth also created his own cadence, one that would go fast and slow at a specific rate.","Even though there were three distinct rhythms, none of the competitors were distracted by the others; each was entirely focused on their own cadence.","Half an hour later, Tian Qiyuan's cadence stopped when he finished his first creation, which turned out to be a gauntlet.","\"He finished the Spirit-grade treasure so quickly! Several times faster than Heaven and Earth Blacksmith!\" The audience didn't miss this detail.","After putting his creation on display, Tian Qiyuan immediately began working on the next grade.","Ding! Ding! Ding!","The audience was surprised when Tian Qiyuan's cadence sounded different than before. This time, it was slightly quicker, with pauses every five strikes.","Half an hour later, Tian Qiyuan finished the Earth-grade treasure, a bow, spending the same amount of time he spent with the Spirit-grade treasure. Typically, it takes longer to craft higher-grade treasures due to the stronger materials used, but that logic did not seem to apply to Tian Qiyuan.","The same phenomenon occurred when Tian Qiyuan crafted his Heaven-grade treasure, which took the form of a saber.","\"How's he doing that?! I have never heard of anyone crafting a Heaven-grade treasure in less than half an hour!\" The blacksmiths watching were left stunned.","\"Fuck! It's too amazing! Do you think he'll do the same with Divine-grade?!\"","\"Surely, that won't happen.\"","\"It can't happen! My heart won't be able to take it!\"","As Tian Qiyuan began working on his Divine-grade treasure, his cadence sped up again. It'd become clear to the audience that Tian Qiyuan increases his cadence the higher the grade.","Half an hour later, Tian Qiyuan hung his finished product on the display, catching up with Heaven and Earth Blacksmith. The audience stared at the Divine-grade spear with awed expressions, many of them in disbelief.","\"Don't tell me he'll do the same thing with Ancient-grade...\"","\"That would be ridiculous!\"","\"Won't the quality suffer if he's working this fast?\" Someone asked.","\"That will depend on his skill.","The audience expected Tian Qiyuan to spend half an hour with the Ancient-grade treasure. However, he didn't start working and sat down to meditate again.","\"Huh? He's meditating again? I thought he finished with that already.\"","\"Perhaps he'd only managed to craft up to Divine-grade initially?\"","\"If it already takes him so many days to craft up to Divine-","grade, how long will it take him to finish Ancient-grade and above? Weeks? Months?\"","\"This doesn't make any sense. One typically works faster in their mental simulation than in reality. Exalted Blacksmith is somehow doing it in reverse!\"","\"Truly an unfathomable existence...\"","Several days later, Tian Qiyuan emerged from his meditation at the same time Heaven and Earth finished his Ancient-grade treasure.","As for Eternal Blacksmith, he'd also finished every grade below Ancient-grade.","Both Eternal Blacksmith and Heaven and Earth Blacksmith started working on their Mystic-grade treasure on the same day, with Eternal Blacksmith being an hour ahead.","While they started refining their materials for the Mystic-","grade treasure, Tian Qiyuan began working on his Ancient-","grade treasure.","The audience held their breaths as the timer neared thirty minutes, wondering if Tian Qiyuan would be able to create another miracle.","When thirty minutes passed and Tian Qiyuan was still hammering away at the material, many sighs of relief could be heard from the audience, most of them coming from blacksmiths.","\"Thank the heavens he didn't finish in thirty minutes. I would've quit my career as a blacksmith if he did.\"","However, after another twenty minutes, the blacksmiths who sighed in relief earlier began holding their breaths nervously again, as they could tell that Tian Qiyuan was on the verge of finishing.","\"Heavens! It hasn't even been an hour! What kind of ridiculous speed is this?! Even the Heaven and Earth Blacksmith and Eternal Blacksmith took several days to craft an Ancient-","grade treasure!\"","Meanwhile, both Heaven and Earth Blacksmith and Eternal Blacksmith were too absorbed in their work to pay attention to anything else.","After putting up his treasure, Tian Qiyuan returned to meditating. However, nobody dared to make fun of him for being slow anymore."]},{"number":1527,"title":"Chapter 1527 Half the Materials","paragraphs":["1527 Half the Materials","As Eternal Blacksmith and Heaven and Earth Blacksmith neared the completion of their Mystic-grade treasure several weeks later, Tian Qiyuan opened his eyes and emerged from his meditation once again.","He quickly gathered the materials and started creating his Mystic-grade treasure. Once he refined the materials and began forming its shape, it was clear that he intended to create a sword.","'He's doing the sword now? I figured that he would save that for his Empyrean-grade treasure since that's what he's most familiar with...' Zi Xuan was surprised by Tian Qiyuan's choice.","If one looked at all of the treasures Tian Qiyuan had created up to this point, none of them were the same type of weapon. Meanwhile, Eternal Blacksmith and Heaven and Earth Blacksmith only crafted what they were famous for. Even without Tian Qiyuan winning, many blacksmiths would agree that Tian Qiyuan was the better blacksmith of the three in terms of skills due to his ability to craft excellent quality weapons of all types equally.","\"How long do you think it'll take him this time?\"","\"Probably two hours.\"","\"No way.\"","\"I'll sell my left nut if he does it within 2 hours.\"","\"Why the left nut, specifically?\"","\"Maybe because he already sold his right nut?\"","The audience cracked jokes with each other. However, most, if not all, of the blacksmiths there remained focused on the competition, not daring to miss any moment of it. To witness a Divine Blacksmith at work was a rare moment, much less three of the best in the Nine Heavens simultaneously.","Additionally, merely by watching these Divine Blacksmiths at work, their own understanding of smithing deepened.","A few hours passed, but Tian Qiyuan had not yet finished his treasure, allowing the other blacksmiths to sigh in relief. Had he completed a Mystic-grade treasure in such a short time, it would have undoubtedly ended many blacksmiths' careers that day.","Heaven and Earth and Eternal Blacksmith finished their Mystic-grade treasures two days later.","With just one treasure remaining to craft, they didn't immediately start working on their final treasure and returned to meditating first.","Even with their experience and skills, they had about a 60 to 70 percent chance of success when it comes to Empyrean-","grade, and any mishap would instantly destroy their chances of success.","Tian Qiyuan finished his Mystic-grade treasure three days later and placed the sword on display.","Zi Xuan had an urge to take the sword for herself when she saw it, but she managed to hold herself back.","\"He's probably going to spend the next week meditating again.\" The audience speculated when Tian Qiyuan was done.","However, to their shock, Tian Qiyuan did not meditate and even grabbed more materials.","\"He's going to attempt crafting the Empyrean-grade without any preparations?! Even the other two decided to meditate first!\"","\"Why is he rushing to create the treasure when he took his sweet time before this? What's going on inside his head?\"","\"He only became a Divine Blacksmith not long ago, right? His success rate must be pretty low right now, so one would expect him to take his time, but this is...reckless?\"","\"Even Eternal Blacksmith, renowned for his high success rate, only had around thirty percent success rate when he first became a Divine Blacksmith.\"","\"Maybe he's trying to show off?\"","\"Hasn't he already shown off enough? He doesn't need to prove himself anymore.\"","As the audience spoke about Tian Qiyuan's decision, the person himself finished picking out his materials, which left everyone puzzled.","\"Huh? He's leaving behind so many materials even though this is the last treasure he needs to craft.\"","Everyone there expected Tian Qiyuan to use all of the remaining material for the final treasure, but he only took half of it. This puzzled everyone, including the expert blacksmiths.","However, Tian Qiyuan didn't bother explaining his actions and immediately went to work.","Ding! Ding! Ding!","His hammer danced back and forth in a rhythmic manner, causing sparks to fly in every direction with every strike.","A few days later, Eternal Blacksmith emerged from his meditation, and he was surprised to see Tian Qiyuan had already started crafting his final treasure.","'What the hell? He's managed to get ahead of us? Did he go straight into it without preparations?' Eternal Blacksmith quickly came to this conclusion after seeing Tian Qiyuan's progress.","He looked at the small pile of materials and became even more confused.","'Is he even trying to win? There's no way he can craft a high-","quality Empyrean-grade treasure with the amount of materials he used.'","Eternal Blacksmith stopped looking at Tian Qiyuan and focused on his own creation. Naturally, he used all of the materials he had left.","Heaven and Earth Blacksmith came out of his meditation a day and a half after Eternal Blacksmith. However, he panicked a little when he saw that he was last to begin working.","'I would understand it if it's Eternal Blacksmith, but Exalted Blacksmith, too?! He was several days behind us! How did he catch up so quickly?!'","Even though he noticed Tian Qiyuan's leftover materials, Heaven and Earth Blacksmith was in too much of a hurry to think twice about it. He quickly got to work shortly after.","\"Finally, the conclusion of this competition is near its end. It should only take them around a month to complete their work.\"","\"Who do you think will win?\"","\"Judging purely on the current results, I'd say Exalted Blacksmith has a really good chance of winning. Not only are his treasures of higher quality than the other two, but his collection is also very diverse. Meanwhile, the other two not only lost in quality but also in variety.\"","\"While it's true that Exalted Blacksmith has the upper hand right now, things might change at the very end. I don't know why, but Exalted Blacksmith opted to use less material for his final creation, which is also the one that will grant him the most points.\"","\"He might not even complete the final task because he rushed it.\"","\"Who are you to claim that he rushed it? Exalted Blacksmith's comprehension is beyond any of our understanding!\"","Time passed quickly, and the audience speculated on the results nonstop.","Two weeks had passed since Tian Qiyuan started working, and it looked like he was on the verge of completing his treasure.","\"That shape... he's creating a dagger?\" Zi Xuan muttered to herself as Tian Qiyuan molded the shape.","A few hours later, Tian Qiyuan completed his treasure. It turned out to be a medium-grade Empyrean-grade treasure.","He placed the dagger on the display, filling all six slots. However, instead of leaving the arena like everyone had expected, Tian Qiyuan returned to the anvil with the remaining materials.","\"What the hell? He's not done?\"","\"What could he craft with so little materials?\"","\"The materials are quite high in quality, so it'd be really wasteful to create low-grade treasures with them. However, there's not enough to create another high-grade treasure, either. In the end, his treasures came out as medium-grade because he didn't use them. If he did, it would've come out high-quality, perhaps even peak-quality.\" One of the blacksmiths there explained.","\"I guess we can only wait and see what he cooks up with it.\"","In the blink of an eye, another week passed.","Both Eternal Blacksmith and Heaven and Earth Blacksmith were on the verge of completing their weapon.","\"Hey... the fact it's taking Exalted Blacksmith this long to craft the treasure... don't tell me it's another Empyrean-grade treasure?\" Someone suddenly speculated.","\"Huh? From that small pile of treasures? No way! There's not enough materials!\"","\"I swear on my soul I will sell my left nut if he crafts another Empyrean-grade treasure!\" One of the blacksmiths there declared.","The audience waited in anticipation as Tian Qiyuan neared the process of forming the treasure's shape.","\"It's another dagger! He's making another dagger!\"","After another three days, Tian Qiyuan finished his eighth treasure.","The aura it emitted was not inferior to his previous creation, and when the audience realized he had crafted two Empyrean-grade treasures, it sent them into a frenzy.","\"Heavens! Exalted Blacksmith actually crafted two Empyrean-","grade treasures!\"","\"Fuck me, he actually did it! And it's medium-quality! I heard someone swear on their soul that they'll sell their left nut if it was achieved! Is he actually going to do it?!\"","The person who made said declaration looked devastated after seeing the results. His face was as pale as sheets, and he looked like he was standing before his own grave.","He could feel many gazes on him, which only worsened his anxiety. He'd made such a bold declaration because he was certain that it wasn't possible. Unfortunately, Tian Qiyuan had made the impossible possible.","The man wanted to go back on his words, and even if it were a half-assed oath, he'd swore on his soul that he would do it. If he fails to fulfill his oath, his soul may be shattered by heavenly tribulation.","While the man lamented his situation, Tian Qiyuan placed the second Empyrean-grade dagger on the same display as the first. As the two daggers touched, they emitted a harmonic aura, as if they were destined to be a pair.","\"...\"","Eternal Blacksmith and Heaven and Earth Blacksmith suddenly halted their hammers for the first time since they started working.","Although the chaotic audience didn't disturb them, the aura radiating from the daggers was so profound that it momentarily blanked their minds upon sensing it. Once their hammers stopped and their momentum killed, their chances of finishing the treasure dropped significantly, to the point where it was almost guaranteed to fail.","However, neither of them were angry. They knew that even if they completed their treasure, it would not be enough to defeat Tian Qiyuan, who crafted two Empyrean-grade treasures."]},{"number":1528,"title":"Chapter 1528 A Special Sword","paragraphs":["1528 A Special Sword","\"I admit defeat. I never even considered crafting two Empyrean-grade treasures.\" Eternal Blacksmith declared shortly after he stopped working.","\"It's also my defeat. Congratulations, Exalted Blacksmith. You're the winner of this competition.\" Heaven and Earth Blacksmith said afterward.","Tian Qiyuan bowed to them with a smile, \"Thank you. It was a fun experience. I never had the opportunity to experience this kind of excitement before. I hope we can do this again in the future.\"","Sometime later, Zi Xuan approached Tian Qiyuan with the Void Meteroid Core in her grasp.","\"Congratulations, Qiyuan,\" she said as she offered the material to him.","\"Thanks.\" Tian Qiyuan casually accepted the prize before tossing it into his spatial ring.","\"Since when did you become so close to Exalted Blacksmith?\" The Sect Master of the Unrivaled Nine Swords Sect inquired with interest.","If Zi Xuan and Tian Qiyuan were in a romantic relationship, it would greatly benefit their sect.","Hearing his question, Tian Qiyuan responded calmly, \"She's my number one customer, so we see each other often.\"","\"I see... Oh, I am Three Swords Divine, the sect master of the Unrivaled Nine Swords Sect.\"","In the upper heavens, immortals who have achieved great feats and widespread recognition are bestowed with a title of their own choosing. As a display of respect, this title is used in place of their actual name, which is reserved only for close friends and family.","As for Tian Qiyuan, he did not pick the title Exalted Blacksmith, which became widespread before he even realized it. However, he never corrected it or changed it, so it just stuck with him.","\"By the way, Exalted Blacksmith, Heaven and Earth Blacksmith, and Eternal Blacksmith, I have a small question for you. What do you plan on doing with the treasures you crafted during the competition?\" Three Swords Divine asked.","When the audience heard this question, they stopped talking to focus on the Divine Blacksmiths' response. They had all been wondering about it long before the competition even concluded.","Tian Qiyuan was the first to speak, \"I have no use for it, so I planned on selling them.\"","\"Same here. I'll auction it off or something.\" Eternal Blacksmith said. He had no intention of keeping something that would only remind him of this utter defeat.","Heaven and Earth Blacksmith nodded in agreement, \"I'll also do the same.\"","\"If you don't mind, I'll purchase the Mystic-grade sword from you, Exalted Blacksmith.\" Three Swords Divine suddenly said.","However, before Tian Qiyuan could even respond, someone from the audience shouted, \"Hold it! I also want to buy it!\"","A crazed frenzy ensued, with people shouting their offers for the treasures. Even many of the blacksmiths there joined, as they wanted something to commemorate this event.","Seeing this, Tian Qiyuan said, \"I will just do the usual and let the Mystic Jade Auction Pavilion handle the sales of my treasures. If you want it, go bid for it there.\"","A second later, a figure from the audience gracefully jumped from the spectators' area to the arena.","It was Qing Ling'er.","\"It's our honor to serve you once again, Exalted Blacksmith. Do you want me to take the treasures off your hand now so you don't need to make the travel later?\" she asked.","Tian Qiyuan nodded, \"Sure.\"","\"Take mine while you're at it.\" Eternal Blacksmith suddenly said.","\"Mine too.\" Heaven and Earth Blacksmith said.","\"Y-yes!\" Qing Ling'er was ecstatic, feeling like she'd struck gold.","Once Qing Ling'er collected all of the treasures, she asked, \"Do you have a schedule in mind, or can we auction them as we see fit?\"","\"Just sell them as soon as possible.\" Tian Qiyuan said.","\"Mine as well.\" Eternal Blacksmith said.","\"Same.\" Heaven and Earth Blacksmith followed.","Sometime later, Qing Ling'er left the Grand Elder Summit and returned to the Mystic Jade Auction Pavilion to immediately start the process.","Seeing this, many of the audience also left to prepare for the upcoming auction.","Before leaving, Eternal Blacksmith said, \"Although I lost to you today, I won't lose the title of God of Creation.\"","\"Dream on, old man. I will be the next God of Blacksmith!\" Heaven and Earth Blacksmith declared.","\"Are you willing to bet your left nut on that declaration?\" Tian Qiyuan chuckled.","Heaven and Earth Blacksmith's face immediately darkened.","\"Hahaha!\" Eternal Blacksmith laughed out loud as he flew away.","Tian Qiyuan also left the scene shortly after.","Once the Divine Blacksmiths were gone, the Grand Elder Summit quickly became empty.","Tian Qiyuan went straight back to his own world, where he stored the Void Meteoroid Core.","\"I'm going to become the God of Creation before I craft you...\" he muttered in a low voice before returning to his training in pursuit of the title of God of Creation. However, he needed to be able to craft Celestial-grade treasures before he could even attempt the title.","Several centuries passed.","One day, Zi Xuan showed up in his world with more materials.","\"Hey, Qiyuan. It's been a while. How's your training?\" she strolled into his home, treating it as though it was her own.","\"Same as usual. What kind of materials did you get me today?\" he asked as if he already knew.","\"This one.\" Zi Xuan showed him the material in her grasp.","\"With this, I only need three more materials for my masterpiece. What kind of sword do you want today?\" he asked.","\"I want a special one today.\" Zi Xuan pointed at his lower body and continued, \"I want that sword.\"","\"...\" Tian Qiyuan fell silent after hearing her response, but he didn't appear surprised.","Sometime after the competition for the Void Meteoroid Core, Zi Xuan showed up at his place to celebrate his victory. One thing led to another, and it eventually led them into the bedroom, where they shared a passionate night with each other.","Since then, Zi Xuan has ceased to be just a customer and has become something more, though they are not exactly dating.","\"When you ask me like this, it feels like I am selling my body for materials,\" Tian Qiyuan eventually said with a bittersweet smile.","\"Is that so? Then here. It's a gift for you.\" Zi Xuan tossed the material at him.","Once Tian Qiyuan caught it and stowed it away, she grabbed his wrist and pulled him toward the bedroom, \"It's been a while. Let me play with your sword.\"","Tian Qiyaun didn't know whether to laugh or cry in this situation, but he didn't exactly dislike it either."]},{"number":1529,"title":"Chapter 1529 Divine Blacksmith Gathering","paragraphs":["1529 Divine Blacksmith Gathering","After spending several days in each other's arms, Zi Xuan, her voice filled with curiosity, asked him while she rested on the bed, \"How close are you to crafting your first Celestial-grade treasure?\"","\"I think I can start working on my first one in a few years,\" he confidently responded.","\"It'll be a sword, right?\"","\"Of course.\"","\"I can't wait to witness the birth of your first Celestial-grade treasure! And don't start without me!\"","\"Don't worry, I'll contact you before I start.\"","Zi Xuan left shortly after, and Tian Qiyuan returned to his training.","Four years later, Tian Qiyuan contacted Zi Xuan through her communication jade slip, notifying her that he would begin crafting his first-ever Celestial-grade treasure.","When she received this momentous news, Zi Xuan dropped whatever she was doing and rushed over to his world.","By the time she'd arrived, Tian Qiyuan was already in meditation, working on the Celestial-grade treasure inside his head.","Zi Xuan patiently waited for him, and seven days later, he emerged from his meditation.","Without uttering a word to Zi Xuan or even looking at her to acknowledge her presence, he immediately started refining the materials.","Zi Xuan knew that he was completely focused and didn't dare to make any sounds. Even her breathing was kept to a minimum.","Feng Tianru was already flying above him before he emerged from his meditation, so she started spewing flames the moment he approached the anvil.","Ding! Ding! Ding!","Tian Qiyuan kept the rhythm constant for the next two months, only stopping to change the material. Due to the immense quality and durability of the materials, it typically takes weeks to refine just one material, even for a Divine Blacksmith. As for those without sufficient skills, they could hammer the material for the rest of their life, and it wouldn't budge.","After spending six months just preparing the materials, Tian Qiyuan finally began crafting the sword.","One month... two months... six months...","After another year of hammering nonstop, Tian Qiyuan finally finished his first Celestial-grade treasure.","\"That took longer than I wanted...\" Tian Qiyuan immediately sat down the moment he finished, his body soaked in sweat.","Zi Xuan approached him shortly after, her eyes flickering with excitement.","\"Congratulations, Qiyuan! You're now officially a true Divine Blacksmith! Now you can truly compete for the position of God of Creation!\"","\"Thank you, but let's slow down a little.\"","\"Slow down? Knowing you, you probably have a 100 percent success rate with Celestial-grade treasures and already qualify to become the next God of Creation. You just need to prove yourself through the God of Creation Ceremony before you're recognized as one.\"","Tian Qiyuan then said, \"Yes, you're right. I am confident that I will never fail even a Celestial-grade treasure. However, the God of Creation Ceremony requires one to craft multiple Celestial-grade treasures in one sitting. I will need at least another thousand years before I can confidently achieve that.\"","\"Anyway, here you go.\" Tian Qiyuan suddenly extended his arm with the sword to Zi Xuan.","\"Huh?\" Zi Xuan didn't instantly comprehend his words and stared at him with a dazed face.","\"It's a gift to you for keeping me company throughout the years. Besides Feng Feng, you're the only one I can truly be myself around.\"","\"...\"","Zi Xuan was speechless. This was the first time she's received a gift from him, after all.","\"Are you sure I can have it? It would sell for a fortune if you sold it.\"","\"I don't care about that kind of stuff. It's not like I don't have money, either. If I really need money, I can just make a few more and sell those. However, the first one will belong to you.\"","\"Thank you...\" Zi Xuan didn't know what else to say.","Sometime later, Zi Xuan spoke, \"Speaking of the God of Creation Ceremony, Eternal Blacksmith recently announced that he would be partaking it in two thousand years.\"","\"Eternal Blacksmith, huh? He's been aDivine Blacksmith for hundreds of thousands of years, after all.\"","\"Did Heaven and Earth Blacksmith say anything about it?\" he then asked.","\"Not that I know of.\"","\"Is that so?\"","Zi Xuan returned to the Unrivaled Nine Swords Sect a few days later.","Almost a thousand years later, Heaven and Earth Blacksmith suddenly announced that he would be doing the God of Creation Ceremony in a year, shocking the world.","It was clear that Heaven and Earth Blacksmith wanted to beat Eternal Blacksmith to it, but many couldn't help but wonder if he'd been too hasty with this decision.","After all, a blacksmith could only attempt the God of Creation Ceremony three times in their lifetime, and Heaven and Earth Blacksmith already attempted it once.","\"Have you heard? Heaven and Earth Blacksmith will be taking his God of Creation Ceremony in a year.\" Zi Xuan visited Tian Qiyuan after hearing this news.","\"Really? I guess I'll have to put my training on halt to watch it.\"","Zi Xuan then realized something, \"Oh, right. It's customary for all Divine Blacksmiths to witness the God of Creation Ceremony, so it'll be a Divine Blacksmith gathering.\"","\"Where is he going to do it?\" Tian Qiyuan asked a moment later.","\"The Grand Elder Summit,\" she said.","\"That place again, huh?\"","Sometime later, Tian Qiyuan and Zi Xuan made their way to the Grand Elder Summit to watch Heaven and Earth Blacksmith's God of Creation Ceremony.","A crowd had already gathered even though there was still a month until the God of Creation Ceremony, and within this crowd was Eternal Blacksmith, as well as five other Divine Blacksmiths.","Besides Exalted Blacksmith, Eternal Blacksmith, and Heaven and Earth Blacksmith, there were five other Divine Blacksmiths in their era.","These five Divine Blacksmiths were Relentless Blackmisth, Fiery Heaven Blacksmith, Yin Yang Blacksmith, Silver Flame Blacksmith, and Star Forging Blacksmith.","Even though he's been a blacksmith for thousands of years, this was Tian Qiyuan's first time seeing the other Divine Blacksmith besides Eternal Blacksmith and Heaven and Earth Blacksmith.","\"It's an honor to meet my Seniors.\" Tian Qiyuan bowed to them in a respectful manner."]},{"number":1530,"title":"Chapter 1530 God of Creation Ceremony","paragraphs":["1530 God of Creation Ceremony","\"Exalted Blacksmith, huh? You're all that I've been hearing about lately. It's nice to meet you finally.\" Star Forging Blacksmith stood up and extended his arms to bow respectfully.","\"There's no need to call us Seniors when you're already above us in terms of skills.\" Relentless Blacksmith said.","Despite his youth and relative inexperience, Tian Qiyuan's skills were already surpassing those of his elders. In their world, skill was the ultimate measure of seniority.","Fiery Heaven Blacksmith suddenly sneered, \"Hmph. Is he really as good as they say? I know he won against Eternal Blacksmith and Heaven and Earth Blacksmith in a competition, but that doesn't mean much to me. I'm not convinced by you, Exalted Blacksmith. You came out of the blue with all of these ridiculous achievements. You're more suspicious than anything, and whatever you're hiding, I'll be sure to expose it.\"","\"You can ignore him, Exalted Blacksmith. He's a very jealous man with a few missing brain cells. None of us takes him seriously.\" Silver Flame Blacksmith, the only female Divine Blacksmith, said with a smile on her face.","\"The fuck did you just say, you silver-haired bitch?! I'll fucking kill you!\" Fiery Heaven Blacksmith roared.","\"As you can see, he truly lives up to his name with his fiery temper. But don't worry, he's all bark and no bite.\" Yin Yang Blacksmith laughed out loud.","\"Exalted Blacksmith, come join me. I have a spot here for you and your friend.\" Eternal Blacksmith pointed at the seats beside him.","Tian Qiyuan nodded and sat beside him.","Once he was seated, Eternal Blacksmith asked him, \"What do you think about Heaven and Earth Blacksmith's decision to perform his God of Creation Ceremony?\"","\"I can't really say since I don't know him well enough. What do you think? You've been rivals for a long time, right?\" Tian Qiyuan said.","\"Indeed, we've been rivals for the longest—ever since we were mere Apprentice Blacksmiths at the academy. Even during our time at the academy, he would always try to one-up me and end up screwing himself over. I want to say that it'll be different this time, but I truthfully don't think he's ready yet. However, I'd be more than happy if he proves me wrong.\" Eternal Blacksmith said.","Despite being rivals, the two of them were also friends.","\"If he fails the God of Creation Ceremony this time, he'll only have one more chance left, which will put immense pressure on him.\" Silver Flame Blacksmith said.","All of the Divine Blacksmiths besides Tian Qiyuan have attempted the God of Creation Ceremony once, with Heaven and Earth Blacksmith attempting his second one.","\"When will you perform your first God of Creation Ceremony, Exalted Blacksmith?\" Star Forging Blacksmith inquired out of curiosity.","Tian Qiyuan smiled behind his mask and said, \"It'll be a while before I attempt the God of Creation Ceremony.\"","\"Hah! He can't even craft Celestial-grade treasures yet!\" Fiery Heaven Blacksmith sneered.","Tian Qiyuan did not reveal that he'd already successfully crafted a Celestial-grade treasure, so only Zi Xuan was aware of this information. He only intended to do so when he was prepared for the God of Creation Ceremony.","Sometime later, Heaven and Earth Blacksmith showed up at the Grand Elder Summit with seven other individuals.","These individuals were from the Ancient Anvil Association, a vast community of blacksmiths. To be acknowledged as an official blacksmith, one must receive a permit from the Ancient Anvil Association.","The Elders of the Ancient Anvil Association must also be present to witness the God of Creation Ceremony. Only with their presence would it be considered legitimate.","Sometime later, one of the individuals from the Ancient Anvil Association hovered above the arena and spoke loudly, \"Welcome to Heaven and Earth Blacksmith's second attempt at the God of Creation Ceremony. In order to be acknowledged as the God of Creation, one must have at least a 25 percent success rate. During the God of Creation Ceremony, Heaven and Earth Blacksmith will attempt to craft 25 Celestial-grade treasures, and he has 100 attempts to do so.\"","Due to the number of Celestial-grade treasures that must be crafted, the God of Creation Ceremony typically lasts over a century.","\"Now, Heaven and Earth Blacksmith will give a brief speech.\"","Heaven and Earth Blacksmith rose into the air before speaking, \"I am aware that my God of Creation Ceremony may appear rushed, but I guarantee you that's not the case, and I will prove it to you by becoming the next God of Creation!\"","When Heaven and Earth Blacksmith spoke, his gaze remained on Eternal Blacksmith for the longest.","Heaven and Earth Blacksmith kept his speech short and immediately began preparing for the God of Creation Ceremony.","\"Heaven and Earth Blacksmith will now be given one year to prepare.\" The Ancient Anvil Association announced.","Then, a Tier 8 Array Master appeared to create a formation around Heaven and Earth Blacksmith to prevent any disturbance.","Once Heaven and Earth Blacksmith closed his eyes, the audience immediately began speaking with each other while many of them also closed their eyes to cultivate.","\"Heaven and Earth Blacksmith seems pretty confident.\"","\"Maybe he's just putting up the act.\"","\"Have some faith in him, will y'all?\"","Meanwhile, Tian Qiyuan closed his eyes to practice inside his head.","\"I'm going to cultivate. You don't need to wait for me,\" he said to Zi Xuan, who nodded.","Most people tend to watch the God of Creation Ceremony for a few days to weeks before leaving. After all, nobody was expected to witness the entire ceremony, which could last for over a century.","While all individuals from the Ancient Anvil Association must be present, only three are required to watch the ceremony, so they take turns watching Heaven and Earth Blacksmith while the others cultivate.","A year later, the Heaven and Earth Blacksmith emerged from his cultivation and began crafting his first Celestial-grade treasure, marking the commencement of the God of Creation Ceremony.","\"So it's finally begun...\" Eternal Blacksmith mumbled as he prepared himself to watch the entire ceremony without missing a moment."]},{"number":1531,"title":"Chapter 1531 God of Creation’s Ceremony(2)","paragraphs":["1531 God of Creation's Ceremony(2)","In order to complete the God of Creation Ceremony and become the next God of Creation, one must not only successfully 25 Celestial-grade treasures within 100 attempts but also craft 5 different types of weapons, so Heaven and Earth Blacksmith could not just craft his specialties.","For his first treasure, Heaven and Earth Blacksmith went for gauntlets, which he succeeded after spending almost two years on it.","His second crafted treasure also turned out to be gauntlets, but it took him 2 attempts to do so.","In the blink of an eye, ten years have passed since Heaven and Earth Blacksmith started his God of Creation Ceremony, and he had just finished his second Celestial-grade treasure.","His third, fourth, and fifth treasures also turned out to be gauntlets, but that took him 5 attempts.","By this point, Heaven and Earth Blacksmith was twenty years into his God of Creation Ceremony, with five Celestial-grade treasures and seven failures.","With eighty-eighty attempts and twenty Celestial-grade treasures left to craft, Heaven and Earth Blacksmith was doing pretty well.","Since he had to craft five different types of treasures, Heaven and Earth Blacksmith was limited to five treasures of each type, so he had to craft a different type of treasure for his next one.","For his sixth creation, Heaven and Earth Blacksmith decided to craft the bow.","He continued crafting the bow until his eleventh Celestial- grade treasure.","Fifty years have passed since Heaven and Earth Blacksmith started his God of Creation Ceremony, and due to fatigue, it was taking him longer to craft each treasure.","Once the God of Creation Ceremony began, there would be no breaks until it was completed.","Most of the audience that were there on the first day had already left, but the audience remained pretty crowded with constant newcomers.","Zi Xuan left after five years, but Tian Qiyuan remained. He spent most of his time in meditation and only woke up every few years to see Heaven and Earth Blacksmith's progress.","The only person there who watched from the beginning without taking any breaks was Eternal Blacksmith, who was determined to witness Heaven and Earth Blacksmith's entire ceremony.","When Heaven and Earth Blacksmith finished his 15th Celestial- grade treasure, he'd used up 47 attempts.","While having 53 attempts to complete 10 Celestial-grade treasures may seem promising, one must consider the Heaven and Earth Blacksmith's fatigue and the fact that he would be crafting treasures outside his area of expertise, which would significantly increase his failure rate.","Heaven and Earth Blacksmith started crafting spears for his 16th Celestial-grade treasure.","By the time he finished his 20th treasure, Heaven and Earth Blacksmith only had 16 attempts left to craft the last 5 treasures.","\"Do you think he'll do it?\" Yin Yang Blacksmith questioned out loud as Heaven and Earth Blacksmith started his 21st treasure.","\"Impossible.\" Fiery Heaven Blacksmith responded without a hint of doubt in his voice.","\"I also think it won't happen, unfortunately.\" Star Forging Blacksmith shook his head.","Thirty years later, Heaven and Earth Blacksmith crafted his 23rd Celestial-grade treasure. Unfortunately, he only had three more attempts for the last two treasures.","\"Unless he performs a miracle, he'll have to try again on his third and final God of Creation Ceremony.\" Eternal Blacksmith sighed.","For his final attempts, Heaven and Earth Blacksmith's movements were sluggish and full of mistakes. To him, it felt like there were mountains attached to his arms, and he was trying to hammer something underwater.","In the end, Heaven and Earth Blacksmith failed the God of Creation Ceremony with 23 Celestial-grade treasures, being only two away from the coveted God of Creation position.","Very few people actually believed Heaven and Earth Blacksmith would pass the ceremony, so nobody was surprised when he actually failed.","\"Good try.\" Eternal Blacksmith approached him after the ceremony ended.","\"Haa... I thought I could do it, but alas...\" Heaven and Earth Blacksmith sat beside the anvil, surrounded by a dispirited aura.","\"Don't sweat it, Heaven and Earth Blacksmith. You still have one more attempt.\" Relentless Blacksmith patted him on the back.","\"Indeed, but I won't need a third attempt.\" Eternal Blacksmith suddenly declared. \"I will become the next God of Creation. If you want my title, you'll have to challenge me for it.\"","\"I can't wait.\" Heaven and Earth Blacksmith chuckled bitterly.","Once Heaven and Earth Blacksmith's God of Creation Ceremony was concluded, everyone returned to doing their own things.","As time passed and Eternal Blacksmith's God of Creation Ceremony approached, Eternal Blacksmith suddenly declared that he would be delaying his ceremony for another thousand years.","Although his decision to delay his ceremony left many disappointed, nobody blamed him for wanting to take more time to prepare. Some believed that Heaven and Earth Blacksmith's failure had influenced him to make this decision, but nobody could be certain.","In the blink of an eye, another thousand years passed, and it was almost time for Eternal Blacksmith's God of Creation Ceremony.","Eternal Blacksmith chose to perform his ceremony at the Grand Elder Summit as well, and all of the Divine Blacksmiths gathered once again on the day of Eternal Blacksmith's ceremony.","\"We are gathered once again for another God of Creation Ceremony. This time, Eternal Blacksmith will be the one partaking in the ceremony.\" The Ancient Anvil Association declared.","\"Thank you all for coming here today. First and foremost, I would like to apologize for delaying this. I unexpectedly experienced enlightenment right before it was time for my ceremony and wanted to take some more time solidifying my new foundation.\" Eternal Blacksmith revealed the true reason for delaying his ceremony for a thousand years, which greatly surprised everyone.","\"To think he would experience enlightenment at his level. I guess this is the end of our rivalry...\" Heaven and Earth Blacksmith sighed after learning of this.","Eternal Blacksmith continued, \"Not only will I complete the God of Creation Ceremony, but I will do so in less than 50 attempts!\"","His bold declaration shocked everyone there.","\"Heavens! In less than 50 attempts?! Just what kind of enlightenment did he experience?!\" Silver Flame Blacksmith exclaimed in a shocked voice.","\"Such a bold claim... I wonder what kind of performance he'll show us...\" Yin Yang Blacksmith muttered.","Without further elaborating on his declaration, Eternal Blacksmith went into meditation to prepare for the God of Creation Ceremony."]},{"number":1532,"title":"Chapter 1532 The New God of Creation","paragraphs":["1532 The New God of Creation","\"What do you think of Eternal Blacksmith's declaration?\" Zi Xuan asked Tian Qiyuan out of curiosity.","\"It would be amazing if he actually achieves such a feat,\" he calmly responded.","\"Really? You're not worried?\"","\"Why should I be?\" Tian Qiyuan responded, his voice tinged with a hint of indifference.","\"He'll become the next God of Creation, you know.\"","\"So what? It's not like that position will be his forever. I can still challenge for it.\"","\"Don't you have to beat his record if you want to become the God of Creation after him?\" Zi Xuan asked.","\"Yes, and I also have to defeat him in a match.\"","If the position of God of Creation is already occupied, anyone who challenges that title must not only surpass the God of Creation's record during their God of Creation Ceremony but also defeat them in a one-on-one match.","A year passed in the blink of an eye, and Eternal Blacksmith emerged from his meditation and immediately began hammering away.","Once the Eternal Blacksmith began working, it took only moments for the other Divine Blacksmiths to notice a significant change in the way he struck the material. His movements were more refined and carried a profound quality that even they could not fully comprehend.","\"My lord! He's improved so much; it's like he became a different person!\" Heaven and Earth Blacksmith exclaimed in a shocked voice. He was the most familiar with the way Eternal Blacksmith smithed, so he was the most surprised out of everyone there.","\"Looks like it wasn't just any ordinary enlightenment...\" Star Forging Blacksmith mumbled.","\"Since when was there ordinary enlightenments? No matter how minor or major, an enlightenment is still an enlightenment. Even a minor enlightenment could transform a carp into a dragon, drastically improving them.\" Silver Flame Blacksmith said.","\"And if you consider Eternal Blacksmith's already deep understanding and vast experience, even a minor enlightenment would be unfathomably profound.\" Relentless Blacksmith added.","Eternal Blacksmith's first creation was a dagger. Unlike Heaven and Earth Blacksmith, Eternal Blacksmith wanted to get the weapon types he didn't excel at out of the way while he still had plenty of energy, as that would give him the highest success rate.","His first creation was a success, and so was his second.","He failed his third attempt but succeeded on his fourth attempt.","Eternal Blacksmith proceeded to succeed every other creation.","Thirty years passed swiftly, and Eternal Blacksmith was on his 30th attempt and 14th creation, which he succeeded in creating.","Eternal Blacksmith now had 15 successful creations while being only on his 31st attempt, so he had 19 more attempts to craft the remaining 10 treasures to fulfill his own declaration.","\"Holy shit... even if he doesn't complete the ceremony within 50 attempts, it's almost guaranteed that he'll become the next God of Creation...\"","The audience was at a loss for words.","Fifteen years later, with exactly 10 attempts left, Eternal Blacksmith only needed 4 more treasures to complete the ceremony and become the next God of Creation.","After another fiteetn years, Eternal Blacksmith had three attempts left, and he only needed one more treasure to have 25 Celestial-grade treasures crafted.","Exactly two and a half years later, Eternal Blacksmith successfully crafted his 25th Celestial-grade treasures on his 49th attempt, completeing the God of Creation Ceremony and becoming the next God of Creation.","The audience erupted with celebration.","However, the God of Creation Ceremony itself has yet to end, and Eternal Blacksmith continued to craft his next treasure.","Even though he only needed 25 Celestial-grade treasures to become the next God of Creation, he still had 51 attempts left to craft as many Celestial-grade treasures as possible, and anyone who challenges his title afterward will be required to beat that record for as long as Eternal Blacksmith lives.","After another hundred years, Eternal Blacksmith finished the God of Creation Ceremony with exactly 40 Celestial-grade treasures created.","\"Heavens! He nearly doubled the requirement to become the God of Creation!\"","\"This is a new record! Not only did Eternal Blacksmith become the next God of Creation, he's also the most successful one!\"","\"Does this mean he's now the Eternal God of Creation, or just God of Creation?\"","Once the God of Creation Ceremony ended, all of the blacksmiths there went to congratulate the newest God of Creation.","\"Congratulations on your achievement, God of Creation.\" Yin Yang Blacksmith respectfully bowed to him.","\"You've bested me, God of Creation. I, Heaven and Earth Blacksmith, admit defeat.\" Heaven and Earth Blacksmith lowered his head in a humble manner.","\"Just you wait, God of Creation! I'll snatch that title away from you soon!\" Fiery Heaven Blacksmith declared.","\"Congratulations, God of Creation. I cannot wait to see what your future creations.\" Star Forging Blacksmith said.","\"Let's have a drink later, God of Creation.\" Silver Flame Blacksmith said.","\"It was quite the show, God of Creation. When I perform my ceremony, I'll make sure to give you an even better show.\" Tian Qiyuan said to him.","\"Oh, really? I cannot wait.\" God of Creation smiled at him.","News of Eternal Blacksmith becoming the next God of Creation had spread throughout the Nine Heavens long before he even finished the ceremony, but the banquet to celebrate his new title did not happen until a year after the ceremony ended.","During the next several thousand years with the Eternal Blacksmith as the God of Creation, Tian Qiyuan rarely made any public appearances and even ceased selling his treasures. His absence led many to initially wonder if something had happened to him, but over time, people stopped talking about him, almost as if he no longer existed.","The other Divine Blacksmiths, excluding Heaven and Earth Blacksmith, attempted their second God of Creation Ceremony during this time.","Star Forging Blacksmith and Relentless Blacksmith barely managed to craft 25 Celestial-grade treasures during their ceremony, but neither of them came close to Eternal Blacksmith's record of 40, so they won't become the next God of Creation.","However, once Eternal Blacksmith retires as the God of Creation, the two of them may compete with each other to replace him.","Meanwhile, secluded in his own world, Tian Qiyuan quietly honed his smithing skills and increased his endurance over the years. Zi Xuan rarely visited him because she knew what he was doing and didn't want to disturb him.","In the blink of an eye, nine thousand years had passed since the Eternal Blacksmith became the God of Creation. Then, on an otherwise ordinary day, the Exalted Blacksmith reemerged, announcing with shocking news that he would be performing the God of Creation Ceremony."]},{"number":1533,"title":"Chapter 1533 Ancient Anvil Association","paragraphs":["1533 Ancient Anvil Association","\"Have you heard? Exalted Blacksmith has returned and announced that he would be doing the God of Creation Ceremony!\"","\"No way! The one who disappeared from the world after Eternal Blacksmith became the God of Creation nine thousand years ago?! When is he going to do the God of Creation Ceremony!?\"","\"He said he's going to do it next month.\"","\"Next month? That's too soon!\"","Once news of Tian Qiyuan's God of Creation Ceremony spread, people from around the world flocked to the Grand Elder Summit, where he would perform the ceremony.","\"The Grand Elder Summit, again? It'll definitely become a tradition to perform the ceremony there from now on.\"","At the Grand Elder Summit, countless people gathered there, including the Divine Blacksmiths, as well as the God of Creation.","\"I knew he was training in seclusion, but I didn't anticipate he would perform the God of Creation Ceremony this soon.\" Silver Flame Blacksmith said out loud.","\"It's been around ten thousand years since he became a Divine Blacksmith, right? This is a little too soon, no matter how I look at it.\" Star Forging Blacksmith sighed.","\"Can he even craft Celestial-grade treasures? I bet he rushed to perform the ceremony the moment he crafted his first Celestial-grade treasure!\" Fiery Heaven Blacksmith laughed in a mocking tone.","\"What do you think of Exalted Blacksmith's decision to perform the ceremony, God of Creation?\" Heaven and Earth Blacksmith asked him.","God of Creation pondered for a moment before responding, \"He crafted his first Empyrean-grade treasure around ten thousand years ago. Even if he's managed to improve enough to craft Celestial-grade treasures with this little time, I cannot imagine he could have achieved a high success rate.\"","Relentless Blacksmith nodded in agreement with God of Creation and said, \"I share the same sentiment. No matter how talented you are, there is a limit to what you can achieve. All of us performed our first God of Creation Ceremony after a hundred thousand years of achieving Celestial-grade treasure, too.\"","\"Let's bet on how much treasure he'll craft. I'll bet a Glistening Cold Ore on 5.\" Fiery Heaven Blacksmith suddenly said.","\"That sounds fun. I'll bet a nine-inch long and three-inch thick Ancient Burning Wood on 12.\" Relentless Blacksmith said.","The others also joined in on the fun.","\"Can I join you guys?\" A new voice suddenly resounded.","The group of Divine Blacksmiths turned to look at the person who had just spoken simultaneously.","\"If it isn't the Sword Goddess. Of course, you can join in on the fun.\" Heaven and Earth Blacksmith said, knowing that she was a friend of Tian Qiyuan.","\"So, what's your bet?\" Fiery Heaven Blacksmith asked.","\"I'll bet this.\" Zi Xuan retrieved an entire Golden Celestial Tree from her spatial ring, shocking everyone there.","\"You're betting an entire Golden Celestial Tree?! And it's at least 1 million years old!\" Yin Yang Blacksmith exclaimed in a shocked voice.","\"Is it too much? I'll change it if you don't want it,\" Zi Xuan casually said.","\"Who said anything about not wanting it? If you want to bet that, by all means!\" Fiery Heaven Blacksmith laughed.","\"What is your prediction?\" Silver Flame Blacksmith asked.","Without hesitation, Zi Xuan responded with a calm smile on her face, \"I'll bet on 100.\"","\"Huh?\"","Everyone paying attention to their little gamble raised their eyebrows in a puzzled manner after hearing her words, most of them believing they had misheard her.","\"Did I hear you correctly? That you'd bet on Exalted Blacksmith crafting 100 Celestial-grade treasures during the ceremony?\" God of Creation asked with a look of disbelief on his face.","\"Indeed, you heard me correctly.\" Zi Xuan calmly nodded her head.","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Fiery Heaven Blacksmith burst out laughing, \"Hahaha! If you're trying to donate that Golden Celestial Tree to one of us, just say so! There's no need to utter such nonsense!\"","The other Divine Blacksmiths also laughed out loud. None of them could take Zi Xuan seriously, after all.","\"Alright, since everyone is having fun, I'll join, too.\" God of Creation said as he retrieved a rare material from his spatial ring. \"I'll bet on 20.\"","\"20? You're overestimating him too much, God of Creation.\" Fiery Heaven Blacksmith shook his head.","\"We'll see about that...\" he calmly said.","The people who sat around them wanted to join in on the fun, but none of them had the guts to do so, as the Divine Blacksmiths' presence was simply too much for them, not to mention the God of Creation himself.","Sometime later, Tian Qiyuan showed up at the Grand Elder Summit. However, there was an issue that most of the people there immediately noticed.","\"Huh? Where is the Ancient Anvil Association?\" Star Forging Blacksmith questioned out loud.","\"Perhaps they're running late?\" Silver Flame Blacksmith said.","\"There's no way they would be late to the God of Creation Ceremony. It's sacred for them.\" Heaven and Earth Blacksmith said.","\"Exalted Blacksmith, where is the Ancient Anvil Association? You are aware that their presence is essential for the ceremony's legitimacy, are you not?\" the God of Creation inquired.","Tian Qiyuan looked at him and said, \"I know, but I don't think they'll show up.\"","\"Why is that?\" God of Creation became even more puzzled.","\"Because I refused to be associated with them,\" he calmly said.","\"What?! You're telling me that you've been an unofficial blacksmith this entire time?!?!\" Heaven and Earth Blacksmith exclaimed in a bewildered voice.","\"That's right.\" Tian Qiyuan calmly nodded.","To be officially recognized as a blacksmith, one must register with the Ancient Anvil Association.","\"Impossible! How come the Ancient Anvil Association hasn't mentioned this before?!\" Silver Flame Blacksmith asked, her voice filled with disbelief.","\"More importantly, why did you refuse to accept them? They're recognized by almost every blacksmith in the world,\" the God of Creation asked.","\"It's simply a matter of pettiness,\" Tian Qiyuan replied with a casual shrug. \"We had some disagreements in the past, and I've held a grudge ever since.\" His words left everyone speechless."]},{"number":1534,"title":"Chapter 1534 Exalted Blacksmith’s Ceremony","paragraphs":["1534 Exalted Blacksmith's Ceremony","\"Disagreement? What kind?\" Zi Xuan asked, her curiosity piqued.","\"I'm glad you asked.\" Tian Qiyuan said, seemingly eager to expose the Ancient Anvil Association.","\"When I was still young and inexperienced, I went to register at the Ancient Anvil Association. However, when they saw the treasure I crafted, they claimed I was too young to have such skills and called me a fraud, even stealing the first treasure I ever created from me that day.\"","The audience was left speechless by this unexpected experience Tian Qiyuan had with the Ancient Anvil Association.","\"I-I understand your frustration, but the Ancient Anvil Association is a massive background with hundreds of thousands of workers. You cannot hold a grudge against the entire faction over a single bad individual...\" God of Creation tried to reason with him.","\"Indeed, they are, and I gave them another chance a thousand years later. Although I was no longer called a fraud, they tried to swindle me by making me sign some nonsense contract that would give them a large portion of my future sales as a blacksmith. When I refused, they threatened to end my career as a blacksmith.\" Tian Qiyuan sneered, his voice dripping with resentment.","In order to receive a license from the Ancient Anvil Association, every blacksmith must sign a contract that would give the association a small portion of their earnings. This contract varied depending on the individual and their background, so everyone had different experiences.","When the blacksmiths heard about Tian Qiyuan's experience, some felt his pain because they also had to give more than others.","Tian Qiyuan was not finished speaking and continued, \"In fact, the person who branded me as a fraud and stole my treasure is the current head of the Ancient Anvil Association, so I will never associate myself with them even if I will never be recognized as an official blacksmith.\"","The entire place was dead silent as they listened to Tian Qiyuan, and many blacksmiths sympathized with him.","\"Anyway, I don't care about the Ancient Anvil Association. So what if they're not here to witness my God of Creation Ceremony? Why is their presence necessary for the ceremony to become authentic? Are the people here watching not enough to authenticate the ceremony? Is the ceremony itself not good enough? Then we might as well rename it to Ancient Anvil Association's God of Creation Assessement!\" Tian Qiyuan sneered.","Eventually, someone from the audience shouted, \"Yeah! Since when did the Ancient Anvil Association become so powerful that they can determine the authenticity of the ceremony?!\"","\"Fuck! Why do we have to register at the Ancient Anvil Association to be recognized as an official blacksmith?! And why do we have to give them a portion of our income just for their recognition?! That's plain robbery!\"","After Tian Qiyuan revealed his strained relationship with the Ancient Anvil Association, the audience, filled with blacksmiths, erupted in curses directed at the association. It was obvious that the Ancient Anvil Association had wronged many people, but they were too afraid to speak up due to the association's immense influence.","However, now that Tian Qiyuan, a renowned Divine Blacksmith, had openly criticized them, it opened the floodgates, with wronged blacksmiths rushing forward to voice their grievances.","Although the Ancient Anvil Association wasn't present physically, they witnessed the spectacle through a treasure that allowed them to see events from afar, typically used to observe crowded gatherings from the comfort of their own homes.","\"Damn it! Is this why Exalted Blacksmith refused to register at our Ancient Anvil Association?! Leader, please tell me he's lying!\" The elders at the association turned to their current head for answers.","None of them knew of the drama between Tian Qiyuan and their association because it was never mentioned until today. However, they always found it weird that Exalted Blacksmith never tried to register at their association.","Some had even personally gone to recruit him, but they were all turned away without explanation. Ashamed, they kept this quiet, leading the public to believe Tian Qiyuan was already with them. However, if what Tian Qiyuan said was true, it clarified everything.","The current head of the Ancient Anvil Association, Yao Tao, had a dark expression on his face as he tried to recall the past.","After thinking for a long moment, he could vaguely recall calling some young brat a fraud before taking away their weapon.","'Fuck! That darned brat was the Exalted Blacksmith?!' he cried inwardly, his back soaked in sweat when he realized his own fault.","Tian Qiyuan was only a teenager when he tried to sign up at the Ancient Anvil Association, bringing with him a peak- quality Spirit-grade treasure. Yao Tao, however, didn't believe a teenager without any background or master could possibly craft something even a Master Blacksmith would have trouble creating.","Therefore, Yao Tao kicked Tian Qiyuan out, but not before confiscating his treasure.","\"What should we do now, leader? Should we show up for his ceremony?\" One of the elders asked in a worried tone.","\"After everything he's said about us? Not a chance!\" Someone else said.","\"Let's refute his claims and then call him out for slandering us with lies. Even if what he said is true, there's no way for him to prove it.\" Another suggested.","After a long conversation, Yao Tao came to a decision.","\"We will refute his claims and go after him for slandering us. As Elder Li said, there's no way for him to prove his claims, something that happened thousands of years ago. Our Ancient Anvil Association has existed for millions of years. We'll not allow a single individual to run our reputation to the ground.\"","\"He'll soon make a fool of himself with the God of Creation Ceremony, too. Once the ceremony ends, we will confront him together.\"","Sometime later, Tian Qiyuan prepared to begin the God of Creation Ceremony. Even though it was not official and without the presence of the Ancient Anvil Association, nobody wanted to miss this occasion.","As of this moment, countless people from around the world were spectating Tian Qiyuan's ceremony.","\"I will now begin my God of Creation Ceremony. Thank you all for being here.\" Tian Qiyuan gave the audience a quick bow before retrieving a large mountain of materials and placing them on the ground.","Typically, the Ancient Anvil Association supplied the materials for the God of Creation Ceremony and kept every treasure crafted during the event. However, without the association present, Tian Qiyuan had to use his own materials. Fortunately, there was no limitations on the type of materials used for the ceremony as long as the results created from it was Celestial-grade.","After taking out the materials, Tian Qiyuan immediately started refining them, leaving the spectators speechless.","\"W-what the hell? He's going straight into it without any mental preparations?! I've never seen anyone do this before!\" Relentless Blacksmith exclaimed in a shocked voice.","\"Did he forget? I also made many mistakes during my first ceremony...\" Silver Flame Blacksmith muttered.","\"Hahaha! What a fool! I'll definitely win this bet!\" Fiery Heaven Blacksmith laughed out loud, even slapping his thighs.","\"I am... truly speechless...\" Heaven and Earth Blacksmith sighed.","The whole audience was left bewildered by Tian Qiyuan's actions. Nobody knew if it was a mistake or done on purpose, but they were certain that he'd messed up severely by not taking the time to prepare for it.","As Tian Qiyuan neared his first month of the ceremony, he started forming the shape of the weapon.","\"What?! He's already almost done?! Impossible! It's only been a month!\" Star Forging Blacksmith stood up in shock.","\"Looks like he's craft swords first.\" Yin Yang Blacksmith mumbled.","After another week, Tian Qiyuan finished his first treasure.","\"Heavens... he really crafted a Celestial-grade treasure in a month. Even the God of Creation requires half a year to do so...\" The other blacksmiths muttered to each other.","Tian Qiyuan immediately moved on to his second treasure. Another month later, he began forming its shape.","\"Huh? He's crafting a dagger this time?\"","Once again, Tian Qiyuan's unpredictable actions left the audience confused and speechless.","\"He's done it! He's successfully crafted two treasures in a row!\"","\"In two months, too! How long will he be able to continue at this pace?!\"","A month later, Tian Qiyuan crafted his third treasure, a bow.","Then, in another month, he crafted a spear for his fourth treasure.","For the fifth treasure, he crafted a fan.","In less than half a year, Tian Qiyuan successfully crafted 5 treasures with 5 attempts.","The audience was so shocked that they could only silently watch him continue with wide eyes, their body numb.","\"T-this can't be... He's definitely cheating somehow! There's no way he crafted 5 Celestial-grade treasures in a row, much less in five months!\" Fiery Heaven Blacksmith suddenly blurted out loud.","However, God of Creation responded in a serious tone, \"Can you prove that he's cheating? With so many people watching his every move, wouldn't someone have already noticed it if he was cheating? Or are you saying that he's skillful enough to cheat in front of so many people, including me?\"","\"That's exactly what I am saying! There's no way he's able to achieve this legitimately!\"","\"Then shut your mouth and keep watching closely. Since you're so confident he's cheating, prove it.\" Star Forging Blacksmith said without taking his eyes off Tian Qiyuan.","It was inevitable that some people would think Tian Qiyuan was cheating. However, without any proof, they can only continue watching until they can expose him.","Zi Xuan was the only one in the audience who watched with a calm expression, free of any suspicion in her gaze.","\"Welcome back, Exalted Blacksmith...\" she mumbled."]},{"number":1535,"title":"Chapter 1535 Fraud","paragraphs":["1535 Fraud","A full year had passed since Tian Qiyuan began his God of Creation Ceremony, and he had crafted 10 Celestial-grade treasures within 10 attempts, meaning he hadn't failed once since he started.","More and more people became skeptical and doubted his legitimacy. Yet, no one could figure out his methods, and continued to watch in amazement as Tian Qiyuan showcased his unfathomable prowess.","'Fuck! How the hell is he doing this?! I refuse to believe that he's doing this without any tricks!' Fiery Heaven Blacksmith began biting his nails in frustration as he continued to analyze every movement Tian Qiyuan made to expose his tricks but to no avail.","He couldn't fathom how Tian Qiyuan was refining the materials so quickly and how he would successfully craft a Celestial-grade treasure every time.'","As Tian Qiyuan continued to defy all logic and common sense, the God of Creation Ceremony entered its third year. Tian Qiyuan kept his ridiculous pace by producing a Celestial- grade treasure nearly every month, reaching 22 Celestial- grade treasures by the end of the second year.","Of course, his 100 percent success rate remained, and he had 78 attempts left to defeat the current God of Creation's record of 40.","Tian Qiyuan's flawless performance left the God of Creation deeply perplexed. On one hand, he wanted to believe in Tian Qiyuan's talent; on the other hand, it was almost too extraordinary to accept, even though he couldn't find any fault in Tian Qiyuan's work.","However, it made absolutely zero sense for Tian Qiyuan to cheat before so many people and in such an obvious manner, no less. If one wanted to cheat, it shouldn't be so exaggerated and obvious.","Tian Qiyuan himself had an unshakable reputation throughout the years. While everybody was suspicious of his skills at first, he quickly proved himself to be the real deal, not to mention the competition he participated in for the Void Meteoroid Core.","'If his talents are truly real and not fabricated... this world might not be ready for someone like him...' God of Creation sighed inwardly.","After another two years, Tian Qiyuan approached the God of Creation's record of 40. Although his crafting speed had slowed down slightly, it was still outrageously fast.","Ding! Ding! Clang!","Tian Qiyuan successfully crafted his 40th treasure on his 40th attempt. Unless he failed to create a single treasure within the next 60 attempts, it was essentially certain that Tian Qiyuan would become the next God of Creation.","A month later, nobody was surprised when Tian Qiyuan created his 41st treasure.","\"Good heavens... what in heaven's name is happening? Is this even real?\"","\"Even if he fails to create a single treasure with the rest of his attempts, he's already smashed the previous record with an unprecedented 41 treasures in a row.\"","\"Do you think the God of Creation will accept this result? He might argue it's an unofficial ceremony.\"","\"With so many witnesses, even heaven itself would not dare to deny Exalted Blacksmith's achievement because of some arbitrary rule made up by the Ancient Anvil Association.\"","\"I kind of pity the God of Creation. He's only held on to that title for ten thousand years, which is probably the shortest time someone has sat in that position.\"","\"Exalted Blacksmith still has to defeat the God of Creation in a one-on-one match to acquire his title officially, right? Nothing is guaranteed.\" Someone said.","\"Are you blind? Even the God of Creation cannot craft more than 3 Celestial-grade treasures in a row, much less 41! I'd be surprised if he doesn't hand over his title without the match since the outcome is already obvious!\"","\"The God of Creation would lose more face if he were to participate in such an obvious match than just to hand over his title since that would show his denial.\"","\"And I would not be surprised if it turns out the Exalted Blacksmith has been cheating this entire time. His talents are too good to be true.\"","\"He's just way ahead of his time, that's all. Also, how can he cheat with so many expert blacksmiths around? There's no way he hasn't been exposed already if that were the case.\"","The audience continued to argue with each other regarding the legitimacy of Tian Qiyuan's ceremony.","Once Tian Qiyuan crafted his 50th treasure, his speed slowed down to a treasure every two months instead of one.","60... 70... 80...","Tian Qiyuan crafted his 80th Celestial-grade treasure in a row six years later. By now, the audience had grown numb and was no longer shocked. They only had one thing in their mind— whether Tian Qiyuan would become the first person in history to craft 100 Celestial-grade treasures in a row or not.","Tian Qiyuan's speed slowed down again after his 80th treasure. Instead of taking two to three months to craft a treasure, he needed five to seven months.","Ten years later, Tian Qiyuan used his final attempt to craft the 100th treasure.","The audience held their breaths as they prepared to witness history being made right in front of their very eyes.","As Tian Qiyuan formed the shape of the final treasure, nearly everybody in the upper heavens had their eyes on him.","\"It's a sword! His final treasure is a sword!\"","Ding! Clang! Ding!","Ding! Ding! Ding!","After spending an entire year on his final treasure, Tian Qiyuan successfully crafted his 100th treasure, becoming the first ever individual to perform a flawless God of Creation Ceremony.","The audience erupted with cheers, but there were also many who still doubted the legitimacy of his performance.","\"Exalted Blacksmith, you fucking fraud! Do you really expect us to believe that you had crafted 100 Celestial-grade treasures in a row?!\" Fiery Heaven Blacksmith was the loudest with the curses.","\"If you're going to bullshit, at least make it believable! I cannot believe I wasted so much time watching this nonsense!\"","\"Fraud! Fraud! Fraud!\"","Of course, the Ancient Anvil Association had planted some of its own people within the crowd to oppose Tian Qiyuan and discredit him.","\"Where is the proof that he's a fraud?! Everyone saw his performance, but nobody could prove that he was cheating!\"","\"Right!? I didn't see anything suspicious, and I watched the entire ceremony without blinking!\"","\"Surely, you have something to say about this, God of Creation!\" Fiery Heaven Blacksmith suddenly turned to look at him.","The audience temporarily became silent as they waited for the God of Creation's response.","God of Creation quietly sat in his seat with a pondering expression on his face. He'd watched the entire ceremony from beginning to end without missing a thing, yet he couldn't find anything that would expose Tian Qiyuan as a cheater. However, his own pride and experience couldn't accept the fact that Tian Qiyuan had such unfathomable capabilities.","After a long moment of silence, the God of Creation solemnly spoke as he stared at Tian Qiyuan's figure, \"Although I did not see anything suspicious during the ceremony, nor can I prove that he'd cheated, common sense tells me that what he'd done is simply impossible. Exalted Blacksmith, you disappoint me. I thought you were someone of integrity and respected you, but to do something like this during the sacred God of Creation Ceremony, you've committed blasphemy.\"","\"Y-you can't be serious!\" Zi Xuan was the first to respond to God of Creation's verdict.","However, once the God of Creation gave his verdict, nobody dared to refute him, even if they believed in Tian Qiyuan.","Despite being called a fraud, Tian Qiyuan did not show any signs of anger and remained tranquil.","He responded a moment later, \"Are you really that reluctant to hand over your title? I don't blame you, though, since you only got to enjoy it for a short ten thousand years. Don't worry. I don't care enough about the title to fight you for it, anyway. The only reason I performed this ceremony was for my own satisfaction.\"","\"It would've been nice if I was recognized as the God of Creation, but whether I have such a title or not won't have any effect on my capabilities as a blacksmith. As a matter of fact, I do not need anyone's approval. I don't craft treasures to prove myself. I do it because I enjoy it, and it benefits me.\"","\"To those of you who still believe in me and recognize me as the next God of Creation, thank you. Unfortunately, it appears that I am not destined to be the next God of Creation.\"","Tian Qiyuan waved his sleeves, collecting all 100 Celestial- grade treasures.","\"Anyway, call me a fraud if you want. You may be able to deceive yourself and even the world, but as long you can't prove that I cheated, you won't be able to get rid of that doubt hidden deep within your soul, and you'll eventually be consumed by it.\"","After saying such words, Tian Qiyuan vanished into thin air before everyone's eyes like a ghost, leaving the entire world speechless.","Shortly after Tian Qiyuan's disappearance, the Ancient Anvil Association showed up at the Grand Elder Summit to further smear Tian Qiyuan's image.","\"As you have all witnessed, Exalted Blacksmith is a fraud that cannot be trusted. Not only did he slander our association with false claims, but he even dared to commit blasphemy during the God of Creation Ceremony.\" Yao Tao said.","\"Our Ancient Anvil Association has known about this for a long time now, hence why we refused to recognize him as an official blacksmith! We haven't said anything until now because we need solid proof to expose him! I shall repeat this once again—Exalted Blacksmith is a fraud!\"","\"Yeah! He's a fraud!\"","\"I cannot believe I had spent so much money purchasing his weapons before!\"","\"Fuck! I also commissioned him for a weapon! I'll destroy that thing once I get home!\"","After the ceremony, the Ancient Anvil Association, supported by the God of Creation, spread the news of Tian Qiyuan being a fraud throughout the Nine Heavens, sending shockwaves through the realms and leaving all of his fans in disbelief."]},{"number":1536,"title":"Chapter 1536 Crafting the Masterpiece","paragraphs":["1536 Crafting the Masterpiece","\"Hold onto your anvils, folks! I've got a shocking revelation for you! The Exalted Blacksmith has been unmasked as a fraud! Don't miss this breaking news!\" A streetwise informant bellowed, drawing a throng of curious onlookers.","\"What? Exalted Blacksmith is a fraud? How is that possible?\"","\"It's true! The Ancient Anvil Association and even the revered God of Creation have already declared the Exalted Blacksmith to be a fraud! In fact, Exalted Blacksmith was never even an official blacksmith to begin with!\"","\"The Exalted Blacksmith not only committed blasphemy during the God of Creation Ceremony by cheating, but all of his creations are not even his!\"","\"What kind of nonsense are you sprouting? How can someone cheat in the God of Creation Ceremony? And many have watched him craft treasures.\"","\"I heard about this. However, nobody at the ceremony could actually prove that the Exalted Blacksmith had cheated during his ceremony.\" Someone defended Tian Qiyuan.","\"I was present at the ceremony, and I didn't notice anything unusual, let alone cheating. It's possible that the Exalted Blacksmith is being unfairly accused due to envy of his skills.\" Another voice chimed in, offering a different viewpoint.","\"The Exalted Blacksmith called out the Ancient Anvil Association before the ceremony began, so they have a motive. As for the God of Creation, he probably just didn't want to hand over his title so soon after acquiring it.\"","Not everyone believed the rumors, but the God of Creation and the Ancient Anvil Association wielded immense influence. Challenging them meant risking their ire and losing access to their invaluable services, making it wiser for most to remain silent.","Because of this, most of the families and sects in the upper heavens remained silent, allowing such rumors to continue spreading like wildfire.","With nobody truly influential stepping forward to refute these rumors, more and more people started believing it. Eventually, the rumor was no longer just a rumor and turned into a fact.","The Ancient Anvil Association also invested tremendous resources and effort into ensuring that Tian Qiyuan became and remained a fraud.","With the God of Creation backing them, almost nothing could stop them from branding Tian Qiyuan as a fraud.","And in just a few hundred years, it'd become common knowledge that Tian Qiyuan was a fraud who managed to become a Divine Blacksmith by fooling the world.","\"God of Creation... I am disappointed in you...\" A face that the God of Creation hadn't seen in a while suddenly showed up to say such words in private.","\"What are you talking about, Heaven and Earth Blacksmith?\" God of Creation responded in a nonchalant tone.","\"You know what I am talking about. For the sake of that title, you've forsaken your own dignity and collaborated with the Ancient Anvil Association to slander Exalted Blacksmith, who performed a flawless God of Creation Ceremony. Because of you, we've lost a prodigy that might never appear in this world again.\"","\"You actually believe that he'd performed a flawless ceremony? It's impossible to have a 100 percent success rate for Celestial-grade treasures, not to mention the speed at which he was crafting them. Even if there is no solid evidence, the abnormal result is enough to convince me that he'd cheated. It's just common sense, plain and simple.\"","There was no change in his tone as the God of Creation remained adamant on his own beliefs.","\"Since when did common sense apply to true prodigies—","monsters? Anyway, I have said what I wanted to say, so I am leaving now.\"","However, God of Creation stopped him and said, \"If you're so convinced that he's legitimate, why haven't you said anything about it?\"","\"I am aware that I do not have the power to convince the public alone, hence why I am here speaking to you personally. I should've said something on that very day, but just like you, I was overwhelmed by his otherworldly performance and became blinded with envy.\"","\"In truth, I have no right to say these things to you since I am just as guilty, and I can hardly raise my hammer nowadays because it carries the weight of my guilt. I wish the best of luck to you and your future endeavors, God of Creation.\"","Heaven and Earth Blacksmith left shortly after without looking back.","A few years later, Heaven and Earth Blacksmith shocked the world with an unexpected retirement announcement.","\"Why did the Heaven and Earth Blakcksmith suddenly announce his retirement? He still has one more attempt at the God of Creation Ceremony, right?\"","\"It might have something to do with what happened to Exalted Blacksmith.\"","\"Were they even close enough for Heaven and Earth Blacksmith to do such a thing for him?\"","\"Who knows, but we've lost two Divine Blacksmiths in less than a thousand years now.\"","After Heaven and Earth Blacksmith's visit and sudden retirement, the God of Creation began to come to his senses, and as if he had been cursed by Heaven and Earth Blacksmith, his hammer became heavier with each passing day.","\"What have I done...\"","God of Creation eventually realized his faults, but it was already too late to change anything, and the damages were already done.","Meanwhile, the Exalted Blacksmith hasn't made an appearance since his God of Creation Ceremony, almost as if he'd vanished from the world.","In reality, Tian Qiyuan was hard at work inside his own world, preparing for his masterpiece.","Zi Xuan visited him a few years after his ceremony. Although she had planned on visiting sooner, she had to deal with some problems first.","When she arrived at his world, she was surprised to see Tian Qiyuan working by the anvil as usual.","\"Hm? Hello, Zi Xuan. It's been a few years. Am I a fraud to the entire world yet?\" Tian Qiyuan asked her with a calm smile on his face.","Zi Xuan frowned at his question and said, \"How can you act so calm in this situation?\"","\"And yes, the Ancient Anvil Association, God of Creation, and Fiery Heaven Blacksmith are hard at work trying to brand you as a fraud. They're even going as far as trying to destroy your creations. Why aren't you even attempting to defend your own image? Are you going to let them continue slandering you like this?\"","\"It's too much of a hassle. The Exalted Blacksmith was the perfect persona for me to collect the materials I needed for my true ambition. Now that I have collected everything I need for my masterpiece, I couldn't care less about what happened to it afterward. In fact, I intended to disappear from the world quietly after collecting the materials.\" Tian Qiyuan shrugged.","He didn't think it was worth it trying to save a persona he'd already intended to throw away.","However, Zi Xuan had a different thought in mind.","\"No! You may not care about that persona, but it's important to me! It's the identity of my first love, and I will not allow anyone to trample on it!\"","Zi Xuan did not stay for long and left in a hurry.","Tian Qiyuan didn't think too much about it and continued his preparations.","Several thousand years later, Tian Qiyuan was almost finished with his preparations.","He knew that Zi Xuan would want to experience the creation of his masterpiece, so he contacted her through her communication jade slip.","\"I will soon craft my masterpiece. You know where to find me. I'll wait for you, but I can't wait too long since the materials are already prepared and will eventually start losing quality if I don't use them.\"","After sending her this message, Tian Qiyuan waited for her arrival.","One year... two years... five years...","Ten years... twenty years... fifty years...","A hundred years passed, but Zi Xuan never showed up.","Tian Qiyuan wanted to look for her, but he'd already wasted too much time and needed to craft the treasure as soon as possible.","'She's probably in seclusion or something. I'll look for her after I finish my work.'","\"Feng Feng! It's time! Let's get started!\" Tian Qiyuan called out to her.","Feng Tianru appeared shortly after, with her body raining flames.","\"God of War's Astral Arts!\" Tian Qiyuan summoned a massive avatar that wielded hammers in both hands, which he used to strike the anvil alongside his own hammer.","Even though it would only take him a month to craft a Celestial-grade treasure, Tian Qiyuan ended up spending over a hundred years straight hammering at the anvil.","All of the rare materials he'd painstakingly collected throughout the years, enough to buy an entire realm, were used for this one treasure.","Once he was finished with the treasure, which took the form of a greatsword, he left his world to find Zi Xuan.","The first and most obvious place he visited to find information on Zi Xuan was the Unrivaled Nine Swords Sect. However, when he showed up at the sect, nobody recognized him.","Since Tian Qiyuan had no intentions of continuing his persona as the Exalted Blacksmith, he no longer had any reason to hide his face and showed up to the sect without his mask.","\"I'm a friend of Lady Zi Xuan. Do you know where I can find her?\" he asked one of their disciples.","\"You're looking for the Sword Goddess...?\" The disciple suddenly wore a stiff expression after being questioned about her.","He then said, \"I'm sorry, but the Sword Goddess hasn't been affiliated with the Unrivaled Nine Swords Sect since she was exiled from the sect several centuries ago.\"","\"What? She'd been exiled from the Unrivaled Nine Swords Sect? How did such a thing happen?\" Tian Qiyuan was greatly shocked by this news and immediately inquired for more information."]},{"number":1537,"title":"Chapter 1537 Gone Rogue","paragraphs":["1537 Gone Rogue","\"How are you not aware of her situation? It caused quite the scene around the world when it happened. Are you really her friend?\" The disciple doubted Tian Qiyuan being Zi Xuan's friend.","\"I was in seclusion for a long time and only recently emerged, so I am still unaware of many things. If you enlighten me, I'll make it worth your time.\"","Tian Qiyuan proceeded to take out an Ancient-grade sword and dangled it in front of the disciple like a carrot on a stick.","The disciple's eyes immediately flickered when he saw this. He never thought he would be able to acquire an Ancient-grade sword just by answering some questions.","\"I'll tell you everything you want to know, Senior!\"","\"You can start by telling why Zi Xuan was exiled.\"","\"That's because she'd gone rouge and went on a killing spree, becoming a mass murderer. If the Unrivaled Nine Swords Sect hadn't exiled her, it would've dragged all of us down with her.\"","\"What? Zi Xuan became a mass murderer? Surely, there must've been a mistake. I've known her for thousands of years. She wouldn't do something like that without a good reason.\" Tian Qiyuan's eyes widened at this shocking revelation.","He knew Zi Xuan was an eccentric individual, but she was definitely no mass murderer. If she killed someone, she definitely would have a good reason for doing so.","\"It's true, Senior. The Sword Goddess went on a rampage against those who slandered the Exalted Blacksmith, especially the Ancient Anvil Association. If anyone dared to slander the Exalted Blacksmith openly, she would show up at their door and slaughter them like pigs.\"","\"Huh...?\" Tian Qiyuan's eyes widened for a second time, as he could totally see Zi Xuan doing such a thing for him as the Exalted Blacksmith Fanatic.","\"She'd killed thousands of people throughout the years, killed two of the Ancient Anvil Association elders, and even crippled the Fiery Heaven Blacksmith—to the point where he could no longer wield a hammer properly. Due to her actions, she was branded as an evil cultivator and was given a bounty.\"","\"She would've probably gone for the God of Creation's throat if he weren't so much stronger than her. Anyway, after being branded as an evil cultivator and given a bounty, the Sword Goddess became the hunted.\"","\"If the Unrivaled Nine Swords Sect hadn't exiled her, we would've been branded as accomplices and also become the world's enemy.\"","\"I understand her situation... and I have another question. Is she dead?\" Tian Qiyuan wore a grim expression on his face as he asked this serious question.","Although they never acknowledged each other as lovers, they were certainly more than just friends and had shared moments that only lovers would. Tian Qiyuan would be lying to himself if he said he didn't have any feelings for her.","\"Last I heard, they managed to destroy her physical body but failed to secure her soul and allowed her to escape. That was about twenty years ago. I haven't heard anything about it since then.\"","\"So she could still be out there, huh...\"","\"Last question. Who destroyed her body?\"","\"That would be Fiery Heaven Blacksmith. Of course, he had help from the Ancient Anvil Association and several other parties.\"","\"Thank you. As promised, I will compensate you for your time.\" Tian Qiyuan handed him the sword and quickly left the scene.","His next objective was to locate Fiery Heaven Blacksmith, which didn't take long at all.","After being crippled by Zi Xuan, Fiery Heaven Blacksmith retired as a blacksmith and became a famous playboy who frequented brothels and whatnot.","After asking around, Tian Qiyuan found Fiery Heaven Blacksmith at the Thousand Fairy Sky Pavilion, surrounded by dozens of beauties as they fed him fruits and drinks.","Tian Qiyuan examined Fiery Heaven Blacksmith's body to see how crippled he was.","Fiery Heaven Blacksmith looked healthy at a glance, but once someone noticed the condition of his hands, they would immediately understand why he had to retire as a blacksmith.","His hands not only lacked fingers, but the hands themselves appeared squashed, resembling that of meatpaste.","Normally, a cultivator at his level would be able to heal such injuries even without the help of medicine. Unfortunately for him, Zi Xuan had struck him with a sword that caused permanent damage and blocked the effects of all healing medicine. This sword was something Tian Qiyuan crafted himself, and he knew at a glance from Fiery Heaven Blacksmith's injuries that she'd used that sword on him.","Unless Fiery Heaven Blacksmith destroyed his crippled body and reconstructed it from scratch, he would have no way of recovering from his injuries fully.","However, such a method was easier said than done. Rebuilding his newly constructed body to its current level would require tremendous effort and take hundreds of thousands of years.","Fiery Heaven Blacksmith did not bother rebuilding his body since he'd already lost all motivation and passion for smithing after Eternal Blacksmith became the God of Creation.","Once he was done examining Fiery Heaven Blacksmith, Tian Qiyuan approached him.","\"Hey, you bastard, are you blind?\"","Fiery Heaven Blacksmith cursed at him before he could even get too close.","\"Can't you see that I am busy enjoying myself here? Your presence is affecting the atmosphere. Get lost before I kill—\"","Before Fiery Heaven Blacksmith could even finish his sentence, Tian Qiyuan retrieved the masterpiece he'd recently completed and swung it.","Sha!","Even though Fiery Heaven Blacksmith could follow Tian Qiyuan's movements, his body was not fast enough to react to it, and before he realized it, his physical body had been destroyed.","\"AHHH!\"","\"MURDERER!!!\"","The ladies around them screamed in terror.","However, Tian Qiyuan did not kill Fiery Heaven Blacksmith, who was now a bodiless soul.","\"Y-you fucking bastard! Who do you think I am?! How dare you do this to—\"","Fiery Heaven Blacksmith failed to finish his sentence a second time, but it was not because of Tian Qiyuan.","When Fiery Heaven Blacksmith subconsciously laid eyes on the sword in Tian Qiyuan's grasp after being attracted by its aura, he was struck with such profound bewilderment that words utterly failed him.","As a Divine Blacksmith, he'd seen all sorts of treasures in this world. However, he'd never seen a treasure like the sword before him at this very moment. While he couldn't tell exactly what it was made of, he instinctively knew that it was something otherworldly—something this world had never seen before.","If he had to describe the treasure, it would be flawless and without equal.","Tian Qiyuan noticed that Fiery Heaven Blacksmith was ensnared by his sword and smiled, \"Are you interested in this?\"","He extended his sword to give Fiery Heaven Blacksmith a better look.","\"W-where did you acquire such a treasure?! Is it a natural treasure, or is it someone's creation?!\" Fiery Heaven Blacksmith asked, pretending as if Tian Qiyuan hadn't destroyed his physical body a moment ago. Despite losing his passion as a blacksmith and retiring as one, he was still one at heart.","Tian Qiyuan shrugged and said, \"I don't know. I found it lying on the street and picked it up.\"","And without saying another word, Tian Qiyuan vanished from the scene like a ghost, leaving Fiery Heaven Blacksmith utterly speechless and confused.","His purpose for visiting Fiery Heaven Blacksmith was solely to punish him for destroying Zi Xuan's physical body. He'd thought about destroying Fiery Heaven Blacksmith's soul, killing him permanently.","However, when Tian Qiyuan saw how interested Fiery Heaven Blacksmith was in his weapon, Tian Qiyuan decided to torture him with curiosity.","Sure enough, Fiery Heaven Blacksmith's encounter with Tian Qiyuan's sword left a profound and everlasting impression on him, sparking an intense desire to create something of comparable brilliance.","His passion for the art reignited, and Fiery Heaven Blacksmith announced his return as a blacksmith after reconstructing his new physical body. He used his memories to study Tian Qiyuan's sword, but no matter how much he tried, he was unable to comprehend it.","Eventually, he gave up trying to understand it and began attempting to replicate it. Alas, nothing he crafted came even close to matching the quality of Tian Qiyuan's sword, even after millions of attempts.","\"If only I could see that sword one more time! If only I had looked at it for a little longer back then!!!\"","His infatuation eventually turned him into a madman who traveled the Nine Heavens in search of Tian Qiyuan and his sword.","Meanwhile, Tian Qiyuan visited the Ancient Anvil Association and flaunted his sword to the experts there, leaving all of them absolutely gobsmacked.","To the untrained eye, Tian Qiyuan's sword appeared to be a high-quality sword and nothing more. However, to expert blacksmiths, it was nothing short of a miracle—the true pinnacle of craftsmanship that surpassed common sense and defied all logic, as if it embodied the very essence and secrets of the art of smithing.","The experts there begged Tian Qiyuan to let them examine the treasure, but Tian Qiyuan refused even to let them touch his sword.","This drove all of the experts there mad, especially Yao Tao, who actually lost control of his emotions and attacked Tian Qiyuan in an attempt to steal the sword.","However, Tian Qiyuan easily stopped Yao Tao in his tracks, even destroying his physical body in the process. Then, without another word, Tian Qiyuan vanished into thin air.","Soon, rumors of a mysterious man with a 'perfect' sword spread throughout the community like wildfire.","\"It was a sword that surpassed even Celestial-grade treasures.\"","\"It was not something created by man but by a god—one that surpasses even the God of Creation!\"","These rumors eventually reached the God of Creation, immediately piquing his interest."]},{"number":1538,"title":"Chapter 1538 Pinnacle of Treasures","paragraphs":["1538 Pinnacle of Treasures","\"A mysterious man carrying around a sword of unfathomable quality that is described as the pinnacle of treasures by those who witnessed it, huh?\" God of Creation muttered to himself after hearing the recent rumors. As a blacksmith, he was more interested in the sword than the individual with it.","Eventually, he could no longer contain his curiosity and began a journey to find the mysterious man with the so-called pinnacle of treasures.","He visited those who had seen the sword to see if he could learn anything about this mysterious man or find any clues that would lead to him. Unfortunately, he could only acquire insubstantial information.","\"He was a tall and handsome man.\"","\"I have never seen him before, but he had a powerful aura around him. I believe he was an expert.\"","\"He was definitely an expert. I don't know how much his sword contributed to his strength, but he managed to obliterate Yao Tao of the Ancient Anvil Association with a single blow.\"","\"His sword matched the length of his body, its blade predominantly black with hints of gold woven in. Although its appearance wasn't extravagant, its quality was undeniably otherworldly,\" one of the witnesses recalled, their voice filled with reverence.","\"If a grade existed above Celestial-grade, that sword would definitely be in that category—or two above it. That's just how perfect it was.\"","As the God of Creation heard more about this flawless sword, his desire to see it with his own eyes intensified.","The God of Creation, driven by an insatiable desire, eventually placed a bounty on both the man and the sword, offering vast fortunes to anyone who could lead him to either. To the man himself, he promised untold riches and treasures beyond imagination should he present the sword in person. This announcement reverberated through the realms, igniting a fervent hunt that spanned across the Nine Heavens.","However, no matter how much people searched, they were unable to find any traces of the man or the sword, as if he'd vanished into thin air.","Meanwhile, Tian Qiyuan went to look for Zi Xuan's soul after messing with the Ancient Anvil Association.","The first place he looked was the secret entrance to her world in the Eighth Heaven. After traveling to the Eighth Heaven and arriving at his destination, he found that the entrance had vanished and was no longer there.","'She probably couldn't handle opening too many entrances to her world after losing her physical body...'","Unfortunately, this was the only entrance to her world that he knew of, and he doubted anyone who wasn't Zi Xuan would know of another entrance.","'If I cannot find her, I'll let her find me...'","Tian Qiyuan could only think of one way to attract Zi Xuan. Although he had already tossed away the identity as the Exalted Blacksmith, if it could help Zi Xuan's situation, he would not hesitate to become the Exalted Blacksmith again.","There was a chance that Zi Xuan might eventually show up in his world, but he didn't know how long that would take or if she'd want to trouble him with her presence.","'Since she acted to clear my name, I should do just that—clear my name.'","However, he didn't know where to start. The Ancient Anvil Association had already convinced the entire world that he was a fraud. If he appeared out of the blue to clear his name after ignoring it for so long, it would only have the opposite effect.","In the end, he decided to return to his world to think of a plan. He also hoped that Zi Xuan would suddenly show up in his world like she often does.","Unbeknownst to him, Zi Xuan had already caught wind of the rumors surrounding the peerless sword. The moment she heard about it, her thoughts immediately turned to Tian Qiyuan. In all the heavens, there was only one individual capable of crafting such a masterpiece.","'So he's achieved his ambitions... It's a pity that I missed the process, and I really want to see the sword with my own eyes, but alas... I don't think I can visit him while in this condition...'","She feared that Tian Qiyuan would disapprove of her methods of trying to clear his name, as she'd gone to the extreme. However, even if it caused him to hate her, she would not stop until she cleared his name.","'Once I reconstruct my body and regain enough strength, I will launch a full attack on the Ancient Anvil Association! Then I will deal with Fiery Heaven Blacksmith once and for all! Since I am not strong enough to deal with the God of Creation yet, I'll save him for last...'","A few years later, Tian Qiyuan appeared in the world again, carrying on his back a beautiful black and golden sword.","Once people started realizing his identity as the mysterious man with the flawless sword, they immediately notified the God of Creation of his whereabouts.","When the God of Creation received this news, he stopped whatever he was doing and flew directly to the location given to him.","Surprisingly, it was the Grand Elder Summit.","\"The Grand Elder Summit, huh? I haven't been to this place since that incident...\" The God of Creation mumbled to himself as he approached the place.","As for Tian Qiyuan, he quietly cultivated at the peak of the summit, where competitions usually took place. It was also where he performed his God of Creation Ceremony.","Although he was surrounded by a crowd, mostly blacksmiths, none dared to approach him. They had all heard of what he had done to Yao Tao. Instead, they merely inspected the sword resting on his lap with awe in their eyes.","\"The rumors were true! That is truly a flawless sword! The pinnacle of treasures!\"","\"Heavens! Who is that man? Do you think he created it?\"","\"There's no way a nobody could have crafted such a treasure! I doubt even the heavens have the capabilities to do so!\"","The blacksmiths stared at the sword with mouths agape, their eyes brimming with wonder and reverence as if they stood before their god."]},{"number":1539,"title":"Chapter 1539 Exalted Blacksmith’s Return","paragraphs":["1539 Exalted Blacksmith's Return","\"Excuse me, can you tell us your name?\" One of the blacksmiths surrounding Tian Qiyuan, like a group of hungry pigeons, suddenly asked him.","Tian Qiyuan looked at the man who just spoke and calmly responded, \"Tian Qiyuan.\"","\"Tian Qiyuan...?\"","\"It sounds familiar, but I can't remember where I heard such a name before...\"","\"I also find it very familiar, too.\"","\"Me too.\"","None of the people there recognized his name at first, but it definitely sounded familiar to them.","God of Creation showed up shortly after, but nobody there managed to remember where they heard his name.","During his time as the Exalted Blacksmith, Tian Qiyuan rarely mentioned his name, only doing so during his earlier days as the Exalted Blacksmith, hence why nobody there could recall it.","When the people there noticed the God of Creation descending to the Grand Elder Summit, they all made room for his landing.","God of Creation touched the ground a moment later, landing right before Tian Qiyuan.","However, the God of Creation didn't utter a word even many minutes after his arrival, filling the atmosphere with an awkward silence.","With a nonchalant expression on his face, his eyes were fixated on the sword on Tian Qiyuan's lap. Yet, if one looked closely, one would notice the God of Creation's eyebrows occasionally twitching.","God of Creation eventually opened his mouth to speak, \"Who... who created that sword?\"","Even the expert blacksmiths present struggled to discern whether the sword was a crafted masterpiece or a natural wonder born from the essence of the world itself, but the God of Creation could tell that it was the former.","He'd seen all kinds of treasures in the world, including the best treasures in the world. However, none of them could even begin to compare to the sword in front of him at this very moment.","He initially believed the rumors about the sword were exaggerations, but upon seeing it with his own eyes, he realized they had, in fact, underestimated its true value and miraculous nature.","\"Does it really matter who crafted it?\" Tian Qiyuan responded.","\"Of course it does!\" he quickly answered.","\"And what are you going to do with that knowledge, God of Creation? Are you going to give them your position?\"","\"What...? That's...\" God of Creation immediately fell silent.","Whoever crafted this sword definitely had the skills to replace him, but he didn't dare to utter such words out loud.","\"Wait... your voice...\" God of Creation suddenly had a moment of realization and wore a look of disbelief on his face.","\"You can't be...\"","Tian Qiyuan stood up and said, \"This sword was crafted by none other than yours truly, Tian Qiyuan.\"","\"Exalted Blacksmith!\" God of Creation muttered in a shocked tone, feeling all sorts of emotions rushing into him.","\"What? Exalted Blacksmith? The fraud of the era?\"","Everyone there was left speechless after finally realizing Tian Qiyuan's true identity.","\"But he's not wearing a mask... what does this mean?\"","\"Why would he expose his face like this? His only saving grace was his unknown identity.\"","\"Forget about all that! He just claimed to be the creator of that flawless sword! If anyone could craft a sword, it would be someone who performed a flawless God of Creation Ceremony! I've always known that he was innocent!\"","\"Is this the return of the Exalted Blacksmith?!\"","\"Why are you all so quick to believe him? He's a fraud!\" someone shouted, their voice cutting through the murmurs of admiration.","\"That's right! He's a fraud! That sword is probably fake, too!\"","\"A fraud, huh?\" Tian Qiyuan suddenly chuckled.","\"What's so funny?!\"","\"Oh, it's nothing serious. I just find your stupidity quite funny, so I cracked a chuckle. What do you think, God of Creation? Do you also think my sword is fake because it's too perfect—","just like my God of Creation Ceremony? I am, by your words, a fraud, after all.\"","God of Creation gritted his teeth and clenched his fists at Tian Qiyuan's words, but he could not find a proper response. Deep down, he knew the truth. He wanted to refute him, but having already acknowledged his own faults privately, he understood that continuing to deceive himself and slander Tian Qiyuan would render him truly irredeemable.","After a moment of silence, God of Creation spoke, \"Let's have a match, Exalted Blacksmith.\"","\"That's quite sudden, but I never shy away from a challenge. What do you have in mind?\"","\"We will both perform the God of Creation Ceremony again—a slightly modified version of it— and at the same time. For this ceremony, we will be crafting specific treasures to ensure that cheating is impossible. Of course, I will also be providing the materials.\"","Tian Qiyuan quickly agreed, \"It's a bit of a hassle, but I'll do it. However, let's make it more interesting. The winner will have to give up on their most valuable possession. In my case, it would be this sword.\"","\"If you can beat me, I will give you this sword.\" Tian Qiyuan held the sword in front of him with a confident aura surrounding him.","The God of Creation swallowed nervously at this enticing offer. However, he had nothing in his possession that could possibly match the sword. Even if he were to give up his title and his entire fortune, it would not be able to compare with the sword.","After pondering for a moment, he said, \"I shall give you my life.\"","The God of Creation's response surprised not just Tian Qiyuan but also left the crowd speechless.","\"What are you trying to achieve? Atone for your crimes of slandering me?\" Tian Qiyuan asked, his voice laced with curiosity.","\"I'll give you an answer if you can defeat me.\"","\"Very well. And a heads up—I have no intention of stopping you if you truly want to give up your life because I have no sympathy for those who wronged me, so be prepared to die once you lose to me.\"Tian Qiyuan said.","The God of Creation calmly nodded, seemingly undisturbed by his words.","\"Then I'll give you the date and location of our match later,\" he said the following moment."]},{"number":1540,"title":"Chapter 1540 Unparalleled Speed","paragraphs":["1540 Unparalleled Speed","News of Tian Qiyuan's return and his upcoming match with the God of Creation spread through the Nine Heavens like wildfire, igniting curiosity and excitement among cultivators and blacksmiths alike.","\"What? The Exalted Blacksmith has returned? What happened to him being a fraud?\"","\"I guess that's why the God of Creation challenged him to a match—to determine whether he is truly a fraud or not.\"","\"The Exalted Blacksmith revealed his identity? How do we know that he's not in disguise?\"","\"So the Exalted Blacksmith is the creator of the flawless sword... It all makes sense now...\"","A few weeks later, the God of Creation announced the time and place for their competition.","\"Our match will take place at the Astral Holy Grounds exactly ten years from now. There will be no time for preparations once the God of Creation Ceremony begins, but you have ten years to prepare.\"","Tian Qiyuan acknowledged the match and vanished from the world for the next ten years.","As Tian Qiyuan's match with the God of Creation grew closer, countless influential figures and powerful backgrounds made their way to the Astral Holy Grounds.","The Astral Holy Grounds, a unique location beyond the Nine Heavens, was accessible only to those capable of traversing the starry sky, making attendance at their match a rare privilege reserved for the most powerful or resourceful cultivators.","Fortunately for those unable to travel but eager to witness the historic event, a special treasure would broadcast the match to the entire world, ensuring everyone could watch the legendary match unfold.","When Tian Qiyuan arrived at the Astral Holy Grounds, he was greeted by a massive sea of influential people. No matter where he looked, he would recognize at least several of them with a glance. Hell, even the Celestial Emperor was present.","Of course, the Ancient Anvil Association and Yao Tao, with his new physical body, were also there.","When Yao Tao sensed Tian Qiyuan's gaze on him, his body instinctively reacted, trembling in fear.","Sometime later, Tian Qiyuan and the God of Creation approached the large area where their stations had already been prepared.","Before they started the match, the Celestial Emperor entered the stage as an announcer and said, \"We have all gathered here today to witness the God of Creation and Exalted Blacksmith's competition. Both contestants will be performing a slightly altered version of the God of Creation Ceremony.\"","\"Just like the original ceremony, they have 100 attempts to craft as many Celestial-grade treasures as they can. However, they both must craft the treasure using the materials provided to them, so they cannot craft whatever they want.\"","In the God of Creation Ceremony, participants could craft any treasures they desired from the materials they selected and choose the type of weapon they desired to make. This flexibility made the traditional ceremony less challenging than the altered version, where they were restricted on the materials they used, as well as the type of treasures they could craft from them.","\"Before we begin this competition, our contestants will give a brief speech.\"","The God of Creation stepped forward and began speaking after the Celestial Emperor gave him a nod.","\"I will keep my speech brief. As some, if not most of you, have already heard, if I lose this match, I will forfeit my life. You may be wondering why I decided to gamble my life in such a manner. There are several reasons, but I will only tell you one.\"","\"If Exalted Blacksmith defeats me, it means he was not a fraud, and I was mistaken the entire time. To slander someone who performed a flawless God of Creation Ceremony, I can only atone with my life.\"","The spectators immediately began mumbling to each other.","\"If the Exalted Blacksmith turns out to be innocent and his God of Creation Ceremony was legit, the Ancient Anvil Association is done for. Nobody will ever trust them again.\"","\"The Exalted Blacksmith is definitely innocent. I've believed in him since day one.\"","Tian Qiyuan spoke next, \"I only have one reason for accepting his challenge—to prove my innocence. If I lose this competition, I will give God of Creation my masterpiece—this sword right here.\"","When Tian Qiyuan revealed the sword, countless gasps echoed through the crowd. Sword enthusiasts were literally drooling at the sight of such perfection, their hands itching with an almost unbearable urge to touch and inspect the masterpiece before them.","The Celestial Emperor was no different. Despite his vast collection of treasures, none could compare to the sword crafted by Tian Qiyuan.","Tian Qiyuan continued, \"With that said, God of Creation's life alone won't be able to make this a fair gamble, so I will be taking every treasure crafted from this God of Creation Ceremony.\"","Tian Qiyuan's words were quite arrogant, but nobody could refute his claims—not even the God of Creation himself.","Sometime later, Tian Qiyuan and the God of Creation went to their workstations.","\"Let the match between God of Creation and Exalted Blacksmith begin!\" The Celestial Emperor announced.","Tian Qiyiuan grabbed the first set of materials. There were signs beside the materials with the required type of treasure, and his first treasure would be a spear.","Once he took a moment to examine the materials, Tian Qiyuan immediately began refining them.","Unbeknownst to the world, Tian Qiyuan's smithing skills experienced a profound evolution after he successfully crafted his masterpiece.","With his current skills, Celestial-grade treasures were no different than Spirit-grade treasures.","A few hours later, while the God of Creation was still refining his materials, Tian Qiyuan finished his first treasure.","\"No way... he's already done? It's only been four hours since he began!\"","\"Impossible! He must be cheating!\"","\"Are you fucking stupid? Almost every expert in the Nine Heavens is present, including the Celestial Emperor himself! Even if he dared to cheat, I do not believe he can evade the detection of so many experts!\"","\"Four hours... what the hell is this? Is he crafting Celestial-","grade treasures or Spirit-grade treasures?\"","\"At this rate, he'll finish all 100 Celestial-grade treasures before the God of Creation can finish a single treasure.\"","God of Creation was so focused on his work that he didn't realize Tian Qiyuan had already finished his first treasure.","Tian Qiyuan quickly moved on to his second treasure and, a few hours later, finished it within three hours.","\"My god! He's gotten even faster!\"","\"Some people can't even comprehend just how amazing of a feat it is to lower even a single minute, much less an entire hour...\"","Ding! Ding! Ding!","Tian Qiyuan's hammer swung with such speed that, to onlookers, his arm seemed frozen in time.","\"How fast is he hammering the materials?! Although I hear a steady rhythm, he's obviously hammering it much faster! What kind of phenomenon is this?!\"","Two hours later, Tian Qiyuan finished his third treasure, lowering his time by another hour.","\"Heavens...\" The Celestial Emperor and the other powerhouses were all left stunned by Tian Qiyuan's ridiculous crafting speed.","While they were certain that Tian Qiyuan was not cheating, they struggled to accept the existence of such unparalleled talent. Desperately, they scrutinized every detail in his movements, hoping to find something to discredit him.","Unfortunately, no matter how hard they tried, they could not find anything sketchy about Tian Qiyuan's work.","Heaven and Earth Blacksmith, who was present at the ceremony, sighed to himself, \"He's truly ahead of our time by countless years.\"","\"Such unrivaled talents... you can only be envious about it.\" Star Forging Blacksmith spoke with a bittersweet smile.","After crafting his 10th treasure, Tian Qiyuan sped up a little more, now requiring only a single hour to finish a treasure","\"Surely, he cannot go any faster than this, right?\"","\"At this rate, he'll finish this ceremony in less than a week.\"","Four days later, Tian Qiyuan started working on his final treasure.","Meanwhile, the God of Creation was still trying to refine the materials for his first treasure.","It was evident who was destined to win this competition long before Tian Qiyuan even completed his second treasure. Yet, no one intervened on behalf of the God of Creation. Instead, they all pitied him. Having staked his very life on this contest, they were essentially witnessing the final moments of the God of Creation.","Unfortunately, his final moments were neither grand nor something to be celebrated. The once mighty God of Creation was humbled, his greatness eclipsed by the brilliance of Tian Qiyuan's otherworldly talent.","Half an hour later, Tian Qiyuan completed his 100th treasure, marking the end of his God of Creation Ceremony. He had somehow surpassed his previous flawless ceremony, achieving the impossible by elevating perfection to an even higher realm.","As Tian Qiyuan finished his last treasure, the entire world fell silent, as if time itself had frozen in awe of his achievement.","Tian Qiyuan placed his hammer down and turned to look at the God of Creation, who was still hammering away, oblivious to the fact that the ceremony had already concluded.","Tian Qiyuan shook his head and approached the God of Creation, stopping right in front of his anvil.","With Tian Qiyuan standing directly in front of him, the God of Creation couldn't help but notice him, even in his state of deep immersion in his work.","\"Bastard, what are you trying to do?! Are you giving up already because you know you can't beat me?\" The God of Creation stopped hammering and roared at Tian Qiyuan.","Tian Qiyuan shrugged and said, \"The competition's already over. However, I won't stop you if you wish to finish your ceremony. That way, you'll get to spend a few more decades doing what you love before you die.\"","\"What...?\" The God of Creation looked at him with disbelief."]},{"number":1541,"title":"Chapter 1541 Defeating the God of Creation","paragraphs":["1541 Defeating the God of Creation","\"Y-you're done with the ceremony...? That's impossible! It's only been several days since we started!\" God of Creation didn't even have to look at Tian Qiyuan's workstation to know that he was farting.","Tian Qiyuan's expression remained calm as he spoke, \"You really don't learn, do you? If you don't believe me, take a look for yourself.\"","He gestured at his completed treasures on display.","The God of Creation didn't want to entertain Tian Qiyuan and his nonsense, but he had to take a look.","When he turned his head to Tian Qiyuan's workstation, he could not see any materials. On Tian Qiyuan's display were 100 Celestial-grade treasures, all of them following their own specifications.","Clang.","The God of Creation dropped his hammer from shock after seeing this.","He turned to look at the audience. They all wore expressions of defeat, a sorrowful aura hanging around them as if they were mourning a profound loss—his imminent death.","While the God of Creation lamented in silence, Tian Qiyuan spoke, \"Even though it's your loss, I won't personally kill you, nor do I really care if you actually honor your own words. You can continue to live after this, but you will forever be known as a coward and slanderer for the rest of your life.\"","Tian Qiyuan no longer paid attention to the God of Creation and turned to look at the Yao Tao, who was seated with several elders of the Ancient Anvil Association and said out loud, \"Are you going to claim that I had cheated this competition, too? Are you going to slander my name and call me a fraud to cover up what you've done in the past?\"","Yao Tao and the elders lowered their heads in shame, not daring to talk back. With their credibility lost and their slander now exposed to so many people, the Ancient Anvil Association was essentially finished.","Moreover, after Tian Qiyuan's performance today, nobody would dare to offend him, who could churn out Celestial- grade treasures like candy.","The Celestial Emperor approached Tian Qiyuan once it became clear that the God of Creation had given up—not that it would have made a difference even if he continued.","\"Congratulations on becoming the next God of Creation, Exalted Blacksmith.\"","However, Tian Qiyuan shook his head and said, \"I have no intention of accepting that position.\"","Seeing the confused look on the Celestial Emperor's face, he explained, \"I came back as the Exalted Blacksmith to clear my name, that's all. I have no intention of working as a blacksmith again.\"","\"No way! With your talents... it'd be an immense waste of talents!\" Heaven and Earth Blacksmith suddenly stood up and exclaimed.","\"Why did you become a blacksmith in the first place?\" The Celestial Emperor asked.","Tian Qiyuan showed his sword and said, \"I started my journey as a blacksmith to craft the perfect weapon, and I have achieved my ambition.\"","The Celestial Emperor swallowed nervously. With the sword so close to him, he had a strong urge to grab it from Tian Qiyuan.","\"What do you plan on doing now that you've retired? I could offer you a position within the Celestial Palace.\" The Celestial Emperor said.","\"I'm going to relax at home for a bit, hopefully with some company. Then, I'll begin my next project, whatever that may be.\"","Tian Qiyuan proceeded to collect all of the treasures he'd crafted. Then, without giving the audience any more of his attention, he disappeared into the distance.","The audience remained silent even after Tian Qiyuan left. As for the God of Creation, he continued to sit before his anvil in silence, his thoughts unknown.","After leaving the Astral Holy Grounds, Tian Qiyuan returned to his own world.","Over the next several years, the world would not stop talking about Tian Qiyuan's match against the God of Creation, who disappeared after their competition and vanished from the world, never to be seen or heard from again.","Nobody knew what happened to him. Some speculated that he'd killed himself in isolation, while others speculated that he chickened out and couldn't kill himself and changed his identity.","As for the Ancient Anvil Association, they were disbanded when everyone lost faith in them. Many blacksmiths blamed the association for Tian Qiyuan's early retirement and refused to collaborate with them. Countless blacksmiths tore up their contracts and discarded them outside the association's headquarters.","The Ancient Anvil Association, one of the oldest establishments for blacksmiths, ended because they slandered a single man, and nobody felt sorry for them.","With the God of Creation gone and Tian Qiyuan refusing the title, the position became awkwardly vacant. Despite being qualified, neither the Star Forging Blacksmith nor the Relentless Blacksmith stepped forward to claim it.","When asked about it, they simply said they were not worthy of it, especially when Tian Qiyuan still existed.","In the end, people gave Tian Qiyuan a new title as the God of Refinement due to his ridiculous material refining speed.","As for Zi Xuan, it became clear to everyone that she had been right all along—Tian Qiyuan was indeed innocent. Although her methods had been extreme, few blamed her for her actions. The Unrivaled Nine Swords Sect publicly announced their willingness to welcome her back into the sect, but they never heard from Zi Xuan again.","Nine years after Tian Qiyuan defeated the God of Creation and cleared his name, he sensed a presence appearing inside his world.","He greeted the presence with a gentle smile, \"It's been a while, Zi Xuan.\"","\"I'm sorry to show up in this pathetic state...\" she sighed, still in her soul form.","\"It's all good. I'm glad you're okay. I was worried that I might never see you again.\"","\"Really? You don't hate me? Even though I've done such horrible things?\"","\"What's so horrible about trying to clear my name? So what if you've killed some people? They deserved it for slandering me.\" Tian Qiyuan shrugged.","\"Qiyuan... thank you...\" Zi Xuan said in a trembling voice."]},{"number":1542,"title":"Chapter 1542 Empyrean Overlord’s True Name","paragraphs":["1542 Empyrean Overlord's True Name","\"What's your plan now?\" Tian Qiyuan asked Zi Xuan sometime later.","\"I don't know yet, but I'll let you know once I think of something. In the meantime, let me see your sword. I've been dying to take a look at it ever since I heard about it.\" Zi Xuan said, her voice filled with enthusiasm.","\"Of course.\"","Tian Qiyuan retrieved his sword and held it before Zi Xuan.","\"Oh...\"","Even without a body, Zi Xuan could feel her entire existence trembling from excitement.","Once her excitement calmed down a little, she noticed the sword emitting a strange aura, almost as though it was trying to charm her soul.","However, after examining it for a little longer, she felt that something was off about it, and she couldn't pinpoint why she was feeling this way.","\"It's definitely an otherwordly sword without equal, and don't misunderstand me for saying this,\" Zi Xuan muttered after a moment, \"but it feels like there's something missing. It just doesn't feel complete, somehow.\"","Zi Xuan braced herself for Tian Qiyuan's reprimand, but to her surprise, he simply smiled at her.","\"If anyone could tell, I knew it would be you, Zi Xuan.\" Tian Qiyuan chuckled.","Despite the multitude of admirers and expert blacksmiths who had seen the sword, none had noticed the subtle flaw that Zi Xuan pointed out.","\"Huh? I was right?\" Zi Xuan muttered in a dazed voice.","Tian Qiyuan nodded and said, \"Indeed, you're right. As you pointed out, while the sword is finished, it's not truly complete. It's missing one key element, but this element isn't something that can be forged or crafted.\"","\"What do you think this element is? Take a guess.\"","Zi Xuan stared at the sword in silence. However, no matter how much she thought about it, the answer eluded her.","\"I can't think of anything.\"","\"The answer is a soul.\" Tian Qiyuan answered a moment later.","\"A... soul? Like a human's soul?\"","\"Although I said soul, it's not the type you're thinking about. It's an extremely rare phenomenon, but did you know that given enough time and spiritual energy, natural plants and herbs can develop into sentient spirits with their own consciousness?\" Tian Qiyuan asked.","\"Yes, I am aware of that.\"","\"Treasures are the same. They, too, have the capability to form their own consciousness. When they do, they become Soul Weapons—a weapon with its own soul. However, not all treasures can become Soul Weapons. As for those that have the capability, one can only wait for them to turn into a Soul Weapon naturally.\"","Tian Qiyuan then continued, \"This sword... it's an artificial Soul Weapon—a soulless one. While it doesn't have a soul right now, it has the capability to house a soul and grow together with it.\"","\"An artificial Soul Weapon...? That's crazy... but what advantage does it providethat a natural Soul Weapon cannot?\"","\"Well, for starters, once a natural Soul Weapon's spirit dies, the weapon loses its powers alongside the spirit. As for my sword, it won't lose its powers or be destroyed even without a spirit because it came into existence without one.\"","\"And since the sword won't be destroyed without a spirit, we can always change out the spirit for whatever reason.\"","Zi Xuan listened to Tian Qiyuan's words as she stared at the beautiful sword.","\"Would a human soul be compatible with it?\" she suddenly asked.","\"A human soul, huh? Since a spirit's soul is almost indistinguishable from a human's soul, I think it would work.\" Tian Qiyuan said.","\"I have decided what I want to do. Qiyuan, let me become this sword's spirit,\" she spoke in a serious tone.","\"What?\" Tian Qiyuan stared at her with wide eyes.","\"The sword is incomplete right now because it doesn't have a soul, right? Then, allow me to complete it. I have always wanted to become one with your swords, so this is exactly what I've been waiting for!\"","\"But you're a human who spent most of your life living in this vast world... Are you really fine with throwing away all of that just to spend your life inside a sword as a spirit?\" Tian Qiyuan hesitated to make Zi Xuan the spirit of his sword.","\"I am. I can continue growing stronger with the sword, right? And it's not like I have to spend the rest of my life inside the sword since it can continue to operate without a spirit.\"","Tian Qiyuan sighed, \"If that's what you really want, I won't stop you. And it's true. If you ever change your mind, you can come out of the sword and return to living as a human.\"","\"Then it's decided. I want to be together with you as your sword. This will fulfill both of my dreams at once, just like killing two birds with one stone.\"","Zi Xuan always wanted to remain by Tian Qiyuan's side, but her position within the Unrivaled Nine Swords Sect made that difficult. Now that she'll be living inside his sword, she'll be able to follow him wherever he goes.","\"However, promise me something.\" Zi Xuan suddenly said.","\"What is it?\"","\"That you'll never let another soul dwell inside this sword for as long as I exist.\"","\"As long as you wish to remain inside the sword, I promise that I won't let anyone else take your spot.\" Tian Qiyuan nodded.","\"By the way, what's this sword's name?\"","Tian Qiyuan smiled and said, \"I thought you'd never ask.\"","\"Since it's a treasure that stands above all treasures under heaven, I named it Number One Under Heaven.\"","\"Number One Under Heaven... What an arrogant yet fitting name. It's perfect.\"","Sometime later, Zi Xuan entered Number One Under Heaven, completing Tian Qiyuan's masterpiece.","\"...\"","\"...\"","\"...\"","\"I remember everything now, Zi Xuan!\" Yuan exclaimed as the sword spirit's aura reached its peak.","Zi Xuan's body trembled after hearing her name, and her aura began to simmer down.","Yuan raised the Empyrean Overlord and mumbled to it, \"I apologize for not remembering you sooner, Number One Under Heaven.\"","Ding!","<You have learned Empyrean Overlord's true name!>","<Empyrean Overlord has begun its true awakening>","<Progress: 10%>"]},{"number":1543,"title":"Chapter 1543 Number One Under Heaven","paragraphs":["1543 Number One Under Heaven","\"So you've remembered everything, huh?\" Zi Xuan pointed her finger at him in a threatening manner.","\"Not literally everything as Tian Qiyuan, but I remember how we met, about the God of Creation Ceremony, about being slandered and clearing my name, and how you became the spirit of Number One Under Heaven.\"","\"Then you remember our promise, right? That you'd never let another soul dwell within my sword for as long as I exist!\" she growled, her anger palpable.","\"Yes... I remember... and I'm sorry for breaking that promise. I have no excuse, even though I only recovered Tian Qiyuan's memories just now. However, can you hear me out for a moment?\"","\"I'll give you one minute to explain yourself.\" Zi Xuan replied after a moment of silence.","\"Thank you.\" Yuan immediately explained the situation to her.","Sometime later, Zi Xuan spoke after grasping the situation, \"I understand the situation now, but that doesn't mean I have to accept it. You tossed them into your Soul Weapons so you could bring them out of the Shadow Realm, but now that they're out of the Shadow Realm, they no longer have any reason to stay inside.\"","\"Now give me back my home before I go in there and remove you myself! I can't promise you'll be in one piece by the time I am finished!\"","Knowing Zi Xuan's character and how much Number One Under Heaven meant to her, he had no doubt that she would actually carry out her own threat.","Yuan quickly pondered for a solution. Since the Soul Weapon could only house one soul at a time and he didn't have another unoccupied Soul Weapon, there was only one place for Yu Ning to stay.","\"It's okay, Young Master. I will come out. Since we're outside the Shadow Realm, it's true that I no longer need to stay inside, and this is her home, after all.\" Yu Ning's voice suddenly said.","And without waiting for Yuan to respond, Yu Ning emerged from Number One Under Heaven.","Unlike Zi Xuan, who was in perfect shape and looked like an actual human, Yu Ning's soul resembled a small, ethereal cloud.","\"Hmph!\"","Zi Xuan immediately entered Number One Under Heaven.","Ding!","<Sword Goddess Zi Xuan has entered Empyrean Overlord>","<Sword Goddess Zi Xuan has reconnected her bond with Empyrean Overlord>","<After reuniting with its spirit, Sword Goddess Zi Xuan, Empyrean Overlord's awakening has accelerated significantly>","<Progress: 100%>","Ding!","<Empyrean Overlord has fully awakened its true form!>","<Empyrean Overlord has changed name, becoming Number One Under Heaven>","Ding!","<Due to your insufficient cultivation, you will not be able to utilize Number One Under Heaven at its full capacity>","<For the safety of the user, Zi Xuan had placed restrictions upon Number One Under Heaven, reducing its power significantly>","[Number One Under Heaven]","[Level: Max]","[Rank: Soul Weapon]","[Growth Rate: ???]","[Requirement: Can only be wielded by Player Yuan]","[Description: The God of Refinement's masterpiece. It is the pinnacle of swords and treasures with unfathomable prowess.]","[Unique Ability(weakened): When wielding Number One Under Heaven, all sword techniques will have their power amplified by 100,000%.]","[Unique Ability(2): Constantly devours the Qi of your targets after a successful hit, replenishing your own Qi.]","[Unique Ability(3): Number One Under Heaven's size and weight can be altered according to the user's desire. Qi consumption increases based on the size and weight gained.]","[Unique Ability(4): When Number One Under Heaven is out, all swords in the vicinity will have their powers sealed.]","[Unique Ability(5): Sealed]","\"...\"","\"...\"","[Unique Ability(9): Sealed]","Five out of nine of Number One Under Heaven's unique abilities were inaccessible due to the restriction.","\"I've been meaning to say this for a while now, but what's with your pathetic cultivation base? You won't be able to use me at my full potential at your current level. It's a miracle you managed to come this far inside the Vanishing Valley.\" Zi Xuan's voice resounded from the sword.","\"I know. I'm working on it.\"","\"Hmph. If I hadn't restricted most of Number One Under Heaven's power before it fully awakened, your body would've exploded just from touching it. Anyway, do you remember how to use me?\"","\"I do, but right now...\"","Yuan turned to look at Yu Ning and said, \"You can stay inside my Dantian.\"","\"What? Are you insane?\" Zi Xuan responded before Yu Ning could. \"How can you let a stranger enter your Dantian so easily? If she wants to destroy your Dantian, there's nothing you can do to stop her.\"","Due to a Dantian's unique properties, it was possible to let living beings reside within them. Xiao Hua and Yuan's other servants were perfect examples of this phenomenon, as they would stay inside his Dantian whenever they entered his body.","However, unlike Xiao Hua and the others who couldn't harm Yuan due to their master and servant status, Yu Ning, who was not bound by any contract, posed a different story. This made her presence within the Dantian potentially dangerous, as she could destroy his Dantian while inside.","\"Even though I haven't known Yu Ning for long, I trust her enough to let her stay within my Dantian,\" Yuan said with a calm smile.","\"Young Master... to go through such lengths for me... I am eternally grateful,\" Yu Ning spoke, her voice trembling with emotion.","And she continued, \"With heaven as my witness, I swear upon my soul that I will never harm you for as long as I live, or may the heavens shatter my soul!\"","A profound aura enveloped Yu Ning's soul as she finished speaking, signifying that her oath had been heard and was now in effect. If Yu Ning were to harm Yuan from this moment forth, her soul would be shattered.","\"You didn't need to do that, but thank you for doing so,\" Yuan said.","\"Once I regain my body, I will definitely serve you properly, Young Master.\" Yu Ning said as she entered his Dantian."]},{"number":1544,"title":"Chapter 1544 Zi Xuan’s Stash","paragraphs":["1544 Zi Xuan's Stash","\"Now then... Zi Xuan, let's talk about your situation. Why are you staying in the Vanishing Valley, possessing that Giant's Sword?\" Yuan turned his focus to Zi Xuan now that Yu Ning's issue was resolved.","\"Good question. Unfortunately, I do not know. Or, more precisely, I don't remember. When I woke up, I found myself already inside the Vanishing Valley, and not wanting my soul to degrade, I had to possess a treasure, and this Giant's Sword happened to be nearby.\"","\"You don't remember? Then do you remember what you did before losing consciousness?\"","\"I have a faint recollection of engaging in a battle, but the specifics elude me. I can't recall the circumstances that led to the fight or who or what I was up against,\" she confessed.","\"Is that so...\" Yuan mumbled with a pondering face.","\"Oh, but I do remember you telling me something right before I lost consciousness. 'Wait for me', you said, and so I did... for countless years.\"","\"Sorry for making you wait so long...\"","\"You can make it up to me with some intense sex later,\" Zi Xuan casually said.","\"...\"","Xiao Hua lifted an eyebrow at Zi Xuan's words.","Yu Ning wondered to herself, 'A sword spirit having intercourse with a human? Is that even possible?'","Unbeknownst to Yu Ning, Zi Xuan was originally human. However, after spending countless years as a sword spirit, her soul experienced a profound transformation that turned her into a hybrid of sorts, the first of its kind.","\"Then did the previous 'me' tell you anything about what I should do?\" Yuan then asked.","\"They always say the same time—just let fate take its course.\"","\"Of course... why did I even ask?\" Yuan shook his head at his own foolishness.","\"What about you, Zi Xuan? Do you have any goals or purpose at the moment?\"","\"I only have one purpose—to protect and serve you as your sword. Unfortunately, due to your insufficient cultivation base, I have to suppress my cultivation base and restrict Number One Under Heaven's true potential, which will make protecting you a lot more difficult. However, unless you run into an immortal or something, there won't be a problem.\"","Yuan nodded, \"Now that I've done everything I need to in here, let's get out of this ominous place.\"","\"Wait. Before you leave, you should take the monster cores I have collected over the years from killing magical beasts that tried to challenge me. I put them right underneath the Giant's Sword. They will benefit your cultivation greatly if you consume them.\" Zi Xuan suddenly said.","\"Okay.\"","Yuan flew toward the Giant's Sword.","\"Did I hear that right? You can consume monster cores?\" Yu Ning doubted her ears.","\"Yes, I have a unique physique that allows me to do so.\"","\"Just what kind of existence are you, Young Master?\" Yu Ning muttered in a dazed voice.","Sometime later, Yuan arrived at the base of the Giant's Sword, where a mountain of monster cores was stashed out in the open. The sight of so many cores piled together was both awe-inspiring and intimidating.","Furthermore, more than half of these monster cores belonged to Immortal-level magical beasts.","\"I won't have to worry about raising my cultivation base for a while...\" Yuan swallowed nervously.","Then he remembered that he was cursed by the Celestial Emperor, so these monster cores would lose 99 percent of their effects.","'If it weren't for the curse, my cultivation could probably shoot straight to True Immortal with this many monster cores and complete one of the requirements to unlock Heaven's Supremacy...' he sighed inwardly.","'Speaking of Heaven's Supremacy... Now that I have Number One Under Heaven, maybe I can defeat a Divine Emperor-level magical beast and get that task finished. Moreover, I have Immortal Monarch's Dominion, which will surely make things easier.'","After putting away the monster cores into his spatial ring, Yuan immediately went around looking for a magical beast with a cultivation of Divine Emperor, which was exactly nine realms above Spirit King.","Zi Xuan continued chatting with him as he traveled.","\"Hey, what's your current life like? And what's our situation looking like?\"","Yuan proceeded to explain about his new life on Earth, the existence of Cultivation Online, and his current situation.","\"Cultivation Online, huh? What an interesting concept the Celestial Emperor had crafted. I'm also interested in your world. Let me see it the next time you return.\"","Yu Ning also listened with great interest. As for Xiao Hua, she couldn't comprehend Yuan's words, nor did she find anything weird about it. To her, it was akin to trying to comprehend an unknown scripture even though she understood the words themselves.","A few days later, Yuan encountered a magical beast at the first level of Divine Sovereign, which was stronger than his initial target. However, he figured that he'd try to defeat it.","He approached the magical beast in a calm manner and used Immortal Monarch's Dominion on it.","\"You are forbidden from moving until I say so.\"","The magical beast's movements immediately stopped. However, it quickly started moving again after a few seconds, albeit extremely slow and stiff.","'Is my cultivation not strong enough to command them perfectly?' Yuan wondered to himself.","He used Immortal Monarch's Dominion on it again, resetting the effects.","Then, with Number One Under Heaven in his grasp, Yuan activated God of War's Astral Arts before using Nine Supreme Swords.","With Number One Under Heaven's Unique Ability, Nine Supreme Sword's power increased by 100,000 percent.","With nine strikes in total, the first strike was powerful enough to kill a Divine Warrior instantly. The second strike could annihilate a Divine Master in one blow. The third strike could defeat a Divine Grandmaster, while the fourth strike was potent enough to kill a Divine Lord.","The Nine Supreme Sword's fifth strike was powerful enough to obliterate a Divine King. However, it took the seventh strike to defeat a Divine Emperor.","As for a Divine Sovereign magical beast, the eighth strike heavily injured it, with the ninth and final strike killing it.","With a single technique that delivered nine consecutive attacks, each more powerful than the last, Yuan managed to defeat a magical beast ten realms above his own cultivation with relative ease."]},{"number":1545,"title":"Chapter 1545 Leaving Vanishing Valley","paragraphs":["1545 Leaving Vanishing Valley","Ding!","<You have achieved an impossible feat by defeating a Magical Beast that was at least nine realms above you!>","<You have acquired the title 'Defying Logic With Overwhelming Strength'>","[Defying Logic With overwhelming Strength: All damage dealt to Magical Beasts will be increased by 1,000%]","Yuan looked at Number One Under Heaven after defeating the magical beast with ease.","\"The difference between its unawakened form and awakened form is night and day. Their strength is simply incomparable. I haven't felt this powerful since Heaven's Supremacy...\" he muttered to himself.","\"You think it is powerful right now? Just wait until you can use its full potential. This isn't even 10 percent of its true power.\" Zi Xuan said.","\"Not even ten percent?\" Yu Ning swallowed nervously.","This was her first time witnessing anyone fight and defeat a magical beast ten realms above their own cultivation. Yet, Yuan managed to do it with relative ease, leaving her in awe of his godlike prowess.","\"Since I am already here, I might as well test out Number One Under Heaven a little more,\" Yuan said before going to find his next target.","Sometime later, he encountered a Divine Grandmaster-level magical beast with a body that was several times larger than an adult elephant.","After halting its movements with Immortal Monarch's Dominion, Yuan activated Number One Under Heaven's third Unique Ability.","Then, as though it was a balloon, Number One Under Heaven began growing in size until it was 150 meters long.","Since Number One Under Heaven was too large to hold, Yuan used Qi Manifestation to wield it, levitating it in the air.","However, despite its increased size, its weight remained the same, but that didn't remain the same for long, as Yuan increased its weight until it was as heavy as a mountain of steel.","Then, he swung it at the magical beast, cleaving its large body cleanly in half.","After killing the magical beast, Yuan reverted the sword's size but kept its weight the same. However, it still felt as light as a feather in his hand, as if the sword's increased weight didn't affect him.","Sometime later, Yuan found a magical beast only at the level of a Spirit Sovereign.","Without using Immortal Monarch's Dominion on it, he struck its body with Number One Under Heaven without killing it and only injuring it with a superficial wound.","After inflicting the injury, Yuan could feel Number One Under Heaven absorbing the magical beast's spiritual energy through the wound before replenishing his cultivation with the spiritual energy it absorbed.","'It's absorbing much more than I'd anticipated...'","Number One Under Heaven was absorbing enough spiritual energy to completely deplete a Spirit King's cultivation base within seconds, causing them to suffer from cultivation deprivation.","\"Just how many unique abilities does your sword have?\" Yu Ning couldn't help but ask.","A typical treasure would only have one unique ability, with the higher-quality ones having two. Even the most powerful Celestial-grade treasures in the world would not have more than three unique abilities.","\"Number One Under Heaven has nine unique abilities.\" Zi Xuan responded in a prideful tone.","\"Nine?!\" Yu Ning was shocked to learn this information.","\"And it will learn more as it continues to evolve. Number One Under Heaven is a unique treasure that does not have a limit—","it's truly a weapon with unlimited potential.\"","\"Is it a natural weapon, or was it crafted by someone?\" Yu Ning asked out of curiosity.","\"It was crafted by none other than the person you're dwelling within, who was once known as the God of Refinement. Both his reputation and skill surpasses even the God of Creation.\"","\"That was in the past—in one of my past lives.\" Yuan calmly said.","\"Huh? How many past lives do you have?\" Yu Ning was baffled to learn that he had more than one incredible incarnation.","\"I don't know the exact number. Do you, Zi Xuan?\" Yuan turned to her.","\"You rarely talked about your past, so no. However, while I don't know much about the lives before Tian Qiyuan, I know he had reincarnated three more times afterward—not including your current one. They are Tian Xin, Tian Kai, and Tian Yingzhe.\"","'Tian Xin... That's the Sword Emperor and the 'Lord'. Tian Kai is the one who taught the Zither Goddess... Who is Tian Yingzhe?'","Yuan only recognized two of the three names provided by Zi Xuan.","Tian Xin was the identity of the Nameless Emperor, also known as the Sword Emperor. Tian Kai excelled in music and also taught the Zither Goddess. However, he didn't recognize Tian Yingzhe at all.","'He could be the Celestial Overlord's founder or a brand new identity that I have not discovered yet...'","\"What do you know about Tian Yingzhe?\"","\"Sorry, but I don't remember anything besides his name. I have more memories missing besides the moment before I lost consciousness and appeared in the Vanishing Valley. However, I think I will remember everything soon since I've been regaining bits and pieces of my memories about two decades ago.\" Zi Xuan said.","\"It's fine. We can learn a lot with just a name.\"","Once he was satisfied with his testing, Yuan flew without stopping until he left the Vanishing Valley with Zi Xuan's help, as his divine sense was not strong enough to see through the natural illusion that prevented people from leaving the place.","\"It feels great to leave that place finally. I was beginning to wonder if I would ever leave.\" Zi Xuan sighed once they were outside Vanishing Valley.","\"I'm just glad I don't have to deal with the Black Death anymore. That thing was a menace.\"","\"That thing? You can damage it with Supreme Sword Aura,\" Zi Xuan suddenly revealed.","\"I just learned Enhanced Sword Aura. It'll be a while before I learn Supreme Sword Aura.\"","\"You can also damage it with Number One Under Heaven—once you unlock its Unique Ability that allows you to cut through anything, including Black Death. However, you'll have to reach Spirit Enlightenment to unlock it.\"","\"Spirit Enlightenment, huh? Good to know.\""]},{"number":1546,"title":"Chapter 1546 Returning to the Third Heaven","paragraphs":["1546 Returning to the Third Heaven","After leaving Vanishing Valley, Zi Xuan asked him, \"What do you plan on doing now?\"","\"I'm going to descend to the Third Heaven for a while.\"","\"What's happening down there?\"","\"Nothing. I'm just meeting up with a friend.\"","\"Is that so? Anyway, I'm going to slumber for a bit, as I haven't been able to relax at home for countless years now. Don't bring me out unless you're in danger.\"","\"Alright. Get some good rest, Zi Xuan.\" Yuan said before putting her away.","Even in its suppressed form, Number One Under Heaven was incredibly overpowered and definitely not necessary for the Fourth Heaven, let alone the Third Heaven.","\"Welcome back, my liege.\" Dong Ye's voice suddenly resounded.","\"It appears that you've reunited with Lady Zi and managed to awaken your sword's true appearance.\"","\"Did you know Zi Xuan was in the Vanishing Valley this whole time?\" Yuan suddenly asked.","\"No, my liege. I was only aware that a powerful sword spirit existed within the Vanishing Valley. Although I had my suspicions, I could never confirm it.\"","Yuan nodded, \"Anyway, I'm going to make a quick trip to the Third Heaven. Watch over my friends while I am gone.\"","\"Naturally.\"","Yuan made his way back to the Black Fog City for their teleportation device.","From there, he teleported to the city closest to the Stairway to Heaven.","Sometime later, Yuan arrived at the Stairway to Heaven.","Instead of immediately entering the Stairway to Heaven, Yuan admired it from outside.","\"Stairway to Heaven...\"","He vaguely recalled crafting the Stairway to Heaven as Tian Qiyuan to make traveling between the Nine Heavens more convenient.","Before the Stairway to Heaven came into existence, cultivators had to traverse the vast starry sky to travel between realms, rendering the notion of journeying from one heaven to another much less accessible.","Each journey, depending on one's starting point and destination, could take years, if not decades. The arduous and perilous voyages deterred many, making travel between Heavens a rare and significant endeavor reserved for the powerful and privileged.","Realizing this, Tian Qiyuan crafted the Stairway to Heaven, allowing everyone the privilege of traversing the Nine Heavens.","In the beginning, the Stairway to Heaven was only used as a means of travel. However, nowadays, it has become a trial of sorts for those in the lower heavens who wish for a better and more challenging life in the upper heavens. Those who successfully ascend are often regarded with great respect and seen as worthy of the higher realms' opportunities and challenges.","As for who decided to turn the Stairway to Heaven into a trial, it was the Celestial Emperor, who wanted to regulate travel within the Nine Heavens so the upper heavens were not overpopulated, allowing the natural resources there to remain abundant.","As for the lower heavens, while they may have fewer resources, they don't have to worry about any Immortals wreaking havoc.","Tian Qiyuan had no problem letting the Celestial Emperor control the Stairway to Heaven, either. It was only natural to let the ruler of Nine Heavens have authority over such issues, and not doing so might spark another war.","Even if he handed control over to the Celestial Emperor, he was still the ultimate decision-maker as its creator, and he could regain full control whenever he wanted. Furthermore, he saw this as an opportunity to turn the Stairway to Heaven into a training ground for his future reincarnations.","Yuan entered the Stairway to Heaven after admiring his own creation for a minute.","\"Welcome back, Master.\" Tian'er greeted him inside.","\"Are you already ascending to the Fifth Heaven?\"","\"No, I am going to visit the Third Heaven.\"","\"I understand. Please have a safe journey.\" Tian'er didn't ask any questions and created a staircase that went down instead of going up like usual.","\"Thank you.\"","Yuan didn't say anything else and began his descent.","Typically, after receiving approval, one must pay the Lord of their respective Heaven a significant amount of resources before they can descend. The only exception is for those traveling under the orders of the Celestial Emperor, such as the envoys sent to the lower heavens to find Yuan.","Moreover, one would have their cultivation restricted to the limits of their destination to control the damage that could be done while there.","Fortunately, Yuan's cultivation was still well within the limits of Third Heaven, so he didn't need to worry about his cultivation being a problem.","An hour later, Yuan emerged from the Stairway to Heaven, arriving at the Third Heaven.","\"I'll be right back.\" Yuan logged off shortly after to contact Bai Lianhua.","Since Yu Ning dwelled within Yuan's Dantian, she was unable to travel to Earth and was forced to enter a slumbering state after he logged off. The same went for Xiao Hua.","\"Yes, I've arrived in the Third Heaven. Meet me at the nearest Myriad of Techniques.\"","\"Okay, I'll see you in a bit.\"","Yuan returned to Cultivation Online the next moment.","\"Looks like I'm unable to go to Earth with you while I am in your Dantian...\"","\"I guess it makes sense since I technically have two bodies, and you're in my other body's Dantian. Meanwhile, Soul Weapons are connected to one's soul, so I can bring it out no matter which body I am using.\"","\"The Spirit Avatar Array and the Soul Transference Array, huh? They were classified as level 8 formations during my time, but even I cannot perform them despite being a level 8 Array Master, so they're definitely level 9 formations. I cannot imagine how powerful the Array Master who performed these two formations on such a massive scale may be, but they're definitely powerful enough to be the God of Formations.\"","\"The God of Formations, huh? What does it take to become one?\"","\"Well, while the position of God of Formation existed during my time, nobody was actually good enough to claim that title. To even have the chance to be the God of Formation, you need to be able to create a level 9 formation that was considered the most complex and difficult formation in existence—the Chaotic Heaven and Earth Formation. It's an unfathomably powerful formation that has flawless offensive and defensive capabilities.\"","\"The Chaotic Heaven and Earth Formation... I have heard of it. It was used by the first Celestial Emperor when I fought him as the Evil God, and it was very annoying to deal with.\" Yuan casually muttered.","\"Huh? Excuse me? What did you just say?\"","\"That I fought the first Celestial Emperor as the Evil God? Oh, right. I didn't tell you guys yet.\"","\"Y-y-you were the Evil God in one of your previous lives?!?!?! Why didn't you say this sooner!?\" Yu Ning exclaimed in a shocked voice.","\"Well, now you know.\" Yuan smiled.","Yu Ning fell silent the next moment, almost as though she was trying to figure out how she should react to this shocking revelation.","Yuan made it all the way to the Myriad of Techniques in complete silence.","Bai Lianhua was standing outside when he arrived.","\"Sorry, did you wait long?\"","Bai Lianhua shook her head and smiled, \"No, I just got here myself.\"","\"Let's go inside.\"","Once inside, Yuan brought her straight to the highest floor and said, \"Alright, go pick whatever techniques you want.\"","\"Are you sure about this?\" she asked, still hesitant to accept such a gift from him.","\"What are you saying now? Go and get some techniques for your faction. Also, you can take your time. I'll also be looking around.\"","\"Okay...\"","Bai Lianhua left the next moment to wander the place while Yuan also went to check out the techniques. While he doesn't need any for himself, he figured that he might as well acquire a few for his faction.","Yet, even after looking through the entire floor, Yuan was unable to find any decent techniques. Although most people would consider the techniques at Myriad of Techniques above standard, they were merely so-so in Yuan's eyes.","Suddenly, a voice resounded inside his head.","\"I see that you've returned from the Vanishing Valley in one piece, Yuan. I'm relieved. Anyway, can I have a moment of your time right now? I have some urgent information for you.\"Senior Bai's voice resounded.","\"I'll be right there.\"","Yuan went to find Bai Lianhua to let her know that he'd be gone for a bit before going to Senior Bai's world.","\"What's wrong, Senior Bai?\" Yuan asked after meeting up with him.","\"This is about the escaped Immortals. Do you remember the third Immortal who managed to escape into the lower heavens? Well, we found the Immortal in the Fourth Heaven, where you currently are.\"","\"The Fourth Heaven... so what's going to happen now?\"","\"There are already experts chasing after this Immortal, but their hands are somewhat tied because they don't want to cause too much damage in the Fourth Heaven.\"","\"This escaped Immortal... do they have their full cultivation?\" Yuan asked.","\"No, their cultivation will be suppressed because of the Heavenly Law. However, they won't be fully suppressed, so this Immortal is still strong enough to wreak havoc within the Fourth Heaven.\"","Yuan began pondering. Since this Immortal has their cultivation restricted, he might be able to finish the task that required him to defeat a Cultivator nine realms above his own.","\"If I happen to run into this Immortal, I can kill them, right?\" he asked.","\"Uhh...\" Senior Bai was left speechless by his question.","\"You actually want to fight the Immortal? That's reckless—","suicidal! I gave you that treasure to detect the Immortal's presence not because I want you to fight them but to run away and call for backup instead!\"","\"I know, but if the Immortal is weak enough, I might be able to catch them off guard and kill it in one go,\" Yuan responded calmly, despite talking about fighting an Immortal."]},{"number":1547,"title":"Chapter 1547 Tian Yingzhe","paragraphs":["1547 Tian Yingzhe","\"I understand your immense talent and prowess, and I've witnessed the full force of your attacks. But, my dear little friend, these Immortals are not like anything you've encountered. They are a force beyond your wildest imagination, and they won't simply stand there to be defeated. I implore you to reconsider your decision.\" Senior Bai's words carried a weight of urgency, hoping to sway Yuan's determination.","\"Don't worry, Senior Bai. I've grown a lot stronger since my visit to the Vanishing Valley. I am also not as reckless as you think. If I deem the opponent too dangerous, I'll run away.\"","\"And what if by the time you realize the danger, it's already too late? It would be far wiser to avoid them altogether,\" Senior Bai sighed, his disappointment evident as he contemplated Yuan's unwavering resolve to face this immortal.","If anyone else were in his shoes, they wouldn't even think of such a thing.","'I guess this is what differentiates the true prodigies from the talented. They are truly incomprehensible beings. There is also a saying that the more talented an individual is, the more they tend to attract danger. Unfortunately, this is also why they tend to perish earlier than others despite having more potential.'","Normally, Senior Bai would stop trying to persuade Yuan to fight the Immortal, but knowing firsthand how dangerous the Immortals from the Nine Heavens Eternal Grotto are, he continued trying.","\"The criminals within the Nine Heavens Eternal Grotto, the Immortals you're so eager to fight, are arguably even more dangerous than the ones sealed within the Primordial Realm. They are also much harder to kill than ordinary Immortals due to their unique physiques, such as the one within the Fourth Heaven, who has the Shrouded Physique, which makes their appearance impossible to perceive even with divine sense.\"","\"And because you cannot see their body, you won't be able to predict their attacks or attack them effectively.\"","\"I see...\" Yuan turned silent with a pondering face, but it wasn't because he was reconsidering fighting the immortal. He was wondering how he could effectively deal with them.","\"Anyway, thank you for warning me about the immortal. I'll keep my eyes out for them. Also, I would like you to pass on a message to Lady Xu for me.\"","Senior Bai narrowed his eyes at Yuan, wondering if he'd given up on fighting the immortal or the opposite.","\"What's the message?\"","\"Can you ask her if she knows the name Tian Yingzhe? That's all.\"","\"Tian Yingzhe? Okay, I'll let her know.\"","\"Then I'll see you next time.\"","\"I'm going to warn you again, just in case. Don't engage with the immortal! Just run away and notify me if you sense them nearby!\"","\"I understand.\" Yuan nodded with a mysterious smile on his face.","Senior Bai still felt concerned for some reason.","Once Yuan left, he sighed out loud, \"Alas... even there's nothing I can do if he truly wants to fight the immortal...\"","\"Hm? Wait a minute. I can just have someone watch over him!\"","With this idea in mind, Senior Bai left his world to contact someone from the Celestial Overlord.","Sometime later, Senior Bai arrived at a massive outdoor training ground that was as large as several major cities.","\"This junior greets Overlord Bai.\"A half-naked, tall, and robust man stopped his training and respectfully bowed to Senior Bai after noticing his presence.","\"Sorry for the sudden visit, Kelan.\"","\"You're always welcome, no matter the time and day.\"","\"Are you busy nowadays?\" Senior Bai asked.","\"It's the same as usual.\"","\"Then, do you mind doing me a favor? I'd like you to watch over a junior of ours in case he does anything reckless.\"","\"A junior of ours? So he's a member of the faction?\"","\"Yes, he joined very recently.\"","\"This junior must be very special for you to go out of your way to do this.\" Kelan smiled.","\"You have no idea. He was recruited by Celestial Overlord Xu herself.\"","\"What?! Celestial Overlord Xu recruited him?! Alright, I'll take a look at this junior. Where is he?\"","\"Fourth Heaven.\"","\"Huh? But we're currently in the Eighth Heaven.\"","\"I am aware.\"","Kelan raised his eyebrows in a puzzled manner.","\"Oh, was this junior sent to the lower heavens to find a certain somebody?\" Kelan suddenly came to this realization.","\"No, this junior was recruited in the lower heavens. He's only a Spirit King, so he's a real junior.\"","\"N-no way...\" Kelan wore a look of disbelief on his face.","When was the last time they had someone with such low cultivation amongst their ranks?","\"Don't look down on this junior, Kelan. Even though he'd only recently joined, he's already a General.\"","\"Already a General?! That's impossible!\" Kelan cried out loud.","Senior Bai smiled, \"If his rank had been lower, I would've asked someone else. You're the only Commander with so much free time, too.\"","\"Please don't make me sound like a slacker, Overlord Bai. Training is also working, and I am still healing from my injury.\"","Senior Bai glanced at the obvious scar that covered Kelan's arm and said, \"I'm just joking with you. Anyway, can you do this favor for me? You'll also be helping Celestial Overlord Xu since she cares about him, too.\"","\"Of course. You just need me to watch over him, right?\"","\"Yes, since he might pick a fight with one of the escaped immortals who was found in the Fourth Heaven.\"","\"A mere Spirit King daring to pick a fight with an escaped immortal from the Nine Heavens Eternal Grotto? This kid's got guts! We might get along pretty well.\" Kelen laughed out loud at this information.","\"His name is Yuan. Also, he's from outside the Nine Heavens, if you know what I mean.\"","\"I know. The Lost Ones, right? Do you mind if I talk to him, or am I just supposed to tail him like a spy?\"","\"You can interact with him if you want.\"","\"Alright.\"","\"Don't bully him too much, or you might catch a beating from Celestial Overlord Xu.\" Senior Bai chuckled.","\"When have I ever bullied a junior?\" Kelan laughed out loud.","\"Then I'll make arrangements for your descent after I speak with Celestial Overlord Xu. You should prepare for your departure, too.\"","\"Understood. I'll see you later, Overlord Bai.\"","After Senior Bai left, Kelan smiled, \"A Spirit King and a General, huh? I have high expectations, so don't disappoint me, junior.\"","After his meeting with Kelan, Senior Bai went to find Xu Jiaqi.","\"It feels like I've been seeing you much often lately. Is this related to him?\" Xu Jiaqi spoke the moment Senior Bai entered her office.","\"Yes, it's about Yuan. I wanted to let you know that I had sent Commander Kelan to watch over him.\"","\"Why?\" Xu Jiaqi raised an eyebrow at this unexpected news.","\"One of the escaped immortals was spotted in the Fourth Heaven, and when I warned him about it, he decided to fight them instead of running away. I advised him not to fight them, and even though he said he understood, I cannot help but doubt him.\"","\"Is that so? Fighting an escaped immortal, huh? If he somehow manages to defeat an immortal, our reputation would skyrocket.\"","\"You want him to fight the immortal?\" Senior Bai stared at her with wide eyes.","\"Of course not. I'm just saying. Anyway, you did the right thing. We cannot let someone as talented as him die in vain. Is that all?\"","\"There's one more thing. Yuan asked me to pass a message on to you.\"","After clearing his throat, Senior Bao repeated, \"Do you know the name Tian Yingzhe?\"","\"...What?\"","Xu Jiaqi's expression froze after hearing this name.","Seeing her reaction, Senior Bai swallowed nervously.","After a moment of silence, Xu Jiaqi suddenly stood up, slammed the desk before her, and loudly inquired, \"Where did he learn of this name?!\"","\"Uh... I don't know. I didn't ask since it seemed like an innocent question. Who is Tian Yingzhe? Should I be worried?\"","Xu Jiaqi didn't immediately respond and fell back onto her chair.","After another moment of silence, she sighed, \"He... was the founder of the Celestial Overlord.\"","\"What?! The founder?! But I thought...\"","Xu Jiaqi nodded and said, \"The founder had two names. One was his true name, and the other was used for the Celestial Overlord. Even among the other Celestial Overlords, only I knew his true name.\"","\"Oh... then was it okay for you to have revealed it to me...?\" Senior Bai asked.","\"It's fine. Since you would've learned it sooner or later after. However, how did Yuan learn of this name?\"","\"I'll ask him the next time I see him.\"","\"Please do.\" Xu Jiaqi nodded with a serious expression on her face.","\"Also, although it's just a name, keep it to yourself.\"","\"Of course. I won't tell a soul.\" Senior Bai nodded.","\"Then what about your response?\" he then asked.","\"Just tell him what I told you.\"","\"I understand.\"","Meanwhile, Yuan returned to Bai Lianhua's side after leaving Senior Bai's world.","\"You're really not being humble.\" Yuan smiled when she saw the piles of techniques Bai Lianhua had picked out.","\"Is this too much? I knew it, but...\"","\"No, it's fine.\" Yuan chuckled.","\"Are you sure I can have all of this for free?\"","\"I'm certain.\"","Once they were prepared, Bai Lianhua brought all of the techniques to the register, shocking the worker.","But before the worker could even open his mouth to speak, Yuan showed his General symbol, shocking the worker even more.","\"Thank you for your service!\" The worker bowed to Yuan.","Yuan nodded at him before turning to look at Bai Lianhua and speaking, \"It's done. You can put them away.\"","\"What? That's all?\" she stared at him with a gawking expression, as she had anticipated a much lengthier process.","\"That's all.\" He confirmed with a smile."]},{"number":1548,"title":"Chapter 1548 Messing With the Qin Family","paragraphs":["1548 Messing With the Qin Family","After acquiring the techniques, they left the Myriad of Techniques. However, even after successfully leaving the store with the techniques, Bai Lianhua couldn't believe that she'd managed to acquire so many powerful techniques for free.","Even if she had her family's full backing, it would still be difficult for them to purchase this many rare and valuable techniques without severely damaging their finances. Yet, she was able to acquire them for free because of Yuan.","\"How exactly did you manage to do that again?\" she looked at him with wide eyes.","\"Did you know that factions also exist in Cultivation Online? I am part of the faction that owns the Myriad of Technique, so it's a member's privilege...of sorts.\"Yuan gave a brief explanation.","\"Do you think I can also join your faction?\" Bai Lianhua knew the answer even before she asked, but she still had to take her chances.","\"Probably not, and I am not looking down on you when I say this, but their requirements are quite high, as they're one of the top factions in the upper heavens. In fact, you won't even meet them unless you ascend at least to the Sixth Heaven.\"","Bai Lianhua showed a bittersweet smile and shook her head, \"No, it's fine. I completely understand. I am not foolish enough to think that I have even a fraction of your talents.\"","\"There's no need to drag yourself down like this. You're plenty talented. With enough experience and time, you'll definitely qualify for my faction.\"","Bai Lianhua nodded and said, \"So, what are you going to do now? Return to the Fourth Heaven?\"","\"Not yet. I still have some business in Third Heaven. By the way, do you know of a Qin Family?\" Yuan said.","\"I know of several. Which one are you referring to?\"","\"The one close with the Walkers Family and the Gu Family.\"","\"Oh, yeah, I know of them. They've been quickly rising in reputation and power recently with the Walkers Family and Gu Family's help, after all. Why are you asking about them? Did something happen between you guys?\"","Yuan nodded, \"I'm not directly involved, but they've been bullying the family of someone who's very close to me, even going as far as to use poison.\"","\"Poison? What a nasty bunch... but I'm not surprised that someone closely affiliated with Fiery Queen has such a nature. What are you going to do with them?\"","\"I'm not sure yet. The family they've been targeting has been losing business because of the bullying, so I'm thinking about messing with their operations within Cultivation Online as a warning.\"","\"If you want, I can help you locate their businesses. It shouldn't be too hard with my family's resources.\"","\"Really? That'd be great.\"","\"Consider it my payment for the techniques—even though it's nowhere enough to pay for everything.\" Bai Lianhua showed a bashful smile.","She continued, \"Then I'll contact you once I have the information prepared. It shouldn't take too long. A few hours at most.\"","\"Alright. By the way, take this.\"","Yuan handed her a spatial ring filled with treasures that he had picked up but had no use for.","\"T-this is a lot... There are even Divine-grade treasures inside! Are you sure about this, Yuan? The techniques are already more than enough...\"","\"Just take it.\" He nodded.","\"Thank you... really...\"","Bai Lianhua logged off the next moment.","With nothing else to do, Yuan also decided to log off.","While he waited for Bai Lianhua to scout the Qin Family's business, Yuan went to visit the Chu Family.","\"I've decided to mess with the Qin Family's business within Cultivation Online.\"","\"Mess with...? If you don't mind me asking... how do you plan on doing that?\" Chu Shijian asked.","\"It depends on the kind of operation they have, but I'll most likely end up destroying all of their business.\" Yuan casually shrugged.","\"Is that so...\"","\"By the way, any news from the Qin Family?\" Yuan then asked.","\"Well, they've figured out that we know about Chu Wuyang being their spy when they haven't been able to contact him since we locked him up. Just yesterday, they threatened to completely destroy our business within Cultivation Online in a few days if we don't obey them.\"","\"A few days, huh? Not before I destroy them in a few hours.\" Yuan smiled.","\"To do so much for us... I really don't know how to thank you...\" Chu Shijian sighed.","\"You don't need to thank me because I am not doing this for you. I am doing this for Lulu.\" Yuan calmly corrected him.","\"We still end up receiving your help, so you have my gratitude.\"","Three hours after they logged off, Bai Lianhua contacted Yuan.","\"The Qin Family has three major businesses in the Third Heaven. The first and most profitable business is their monster hunting business. They have about 50 different teams that specialize in monster hunting throughout Third Heaven, and you can identify them through the purple badge by their waist. Their strongest and highest-grossing team is in Night Wing City, most of them being Spirit Lords. While they don't have a store, they typically meet up at the Purple Lizard Pavilion before going on their hunt.\" After giving Yuan their location, Bai Lianhua proceeded to give him some of their names and their physical descriptions.","She continued, \"Their second business, the dungeon hunting team, is currently staying at the Eight Point Hotel in Yun Yun City.\"","\"Their third business is a medicine store called Perfect Qin Medicine, which is also located within Night Wing City.\"","\"You've gathered so much information so quickly. I was told it wasn't easy learning about another's business without having insiders.\" Yuan smiled.","Bai Lianhua chuckled, \"Who in the Ten Great Families doesn't have a spy or two? With how quickly the Qin Family has been growing, I'm sure there are many keeping eyes on them.\"","\"Makes sense. Then I'll see you later.\"","\"Yes, see you later.\"","After returning to Cultivation Online, Yuan made his way to Night Wing City while Bai Lianhua sorted out all of the treasures Yuan gave her.","Sometime later, Yuan arrived at the Purple Lizard Pavilion and, using his divine sense, looked at every single individual inside the pavilion.","\"It must be them.\"","Yuan quickly found the players who matched the description Bai Lianhua gave him.","He didn't approach them and simply watched them from afar.","There were eleven players in their group, all of whom were between the sixth and ninth levels of Spirit Lord.","Although Yuan wanted to kill them immediately, he decided to mess with them a bit first.","Half an hour later, once they were prepared, the group of players left the city and entered the nearby wilderness, where magical beasts between the third and sixth levels of Spirit Lord roamed.","They quickly encountered their first magical beast. It was at the fifth level of Spirit Lord.","Yuan didn't interfere and watched them hunt the magical beast together. Their movements and great teamwork indicated that they'd been working together for a long time.","It took them almost ten whole minutes to defeat the magical beast, but only five out of eleven had fought.","After defeating the magical beast, they stripped any valuable materials from the corpse before resuming their hunt.","For their next encounter, the other six that didn't participate in the first encounter fought.","They rotated between two groups to save energy, as they planned on hunting until night.","However, during their third encounter, right as the group was able to defeat the seventh-level Spirit Lord magical beast, Yuan appeared out of thin air to steal their kill.","\"What the—?!\"","\"Fuck! Who the hell are you?!\"","Yuan was wearing a mask, so none of them could identify him. Moreover, Yuan had killed the magical beast so badly that even its materials could not be salvaged.","\"Identify yourself!\" The group demanded.","However, Yuan didn't say anything and merely escaped from the scene, vanishing like a ghost.","\"What the fuck was that about...?\"","\"I have no idea...\"","\"He was probably just some weirdo passing by. Let's forget about him and continue our hunt.\"","The group didn't bother chasing after Yuan and resumed their hunt.","However, their fourth and fifth encounters had all been sabotaged by Yuan, who refused to explain anything and vanished as soon as he was done.","\"God damn it! What the fuck is going on?!\"","\"Does that person have a grudge against us or something? He's not even letting us collect the materials... I have never seen or heard of anything like this before...\"","\"That's it! If he dares to show up again, we're all going to attack him without warning! Keep your eyes out!\" The leader of their group declared.","They encountered their sixth magical beast soon.","Once again, Yuan showed up at the end to claim the kill for himself.","The group of hunters was prepared this time and attacked him the moment he showed himself.","However, none of them had expected Yuan to block all of their attacks with ease, and before they could attack again, Yuan vanished into thin air.","\"God fucking damn it! What the hell is that bastard's problem?!?!\"","\"We've been out here for four hours and only managed to secure one kill!\"","\"He's probably hiding his face because he's afraid we might recognize him.\"","\"Let's see how long he can keep this farce up! He must've used a considerable amount of spiritual energy to defeat the last few magical beasts. I doubt he'll be able to continue this for long! He will eventually slip up, and that's when we'll get that bastard!\"","\"Yeah!\"","The group continued their hunt, fueled by anger and the desire to catch Yuan."]},{"number":1549,"title":"Chapter 1549 Messing With the Qin Family(2)","paragraphs":["1549 Messing With the Qin Family(2)","Several hours have passed since Yuan started messing with the Qin Family's strongest hunting group. They figured he would eventually run out of energy and mess up, but Yuan continued stealing their kills with seemingly no effort at all.","\"Fuck! I've had enough! Get out here and face us like a man, you fucking coward!\"","\"Come out!\"","\"Get out here and fight me, you bastard!\"","The group of players eventually had enough and started yelling out loud like a group of maniacs.","Seeing this, Yuan smiled inwardly, 'I guess it's about time I stop messing around and deal with them for real.'","With that in mind, he emerged from his hiding spot and appeared before them.","\"You've finally appeared, you kill-stealing bastard! I have never seen anyone as shameless as you!\"","\"Let me give you a good beating!\"","The group of players approached Yuan with enraged faces.","However, Yuan raised his hand and gestured for them to stop, \"Wait a minute. I have some questions for you before I decide your fates.\"","\"And who the fuck are you to decide our fate?! Get him!\" The leader of their group shouted.","But before any of them could move, Yuan released his suppressed cultivation base at the peak of Spirit King.","The pressure was so immense and unbearable for these Spirit Lords that they collapsed on the ground, unable to breathe.","\"A-a Spirit King!\"","\"Please! Have mercy!\"","Yuan retrieved his aura, allowing them to breathe again.","\"I think you might have mistaken us for someone else. I don't ever recall offending someone like you!\"","Hearing such words, Yuan spoke, \"So you guys aren't working for the Qin Family?\"","\"Huh? This is about the Qin Family?\"","He silently nodded.","\"We do work for the Qin Family, but what's that got to do with this?\"","\"I'll keep this short, but I'm going to shut down the Qin Family's business, so if you could do me a favor and just quit, I won't make things difficult for you.\"","\"What?! This is too sudden! We can't do that even if you threaten us!\" One of them quickly said.","\"Why are you targeting the Qin Family? They have a lot of influence nowadays, especially with the Ten Great Families' help.\"","\"I am just giving them a taste of their own medicine. They dared to mess with the Chu Family's business, so I am now messing with theirs.\"","\"The Chu Family...? Look here, we have no involvement in businesses outside hunting magical beasts. And we're bound by a contract. If broken, we'd need to pay a huge fine, so we cannot quit even if you threaten us.\"","\"How much are these fines? I'll pay for them.\" Yuan said.","\"You'll pay for our fine? That's ridiculous...\"","\"If not, I'll give you a real excuse to not work anymore—by killing you until you lose your ability to cultivate.\" He calmly threatened, leaving them speechless.","The players trembled in fear upon hearing Yuan's words, which were definitely effective.","They exchanged glances with each other and, without uttering a word, nodded at each other.","\"Alright, we'll quit if you can pay for our fines. It's a million dollars for each violation.\"","If Yuan were truly willing to pay for their fines, it would definitely be better than getting killed and losing their ability to cultivate, as they would be able to change employers.","\"A million each, right?\" Yuan retrieved a random Heaven-","grade treasure and showed it to them.","Although Heaven-grade treasures have gone down significantly in price—at least compared to when Yuan sold the Frozen Jade Zither—as they're becoming more accessible, they can still be fetched for over ten million dollars with ease.","\"You can keep the change. Also, if I find out that any of you were involved with messing with the Chu Family, I'll hunt you down not just in Cultivation Online but also on Earth, so this is your last chance to come clean.\" Yuan said as he handed the treasure to the one who seemed to be the leader of the group.","\"I swear we're not involved! I don't know about the other teams, but we're definitely clean!\"","Yuan nodded and said, \"Also, if you're still working for the Qin Family after this, you'll die before you even realize it.\"","\"We wouldn't dare!\"","\"Ah, before you leave, tell me about the other hunting teams.\" Yuan then said.","\"I have their schedule and hunting grounds all listed here.\" The leader of the group handed Yuan a jade slip that contained all sorts of useful information that allowed him to hunt the others down more efficiently.","\"Thank you.\"","Yuan left shortly after.","While Yuan went hunting down the other teams, the group of 11 players immediately went to sell the Heaven-grade treasure on COPlayerAuctions. The treasure was sold in under one hour for 15 million dollars.","Over the next several days, Yuan traveled all over the Third Heaven and bribed all of the Qin Family's monster-hunting teams to quit. Those who refused to accept his bribes were threatened with death, and the rude ones were beaten until they were on the verge of death, which only took a single punch from him.","When the Qin Family was suddenly told by their strongest and highest-earning monster-hunting team that they'd quit, the Qin Family was left baffled and confused.","They became even more bewildered when every member of the team paid the fine for breaking the contract.","When asked why, the team told the truth—that they were threatened by a powerful cultivator to quit working for the Qin Family or have their cultivations crippled.","Soon, more and more teams from their monster-hunting business stopped working with them.","\"Fuck! Which bastard is responsible for this?! And why are they doing this?!\"","Qin Mulan, the head of the Qin Family, slammed his table in anger, causing it to split in two.","\"For it to happen right after Chu Wuyang was caught... I don't think this is a coincidence.\" Qin Long, his eldest son, said with a pondering expression on his face."]},{"number":1550,"title":"Chapter 1550 Messing With the Qin Family(3)","paragraphs":["1550 Messing With the Qin Family(3)","\"So the Chu Family is involved in this, huh? But how did they acquire information on all of our monster-hunting teams?\" Qin Mulan pondered out loud.","\"I'd wager one of our own teams betrayed us, providing the Chu Family with the information they needed. But for them to resort to hiring a Spirit King, they must be quite desperate.\" Qin Long said.","\"Long'er, I'll leave this troublemaker in your hands..\" Qin Mulan said to his son.","\"I will crush this bastard for daring to mess with my Qin Family!\" Qin Long nodded with a cold expression on his face.","Meanwhile, after Yuan made all of the Qin Family's monster- hunting teams quit, he made his way to Yun Yun City, where their dungeon-hunting team was residing in the Eight Point Hotel.","Due to how rare dungeons typically were, most businesses put most of their resources into one team.","The Qin Family's dungeon team consisted of thirty players, all of whom were between Spirit Grandmaster and Spirit Lord.","When Yuan arrived, he used divine sense to scout the hotel and immediately found 20 players with the Qin Family's identification token. According to the intel provided by some of the monster-hunting teams, all of the members of the dungeon team stayed at the same hotel.","\"Are the others offline or scouting? Well, it doesn't matter.\" Yuan pondered what he should do with them.","Sometime later, he forced his way into one of the rooms through the window. Inside, four players were looking at a large map together.","\"Who the fuck are you?!\"","Yuan's intrusion immediately alerted them because he made no effort to be stealthy.","They swiftly pulled out their weapons and pointed them at Yuan.","\"Calm down; I'm not here to hurt you.\" Yuan calmly raised his hands as if to show that he was harmless.","\"Then why are you here?\" One of them asked with a suspicious frown.","\"I'm here to make you quit working for the Qin Family. I'll even pay for whatever fine you may incur for breaking the contract.\"","\"What...? And why are you doing this?\"","\"I have some beef with the Qin Family, that's all. So, what do you say?\"","\"I say... screw off!\" The four players in the room suddenly pounced at Yuan with their weapons flying.","However, Yuan didn't even bother dodging their attacks and used his body to block them.","\"What the fuck?!\"","The players were shocked when their weapons couldn't penetrate Yuan's skin, much less injure him. It felt like they were trying to cut metal with a butter knife.","\"It's pointless. You won't be able to kill me even if I went to sleep right now. Anyway, I'll give you one more chance to keep your life. Quit working for the Qin Family or die to me with a chance of becoming a cripple.\"","Yuan stood before them like a domineering warlord, his aura so intense it made the players gasping for breath.","\"W-we will quit...\"","They eventually said.","\"Alright. One more thing. Are you guys, by any chance, responsible for bullying the Chu Family?\" Yuan suddenly asked.","\"Huh? The Chu Family...?\"","\"N-no... we had nothing to do with that...\"","\"Right? I have no idea what you're talking about.\"","These players suddenly became nervous, and it was written all over their faces.","\"Is that so?\"","Yuan suddenly pulled out the Grail of Truth, which was already emitting a bright light.","\"Sorry, but it looks like my offer will no longer apply to you anymore.\"","\"W-wha—\"","Before any of them could even utter a single word, Yuan waved his sleeve with Sword Aura pouring out.","Three of the players immediately turned into a cloud of blood mist, while one of them only lost an arm.","Of course, he survived only because Yuan allowed him to live.","\"Tell me, who else was involved with the Chu Family? Just the four of you, or the entire team?\" Yuan asked him, who was kissing the floor with his buttocks, his face filled with fear as snot and tears flowed down his face.","\"A-all of us! We were all paid a bonus by the Qin Family to mess with the Chu Family's business!\" The player immediately revealed everything.","The Grail of Truth had no reaction, meaning he was telling the truth.","\"Is that so? Make sure to tell your buddies to quit, or I'll come after you until you can no longer cultivate.\" Yuan killed the last player after finishing his sentence.","He made his way to the next room shortly after.","\"Who the hell are you?!\"","There were five players in this room.","Yuan went straight to business and said, \"I'm here to avenge the Chu Family. If you don't quit working for the Qin Family after I kill you, I'll continue to kill you until you lose your ability to cultivate. If you're unlucky to be crippled after one death, that's too bad.\"","Before any of the players in the room could even respond, Yuan killed all of them with Sword Aura.","He continued doing this until every member of the Qin Family's dungeon team was wiped out. However, there were several that weren't at the hotel, so he waited a few hours for them to show up before moving to his next target.","After waiting for six hours, the rest of the team showed up at the hotel, and all of them were killed after being told to quit working for the Qin Family.","The Qin Family was immediately alerted when Yuan killed the first four players.","\"What?! He killed all of them because they were involved with the Chu Family?! This confirms it! That bastard is avenging the Chu Family and targeting our businesses in Cultivation Online!\" Qin Mulan slammed his desk that was just replaced, destroying it again.","\"Long'er, how are you going to deal with this bastard?\" he turned to look at Qin Long, who had a pondering face.","\"Since he's targetting our businesses, he'll most definitely show up at our medicine store. I'll wait for him there,\" he said.","\"How are you going to stop him? He's a Spirit King!\" Qin Mulan said with a frown.","\"So what if he's a Spirit King? I have with me a magic talisman that can instantly kill even a Spirit Emperor! A Spirit King is nothing before me!\"Qin Long laughed out loud.","\"Good!\" Qin Mulan nodded."]},{"number":1551,"title":"Chapter 1551 Qin Long","paragraphs":["1551 Qin Long","After he met with his father, Qin Long immediately went to his family's medicine store to wait for Yuan.","\"Welcome, Young Master Qin. Are you looking for some medicine today?\" The workers there greeted Qin Long.","\"This place will be attacked soon. Close down the shop and get everyone out of here,\" he said to them.","\"What? Who would dare to attack us?\" The workers there were shocked to hear this news.","They had the Ten Great Families' backing. No sane player would dare to offend them, much less attack them.","\"I don't know, but they undoubtedly work for the Chu Family. Anyway, get out of here. Things will definitely get messy here.\"","The workers quickly closed down the store and left, leaving Qin Long alone in the store.","Sometime later, Yuan arrived at Night Wing City once again. He used divine sense to inspect the place.","'Only one guy, huh? Looks like he's expecting me.'","The lone individual at the store had a confident and arrogant air around him as he sat at the entrance like a commander in battle.","After pondering for a moment, Yuan casually approached the store without hiding his presence.","Qin Long immediately noticed him due to his mask and said, \"So, you're the bastard that's been trying to ruin my family's business, huh? How much did the Chu Family pay you? I'll triple it if you stab them in the back.\"","\"Who said anything about getting paid? I'm doing this without any payment.\"","Qin Long frowned at this unexpected information and said, \"Do you even know who you're messing with? We have two of the Ten Great Families backing us. Once we figure out your identity, you can kiss your life goodbye.\"","\"Oh? Is that so? Then I'll make it easy for you.\" Yuan spoke as he reached for his mask and removed it, revealing his handsome face to Qin Long.","\"Y-you! Player Yuan!\" Qin Long immediately recognized him.","'It's been Player Yuan this entire time?! I should've realized this sooner!' Qin Long nearly facepalmed.","Qin Long was aware that Chu Liuxiang had left the family to live with Yuan, so it should've been obvious that he would be the one messing with them when they said he was a Spirit King.","\"Did Chu Liuxiang ask you to do this?\" Qin Long asked.","\"No, I am doing this because I owe the Chu Family. You must be from the Qin Family. What do you think you can achieve by yourself?\"","\"You'll find out soon enough, bastard.\" Qin Long sneered in disdain.","He'd always wanted to deal with Yuan for stealing Chu Liuxiang from him, but he couldn't find a way to do so since Yuan lived inside the Dragon Spiral Mountain and barely interacted with other players in Cultivation Online, making it difficult to track him.","Yuan smiled and said, \"You seem awfully confident. Is that thing in your pocket really that powerful?\"","\"!!!\"","Qin Long's expression immediately darkened after realizing Yuan was aware of his magic talisman.","\"Judging by its spiritual energy, is it a magic talisman? The same one you gave to Chu Wuyang?\" Yuan continued.","Qin Long immediately retrieved the magic talisman from his robe and pointed it at Yuan.","\"So what if you know about it? It's too late to run. I only need half a second to activate it, and then you'll go boom.\"","\"Before I kill you, let me ask you something.\"","Yuan calmly nodded with a carefree smile, seemingly unfazed by his threat.","\"How far have you gotten with Chu Liuxiang?\" he asked.","\"You don't need to concern yourself with our relationship, but if you really need to know, we're very intimate with each other.\"","Qin Long's entire face twisted in anger, his face flushed red. If one's glare could kill, his was definitely intensive enough to commit mass murder.","\"Why are you looking at me like I stole your lover? She was mine to begin with. You were the one using underhanded tactics trying to steal her from me.\" Yuan casually shrugged.","\"Silence, you bastard! I've had my sights on her for years!\"","\"So what? You were never fated to be with her. Simple as that.\"","\"And you are fated to die here! Die for me, you bastard!\"","Yuan could tell that Qin Long had begun pouring his spiritual energy into the magic talisman and activated Sword Aura.","Before Qin Long could fully activate the magic talisman, his entire arm was severed by Yuan's Sword Aura.","\"Ahh!\"","Qin Long fell back while screaming.","\"Think about our surroundings. Using such a powerful item in the middle of a city would be disastrous.\" Yuan shook his head.","If they were not in a bustling city surrounded by people, Yuan would've let Qin Long use the magic talisman on him. Unfortunately, the magic talisman was simply too strong and had the capability to level the entire city.","Yuan collected the magic talisman and tossed it into his spatial ring.","He turned to look at Qin Long and said, \"Any more tricks up your sleeve? If not, I'll kill you now.\"","\"You'll pay for this, Player Yuan!\"","\"I'll be waiting.\" Yuan casually flicked his arm, decapitating Qin Long with Sword Aura.","After killing Qin Long, Yuan destroyed the entire building before him so the Qin Family could no longer use it for business.","His action shocked everyone around him, but nobody dared to call for help.","By the time the city guards arrived, Yuan had long left the city.","'Now that I've dealt with the Qin Family's business, let's wait a little to see how they'll react.'","Yuan logged off for the day and notified the Chu Family of the situation.","\"I'm sorry, father. I couldn't even activate my magic talisman because he used some invisible skill.\" Qin Long also notified his father of his failures.","\"What happened to our store...?\"","\"By the time I returned, it had turned to rubble...\" he sighed.","Bang!","Qin Mulan slammed his desk, destroying it.","A moment of silence filled the room before Qin Mulan spoke in a grim voice, \"I'll contact the Walkers Family and the Gu Family to see if there's anything they can do about our situation.\"","Qin Mulan contacted them shortly later.","\"Player Yuan? Sorry, but there's nothing we can do against him in Cultivation Online.\" The Walkers Family refused to deal with Yuan while he was inside Cultivation Online. They knew that he was essentially impossible to defeat, and fighting him would only result in their loss.","The Gu Family, however, did not immediately refuse to help the Qin Family.","\"If you can provide us with a solid plan to deal with Player Yuan, we will assist you.\"","Thus, the Qin Family proceeded to spend the next several hours planning.","\"Player Yuan is helping the Chu Family, right? Why don't we just attack all of their businesses at once? There's no way he could stop all of us at once.\"","\"The Chu Family have already changed their operations, and without Chu Wuyang, we won't be able to locate them fast enough.\"","\"How will attacking the Chu Family help us defeat Player Yuan? That'd only enrage him even more!\"","\"Player Yuan is a Spirit King. There are probably fewer than 10 Spirit Kings, even amongst the top players. It's impossible to defeat him.\"","\"How about we borrow the power of NPCs? There are plenty of Spirit King cultivators in the Third Heaven.\"","\"Actually, I know of a faction in the Third Heaven that specializes in assassinations.\" Qin Long suddenly said.","\"That's great and all, but what if he's already returned to the Fourth Heaven by then? Won't we be wasting our money?\"","Despite spending hours on it, the Qin Family could not find a solid plan to deal with Yuan. In the end, they could only wait for Yuan to leave the Third Heaven before they resumed their businesses.","Sometime later, Qin Long returned to Cultivation Online. Since he died inside Night Wing City, he respawned in the same city.","\"Fucking Player Yuan. I will definitely have my revenge the next time I see him!\" Qin Long looked at the sky and cursed out loud.","\"Oh? How are you going to do that?\" A familiar voice suddenly resounded behind Qin Long, greatly startling him.","He swiftly turned around to see a familiar face standing behind him.","\"P-Player Yuan?! Why are you here!?\" he cried out loud.","\"I heard someone calling my name, so I came here to see who it was,\" Yuan said sarcastically.","He continued, \"Anyway, I see that you still have your cultivation. How many times do you think I'll have to kill you before you lose the ability to cultivate?\"","\"Y-you... you can't be serious!\" Qin Long had a terrified expression on his face after realizing what Yuan wanted to do to him.","'He's planning on spawn camping me?!'","Due to how respawning works in Cultivation Online, it was possible to trap someone within a city and kill them repeatedly. However, this was only done by the foulest players and was heavily frowned upon by the player base.","\"Do you not value your reputation?! Once word gets out that you're a spawn camper, your reputation will sink to the bottom!\"","\"Would they even believe such rumors?\" Yuan smiled.","The next moment, Qin Long found himself staring at the death notification.","'Fuck! I must get out of the city before he finds me again!' Qin Long immediately ran for the teleportation device upon respawning in a random area within the city.","However, before he could even travel a block, Yuan appeared before him like a ghost.","\"What?! How did you find me already?!\" Qin Long cried out loud, his eyes filled with shock.","Yuan merely responded with a silent smile before killing him for the third time."]},{"number":1552,"title":"Chapter 1552 Vengeful Slaughtering Formation","paragraphs":["1552 Vengeful Slaughtering Formation","After Yuan killed him for the third time, Qin Long had to wait 24 hours before respawning.","When an avatar is killed, it requires time to be reconstructed. While in this state, the player's consciousness will be transported to a black room with a countdown.","\"Fuck! How did he find me so fast?! We don't respawn in the same location, and it's randomized, so there's no way he could've predicted my respawn point! He must have some sort of technique that allows him to find me quickly.\" Qin Long quickly came to this conclusion, but he could do nothing about it.","Sure enough, Yuan found him using divine sense, which is already powerful enough to cover the entire city and more.","While Qin Long waited for his death cooldown to disappear, he started spreading rumors of Yuan being a spawn camper online, spamming this information as far and wide as possible.","Since spawn campers are widely despised and frowned upon by most players, it didn't take long for people to respond. However, Qin Long quickly became irritated when nobody believed him.","\"Hahaha... Player Yuan spawn camped you in the Third Heaven? He left for the Fourth Heaven already!\"","\"I'm sure Player Yuan has much better things to do than spawn camp a nobody!\"","\"Let's say he did spawn camp you, for argument's sake. I bet you deserved it. One thing I've learned about Player Yuan is that he isn't the type to provoke others without reason.\"","Qin Long was left fuming after seeing countless people mock him in the comments of his discussions. It also reminded him of Yuan's words before getting killed.","Twenty-four hours have passed, and Qin Long's death cooldown disappeared, but he didn't immediately log back onto Cultivation Online and waited an extra day before doing so.","However, when he logged back in and respawned, Qin Long was terrified by a particular change that occurred within his body.","\"M-my cultivation is gone!\" he cried out loud.","When a player dies, one of three things can happen. One, nothing changes. Two, they lose all their cultivation and must start from scratch. Lastly, and arguably the worst outcome, they lose the ability to cultivate entirely, becoming a cripple.","Players around the world collaborated to determine the probabilities of these three outcomes. With contributions from hundreds of millions of players, the chances of each outcome were finally revealed.","Upon experiencing death, there was a 96 percent chance that nothing would happen to the player. There was a three percent chance they would lose all of their cultivation, and there was a one percent chance they would lose the ability to cultivate entirely.","Although the probability of becoming a cripple was low, it was not zero, and millions of players around the world have already lost their ability to cultivate.","Of course, losing all of one's cultivation was still better than becoming a cripple. That said, Qin Long had spent a fortune getting to Spirit Lord, unlike most ordinary players, so it was a devastating blow to him regardless.","\"M-my cultivation! Ahhhhhh!!!\" Qin Long fell to the ground and bawled his eyes out on the street with many spectators around him. However, he was too devastated to care about the people around him, even if they saw him as a madman.","For many minutes, Qin Long did not stop crying. Due to his commotion, the city guards were eventually called. When they showed up, they treated Qin Long like a madman and dragged him away, returning peace to the city.","However, as they dragged Qin Long away, a masked figure appeared before them, blocking their path.","Before the guards could even speak, the masked man said, \"Qin Long, right? I see that you've lost your cultivation base after the last death. Unfortunately, but at least you can still cultivate.\"","Qin Long snapped out of his daze after hearing Yuan's voice.","However, before he could speak, Yuan continued, \"At least for now. If you do not give the Chu Family your word that you will never bother them again, I will keep killing you until you do. You will never be able to play Cultivation Online again because you will immediately die after respawning.\"","Once he finished his sentence, Yuan used his Sword Aura to kill Qin Long again, shocking the guards. Yet, before they could even react, Yuan vanished into thin air like a ghost.","While Qin Long waited for his cooldown to disappear again, Yuan spoke to Yu Ning.","\"Do you know any formation that can keep attacking someone even if I am away? I don't plan to stay here much longer, but I can't leave without ensuring the Chu Family's safety.\"","\"Yes, I do. I can create a formation around this city that will immediately attack a specific individual whenever they enter its range, and it can operate even if you're not present, but it'll only be able to target people you've interacted with before.\" Yu Ning responded.","\"That's perfect. Since he'll keep respawning within this city, this will keep him inside the city for as long as I want... Alright, let's do this.\" Yuan said.","Yu Ning took control of Yuan's body the next moment to create the formation.","Sometime later, Yuan regained control and activated the formation.","<Vengeful Slaughtering Formation has been activated>","He wanted to witness the formation in action at least once before he left, so Yuan remained in the city until Qin Long's return.","'I'll give you three days, Qin Long. Hopefully, you won't immediately budge and die a few more times before coming to your senses.' Yuan smiled inwardly.","Meanwhile, Qin Long was losing his mind inside his room.","\"That fucking bastard, Player Yuan! I swear to god that I will fucking kill him even if it's the last thing I do!\"","Despite Yuan's warning, Qin Long had no intention of listening to his demands.","\"I refuse to believe that you'll remain in the Third Heaven forever just to kill me!\"","Qin Long decided to wait an entire week before returning to Cultivation Online. In the meantime, he spoke to his father about his situation.","Of course, Qin Mulan was unhappy to learn that his son had lost all his cultivation, wasting the fortune they'd spent on resources to boost his cultivation. But there was no use crying over spilled milk.","Three days later, seeing that Qin Long hadn't returned yet, Yuan left the city and made his way back to the Stairway to Heaven to return to the Fourth Heaven.","\"Welcome back, Master. Are you returning to the Fourth Heaven?\" Tian'er asked him.","\"Yes.\"","\"Okay.\"","Tian'er created a staircase straight to the Fourth Heaven for him.","\"Thank you.\"","Yuan ascended, returning to the Fourth Heaven shortly after.","Upon returning to the Fourth Heaven, Yuan contacted Dong Ye.","\"Dong Ye, I need you to find someone for me. They are an escaped immortal from the Nine Heavens Eternal Grotto. This immortal has the Shrouded Physique. Apparently, he was spotted in the Fourth Heaven.\"","\"Of course, I shall find him even if it's the last thing I do.\" Dong Ye immediately agreed without asking for his reason for wanting to find this immortal.","\"Thank you.\"","\"Now, I have some time to spare while waiting for Dong Ye. What should I do in the meantime?\" Yuan pondered out loud.","After thinking for some time, he remembered Xi Shengmo telling him about the Pavilion of Knowledge, which may have information on the Immortal Monarch.","'Let's give them a visit with Xi Meili.'","With his next destination in mind, Yuan went to find Xi Meili at the Cultivators' Haven.","When he arrived, he went directly to their training rooms. However, they were all closed.","He didn't want to disturb them, so he used his divine sense to peek inside Xi Meili's room to see if she was busy.","Xi Meili was partially transformed inside her training room. Her body emitted a profound and oppressive aura as she sat in a cultivating position. The walls around her were also heavily damaged, even though they could resist attacks from Spirit Sovereigns without any problem.","Seeing this, Yuan didn't dare to disturb her and waited for her to finish.","Several days later, Yuan suddenly received a notification.","<Vengeful Slaughtering Formation has been initialized>","'So he's finally decided to return to Cultivation Online, huh?'","A few seconds after this notification, another notification appeared before him.","<You have killed 'Qin Long'>","Meanwhile, when Qin Long finally logged into Cultivation Online for the first time in a week, his presence triggered the formation.","The formation located Qin Long's precise location and activated in less than three seconds, and before Qin Long could even fully see his surroundings, his body was bombarded by powerful attacks that would instantly obliterate even a Spirit King, so even if he still had his original cultivation, it wouldn't have saved him.","<You have died>","Qin Long had only managed to take a single breath in Cultivation Online before being killed, and he wasn't even able to release the breath he took in.","Even after his death, it took a long minute before Qin Long comprehended that he'd just been killed for the fourth time.","\"What the fuck?! He actually waited an entire week for me?!\" Qin Long was more shocked by Yuan's stubbornness than his sudden death.","\"Does he really intend to spawn camp me until our family stops messing with the Chu Family?! I don't even have the authority to make such a call!\" he cried out loud.","Only the family head, his father, had the authority to fulfill Yuan's demand, but he did not want to embarrass himself further, putting him in a perplexed situation."]},{"number":1553,"title":"Chapter 1553 Purple Sea","paragraphs":["1553 Purple Sea","After his death, Qin Long immediately logged off Cultivation Online and tried to cultivate. He sighed in relief after realizing that he could still cultivate properly.","Even though the chances of becoming a cripple were only one percent, it was enough to stress any player out, much less someone like Qin Long.","\"Damn it! What should I do?! I cannot keep letting him get away with this! At this rate, he'll really cripple me!\"","After pondering for a long moment, Qin Long suddenly thought of a good idea.","\"Since nobody believes me that Player Yuan is spawn killing me, I shall let the entire world witness it! If there were thousands of players watching, I doubt Player Yuan would dare to kill me in front of so many people! This will allow me to get away safely!\"","He went online and started another campaign. This time, he advertised his own demise, telling people to visit Night Wing City if they wished to see Player Yuan spawn camping him.","Sure enough, his antics were effective, and many players visited Night Wing City over the next several days. However, many of these players just wanted to see Player Yuan and couldn't care less about Qin Long being killed.","News agencies also sent people to witness Player Yuan spawn killing, as it would give them something to talk about for a while.","Soon, tens of thousands of players could be seen wandering Night Wing City.","Four days after his last death, Qin Long logged back into Cultivation Online. Night Wing City was bustling with activity, with players thronging every corner, most of them hoping to meet Player Yuan.","After respawning, Qin Long shouted out loud, \"Witness me!\"","The players around him instantly turned their heads to look at Qin Long, and just as they finished turning their heads, several powerful attacks descended from the sky to attack Qin Long, instantly killing him.","Qin Long was shocked by his swift death. He could've never anticipated Yuan would be so ruthless as to kill him without hesitation despite the presence of so many players.","As for the players, they immediately looked at the sky, expecting to see Yuan hovering above them. However, they were left puzzled when nobody was in the air where the attacks were shot from.","\"Where's Player Yuan? I don't see him.\"","\"Did he leave already?\"","\"That quickly? No way. I don't think he was even here.\"","\"Hahaha! What kind of scam is this? I knew this Qin Long was trying to slander Player Yuan all along, but I was still expecting something! How foolish of me!\"","\"Who was the one that just got killed? I couldn't even see his appearance clearly before he died.\"","\"Probably some poor soul paid to die so that they could sell this nonsense to us.\"","Qin Long quickly became a laughing stock once news of what had transpired within Night Wing City spread on the internet.","[Qin Long, eldest son of the Qin Family, slanders Player Yuan]","[Player Yuan is innocent]","Many articles about Qin Long quickly surfaced, spreading through the community like wildfire.","Qin Mulan quickly learned of Qin Long's embarrassing situation and summoned him.","\"Long'er! What the fuck are you doing?! I asked you to take care of Player Yuan, but you dragged our family name through the mud instead! You're a laughing stock right now!\" Qin Mulan slammed his desk, destroying it.","Now that his reputation had hit rock bottom, Qin Long no longer cared about losing some more and revealed the entire situation to his father.","\"Player Yuan threatened to continue killing me until I lose my ability to cultivate or we stop messing with the Chu Family. At this rate, I will never be able to play Cultivation Online properly again. Please do something about this, Father! Let's just forget about the Chu Family! They're not worth our attention anymore!\" Qin Long appeared to be on the verge of tears as he revealed this information.","Qin Mulan wore a deep frown on his face after hearing this and said, \"Our Qin Family and the Chu Family have been at war with each other for many generations! How will we face our ancestors if we give up?! We'd essentially be acknowledging our defeat! We will not stop until the Chu Family is completely bankrupted!\"","\"As for your situation,just take a break from Cultivation Online to focus on your real cultivation. I doubt Player Yuan will spawn camp you forever. He will eventually have to give up and return to doing whatever he's doing. Also, he has an upcoming Faction War with the Fiery Garden of Hell. He won't be able to play Cultivation Online during that time, so you can use that time to leave the Night Wing City.\"","Qin Long looked at his father with wide eyes.","\"Y-you're a genius, Father! I completely forgot about his upcoming Faction War! Alright, I'll do that and take a break from Cultivation Online.\"","Qin Mulan nodded and said, \"I will try to do something about those mocking you online. While I won't be able to censor everything, it'll definitely reduce the amount of people talking about you.\"","\"Thank you, Father. I apologize for this failure. I will definitely make it up to you one day.\"","With that, Qin Long stopped logging onto Cultivation Online and focused on his cultivation on Earth.","Qin Mulan quickly started paying people to censor anything negative about Qin Long, slowing down the attention he was receiving.","Meanwhile, Yuan knocked on the door to Xi Meili's training room once he noticed she'd finished her cultivation and appeared to be taking a break.","Xi Meili walked to the door, and she muttered to herself, \"I'm pretty sure I still have plenty of time left in his place.\"","\"Huh? Yuan? You're back?\" she was pleasantly surprised to see him standing in front of her training room.","\"Yes, and I plan on visiting the Pavilion of Knowledge, operated by the Xuan Family. Since your father had a connection with them, I was wondering if you want to come with me.\"","\"Of course! And I hope you didn't wait too long for me.\"","\"It wasn't too bad.\"","They left the Cultivators' Haven together shortly after.","\"Do you know where the Pavilion of Knowledge is?\" Xi Meili asked him.","\"No, I don't, but someone might.\"","He asked Dong Ye about the Pavilion of Knowledge.","\"The Pavilion of Knowledge is located on a secluded island in the middle of the Purple Sea, north of Keen City.\"","\"Purple Sea, huh? Alright.\"","Yuan used the teleportation formation to travel to Keen City and, from there, traveled north for several days until he encountered a purple-colored sea.","\"I wasn't expecting a literal purple-colored sea...\" Xi Meili muttered with a surprised look on her face. This was her first time seeing something so unusual before.","With their divine sense, they could see thousands of fishermen at the docks.","\"Hey, what are they doing?\" Xi Meili, who had never seen fishermen before, asked.","\"They're fishermen, and they are fishing—trying to catch the fish in the water,\" Yuan explained.","\"Fishing...? What an odd thing to do.\"","\"Want to take a closer look?\" Yuan then asked.","\"Yes!\" she immediately nodded, her face filled with anticipation.","They entered the docks and watched the fishermen.","Sometime later, Xi Meili approached one of the fishermen and asked, \"What are you trying to catch?\"","\"Hm? Are you new to the Purple Sea?\" The fisherman asked.","\"Yes. This is my first time visiting this place,\" she nodded.","\"Well, there's only one thing we can catch from the Purple Sea","—Violet Tuna. However, they're exceedingly rare. Even though there are thousands of us fishing every day around the clock, only around ten of us will catch a single Violet Tuna for the entire day.\"","\"Why are they so rare? And why are they so desirable?\"","\"Well, for one, they're incredibly delicious. But that's not the main reason they're so coveted. Violet Tuna are infused with potent spiritual energy, and consuming one can significantly boost a cultivator's strength. They're not just a delicacy; they're a treasure for anyone seeking to enhance their cultivation,\" said the fisherman.","\"What's the history behind the purple-colored sea?\" Yuan suddenly asked.","\"Legend has it that a mighty dragon was slain near these waters, and its purple blood seeped into the sea, forever staining it with its vibrant hue,\" said the fisherman.","\"A dragon with purple blood? That would be the Ancient Galaxy Dragon. They're incredibly rare and powerful, even among the dragon race. I heard less than ten of them have existed since ancient times.\" Xi Meili muttered after hearing this information.","\"Do you know anything about the Pavilion of Knowledge?\" Yuan then asked.","\"Ah, those weirdos that live in the middle of the Purple Sea? I know they live in the middle of the Purple Sea and rarely leave their place. There's also a rumor that says they will reward you if you can provide them with useful information they don't already know.\"","\"I see. Thank you for the information.\"","Yuan suddenly pointed two fingers at the Purple Sea. Then, with a gesture, he fished out a sizeable purple-colored fish from the water with his spiritual energy.","This shocked every fisherman there and left them speechless.","Once the fish hovered before Yuan, he said, \"For taking the time to speak with us.\"","The fisherman accepted the Violet Tuna with a dazed look on his face, unsure how to react.","But before he could say anything, Yuan and Xi Meili flew away, disappearing into the horizon."]},{"number":1554,"title":"Chapter 1554 Pavilion of Knowledge","paragraphs":["1554 Pavilion of Knowledge","\"How did that young man do that? Divine sense shouldn't work in the Purple Sea...\" The fishermen were shocked by what Yuan had done.","The Purple Sea had a special property that blocked all divine sense from peeking underneath the water's surface, hence why nobody there could repeat what Yuan did despite being cultivators themselves.","Meanwhile, Yuan and Xi Meili continued flying north for several days until they could see a tall silhouette on the horizon.","\"We're almost there.\" Xi Meili's voice was brimming with excitement, as this would mark her first encounter with another dragon clan outside the Ancient Dragon City.","After a few more hours of flying, they finally arrived at the Pavilion of Knowledge, situated in the center of a large island.","The Pavilion of Knowledge was an imposing, tower-like structure with a spiraling design that ascended towards the heavens, its peak lost amidst the clouds. The island looked like any tropical island, but magical beasts wandered freely. Most of them were around Spirit Emperor level, with a few at Spirit Sovereign level.","However, before they could even reach the island, Yuan and Xi Meili stopped when they noticed a figure approaching them from the island.","This individual was a middle-aged man with blue hair and azure-colored eyes who boasted the cultivation of Spirit Enlightenment.","\"Welcome to the Pavilion of Knowledge. I am Xuan Wei, one of the Seven Scroll Elders here. How can we assist you today?\"","When Xuan Wei spoke, his gaze was mainly on Xi Meili, almost as if he was aware of her dragon bloodline.","\"I'm here to learn more about the Immortal Monarch,\" Yuan said.","Xuan Wei turned to look at him with a frown and replied, \"You want information on the Immortal Monarch? Not only are you not worthy, but you won't even be able to afford it.\"","Xi Meili frowned and said, \"Who are you to decide whether he's worthy or not?\"","\"Any information on the Immortal Monarch is sacred and priceless, and our Pavilion of Knowledge does not accept money or treasures for payment. The only payment we accept is information of equal value, and there's no way in hell a nobody from the Fourth Heaven would have information as valuable as information on the Immortal Monarch.\" Xuan Wei sneered.","\"You're making a lot of assumptions...for a nobody.\" Xi Meili sneered back.","Xuan Wei frowned and said, \"I showed you respect by personally coming out to greet you because I could tell you're of dragon bloodline, and this is how you treat me? You can leave now. The Pavilion of Knowledge will not serve you.\"","\"If you want to show respect, you should've sent the head of this place to greet me. What is a mere servant's greeting worth?\" Xi Meili shook her head, seemingly genuinely disappointed.","Xuan Wei's face darkened after being mocked as a servant by Xi Meili.","\"If you think I won't harm you because we have dragon blood flowing through our veins, you're sorely mistaken, Junior!\" Xuan Wei roared.","\"Oh, yeah? I'd love to see you try!\" Xi Meili retrieved Furious Dragon and went into a combative position.","Seeing this, Xuan Wei merely released his cultivation base.","\"How brazen of you, Junior! This Senior shall teach you a lesson your parents never taught you today!\"","Yuan shook his head at their situation before looking at the Pavilion of Knowledge and speaking, \"To the Senior watching this, are you sure you want to let them continue? Her surname is Xi, and her father's name is Xi Shengmo.\"","\"?!?!\"","After hearing this information, the individual who had been watching them from the peak of the Pavilion of Knowledge experienced a great shock, causing him to fall back on his chair.","\"Stop it, Xuan Wei!\"","A loud voice boomed the next moment, instantly halting Xuan Wei's movements. He turned to look at the Pavilion of Knowledge with a puzzled expression on his face, and a silhouette approached them from the tower before he could even utter a word.","This silhouette belonged to an elderly man with long white hair, a short blue beard, and azure-colored eyes shimmering with profound knowledge. He donned a black outfit adorned with a blue scroll-shaped symbol.","\"Grandfather, what are you doing out here? And why did you stop me from punishing these rude Juniors?\"","However, the old man completely ignored him and respectfully bowed to Xi Meili.","\"I apologize for my grandson's lack of manners, Young Lady. May I have your name?\"","\"Xi Meili. Who are you, old man?\"","\"Y-you! How dare you address the master of the Pavilion of Knowledge as 'old man'?!\"","\"Just shut up for a moment!\" The old man snapped at him before returning to smile at Xi Meili.","\"As he said, I am the master of the Pavilion of Knowledge and the previous Patriarch of the Xuan Family who operates the Pavilion of Knowledge within the Fourth Heaven. My name is Xuan Kun.\"","\"Is it true that your father's name is Xi Shengmo?\" he then asked.","\"That's right. You know my father?\"","Xuan Kun nodded and said, \"I didn't just know him. I—our Xuan Family used to serve the Xi Family and his father—long before they entered the Ancient Dragon City.\"","\"What?! But they haven't left the Ancient Dragon City for millions of years! Why would they come out now?!\" Xuan Wei cried out loud after hearing this.","\"Since you're out here, does that mean your father is also...?\" Xuan Kun asked, his eyes flickered with a hint of anticipation.","\"Nope. I left the Ancient Dragon City by myself to travel with Yuan.\" Xi Meili shook her head.","\"Oh... is that so...\" Xuan Kun immediately became dejected. \"I was hoping to speak with him again after so long.\"","\"Anyway, let's go somewhere more comfortable and continue our conversation there, shall we?\"","Xi Meili nodded.","Yuan and Xi Meili proceeded to follow Xuan Kun to the Pavilion of Knowledge.","\"Grandfather, are you sure we can trust them? What if they're impersonating the Xi Family?\" Xuan Wei asked him through divine sense.","\"Shut up, you idiot. You've never seen someone from the Xi Family, so you wouldn't know, but I can tell that the Young Lady is definitely from the Xi Family. I am confident enough to put my life on the line. I also expect you to give her a proper apology.\"","\"Why are you treating her like you still serve the Xi Family? We haven't worked for them since they went into hiding within the Ancient Dragon City!\" Xuan Wei couldn't comprehend why they had to lower their heads to someone they used to work for.","\"I bet our current standing isn't lower than the Xi Family!\"","\"You better watch your mouth, Xuan Wei. If you think I won't hit you because you're my grandson, you can test me! Our Xuan Family has served the Xi Family for generations since ancient times. Even if we no longer work for them, we will always put them above us!\"","\"...\" Xuan Wei could not understand Xuan Kun's point of view and decided to remain silent.","Once they arrived at the Pavilion of Knowledge, Xuan Kun led Yuan and Xi Meili to one of the guest rooms for esteemed guests.","\"Xuan Wei, go bring them some tea. You can use my tea leaves.\"","\"What? We have servants for that.\" Xuan Wei wore a look of disbelief on his face.","How could he, one of the Seven Scroll Elders, stoop as low as serving tea to guests? His position was only below that of his father and Xuan Kun.","\"Don't make me repeat myself.\" Xuan Kun narrowed his eyes with a cold glint in them.","Xuan Wei could only swallow his frustration and listen to Xuan Kun's command.","\"I guess I wasn't wrong to call you a servant.\" Xi Meili chuckled, rubbing salt on his wounds.","Xuan Wei's body trembled in anger, and he stopped walking for a second, but he didn't say anything and quickly left.","\"Don't tease him too much, Young Lady. He has a short temper.\" Xuan Kun smiled.","\"That's what he gets for looking down on Yuan,\" she sneered.","\"Yuan... you must be her friend.\" Xuan Kun turned to look at Yuan, who appeared unremarkable at a glance, but once he tried to peek deeper, Xuan Kun was surprised that even he couldn't inspect Yuan's body, who was only a Spirit King.","\"Thank you for calling out to me earlier. I would no longer be able to face my ancestors in the future if someone from our Xuan Family had harmed a member of the Xi Family.\"","\"He's more than just a friend to me, Senior Xuan. He's essentially a member of our family—with my parents' approval, of course.\"","\"What? His Majesty accepted a human into the Xi Family? That's unthinkable...\" Xuan Kun stared at her with wide eyes.","He could still vividly recall Xi Shengmo's hatred for humans, which forced his family to escape into the Ancient Dragon City.","\"You don't have to believe me. Yuan, show him your robe and ring.\" Xi Meili winked at him.","Yuan nodded and retrieved the Golden Dragon Robe and the Dragon Spatial Ring, showing it to Xuan Kun, who stood up from shock.","\"The Dragon Spatial Ring?! And even the Golden Dragon Robe?! Heavens! I never thought I would see these precious items in a human's possession!\" he exclaimed.","\"You have no idea how much he helped my Xi Family. If it weren't for him, the Azure Dragon Family would've ended our family's lineage.\" Xi Meili sighed.","\"The Azure Dragon Family? Those ambitious bastards tried to do something like that? Though, I can't say I'm surprised. They have always been hungry for power and authority—even before they moved to the Ancient Dragon City.\" Xuan Kun shook his head at this information."]},{"number":1555,"title":"Chapter 1555 Pavilion of Knowledge(2)","paragraphs":["1555 Pavilion of Knowledge(2)","\"Young Master, on behalf of the Xuan Family, thank you for helping the Xi Family.\" Xuan Kun respectfully lowered his head at Yuan.","\"Don't even mention it. I only did what was natural.\" Yuan smiled.","\"Anyway, you're here for information on the Immortal Monarch, correct?\" Xuan Kun then asked.","\"Yes, that's correct.\"","\"I see... Unfortunately, as Xuan Wei had already said, any information on the Immortal Monarch is incredibly sacred to us, so even if you are with the Xi Family, I cannot give you any information without payment. This is also a rule of the Pavilion of Knowledge I cannot break as its Master.\"","\"No, I completely understand. I never thought it was going to be free, anyway. If you provide me with new information on the Immortal Monarch, I will be willing to share information on the Immortal Monarch that you may not be aware of. That sounds fair, correct?\" Yuan said.","Xuan Kun looked at Yuan with a doubtful gaze. Information on the Immortal Monarch was incredibly rare and not something that could be found within the Fourth Heaven in this day and age, after all.","However, he only remained doubtful and didn't outright dismiss Yuan as a fraud.","\"By the way, how does the Pavilion of Knowledge verify the information they're given?\" Xi Meili suddenly asked.","\"We have a treasure called the Heavenly Scroll of Validity. It can tell whether someone is being genuine or not,\" explained Xuan Kun.","'Sounds like my Grail of Truth.' Yuan thought inwardly.","While the Heavenly Scroll of Validity and the Grail of Truth had similar functions, they were actually very different. The Grail of Truth only had the capability to tell whether someone was lying or not, so it wouldn't be able to detect anything deeper than that.","As for the Heavenly Scroll of Validity, it directly reads one's soul to tell if they are being genuine or not.","\"If you truly wish to purchase information on the Immortal Monarch, we will need to verify your information before the Heavenly Scroll of Validity.\" Xuan Kun continued.","\"I'll do it.\" Yuan nodded.","\"Let's do it after we drink some tea. I'd like to chat more with the Young Lady here, as well.\"","\"I don't mind.\"","Xuan Wei returned sometime later with three cups of tea.","He placed the tea on the table, immediately turned around, and walked back out to the door without uttering a single word, clearly still upset that he was treated like a servant.","\"Wait.\" Xuan Kun suddenly stopped him.","\"The Young Lady here hasn't received an apology from you yet.\"","\"Why do I have to apologize to her?! I did nothing wrong!\" Xuan Wei roared.","\"Do I really have to repeat myself?\" Xuan Kun frowned, his domineering aura growing more noticeable.","Xuan Wei's entire body trembled in anger, but he didn't dare to talk back.","He turned to Xi Meili and reluctantly lowered his head before stiffly speaking, \"I'm sorry.\"","\"Apology accepted.\" Xi Meili could've remained silent, but she thought it would annoy him more if she responded, and she was right.","Xuan Wei stormed out of the room the next moment, his face flushed red.","\"Now then... Young Lady, can you tell me about your life in the Ancient Dragon City? And how is the Xi Family fairing nowadays?\" Xuan Kun asked.","Xi Meili casually nodded and began recalling her life in the Ancient Dragon City.","Although Xuan Kun's request seemed innocent and out of curiosity at a glance, he was actually trying to acquire information on the Ancient Dragon City.","Due to Ancient Dragon City's seclusive and secretive nature, any information on them would be precious to the Pavilion of Knowledge, especially information on the Xi Family, a dragon clan with royal blood that hasn't been seen in the outside world for millions of years.","Yuan silently enjoyed the tea as he listened to their chat.","In the blink of an eye, several hours have passed since Yuan arrived at the Pavilion of Knowledge.","\"I see... I'm glad that His Majesty is doing well these days. It's unfortunate that he can no longer progress his cultivation due to the lack of spiritual energy there, but he knew this before going inside the Ancient Dragon City. Now let me tell you about the history of the Xuan Family with the Xi Family.\" Xuan Kun said.","\"Our Xuan Family has served the Xi Family for generations— even before the Divine Heavens split into Nine Heavens. It all started when your ancestors saved our ancestor's life. After our ancestors swore loyalty to the Xi Family, we started working as their servants until we were promoted to being their record keeper, where we record significant moments or their achievements.\"","\"Everything was great...until the humans started hunting down dragons like madmen. The Xi Family didn't want to deal with humans and decided to move into the Ancient Dragon City, a world of its own, created by none other than the Dragon Ancestor. However, the Xi Family didn't force their retainers to follow them and gave us a choice—to follow them or remain in the Nine Heavens.\"","\"Our Xuan Family wanted to follow the Xi Family, but alas, we found a new objective in life when a certain someone showed up—the Immortal Monarch. This individual was so awe-","inspiring and special that we wanted to remain outside to witness and record his greatness, which was the start of the Pavilion of Knowledge.\"","\"This is why we regard information on the Immortal Monarch sacred. It's the foundation of the Pavilion of Knowledge.\"","\"Anyway, we can start verifying your information now.\"","Yuan nodded and stood up, \"Let's go.\"","Xuan Kun proceeded to bring them to a large and spacious room on the upper floor. This room only had four things inside—a table, two chairs, and a golden scroll that was floating above the table.","This scroll emitted a profound, almost otherworldly aura that permeated the room.","\"Please, have a seat.\" Xuan Kun gestured toward one of the chairs before sitting down on the other one.","Once Yuan sat across from him, Xuan Kun activated the Heavenly Scroll of Validity.","\"From this point forth, the Heavenly Scroll of Validity will enter your soul to determine whether your information is genuine or not.\"","\"Let's start with something simple. What is your name?\"","\"Yuan.\"","The very next moment, the Heavenly Scroll of Validity emitted a golden glow that made the room appear divine.","\"Good. Now, lie to me. Do you know Xi Meili?\"","\"No.\"","The Heavenly Scroll of Validity did not glow and released an imposing pressure that filled the room, as though a judge had just sentenced someone to death.","\"Last test. I won't ask you anything. Just tell me something. It doesn't have to be real, either.\"","Hearing such words, Yuan showed a mysterious smile on his face as he spoke, \"The Immortal Monarch is still alive.\"","\"?!?!\" Xuan Kun's eyes widened with surprise after hearing Yuan's information.","As someone with millenniums of experience verifying information, he could usually tell when someone was farting or not, even without the Heavenly Scroll of Validity's help. Yet, he somehow found Yuan's information to be real even though it shouldn't be possible.","Xuan Kun immediately turned to look at the Heavenly Scroll of Validity for its response. He wanted it to permeate the room with its golden glow so badly, but he knew that it wasn't going to happen, as that would have severe and significant implications.","A moment later, the room brightened as the Heavenly Scroll of Validity glowed gold.","\"WHAT?!\"","Xuan Kun stood from his chair and slammed the table, looking like he'd just witnessed his ancestors crawling out of their graves.","After standing there for a long minute with a bewildered look on his face, Xuan Kun looked at Yuan and asked in a trembling voice, \"W-where did you get this information?!\"","However, Yuan merely shrugged and said, \"Who knows, but the information I just gave you should be pretty valuable, right? I wonder if it's valuable enough for you to give me what I want.\"","Xuan Kun's jaw dropped after hearing his words. He was rendered completely speechless, and his mind was already in a mess from the earlier information.","Eventually, he took a deep breath and sighed, \"Very well... I shall give you all the information we have on the Immortal Monarch. But honestly, the information you gave us is already more valuable than everything we've gathered since our foundation.\"","\"That's fine.\"","\"Follow me...\"","Xuan Kun tried to walk to the door, but he stumbled and fell on the floor like an old man who suddenly had his cane taken away.","\"Sorry, but can you give me a moment?\" he asked with an embarrassed look on his face.","\"Take your time.\" Yuan nodded with a smile.","Xuan Kun remained seated on the floor for several minutes, contemplating the information that the Immortal Monarch was still alive out there somewhere.","'The Immortal Monarch is alive...? The Immortal Monarch is alive?! Why hasn't he made an appearance for so long?! What about the Nine Divine Supremes?! Just who is this young human?!' Xuan Kun knew Yuan was an extraordinary existence when he managed to visit the Ancient Dragon City and receive the Xi Family's approval, but this was truly far beyond his expectations.","'This young man... could he be related to the Immortal Monarch? Perhaps his descendant? No... he wouldn't need to look for information on the Immortal Monarch if he were the Immortal Monarch's descendant...'","Sometime later, once Xuan Kun could finally walk properly, he led Yuan to the room on the highest floor of the Pavilion of Knowledge."]},{"number":1556,"title":"Chapter 1556 Chronicles of the Immortal Monarch","paragraphs":["1556 Chronicles of the Immortal Monarch","\"This is the room where we keep all of the Immortal Monarch's information. We call this room the 'Chronicles of the Immortal Monarch,'\" Xuan Kun said as they approached a metal door crafted from a black metallic material adorned with the image of a human figure surrounded by nine beastly entities.","\"You will be the first guests to visit this room. Welcome to the Chronicles of the Immortal Monarch.\"","Xuan Kun proceeded to bite his thumb and press it against the door, feeding it with his blood. The black door slowly creaked open, and Xi Meili swallowed nervously in anticipation. However, once the door was fully opened and they stepped inside, the interior was quite ordinary.","Inside, tall wooden shelves hugged every wall in the room, and thousands of scrolls were neatly placed on them.","\"Please, take as much time as you need here. They are all labeled, too. I will be leaving to deal with something else. If you need anything, don't hesitate to call me. I will be in the room across from this one.\" Xuan Kun said to them before closing the door for them. Then, he went into the other room and sealed the door shut.","\"Where should we start?\" Xi Meili asked as she looked around.","Yuan used his divine sense to look at all of the labels quickly and pointed to the shelf by the door.","\"That's the beginning, so we can start from there.\"","Xi Meili nodded and walked to the shelf.","\"Immortal Monarch's First Appearance,\" she read the label out loud.","She picked out the scroll labeled with the number 'one' and looked at Yuan, asking, \"Can I do the honors of reading it?\"","He nodded with a smile, \"Go ahead.\"","Thus, Xi Meili began reading the records of the Immortal Monarch's first appearance.","According to the records, the Immortal Monarch's appearance was very sudden, like thunder in a clear blue sky, and when he appeared, there were already three Divine Supremes by his side.","\"When he first appeared in the world, he was already accompanied by three supreme entities that would eventually be known as the Nine Divine Supremes.\"","\"The first was Dragon Goddess Yeyou, also known as the Dragon of Origin, one of the first dragons to exist in the Divine Heavens alongside the Dragon Ancestor and the Great One. Unlike the other two Dragons of Origin, who spread their names far and wide, Dragon Goddess Yeyou preferred being lowkey and seclusive. She was rumored to be the strongest divine beast during her time. Unfortunately, she disappeared along with the Immortal Monarch.\" Xi Meili read, her hands trembling with excitement.","\"The second supreme entity who followed the Immortal Monarch was the Primordial Phoenix, one of the first phoenixes to exist. Her prowess rivaled that of the Dragons of Origin, except the Dragon Goddess, who was stronger than the other two Dragons of Origin. The Primordial Phoenix's body burned so intensely that she would set entire stars ablaze just by being in its vicinity. She was rumored to have true immortality, where she would not die even if her soul perished. She also disappeared alongside the Immortal Monarch.\"","\"The third supreme entity that followed the Immortal Monarch was also the most mysterious and unique of the Nine Divine Supremes. Eater of Stars, once known as a natural calamity that devoured stars and everything unfortunate enough to enter its path as though it was her only purpose. We don't know her name or how the Immortal Monarch tamed an entity like her, but she was the most obedient of the Nine Divine Supremes. Almost everything about her is a mystery. From her origins to her true strength, they all remained unknown even after the Immortal Monarch's disappearance.\"","\"The Eater of Stars disappeared alongside the Immortal Monarch but was spotted nine hundred thousand years later. She had returned to being the Abyss Calamity she was once infamous for, devouring the stars and everything in the galaxy more intensely than before. However, there hasn't been any news of her since her initial reemergence.\"","Yuan's body trembled after learning that Eater of Stars had returned to her life before she met the Immortal Monarch, most likely because he'd perished and could no longer satisfy her insatiable hunger.","He looked to the ceiling with a woeful frown on his face, wondering if she was still living such a harsh life in the starry sky.","'If she's still out there, I need to find her as soon as possible so she can live a normal life again...' Yuan clenched his fists until they bled, his eyes filled with newfound determination.","However, in order to traverse the starry sky without the help of treasures, one must at least be a Golden Immortal. As for treasures that allow one to traverse the starry sky, most of them are insanely expensive.","\"The Immortal Monarch and these three supreme entities traveled the Divine Heavens for thousands of years with one goal—to stop the war between humans and beasts and start their coexistence.\"","\"The first intervention by the Immortal Monarch was between the Blood Mastiffs and humans. Due to their highly desirable blood, Blood Mastiffs were hunted by humans to near extinction. As revenge for his bloodline, the strongest Blood Mastiff, known as the Crimson Terror, went on a carnage and destroyed hundreds of human settlements and consumed countless humans.\"","\"In order to calm the Crimson Terror, the Immortal Monarch had to fight with it. Their fight lasted seven hundred years until the Crimson Terror was defeated. After their fight ended, the Crimson Terror swore loyalty to the Immortal Monarch and became the fourth Nine Divine Supreme.\"","'Crimson Terror... he was the Lord's father...' Yuan recalled what the Lord told him not long ago.","Xi Meili continued, \"After turning the Crimson Terror into his subordinate, the Immortal Monarch swiftly dealt with the humans hunting the Blood Mastiffs. He declared that if any humans hunted Blood Mastiffs solely to benefit from their existence—or any beasts, for that matter—he would personally wipe them out. This was the true beginning of his campaign to bring peace to humans and beasts.\"","\"Over the next several thousand years, the Immortal Monarch stayed true to his words, killing humans that hunted beasts for their materials. As for beasts that hunted innocent humans for revenge, the Immortal Monarch also dealt with them. A lot","—countless humans and beasts died at the hands of the Immortal Monarch. In the end, the war between humans and beasts was forced to end by a third party with overwhelming power that could wipe out either side.\"","\"The Immortal Monarch appeared to be a gentle and kind individual at a glance, but he was a true tyrant who made the world obedient with fear and power. However, he also made the world a better place by doing so.\"","\"A tyrant...? That was unexpected.\" Xi Meili looked at Yuan, who also looked surprised by this information.","He thought the Immortal Monarch had ended the war between humans and beasts through other means, but it turned out that he had simply forced it to end by making everyone fear him.","\"To end the war by force... it may be a morally questionable method, but it was undeniably effective,\" Yuan sighed out loud.","\"No... it may have been the only method...\" Xi Meili suddenly said.","\"Not just humans, but beasts can also be unreasonable beings. If you wish to have two objects that naturally repel each other join together, it can only be done with force.\" Xi Meili said.","For example, attempting to make two magnets of opposite poles touch requires force, as their natural state is to repel each other.","Yuan nodded, agreeing with her.","Xi Meili continued reading the scrolls.","\"Once the war ended, the Immortal Monarch began working towards bringing humans and beasts together, something that could not be forced.\"","\"In order to do this, he started with befriending the beasts to let them know that it was possible to coexist with humans. The Immortal Monarch started with the Dragon Clan due to his connection with Dragon Goddess Yeyou.\"","\"The Immortal Monarch started from top to bottom, so he first met with the Dragon Ancestor, who he quickly befriended. Due to the Dragon Ancestor's immense influence in the Dragon Clan and with two of the three Dragons of Origin by his side, convincing the rest of the Dragon Clan required little to no effect.\"","\"After gaining the Dragon Clan's approval, the Immortal Monarch sought the approval of the Great One. However, for reasons unknown, the Great One refused, even antagonizing the Immortal Monarch. Rumors suggested that the Great One was not on friendly terms with the other two Dragons of Origin and thus could not accept someone they already accepted.\"","\"The Immortal Monarch and the Great One weren't on good terms with each other? Now that's another piece of information that I did not expect...\" Yuan muttered after hearing this information.","He thought he had some kind of fate with the Great One at the beginning of his journey in Cultivation Online, but after their last interaction, their relationship with each other had become somewhat clouded.","With this new information, his future relationship with the Great One became even more cloudy.","'It's a pity that we might be enemies in the future. I even learned Dragon's Gaze from him in this life...' Yuan sighed inwardly.","However, he didn't immediately consider the Great One an enemy, as there were still many uncertain things.","Xi Meili continued, \"One day, the Immortal Monarch and the Great One had a massive fight that shook the Divine Heavens, and they became sworn enemies since that day.\"","\"...\"","Yuan became speechless."]},{"number":1557,"title":"Chapter 1557 Chronicles of the Immortal Monarch(2)","paragraphs":["1557 Chronicles of the Immortal Monarch(2)","\"Sworn enemies with the Great One? Now that's an achievement one can brag about.\" Xi Meili chuckled at this information.","The Great One was a supreme entity that stood at the pinnacle of the world. To be noticed by him was an honor beyond measure, and to be considered a sworn enemy was a mark of unparalleled distinction. Of course, whether that was a good thing or not was debatable.","\"What do you think caused the fight?\" Xi Meili looked at Yuan.","He shrugged, \"I can't imagine. From my few encounters with him, I can tell that he's a very prideful and fulfilled individual. I cannot imagine someone like him would fight over something simple.\"","Xi Meili then said, \"I always thought the Dragons of Origin were close to each other since they were the first dragons to come into existence and might see each other as siblings, but I guess I was too naive.\"","\"Don't siblings tend to argue with each other?\"","Yuan, drawing from his own experiences, mused, \"Although most of my time with Yu Rou was pleasant, there were moments when we had fought in the past. So, I would understand it if the Dragons of Origin had similar experiences.\"","\"Sibling fights, huh? I totally understand. I am always butting heads with Murong.\" Xi Meili chuckled.","She continued reading the next scroll a moment later.","\"After securing the Dragon Clan's approval, the Immortal Monarch set his sights on the Heavenly White Tiger Clan, a formidable yet relatively small clan renowned for their ferocity and tumultuous nature. Ranked as the seventh most powerful clan, their influence belied their size. The males, in particular, were notorious for their insatiable lust, a trait embedded deeply within their bloodline, which often led them into conflict with other clans.\"","\"Although the females were not as lustful as the males, they were known to go to extreme lengths to acquire a partner once they fancied someone. Due to their nature, they did not make a good first impression, and the entire clan received a massive beating from Dragon Goddess Yeyou when the males tried to go after her and the females tried to get overly friendly with the Immortal Monarch.\"","\"Their leader, the Heavenly White Tiger God, was particularly affected. He was beaten so severely that he lost all sexual desire, becoming as pure and chaste as a monk. He would also become the fifth of the Nine Divine Supremes.\"","\"Che. The Heavenly White Tigers.\" Xi Meili sucked her teeth in an annoyed manner after being reminded of her encounter with Bai Xutao.","\"The Dragon Goddess should've just killed all of them back then,\" she casually commented.","She looked at Yuan and continued, \"By the way, how's Feng Feng's recovery?\"","\"I've been feeding her my blood almost every day. Her appearance's changed a lot, but I still don't know when she'll return.\"","\"I see... Hopefully, she'll return to us soon.\" Xi Meili said before returning to the scroll.","\"During his campaign to receive the approval of all major beast clans, the Immortal Monarch would occasionally hunt the surviving demons that had managed to flee the war.\"","\"Demons, huh? I never got to see one. They must be all gone by now, right? What a pity.\" Xi Meili muttered.","Yuan smiled and said, \"You should be glad that you never got to experience their disgusting presence. Unfortunately, demons still exist in this world—and mine. They're just in hiding now.\"","\"Have you seen one?\" she then asked.","He nodded, \"Yes, and more than just one, unfortunately.\"","\"Then did you fight them? They're supposedly immortal—with an indestructible body.\"","\"Their body is definitely destructive. They just have insane recovery, so any damage they take would instantly recover, and unless you get rid of their entire being in one go, they could fully regenerate even from a small chunk of flesh.\"","\"The only reliable method of getting rid of them would be demon-sealing techniques and sacred flames. Unless you have one of these abilities, you don't want to meet a demon.\"","\"I'll keep that in mind,\" she said.","She picked up another scroll and continued, \"After traveling for hundreds of years, the Immortal Monarch met the sixth of the Nine Divine Supreme, a powerful divine beast that did not belong to any clan—the Divine Yin Yang Crane.\"","\"The Divine Yin Yang Crane was a one-of-a-kind mythical being said to bring immense luck to anyone for the rest of their life if they are lucky enough to see it, and most people live their whole life not seeing it, including immortals that have lived for millions of years. Yet, the Divine Yin Yang Crane had personally appeared before the Immortal Monarch and requested to follow him.\"","\"The Divine Yin Yang Crane, huh? This is my first time hearing about such a creature.\" Xi Meili commented afterward.","\"Me too,\" Yuan said.","\"Is this information helping you regain your memories?\" she then asked.","\"No, nothing's coming up.\"","\"Maybe you'll recall something after hearing a little more. We still have thousands of scrolls to go through, after all.\"","She moved on to the next scroll.","\"The seventh to join the Nine Divine Supremes was the Celestial Turtle, a divine beast said to have the strongest and most durable body in the Divine Heaven. The Celestial Turtle has a massive body that was many times larger than the sun, and due to its size, it could only live in the starry sky.\"","\"Rumors say that the Immortal Monarch had built a home for himself and the other Divine Supremes somewhere on the back of the Celestial Turtle, but nobody could confirm this rumor.\"","\"The eighth of the Nine Divine Supreme was the Shadow Dweller, a divine beast that can enter and traverse shadows. Not much is known about this Divine Supreme due to its lack of presence.\"","\"The ninth and final of the Nine Divine Supreme is unknown. Nobody but the other Divine Supremes and the Immortal Monarch himself have seen the Ninth Divine Supreme's beast form.\" Xi Meili closed the scroll.","\"There's not much information about the Nine Divine Supremes here. Maybe they have their own category,\" she said afterward."]},{"number":1558,"title":"Chapter 1558 Chronicles of the Immortal Monarch(3)","paragraphs":["1558 Chronicles of the Immortal Monarch(3)","Although there were still thousands of scrolls left to be read, there were only a few scrolls left that focused on the Immortal Monarch's journey. The other scrolls were dedicated to miscellaneous information on the Immortal Monarch and his companions.","\"After spending thousands of years convincing the beast clans that humans could coexist with them, the Immortal Monarch helped some of the beast clans settle around human settlements, allowing them to experience it firsthand.\"","\"Of course, the humans weren't happy about having beasts as neighbors, but there wasn't anything they could do to get rid of them, as the beast clans were all protected by the Immortal Monarch, someone even the Celestial Emperor had to be respectful around.\"","\"Eventually, after many decades of coexistence, humans and beasts grew accustomed to each other's presence. Gradually, they began to converse and build a sense of camaraderie, transforming from wary neighbors to unlikely allies.\"","\"Unfortunately, not every beast clan managed to coexist with humans. The Immortal Monarch did not force this on either side and allowed the beast clans that did not want to be around humans to return to their original settlement.\"","\"Eventually, the notion of humans coexisting with beasts became commonplace. Many beast clans lived alongside humans, collaborating to build thriving cities and communities, breaking down the barriers that once separated them.\"","\"The Immortal Monarch, content with the harmony he had fostered, ceased his role as mediator between humans and beasts and vanished from the world. For several thousand years, his whereabouts and activities remained a mystery. When he finally reappeared several thousand years later, he seemed like a different person, transformed by the unknown experiences during his absence.\"","\"His demeanor had shifted significantly; he appeared more serious, less approachable, and carried an aura of profound gravity. The cause of this transformation was unknown, but it was unmistakable. Not long after his return, the Immortal Monarch sought a private audience with the Celestial Emperor.\"","\"At that time, no one thought much of his audience with the Celestial Emperor, as they were known to be quite friendly and had many conversations before. However, this time was different. For reasons unknown to anyone but the two, their conversation sparked a fierce battle that lasted seven days straight. The Celestial Palace was flipped upside-down and turned to ruins as a result.\"","\"The Celestial Emperor survived, albeit heavily injured from the battle. As for the Immortal Monarch, he vanished once more, now branded a criminal. Despite this, the Celestial Emperor refrained from hunting him down, wary of the Immortal Monarch's immense power and the might of his Nine Divine Supremes.\"","\"News of the Immortal Monarch attacking the Celestial Emperor sent shockwaves throughout the Divine Heaven, raising questions from all corners. Speculations quickly followed, but with so little information to go on, most of these theories sounded like pure fantasy.\"","\"After a few more thousand years of silence, the Immortal Monarch reappeared and confronted the Celestial Emperor once again—with all Nine Divine Supremes by his side this time. The Celestial Army was prepared to fight to the death to protect the Celestial Emperor, but to their surprise, the Immortal Monarch only uttered a few words to the Celestial Emperor before leaving. Yet, the Celestial Emperor's face remained etched with fear long after the Immortal Monarch had departed.\"","\"The words uttered by the Immortal Monarch were 'Only I control my own fate, nobody else'.\"","\"The Immortal Monarch vanished from the world after that, never to appear in public again. Shortly after his disappearance, a catastrophic event unfolded. The sky turned a bright red, as if painted with blood, and the Divine Heaven was split into nine different realms, becoming what we know today as the Nine Heavens.\"","\"It's evident that the Immortal Monarch had something to do with the event, but nobody knew why—except for the Celestial Emperor. However, the Celestial Emperor remained silent despite being questioned by the entire world.\"","Xi Meili returned the scroll to the shelf with a bewildered look on her face, clearly taken aback by what she'd just read.","Even Yuan wore a pondering expression on his face.","\"So the Immortal Monarch caused the Divine Heaven to become the Nine Heavens, and it had something to do with the Celestial Emperor. I wonder what happened after he accomplished his ambitions that caused him to change so drastically?\" Yuan muttered to himself.","\"Whatever happened, it was disastrous enough to split the entire world into pieces.\" Xi Meili commented.","\"Can you think of anything powerful enough to split the Divine Heaven?\" Yuan asked.","Xi Meili pondered for a moment before shaking her head, \"While a Cultivation God may have enough power to destroy the world, splitting the Divine Heavens into several pieces while keeping the world intact is a different story. Maybe a treasure? I have no clue, honestly.\"","\"What do you think?\" she then asked.","\"It was most likely a fight that caused it. As for the Immortal Monarch's opponent, there's too little information to go on, so I cannot imagine.\"","\"A fight? The Immortal Monarch had the Nine Divine Supremes, who were considered the most powerful entities in the world, each strong enough to rival a Cultivation God. I cannot imagine an opponent the nine—ten of them couldn't defeat even working together.\" Xi Meili shook her head, finding it hard to believe anything could defeat the Nine Divine Supremes when even the Celestial Emperor was powerless before them, not to mention the Immortal Monarch himself.","Yuan couldn't argue with Xi Meili's logic. However, he couldn't shake the feeling that it was definitely a fight that caused it.","Suddenly, a particular term appeared inside Yuan's head.","'Outer God...'","He recalled the Black Death uttering this word for some reason.","'What if there are existences out there that defy the laws of this world—with power that surpasses the Nine Divine Supremes?' he wondered inwardly.","It wouldn't be the first time something extraordinary existed beyond their knowledge. Take Earth and Cultivation Online, for example.","If it weren't for Cultivation Online, Yuan might never have discovered the existence of the Nine Heavens, a realm far beyond their world's understanding and reach."]},{"number":1559,"title":"Chapter 1559 Chronicles of the Immortal Monarch(4)","paragraphs":["1559 Chronicles of the Immortal Monarch(4)","\"Well, that's all for the Immortal Monarch's journey. The rest of the scrolls seem to focus more on his companions and the places he'd visited than the person himself.\" Xi Meili said as she looked at the other shelves.","\"Let's check out the information on the Nine Divine Supremes,\" he said.","Xi Meili nodded and excitedly walked to the shelf with a sign that read 'Dragon Goddess Yeyou'.","\"Dragon Goddess Yeyou, one of the first dragons to exist, was also known as the Dragon of Origins. Beyond Dragon Goddess Yeyou and the other two Dragons of Origin, the exact order in which the three Dragons of Origins came into existence remains unknown.\"","\"Although she is typically in seclusion, slumbering far away from any settlement, whenever she wakes up from it, she would always find someone to spar with, earning her the nickname of Supreme Tormentor.\"","\"Dragon Goddess Yeyou's cultivation reached the equivalent of Cultivation God sometime past the Evil God's Era. Rumor has it that she was the first entity to reach such a profound cultivation.\"","\"We didn't learn of this until she started traveling with the Immortal Monarch. However, she was someone who got envious easily, especially when it concerned the Immortal Monarch, and would occasionally throw tantrums.\"","Yuan smiled at this information and recalled the little tantrum she had thrown at the Dragon Spiral Mountain.","The scrolls went on to talk about Dragon Goddess Yeyou's history—at least the ones publically known. Due to Dragon Goddess Yeyou's seclusive nature, not much was known about her in her earlier days, especially before she met the Immortal Monarch.","According to those who fought with her, Dragon Goddess Yeyou had a remarkably simple routine: she would either slumber or spar with others. If she wasn't napping in the starry sky, she was bullying someone. If she wasn't bullying someone, she was sleeping.","After meeting the Immortal Monarch, Dragon Goddess Yeyou only slumbered whenever the Immortal Monarch entered seclusion, and she would only pick fights with those who tried to get too close to him.","It was quite obvious that Dragon Goddess Yeyou fancied the Immortal Monarch, but nobody was bold enough to say it out loud—not even the other Divine Supremes.","After spending several hours on Dragon Goddess Yeyou's information, Xi Meili went on to read about the Primordial Phoenix.","\"The Primordial Phoenix was perhaps the only divine beast who walked amongst the humans before the Immortal Monarch's influence. She had her own business, selling treasures she acquired, amassing a fortune rivaling even the Great One, who was known to hoard treasures like a madman.\"","\"The Primordial Phoenix didn't spend as much time as the others with the Immortal Monarch and only showed up occasionally whenever she got bored or was needed, like that time when the Immortal Monarch visited the Phoenix Clan.\"","\"The Primordial Phoenix is highly competitive and is often seen butting heads with Dragon Goddess Yeyou.\"","Eater of Stars was next on Xi Meili's reading list, but her shelf was quite empty when compared to the others, with one exception—the ninth member of the Nine Divine Supreme.","Most of the information on the Eater of Stars was about her past before she met the Immortal Monarch. Besides Dragon Goddess Yeyou, she spent the most time with the Immortal Monarch—to the point where it was nearly impossible to see the Immortal Monarch without her somewhere around him.","\"The Eater of Stars was especially protective of the Immortal Monarch. If she perceived any threat to him, no matter how minor, she would immediately become aggressive, ready to unleash her wrath on anyone who dared to harm him.\"","Nobody but the Nine Divine Supreme knew this, but the Immortal Monarch kept her hunger satisfied with his own blood, so it was only natural for the Eater of Stars to be protective of him since he was the reason she could live a normal life.","After finishing the scrolls on Eater of Stars, Crimson Terror was next.","\"Despite the nickname he was given, Crimson Terror wasn't born a killer. In fact, he disliked violence and would always find a method to avoid it. Unfortunately, in order to protect his own clan from the greedy humans, he was forced to kill and kill until one day, he lost his mind and became nothing but a crazed killer.\"","\"If the Immortal Monarch hadn't snapped him out of it, the Crimson Terror would've inflicted significant damage not to just human society but the beast clans, as well.\"","After being tamed by the Immortal Monarch, Crimson Terror traveled the world in his human form to fix the damage he'd done to the innocent.","\"Up next, we have the Heavenly White Tiger God...\"","Just as Xi Meili reached for a scroll, the door opened, and Xuan Kun walked inside.","\"How's everything so far?\" he asked them.","\"I've learned a lot of new things from here, and we're just getting started,\" Yuan said.","\"I'm glad. Anyway, I have a new guest who needs my attention, so I will not be available for a little.\"","\"This guest must be fairly important.\" Xi Meili causally said.","\"Yes... this individual is not only from the upper heavens, but she's also from the Immortal Clans that are closely related to the Immortal Monarch.\"","\"Someone from the Immortal Clans?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow, his interest piqued.","\"Which clan is she from?\"","\"The Heavenly White Tiger Clan.\"","Yuan narrowed his eyes at this information.","'Could it be her?'","Yuan recalled the woman who showed up to protect Bai Xutao.","Xi Meili also had similar thoughts.","'For her to show up in this place, she must be looking for information...' Yuan thought to himself.","\"Then, I'll let you return to your study now.\" Xuan Kun closed the door and went downstairs to meet this individual while Yuan and Xi Meili returned to reading scrolls.","Even if this individual turned out to be the same woman they met, they had no reason to be in her business and decided to just ignore it for the time being."]},{"number":1560,"title":"Chapter 1560 Bai Ning","paragraphs":["1560 Bai Ning","Once Xuan Kun arrived at the reception area, he could see a beautiful young woman standing with Xuan Wei, who had a respectful smile on his face, a stark contrast to the way he greeted Yuan and Xi Meili.","\"Welcome to the Pavilion of Knowledge, Lady Bai Ning. How can we assist you today?\" Xuan Kun respectfully bowed to her.","Bai Ning looked at him nonchalantly and said, \"I heard that this is the place to go for information. Is that correct?\"","\"That depends on the type of information you're looking for, but generally, yes. We have information on pretty much everything, including information that is normally only available in the upper heavens.\" Xuan Kun spoke with confidence.","The Pavilion of Knowledge gathered information from not only the Fourth Heaven but also all the other Heavens. They achieved this by contacting other information-gathering agencies in the upper heavens and sharing information with each other.","\"Good. I am looking for someone,\" Bai Ning then said.","She continued as Xuan Kun raised an eyebrow, \"This individual has long golden hair and golden eyes, a unique scent that does not belong to any beast clan that I know of, but his aura did resemble that of the dragon clan slightly. He wields a golden Soul Weapon shaped like a spear that can easily penetrate spiritual energy. He might have a habit of wearing masks.\"","\"Oh, he's also immensely talented, being able to fight even Spirit Enlightenment despite being a mere Spirit King.\"","Xuan Kun wore a look of disbelief on his face after hearing the description of someone who sounded like pure fiction to him.","\"A Spirit King that can fight Spirit Enlightenment? That doesn't sound feasible at all...\" Xuan Wei subconsciously uttered this after hearing such a ridiculous claim.","Bai Ning narrowed her eyes at him and sneered, \"Are you calling me a liar?\"","\"N-not at all! But how can you be sure this information is correct?\"","\"Because I encountered and fought him myself in the Third Heaven. Not only did he match my strength, but he also humiliated my little brother, who had to unseal his cultivation to Spirit Enlightenment. Even then, it wasn't enough.\"","\"A Spirit King from the Third Heaven was able to match you? That sounds ludicrous, but since it's coming from you...\" Xuan Kun swallowed nervously.","He began pondering seriously, but nobody that fit the description came to mind.","'There's no way a genius like that would go unnoticed. In that case, he must be a newcomer...'","\"Do you have any more information on this individual?\" Xuan Kun asked.","Bai Ning recalled every little detail Bai Xutao told her to Xuan Kun, who listened with great interest.","\"I see... Truly a fascinating individual... As for that spear you mentioned...\"","Once Xuan Kun was given more details on the Soul Weapon wielded by this individual, he immediately thought about the Dragon's Soul, something the Xi Family had in their possession even before they entered the Ancient Dragon City.","'A Soul Weapon that sounds like the Dragon's Soul, and with the Young Lady's recent emergence... is this just a coincidence, or...?' Xuan Kun wondered inwardly, not daring to rush any conclusions.","\"Oh, one more thing. This masked individual had some weird technique. Right when I was about to strike him, he shouted 'halt' at me in a commanding tone, and as though I was his servant, my body obeyed even though my mind rejected it.\" Bai Ning suddenly said.","\"What?\" Xuan Kun frowned upon hearing this, and he asked, \"Can you repeat that one more time? And how you felt in more detail?\"","Bai Ning closed her eyes and recalled the moment her body stopped working.","\"With a single word, that individual was able to take complete control of my body, forcing it to listen to his commands regardless of my own will. If he told me to kill myself at that moment, I would've probably done so. I have never felt so powerless in my life...\" Bai Ning wore a nervous expression on her face as she recalled the sensation of being powerless, something she had never experienced since birth.","Xuan Kun swallowed nervously and took a deep breath before speaking, \"I don't want to startle you or anything, Lady Bai, but what you described sounds exactly like an authority—","something only the purest of royal bloodlines can wield.\"","\"What?\" Bai Ning frowned upon hearing this and said, \"You mean to tell me this individual has the authority to command the Heavenly White Tiger's bloodline when we are already the purest of our bloodline? That's nonsense!\"","The Heavenly White Tiger Clan already stood at the peak of their bloodline, so it was impossible for another bloodline to have the authority to command them.","\"In that case, I can only think of one possibility, even though it may sound even more ridiculous than the last...\" Xuan Kun's body trembled at this thought.","\"What is it?\" Bai Ning urged.","After taking a deep breath, Xuan Kun muttered in a shivering voice, \"Immortal Monarch's Dominion... That's the only authority that could possibly surpass the Heavenly White Tiger's authority.\"","\"Are you insane?!\" Bai Ning suddenly roared, her voice filled with anger.","\"You dare suggest that the Immortal Monarch is still alive and that the person I fought was him?!\"","Just the thought of raising a finger against the Immortal Monarch left Bai Ning in utter disgust and anger, as she would rather die than do such a thing.","\"Even if the Immortal Monarch were alive, he wouldn't be a Spirit King! Moreover, why would the Immortal Monarch be bullying my little brother?!\"","After Bai Xutao's fight with Yuan, Bai Ning brought Bai Xutao, who was half dead after the heavenly tribulation, back to her family, where he had to explain everything. However, Bai Xutao gave a fake story, so Bai Ning was still unaware of the whole situation and thought Yuan was just targeting the Heavenly White Tiger Clan for whatever reason.","\"I know how ridiculous it sounds, but it's the only explanation. Furthermore...\" Xuan Kun hesitated for a moment before continuing, \"The Immortal Monarch... he's alive...\"","\"What... did you just say?\" Bai Ning and Xuan Wei stared at him with wide eyes, their faces filled with shock."]},{"number":1561,"title":"Chapter 1561 Bai Ning(2)","paragraphs":["1561 Bai Ning(2)","Bai Ning's entire being froze like a stone statue after being told that the Immortal Monarch was alive. Her body trembled after a moment of silence, and she suddenly reached for Xuan Kun's collars.","Once she got ahold of his robes, she lifted him into the air and roared, \"I swear to god, if you're messing with me!\"","Xuan Kun was startled by her sudden aggression and hastily said, \"I-it's true! This information has already been verified through the Heavenly Scroll of Validity! The chances of this information being fake are almost zero!\"","\"Who? Who gave you this information!?\" she growled.","Xuan Kun hesitated to reveal this information since the Pavilion of Knowledge prided itself on its confidentiality. If he revealed a customer's name, it would set a dangerous precedent and, if exposed, would sink their reputation to the bottom of the sea.","\"Please forgive me, but I cannot reveal a client's information, especially if that individual may have a connection with the Immortal Monarch. I beg for your understanding, Lady Bai.\" Xuan Kun said, his body soaked in cold sweat.","\"...\"","Bai Ning froze again and, after a moment of silence, released Xuan Kun and said, \"My apologies. I got a little too excited after learning of the information. You're right. This individual likely has connections with the Immortal Monarch to have such valuable information. I almost made a rash judgment there.\"","Xuan Kun sighed in relief and said, \"Thank you for your understanding. Although I cannot reveal this individual's information to you, I can speak with him and see if he would be willing to meet you.\"","Bai Ning's eyes flickered after hearing this, and immediately nodded, \"Please do! I must speak with this individual, no matter what! If there's anything I can do that would increase the chances of meeting him, let me know!\"","Xuan Kun pondered for a moment before responding, \"I'm not sure, but he seemed very interested in information related to the Immortal Monarch. If you have information to share with him, he'd have a reason to speak with you.\"","\"Information on the Immortal Monarch, right? I have plenty of that.\" Bai Ning quickly agreed.","As an Immortal Monarch enthusiast, Bai Ning collected all sorts of information on the Immortal Monarch, and being part of an Immortal Clan, she has access to information not available to the public.","\"What about the individual you wanted to find?\" Xuan Wei suddenly asked.","\"I can deal with him later. This takes priority,\" she said.","\"Then I'll be back. You can rest in the guest room in the meantime.\" Xuan Kun said.","\"Hm? You make it sound like you'll be able to contact this person soon.\"","\"Well... he is currently in the Pavilion of Knowledge, after all...\"","\"What did you say?!\" Bai Ning was pleasantly surprised by this news.","\"You don't mean...\" Xuan Wei swallowed nervously as he thought of their recent rude guests.","Xuan Kun left shortly after, leaving Xuan Wei and Bai Ning alone.","Sometime later, Xuan Kun opened the door to Chronicles of the Immortal Monarch.","\"Young Master, I apologize for disturbing you, but the guest from the Heavenly White Tiger Clan would like to meet you. Due to her background, I shared with her the information you told me.\" Xuan Kun said with an apologetic look on his face.","\"She wants to meet me, huh?\" Yuan didn't immediately give an answer.","\"She said she's willing to share information on the Immortal Monarch if you agree to meet with her. Since she's from an Immortal Clan, her information would undoubtedly be valuable.\"","Yuan pondered for a moment before nodding his head, \"Sure, I'll go meet with her.\"","\"Thank you!\" Xuan Kun bowed to him, feeling relieved.","Xi Meili placed the scroll in her hands down and asked through divine sense, \"Should I come with you?\"","\"No, I can speak with her alone. She might also recognize you.\" Yuan said.","\"Alright.\" Xi Meili nodded.","Yuan left the room while Xi Meili continued to read the scrolls.","Sometime later, Xuan Kun brought Yuan to Bai Ning.","The moment Bai Ning saw Yuan, she raised an eyebrow. She didn't recognize Yuan but felt like they had met somewhere.","\"Hello, I am Bai Ning of the Heavenly White Tiger Clan. How should I address you?\" Knowing that he might be connected to the Immortal Monarch, Bai Ning spoke to him in a respectful tone.","\"Yuan,\" he said.","\"I heard you wanted to speak with me. What is this about?\" he then asked.","\"I heard from Xuan Kun here that you were the one who told him the Immortal Monarch is alive. If you don't mind me asking, how did you acquire this information? I will share with you everything I know about the Immortal Monarch. In case you don't know, the Heavenly White Tiger God, our ancestor, was one of the Nine Divine Supremes that followed the Immortal Monarch, so we know more than most.\"","\"I don't mind telling you, but can you tell me what you plan on doing with that information first?\" Yuan said.","\"What I plan on doing...?\" Bai Ning raised an eyebrow, as she hadn't thought about it yet.","\"I-if the Immortal Monarch is truly alive, I want to meet him...\" she responded in a low voice after a moment of silence.","\"And what are you going to do once you meet him?\" Yuan continued to ask.","\"I will serve him just as the Nine Divine Supreme had! That is my dream!\" she answered with a serious expression on her face.","\"And what if he refuses?\"","\"That's...\" Bai Ning was left speechless.","\"I haven't thought that far, but I will not give up even if it's the last thing I do!\"","Yuan remained silent for a moment before speaking, \"If you want to meet the Immortal Monarch that badly, I can let you meet him.\"","\"What?! Really?! You know where the Immortal Monarch is?!\" Bai Ning's eyes widened with shock.","\"Yes, but you'll have to do something for me.\"","\"I will do anything!\" she answered without hesitation.","\"We'll see about that,\" Yuan said with a mysterious smile on his face."]},{"number":1562,"title":"Chapter 1562 Vial of Blood","paragraphs":["1562 Vial of Blood","\"So, what do you need me to do?\" Bai Ning urged in an impatient manner.","Yuan calmly said, \"You have a brother, right?\"","\"Yes... I have several younger brothers, in fact. Why are you asking?\" Bai Ning raised her eyebrows with a confused look.","\"I am looking for one of them. According to what I was told, he wields a pair of gauntlets.\" Yuan said, pretending he didn't know Bai Xutao.","\"Gaunlet... I know three of them that wield them. Any more specifics?\"","\"I heard he came down to the lower heaven for some mission.\"","\"Oh, then you must be talking about Bai Xutao, our youngest. Why are you looking for him?\"","\"I met him not long ago and couldn't finish our conversation because he had to leave suddenly. I'd like to speak with him and repay a little debt I owe him.\" Yuan said with a calm smile on his face.","\"Is that so...\" Bai Ning's face became a little nervous as she continued, \"Unfortunately, Bai Xutao was heavily injured not long ago, so I had to send him back home to the upper heavens, so you might have to wait until he recovers.\"","\"Heavily injured in the lower heavens? What happened to him?\" Yuan acted surprised to hear this information.","\"He was viciously beaten by this masked individual.\"","\"What? Why would this individual do such a horrible thing?\" Yuan's eyes widened with shock.","\"My brother claimed it was a random attack—that he has no idea why he was being attacked. However, Bai Xutao is a troublemaker, so I wouldn't be surprised if he offended someone he shouldn't have. This individual was insanely talented and powerful... there's no way someone like that would attack Bai Xutao without reason.\"","\"This is also why I came to the Pavilion of Knowledge—to find this individual who attacked my younger brother.\" Bai Ning clenched her fists in frustration.","In her head, she couldn't care less about avenging Bai Xutao. The real reason she wanted to find this individual was to fight him again and to learn about his mysterious power.","\"What will you do once you find this individual?\" Yuan asked out of curiosity.","\"Well, I am going to find out the real reason he attacked Bai Xutao, but regardless of the reason, he'd nearly crippled someone from the Heavenly White Tiger Clan, so he will need to pay for his crimes. I will bring him back to my family so they can deal with him.\" Bai Ning said.","\"I see... I hope you find this individual and find justice for Bai Xutao.\" Yuan said.","\"As for meeting with the Immortal Monarch, he's not in the condition to meet anyone right now, anyway. I'll let you meet him in the future.\"","\"What?! Is he okay?! You make it sound like he's injured or something!\" Bai Ning's face darkened, acting like a mother about her missing child.","\"It's complicated, but you'll find out in the future. Anyway, can you share your information on the Immortal Monarch with me?\"","After a moment of silence, Bai Ning nodded her head, and she retrieved a jade slip from her spatial ring before handing it to him.","\"This is my personal logbook. I logged all of my information on the Immortal Monarch here. You can borrow it for now.\"","Yuan accepted the jade slip and said, \"Thank you. As a token of our new friendship and to further develop our trust in each other, I would like you to have this...\"","Yuan retrieved an object from his spatial ring and offered it to her.","\"This is...\"","Bai Ning raised her eyebrows at the vial of blood before her with a puzzled face. Why was he giving her blood, and who does it belong to?","However, not wanting to be rude, Bai Ning accepted it without any question.","\"T-thank you...?\" she said in a stiff voice.","The vial was the length of her finger, and only a fourth of it contained blood.","\"It was nice meeting you. Then I'll go back upstairs now.\" Yuan turned around and left before Bai Ning could question him about the blood.","Once Yuan left, Bai Ning opened the vial and took a sniff of the blood.","Her senses immediately went crazy from the sweet scent of the blood, and her body trembled uncontrollably from excitement.","\"What a profound scent! Whose blood does it belong to?!\" Even Xuan Kun could smell it from afar, and the scent made his mouth watery.","\"I don't know but... I really want to taste it for some reason.\" Bai Ning swallowed nervously.","Usually, she'd never even think about tasting a stranger's blood, but the sweet scent was too enticing and compelled her to do so.","\"I'll just taste a drop to see if I can identify it...\" Bai Ning carefully retrieved a drop of blood from the vial with her Qi Manifestation and placed it in her mouth.","The instant the drop of blood touched her tongue, an overwhelming sensation surged through Bai Ning's entire being, as if she had been touched by the divine itself, baptized in an ethereal purity that transcended all comprehension.","\"Good heavens!\" she cried out loud and fell to her knees, nearly dropping the vial of blood in the process.","\"W-what the?! Lady Bai! Are you okay?! Did that bastard poison you?!\" Xuan Wei exclaimed in a terrified voice after seeing her drastic reaction.","Bai Ning didn't respond to him and merely stared toward the sky with a dazed look on her face.","\"Lady Bai...?\" Xuan Kun swallowed nervously.","\"It's... it's so fucking delicious...\" she muttered in a dumbfounded voice.","\"Huh? Excuse me?\"","\"This otherworldly taste that's unlike anything I've tasted before... this to-die-for taste... only one individual could make a divine beast fall to their knees with the delicious taste of their blood— the Immortal Monarch! This blood definitely belongs to the Immortal Monarch!!!\" Bai Ning exclaimed as she came to a realization.","\"T-the Immortal Monarch's blood?!?! Impossible!\" Xuan Wei cried out loud, his voice filled with disbelief."]},{"number":1563,"title":"Chapter 1563 Immortal Monarch’s Blood","paragraphs":["1563 Immortal Monarch's Blood","Both Xuan Wei and Xuan Kun looked as though they just witnessed their ancestors' ghost after hearing Bai Ning's words.","\"Lady Bai... I don't mean to doubt you, and I apologize in advance for saying this, but could you be mistaken?\" Xuan Kun said in a nervous voice.","\"Mistaken? Me? Impossible! Although I have never tasted the Immortal Monarch's blood before, I have read enough about it to recognize it if I ever tasted it! This blood is, without a shadow of a doubt, the Immortal Monarch's blood, and I am willing to bet my life on it!\" Bai Ning spoke with confidence.","\"If you're that certain...\" Xuan Kun stared at the vial of blood and swallowed nervously.","He didn't wholly believe Bai Ning, but it wasn't as though he could make her use the Scroll of Validity, as that would basically tell her he didn't trust her. However, if there's even one percent that the blood genuinely belonged to the Immortal Monarch, he wanted it!","\"Lady Bai... this may be imprudent of me, and allow me to apologize in advance again, but...\"","\"No.\" Bai Ning responded before he could even finish his sentence.","She turned to glare at him and continued, \"You were going to ask me to give you some of this blood, right? I refuse. I don't care what you have to offer me. I won't give you even a single drop.\"","Xuan Kun began sweating profusely at her words, but he still remained hopeful, \"I beg you, Lady Bai... You have about a dozen drops of blood inside that vial... Can't you just spare a single drop for this old man? It would mean the world to me!\"","Bai Ning sneered and said, \"I'll think about it if you can find me the individual who attacked Bai Xutao.\"","Xuan Kun's jaw dropped. After a moment of silence, he sighed out loud, \"I'll be blunt, Lady Bai. It's almost impossible to find someone like that with so little information. The only thing we know about this individual is that he's a genius who can fight multiple realms above his own cultivation and that he wields a golden spear that can penetrate spiritual energy.\"","\"And there's a high probability that he's from the dragon clan.\" Bai Ning quickly added.","Xuan Kun sighed again, \"I will ask my informants in the Third Heaven to see if they have any information. It might take a couple of days for a response.\"","\"That's fine. I planned on staying here a little longer, anyway.\" Bai Ning nodded as she looked at the upper floors of the tower.","Meanwhile, Yuan returned to Xi Meili's side.","\"How'd it go? Did she recognize you?\" Xi Meili asked.","He shook his head, \"No, but I got the feeling that she finds me familiar.\"","\"What did you talk about? It was over pretty fast, too.\"","\"It wasn't much. She asked me how I knew about the Immortal Monarch being alive.\"","\"So, did you lie to her?\"","\"No, I didn't lie. I didn't even tell her anything.\" He casually shrugged.","\"Huh?\" Xi Meili raised an eyebrow.","\"She stopped caring about that when I told her that I could set up a meeting with the Immortal Monarch for her.\"","\"And you intend on keeping your word?\"","\"Of course, but she'll need to do something for me first. I wasn't able to kill Bai Xutao back then, so I'm giving her the chance to set up another meeting for me.\"","Xi Meili's jaw dropped at his words.","\"And then what? You'll reveal your true identity after killing Bai Xutao in front of her?\"","\"Pretty much.\"","\"That's... pretty cruel. I wonder how she'll react,\" she muttered.","Yuan smiled and said, \"I get the feeling that she'd do anything for the Immortal Monarch. I don't doubt she'd even kill her own brother if the Immortal Monarch told her to.\"","\"Then you might as well do just that. At least that'll save you some energy.\"","\"No, I won't feel satisfied unless I squeeze Bai Xutao's life away with my own hands for attacking you and Feng Feng.\"","\"Are you sure you want to do that? He's a descendant of the Heavenly White Tiger God, one of the Nine Divine Supremes. I won't blame you for forgiving him.\"","Xi Meili wondered if he'd feel bad about killing one of his follower's descendants.","\"It's not like he's the Heavenly White Tiger God's son—or even grandson. If the Heavenly White Tiger God were here, he'd probably kill Bai Xutao before I could even get to him.\" Yuan shook his head.","\"You make a fair point...\" Xi Meili mumbled with a look of realization.","\"Anyway, I'll deal with it when we get there. For now, let's check out the information that the woman gave me for meeting her.\" Yuan retrieved the jade slip and began reading its contents.","Half of the information in the jade slip talked about the Heavenly White Tiger God's achievements during his time as one of the Nine Divine Supremes. The other half was mostly scattered information about the Immortal Monarch, such as potential hobby, his height, his woman type, and how delicious his blood tasted.","\"There's not much in here that I don't already know, but there is some useful information about the Heavenly White Tiger God and their Heavenly White Tiger Clan,\" Yuan muttered after reading all the information, feeling as if he had just perused the diary of a love-stricken teenager. The text was filled with effusive praises for the Immortal Monarch, offering more adulation than substantial information.","\"Most of the information left in this room are rumors rather than actual facts,\" said Xi Meili.","Yuan nodded and said, \"Then let's read through them quickly and leave.\"","A few hours later, a familiar voice resounded inside Yuan's head, \"My liege, I have found this immortal you're looking for.\"","\"Oh? Where are they?\"","\"They are actually very close to your current location, hiding on a remote island in the middle of the Purple Sea.\" Dong Ye said.","\"Perfect.\" Yuan smiled at this information."]},{"number":1564,"title":"Chapter 1564 Meeting the Escaped Immortal","paragraphs":["1564 Meeting the Escaped Immortal","After learning that the escaped immortal was close to his location, Yuan said to Xi Meili, \"Let's stop here. Something else came up.\"","Worried that the immortal might leave before he could finish the scrolls in this place, Yuan decided to deal with the immortal first, then return to the Pavilion of Knowledge to finish the rest if possible.","\"Huh? What came up?\" Xi Meili lifted her head to look at him with a raised eyebrow.","Since Dong Ye spoke to Yuan through Divine Sense, she had no idea about their conversation.","Yuan gave her a quick brief of his situation, \"There is a place called the Nine Heaven Eternal Grotto that imprisons some of the most dangerous immortals in the world. A few of them escaped recently, and one of them managed to enter the Fourth Heaven. That immortal happens to be close by, so I am going to kill them real quick.\"","\"What?! An immortal?!\" Xi Meili was shocked speechless by such information.","\"You make it sound like killing an immortal is a simple thing to do! They are so powerful that even a Divine Ancestor would not last a single strike from them! And they won't die even if you destroy their body!\" Xi Meili exclaimed.","\"I doubt I will be able to kill an immortal in their perfect condition. This immortal is greatly weakened due to being in the Fourth Heaven, so I have a good chance of defeating them.\"","\"Even if their cultivation is weakened, they can still use powerful techniques and Immortal Qi, which mortals cannot resist!\"","Yuan confidently smiled and said, \"I know it's dangerous, but I have to do this. You should stay here. I don't want you to get caught up in our fight.\"","\"No! Let me fight with you!\" Xi Meili quickly shook her head.","Yuan sighed, \"That's not possible, and you should know that. I won't have the leisure to protect you during our fight, either.\"","Xi Meili clenched her jaws tightly in frustration, but she couldn't argue with Yuan. She knew that she would die long before she could even react if she fought with an immortal.","After a moment of silence, she sighed out loud, \"In this entire universe, you're probably the only mortal who would dare to fight an immortal. But that's also what I like about you. Don't die on me, Yuan.\"","\"I promise you that I'll return.\" Yuan nodded with a serious face.","He left the room shortly after while Xi Meili remained inside.","\"Are you leaving already?\" Yuan encountered Xuan Kun on his way out.","\"I'll be leaving for a little, but I'll be back. Xi Meili will stay here.\" Yuan said.","\"Is that so... by the way... that vial of blood you gave to Lady Bai... do you have more? Even a single drop is enough. If so, I'd like to purchase it from you!\"","Xuan Kun decided to try his luck with Yuan since it might be impossible to get Bai Ning to part with her supply.","Yuan shook his head and said, \"Sorry, but that's all I have.\"","\"Is that so...\" Xuan Kun wore a dejected expression on his face, looking like he'd been rejected by the love of his life.","After leaving the Pavilion of Knowledge, Yuan asked Dong Ye for directions to the escaped immortal.","\"If you fly southwest, you should arrive at a small island in three days. The escaped immortal is hiding there.\" Dong Ye said.","\"Alright.\"","Without hesitation, Yuan started flying toward the southwest.","Two and a half days later, he could see a small island on the horizon.","This island had a small mountain on it, and it was surrounded by purple trees.","Yuan didn't want to alert the immortal with his divine sense, so he restrained from using it on the island.","However, Dong Ye was a different story, as his divine sense would be too powerful for the immortal to sense.","\"Where is he?\" Yuan asked.","\"Hidden in one of the mountain caves. They've hidden their presence and are trying to recover spiritual energy. If you want to fight them, now is the best time.\" Dong Ye said.","Yuan nodded and took a moment to prepare himself.","After taking a deep breath, he retrieved Starry Abyss before releasing his aura. He purposefully avoided using Number One Under Heaven to see how much he could handle without her.","\"Come out!\" he roared.","The instant the immortal sensed Yuan's presence and powerful aura, they immediately thought about escaping. However, they stopped when they realized that Yuan was alone and was a mere Spirit King. After a moment of pondering, the immortal emerged from their hiding spot to confront him.","Yuan narrowed his eyes at the immortal's appearance, shrouded by a mysterious mist, looking like a cloud that could block divine sense.","'If Divine Sense doesn't work, let's try Divine Gaze...'","Yuan used Divine Gaze, and to his surprise, he could see through the mist, but the immortal's true appearance remained as a silhouette.","The figure inside the mist narrowed their eyes after sensing Yuan's Divine Gaze.","'A mere Spirit King using Divine Gaze only those in the Divine Realm can use? Who is this kid?' the immortal wondered inwardly.","\"Hey, why don't you show me your real appearance?\" Yuan suddenly spoke.","\"And why would I do that?\" The immortal spoke in a hoarse voice.","\"I'm just curious. I want to see my opponent before fighting them.\"","\"You want to fight me...? A mere mortal? Do you even know who I am?\" The immortal expected many things from Yuan, but a fight was not one of them. They were also confident that Yuan was not suppressing his cultivation and was a genuine Spirit King.","\"Yes, I do. You're an immortal who escaped the Nine Heaven Eternal Grotto, right?\"","\"And you still want to fight me despite knowing that...? Why are you trying to kill yourself?\" The immortal couldn't believe what they were hearing.","\"Who said anything about wanting to die? You may be an immortal, but your cultivation is currently restricted to the Divine King realm.\" Yuan smiled.","The immortal was speechless. They couldn't fathom how Yuan could talk so confidently before someone several realms above his own strength.","\"To think I'd be looked down upon by a mere mortal... hahaha!\" The immortal suddenly laughed out loud.","\"Very well... I shall teach you the difference between a mortal and an immortal today... at the cost of your insignificant life!\" The immortal roared, his aura skyrocketing the next second."]},{"number":1565,"title":"Chapter 1565 Fighting the Escaped Immortal","paragraphs":["1565 Fighting the Escaped Immortal","When the Immortal released their cultivation, Yuan barely felt its pressure. However, they didn't release all of it, and it only went up to Spirit Enlightenment.","The Immortal never intended to fight Yuan with their full power, thinking it would be an overkill. Moreover, they were still hiding from the pursuers from the upper heavens. If they released their full cultivation, the pursuers would definitely find them in a heartbeat.","'There's no need to expose my location just to kill a mere mortal! I'll end this before he can even realize what had killed him!' The Immortal laughed inwardly before they flew at Yuan with immense speed.","Seeing that the Immortal had no intention of fighting him with their full strength, Yuan smiled and said, \"You'll also regret underestimating me.\"","Although the Immortal was going easy on him, Yuan didn't have the leisure to go easy on the Immortal.","The Immortal, still with the appearance of a floating cloud, flew at Yuan.","Yuan immediately used Divine Gaze to see how the Immortal was going to attack him.","Sha!","As though the Immortal had turned into a porcupine, hundreds of needles made entirely of spiritual energy burst out of the cloud and flew toward Yuan.","<Ten Thousand Ghost Blades!>","Yuan cloned the Starry Abyss 10,000 times and used them to deflect the needles while attacking simultaneously.","\"Cheap tricks!\"","The Immortal roared and released some more of their aura, which was strong enough to block the Starry Abyss and, like an invisible wall, halted all of the attacks.","Yuan narrowed his eyes slightly at the sight of this.","'Unlike Number One Under Heaven and Dragon's Soul, the Starry Abyss is too weak to do anything. Even if I managed to hit him, it wouldn't do any damage.'","Due to its lack of power, Yuan retrieved the Starry Abyss.","'I definitely need to take some time strengthening the Starry Abyss after this...' he thought to himself as he wielded Dragon's Soul next.","\"Two Soul Weapons?\" The Immortal narrowed their eyes at Dragon's Soul, surprised that a mortal could wield two Soul Weapons. They could also feel an unfathomable aura emitted by Dragon's Soul.","Yuan used his movement technique to instantly close their distance, approaching the Immortal without hesitation.","Once he was close enough, he began thrusting Dragon's Soul at the Immortal.","\"!!!\"","The Immortal was greatly shocked when the Dragon's Soul touched their mist and destroyed it with ease.","'Fuck! What the hell is that Soul Weapon?!' The Immortal was left terrified after seeing their unique mist being destroyed when it was indestructible to weapons.","'To think he'd have a weapon that could cut through my mist! What fucking bad luck!' The Immortal cursed inwardly after realizing they'd met their worst enemy.","\"Looks like this weapon is effective on you.\" Yuan smiled after seeing how far the Immortal had backed up.","\"So what? In the end, it's still useless if you can't hit my actual body.\" The Immortal sneered.","\"We'll see about that.\"","Yuan went on the offensive while the Immortal focused on avoiding his Dragon's Soul, occasionally throwing powerful spiritual attacks at Yuan.","After just several exchanges, it was clear to Yuan that this Immortal was a cultivator who focused on spiritual techniques instead of using weapons like the majority of cultivators out there.","'What the hell is up with this mortal human?! He's just a mere Spirit King, yet he fights like he has countless years of combat experience!' The Immortal was bewildered by how skillful Yuan was in combat.","None of his movements were wasted, and his decisions seemed instant, even reading several seconds ahead.","The Immortal had fought tens of thousands of Immortals even before they were sent to the Nine Heavens Eternal Grotto, but they'd never fought someone half as experienced and skillful as Yuan.","'My cultivation may be superior, but this bastard's combat skills are unfathomably high! It's like I am fighting someone in the God Ascension Realm!' The Immortal began doubting whether Yuan was actually a Spirit King or actually a God Ascension Realm cultivator in disguise.","Yuan's combat experience through the God of War helped him narrow the gap between him and the Immortal, but it was far from enough.","\"Enough!\" The Immortal suddenly roared, and their cultivation entered the Divine Realm, becoming a Divine Warrior.","The Immortal's speed and overall prowess increased significantly after the boost. Yet, it still wasn't enough to overwhelm Yuan.","'Is this guy really human?! How is he fighting me while only having the cultivation of a Spirit King?! He should've died long ago!' The Immortal was baffled by Yuan's nonsensical existence.","There were plenty of unique and heaven-defying immortals inside the Nine Heavens Eternal Grotto, but none of them were as ridiculous as Yuan, who could fight several realms above his own with ease.","Usually, one would be considered talented if they could fight someone one or two levels higher, a genius if they could battle someone at least three levels above, and only a true prodigy would be able to challenge an opponent an entire realm higher.","Yuan was currently fighting someone four realms above his own. Not only that, but he was also fighting someone one major realm above. The difference in prowess between Spirit King and Spirit Enlightenment was insignificant compared to Spirit Enlightenment and Divine Warrior.","If the former was akin to heaven and earth, the latter was akin to Earth and Nine Heavens.","Meanwhile, unbeknownst to Yuan or the Immortal, a figure was watching their fight from afar.","\"So that's the newcomer, huh? Magnificent! He truly deserves to be a General with his capabilities, much less a member of the Celestial Overlords!\" Kelan smiled as he continued spectating their fight.","\"However... to defeat that Immortal will require much more than that, Junior...\"","A few moments later, the Immortal increased their cultivation by another level, entering Divine Master.","\"The difference between Divine Warrior and Divine Master is greater than Spirit King and Divine Warrior. How will you deal with this now?\" Kelan mumbled as he prepared to save Yuan at any moment."]},{"number":1566,"title":"Chapter 1566 Fighting the Escaped Immortal(2)","paragraphs":["1566 Fighting the Escaped Immortal(2)","\"Divine Master, huh? Finally, some challenge.\" Yuan smiled upon seeing the Immortal's increased cultivation.","\"That arrogance won't last long!\" The Immortal roared before they rushed at Yuan.","Just the pressure from the Immortal's aura alone would kill an ordinary Spirit King. However, Yuan had the Golden Immortal Physique, as well as a Sword Body, so he barely felt it.","\"Shrouded Illusion!\"","The mist around the Immortal suddenly began spreading, quickly covering a hundred miles around them.","While inside the mist, Yuan's Divine Sense and eyes were rendered useless. The only thing he could rely on was his Divine Gaze and instincts.","Suddenly, as though a massive hoard of monsters appeared, Yuan could hear loud noises approaching him from a distance. Soon, thousands of silhouettes appeared, crashing toward him like a wave.","Each individual silhouette had a distinct aura and presence, making them feel incredibly real, almost indistinguishable from reality.","Without hesitation, Yuan fiercely swung Dragon's Soul, instantly destroying the hoard of silhouettes and scattering the mist like smoke.","However, the mist quickly restored itself, and another illusion appeared shortly after.","Moreover, the mist started transforming into a background until the mists were no longer visible, and Yuan quickly found himself in the middle of a bustling city.","\"Chicken skewers here! Come get your chicken skewers!\"","\"Free newspapers! Free newspapers!\"","\"Mom, I am tired. Let's go home already.\"","The pedestrians spoke and acted like real humans. The smell of chicken skewers reached Yuan's nose, and he could even feel the heat coming from the blazing sun in the sky. It was almost as if he'd been teleported to an actual city. However, Yuan's expression remained nonchalant.","'This is quite a powerful illusion... I wouldn't blame anyone for falling to it, ' he thought.","If one had weak mental strength, one would quickly lose oneself in the illusion and fail to distinguish fake from reality.","Yuan closed his eyes and took a deep breath. A second later, when he opened them again, he could no longer see the people or the city, and the mist was visible once again.","Moreover, several spiritual attacks were launched in his direction.","Despite seeing the attacks and having plenty of time to avoid them, Yuan stood still and allowed the attacks to strike his body.","The impact from the attacks was strong enough to blow the mist field away. Yet, Yuan remained still, and his body was only slightly injured.","By the time the Immortal even realized Yuan had survived the attack, his injuries had already healed completely.","\"Heavens! He took several Divine Master's attacks with his bare body and took virtually no damage! What is his body made of?!\" Kelan's eyes widened with shock after witnessing this.","Despite being a Body Refiner himself, Kelan could not imagine the extent to which Yuan had tempered his physique to be able to achieve such a ridiculous feat.","Although the Immortal's face wasn't visible, Yuan could tell they were greatly shocked by his durability.","Not only did Yuan casually shrug off their powerful illusion, but he even ate several of their spiritual attacks with his bare body and came out unscathed.","The Immortal were beginning to wonder whether they could defeat Yuan without using their full strength. However, even if they managed to kill Yuan, they would have to deal with their pursuers afterward.","'Damn it all! Why did I have to encounter such a fucking monster in the Fourth Heaven?! My luck is rotten to the core!' The Immortal cried inwardly. They'd managed to escape from the Nine Heavens Eternal Grotto to the Fourth Heaven without feeling half as cornered as they were currently, and it was all due to a single mortal.","'Fuck it! Let's just quickly kill him and hope my pursuers aren't so close that I won't be able to escape!'","The Immortal increased their cultivation once again, reaching all the way to the peak of Divine Grandmaster.","The aura being emitted by the Immortal now was at least four times stronger than before.","Sensing the tyrannical aura coming from the Immortal, Yuan knew that even his godly body would not be able to endure a single hit from the Immortal.","The difference between Spirit Master and Spirit Grandmaster was simply too massive for him to ignore.","'I guess it's finally time to fight seriously.'","For the first time during their fight, Yuan equipped his equipment, from the Stygian Vest to the Stygian Boots.","Indeed, Yuan had been empty-handed this entire time while fighting the Immortal.","The moment Yuan equipped his equipment, his aura changed drastically.","The Immortal frowned at this and, without hesitation, increased their cultivation once again, becoming a Divine Lord.","The Stygian Vest could deflect all attacks below Divine Lord, but that ability was rendered useless the moment the Immortal became a Divine Lord. However, Yuan was using it for its life-saving skill, so it was still useful.","Yuan and the Immortal began their clash shortly after. The two of them moved at the speed of light, and every exchange would fill the surface of the Purple Sea with large craters.","The immense spiritual energy emitted by their fight rippled far and wide, reaching even the Pavilion of Knowledge.","After sensing the powerful ripples, Bai Ning and the others within the Pavilion of Knowledge stopped whatever they were doing and became alert.","\"What powerful spiritual energy! Two Divine Realm experts must be fighting each other nearby! I need to check this out!\" Bai Ning looked at Xuan Wei and said, \"I'll be back.\"","Since she had nothing to do while waiting for Xuan Kun, Bai Ning decided to entertain herself with this event.","\"Allow me to come with you just in case...\" Xuan Wei hastily said.","\"Just in case what? You're not even qualified to protect me when you're so weak.\" Bai Ning sneered at his attempt to be a knight, as his cultivation was nowhere near hers. If anything, she would be the one protecting him.","Xuan Wei's face flushed with embarrassment after being reminded he was weaker than her. He lowered his head in silence, and Bai Ning left the place and made her way toward Yuan."]},{"number":1567,"title":"Chapter 1567 Fighting the Escaped Immortal(3)","paragraphs":["1567 Fighting the Escaped Immortal(3)","'Yuan...\" Xi Meili looked toward the direction of his battle with tightly clenched fists and a nervous face. She wanted to follow him so badly, but she knew she would only get in his way and convinced herself to stay in the room.","Meanwhile, Yuan and the Immortal continued to attack each other as though their lives depended on it.","\"White Lance!\"","The Immortal created over ten thousand spears out of spiritual energy in the sky before launching all of them at Yuan.","Seeing this, Yuan stopped moving and focused on blocking the attack. Using Dragon's Soul, he destroyed as many of them as he could and purposefully allowed some of them to hit his body.","Even with his godly body and Stygian Vest, the spears were powerful enough to penetrate holes into his body easily. Still, due to his regeneration ability, these holes would instantly recover, and in seconds, it was as though they never existed.","The Stygian Vest, as a treasure, also had a similar function. Unless struck by an attack strong enough to obliterate it completely in one hit, it would always recover.","The Immortal slowly increased their cultivation from the first level of Divine Lord to the peak of Divine Lord.","After an entire day of trying to kill Yuan with no results, the Immortal finally had enough and roared, \"Ahhhh! I've had enough of you! I don't know what trick you're using, but I will not let this go on any longer!\"","He released all of his cultivation, causing it to shoot to the peak of Divine King instantly. The Immortal's aura was so tyrannical that Yuan felt like someone was strangling him by the neck.","The difference between Spirit King and Divine King was simply too vast, even for someone like Yuan.","Without hesitation, Yuan tossed most of his cards onto the field. After releasing a deafening roar, Yuan transformed into his dragon form. However, he didn't feel that was enough and equipped the Celestial Visage.","\"A Celestial-grade treasure! How in heaven's name did he acquire such a treasure in the Fourth Heaven?!\" Kelan's entire being trembled after seeing Yuan pull out a treasure far beyond their current realm.","However, what shocked him the most was Yuan's transformation.","\"Is he actually half human and half beast?\" he wondered out loud.","\"Just what the fuck are you?! How many more bullshit are you going to pull out of your ass?!\" The Immortal exclaimed after seeing Yuan's transformation.","The Immortal was certain that Yuan was only at the Spirit King level, as he would have advanced his cultivation base long ago if he were higher. However, the fact that he hadn't meant that this was his true cultivation. Yet, this raised more questions. How could a Spirit King be on par with a Divine King?","The difference between their cultivation was so vast that no treasure or technique could bridge the gap—at least, that's how it should've been.","\"I am not done yet!\" Yuan suddenly said.","<God of War's Astral Arts!>","A massive avatar appeared, its frame big enough to completely obstruct the Immortal's view of the Purple Sea.","\"That's ridiculous!\" The Immortal cried out loud.","\"That's the God of War's Astral Art! Did Celestial Overlord Xu teach him that technique?!\" Kelan cried out loud.","Compared to his previous shocks, this revelation was the most profound, shaking him to his core.","However, Yuan still had more cards to play. After putting away Dragon's Soul, he retrieved Number One Under Heaven, instantly filling the atmosphere with an otherwordly aura.","\"A third Soul Weapon!?\" The Immortal was on the verge of tears. They could've never even dreamed of encountering such a monster in the Fourth Heaven. Hell, not even the Supreme Heaven had a monster like Yuan.","\"Let's play to our heart's content!\" Yuan spoke with a wide grin on his face as he struck first.","<Nine Supreme Swords!>","The first strike descended upon the unprepared Immortal like a falling mountain.","However, as powerful as Yuan's attack appeared, he was still fighting a Divine King, and the Immortal was able to block it without too much difficulty.","The second strike immediately followed.","\"Don't you dare look down on me, mortal! No matter how many tricks you have up your sleeve, it won't help you defeat me!\" The Immortal roared as they blocked the second strike, then the third and fourth shortly after.","The fifth and sixth strike was also blocked, but the Immortal struggled to do so.","The seventh strike was so powerful that the Immortal barely managed to block it.","Once the eighth strike descended, the Immortal didn't dare to block it and opted to avoid it.","The eighth strike struck the Purple Sea, splitting it in half.","\"What's wrong? Why are you running from a mortal?\" Yuan provoked the Immortal as he launched the ninth sword strike.","The pressure from the ninth sword strike was nothing to scoff at. Even Kelan, who was watching from afar, felt threatened by it.","Although enraged, the Immortal didn't succumb to Yuan's provocation. Instead, they employed a movement technique so swift that it appeared as if they had teleported.","The ninth sword strike cleaved the Purple Sea with such force that it not only split the water in half but also gouged a profound fissure into the seabed. Two powerful tsunamis were also created from the split water, reaching the clouds.","\"Let's see if you can avoid this!\"","<Limitless Sword Domain!>","Thousands of swords appeared in the sky before flying toward the Immortal, who frantically tried to avoid them. However, the swords chased after them like homing missiles.","\"Each sword is overflowing with Enhanced Sword Aura! What a terrifying ability!\" Kelan felt a strong urge to fight Yuan after witnessing how fierce their battle was.","\"I have severely underestimated our newcomer! At this rate, he might actually be able to defeat this Immortal!\" Kelan almost couldn't believe his own words.","The thought of a mortal killing an immortal was so outrageous that even insane people wouldn't believe it. Yet, it was slowly happening before Kelan's eyes."]},{"number":1568,"title":"Chapter 1568 The Escaped Immortal’s True Appearance","paragraphs":["1568 The Escaped Immortal's True Appearance","However, as much as Kelan wanted Yuan to defeat the Immortal, he still expected Yuan to lose the fight.","\"Although you've been doing good so far, the Immortal still has one more trick up their sleeve. This trick is what differentiates and truly separates mortals and immortals.\" Kelan muttered after seeing how much Yuan was dominating the Immortal.","'This is outrageous! Why does such a mortal exist in a place like the Fourth Heaven?! If only I weren't injured by the pursuers,I could've killed him in seconds instead of being ridiculed like this!' The Immortal cursed inwardly.","They had been chased nonstop since escaping the Nine Heavens Eternal Grotto and were injured in the process. If it weren't for their injury, Yuan wouldn't have been able to push the Immortal so far.","'This mortal... should not exist! His existence is extremely dangerous! Even if I have to sacrifice my life in the process, I will get rid of him!'","Several hours later, the Immortal's aura suddenly changed, causing their surroundings to freeze.","From spiritual energy to the Purple Sea, everything was still, as though time itself had frozen.","'This pressure!' Yuan halted his movements after sensing this familiar aura.","He excitedly smiled and said, \"It's about time you use Immortal Qi. I was wondering when you'd use it.\"","\"I hate to admit this, but to force an immortal like me to use Immortal Qi on you, a mortal, is an unprecedented feat that I must respect.\"","As the immortal spoke, the mist around them began dissipating, revealing their true appearance for the first time.","Yuan's eyes widened with surprise when he saw the Immortal, who was much smaller than he'd anticipated.","\"A child?\" Yuan muttered in a daze as his gaze stared at the little boy floating before him.","The Immortal's true form was revealed to be that of a small boy, seemingly no older than ten years. Of course, the immortal wasn't a real child but merely bore the appearance of one. Adding to the strangeness, a short white tail protruded from his back.","\"As a show of respect, I shall fight you in my true form,\" said the Immortal.","\"You... you're not human?\" Yuan asked him with a strange frown.","\"Do I look human to you? I am of the proud Misty Fox race.\" The Immortal responded in a boastful tone.","\"Haa...\" Yuan sighed with a genuinely disappointed look on his face. He'd gone out of his way to fight this immortal because he thought they were human.","However, now that the Immortal is revealed to be a beast, it would no longer count toward his Unique Quest, even if he were to defeat the Immortal.","The Immortal misunderstood Yuan's reason for disappointment and roared, \"Are you looking down on me because of my appearance?! This is why I refuse to show myself!\"","Despite saying such words, the Immortal had to reveal himself mainly due to his injury. Concealing himself required a significant amount of energy, and he wouldn't be able to maintain it for much longer if he also had to use Immortal Qi on top of that in such a state.","In the end, the Immortal decided to throw away his defenses to focus solely on his attack power.","Yuan shook his head and said, \"No, I am not looking down on you. I thought you were human, hence why I even bothered to fight you. Now that I know you're a beast, I don't really have a reason to continue fighting you.\"","\"What kind of bullshit is that?! You disturbed my recovery and forced me to reveal myself! We're going to fight to death even if you don't want to!\" The Immortal shouted.","\"I never planned on backing out of our fight, anyway.\" Yuan smiled.","\"There won't be any fight! I am going to massacre you now!\" The Immortal roared before activating a technique using Immortal Qi instead of normal Qi.","\"Immortal White Lance!\"","The same technique from before was now multiple times stronger, and since they were created from Immortal Qi, Yuan would not be able to destroy them even using Dragon's Soul.","Furthermore, the Immortal Qi being exuded by the Immortal made it much more difficult for Yuan to move, and his entire body was screaming from pain. In fact, his muscles were being torn apart every passing second. He was essentially a sitting duck at this moment in time.","Seeing this, Kelan prepared to save Yuan.","However, despite his seeming perilous situation, Yuan did not panic.","\"Die, you monster!\" The Immortal gestured, causing hundreds of Immortal White Lances to rain upon Yuan.","Yet, Yuan refused to move, much less dodge the incoming attack.","\"Has he given up on living?! Fool!\"","Not daring to wait until it was too late, Kelan made his move, disappearing from his spot.","A split second later, Kelan appeared in front of Yuan, who was slightly surprised by this sudden intruder.","However, before Yuan could speak or take any action, Kelan released an overwhelming aura that far surpassed the Immortal and destroyed all of the Immortal's attacks with a mere flick of his arm, treating them like they were mere candle flickers.","The Immortal's entire body trembled in fear when he sensed Kelan's profound presence.","Unlike the Immortal, who had traversed to the Fourth Heaven illegally, Kelan received approval, so his cultivation wasn't as suppressed as the Immortal. However, the Immortal was sure he would not be this newcomer's opponent even if they had similar cultivation.","Ignoring the Immortal, Kelan turned to look at Yuan with a proud demeanor around him.","\"Why did you give up at such a crucial moment, Junior? Even if you are certain of your death, as a man, you should fight until your last breath. Who knows? Maybe a miracle could've happened.\"","Kelan expected Yuan to thank him for saving his life. Yet, Yuan had a frown on his face.","He removed the Celestial Visage so Kelan could see his frown and said coldly, \"Who said I gave up? And who the hell are you? Who permitted you to interrupt our fight?\"","\"Huh?\" Kelan muttered in a surprised tone, his expression puzzled."]},{"number":1569,"title":"Chapter 1569 Distraction","paragraphs":["1569 Distraction","Kelan was rendered speechless by Yuan's response, and after a moment of silence, he spoke, \"Junior, it's good to be confident in yourself, but you were clearly on the brink of death. If I hadn't saved you just now, you'd have become a human skewer.\"","\"Also, if you hadn't given up, why were you frozen just now? Any onlooker would've assumed you were giving up in that situation.\" Kelan said.","Yuan shook his head and sighed, \"While I appreciate your thoughtfulness, it was unnecessary and undermined my existence. Leave. I don't need your assistance.\"","\"You...\" Kelan's expression quickly turned angry. He couldn't believe he was being lectured by the very person he had just saved.","\"Is that so! Then you can go ahead and die here, you stubborn and arrogant little bastard!\" Kelan left the scene the very next moment.","However, Kelan didn't wholly leave and only pretended to do so. Even if Yuan refused his goodwill and shooed him away, he still had a duty to protect Yuan, and it was not only his promise to Elder Bai that compelled him to do so.","Yuan's talent was simply shocking and unlike anything he'd seen before, and that fact alone was worth his protection.","'Regardless of his character, he's a profound existence that will significantly benefit our Celestial Overlord in the future. However, he'll need to survive until then, and with his suicidal nature, it's not going to be easy keeping him alive.' Kelan sighed inwardly, feeling like an older brother trying to keep his younger siblings out of trouble even though he was hated by them.","Meanwhile, the Immortal was left speechless by what had just transpired.","'W-who the hell was that bastard just now?! I don't recognize him, and since he left without doing anything to me, it's safe to assume that he's not with the pursuers!' The Immortal swallowed nervously.","If Kelan had been with his pursuers, he would've never made it to the Fourth Heaven alive. That was just how vast the difference in their strength was. Immortals are prideful creatures, so for one to acknowledge their inferiority held great significance.","\"I apologize for that.\" Yuan suddenly said.","\"What?\" The Immortal stared at him with wide eyes.","\"That man's interruption. Although it was never my intention, he disturbed our battle. Go ahead and use that technique again. I can even wait for you to recover some of your energy.\" Yuan explained.","Not just the Immortal, but even Kelan was utterly speechless.","After a moment of silence, the Immortal began trembling, his face flushed red, turning into a tomato.","\"STOP MOCKING ME, YOU BASTARD! DO I REALLY APPEAR THAT PATHETIC TO YOU?!\"","With an enraged bellow, his aura skyrocketed.","Meanwhile, several individuals far away from the Purple Sea sensed the distinct aura of the Immortal's Qi.","\"It's the escapee!\"","\"Why are they releasing so much Immortal Qi?! Are they engaged in battle with another immortal?!\"","\"It must be the others! But why didn't they notify me?! They know that Immortal isn't someone they can handle alone!\"","The immortals chasing after the escaped immortal were puzzled when they were not notified, and when they contacted the others, they were shocked to learn that none of them were actually fighting the escaped immortal.","\"What? None of you are fighting the escapee?! Then what's with this immense Immortal Qi?! They wouldn't release so much Immortal Qi for no reason!\"","\"Maybe the escapee is trying to lure us into a trap.\"","\"Do you seriously believe that?\"","\"Whatever the escapee is attempting, we need to capture or kill them! Let's hurry up before they escape our grasp again!\"","These immortals immediately started soaring toward the Purple Sea.","At the same time, Bai Ning was just minutes away from reaching her destination.","Unlike Kelan, Yuan could sense her approaching presence from miles away. Not wanting to expose his identity so quickly, he wore the Celestial Visage again, hiding his face.","Just as Bai Ning arrived, the Immortal activated his technique again.","\"Immortal White Lance!\"","Thousands of white lances filled the sky, each exuding profound Immortal Qi.","Bai Ning was shocked by the scene, but when she noticed the masked man in the middle of the battlefield, her eyes fixed on him, and she was unable to look away.","\"It's him!\" she exclaimed in a bewildered voice.","Although he was wearing a different mask, she recognized him as the individual who bullied Bai Xutao and used that weird technique on her.","Bai Ning wanted to approach Yuan, but he was in a position where she could not enter, as she risked getting blown away with him by the Immortal.","\"DIE FOR ME, YOU HUMAN MORTAL!\"","The Immortal released his technique.","Kelan gritted his teeth as he watched Yuan being bombarded with Immortal Qi. He wanted to believe in Yuan, but his instincts acted before he could even think.","However, he was immediately halted by an unfathomable presence that surpassed even Senior Bai.","\"Who's there?!\" Kelan frantically looked around but couldn't sense anyone.","'To avoid my detection, they must be a God Ascension Realm expert! What the hell is going on right now?!' he cried inwardly.","\"Oh no! Junior!\"","The distraction rendered Kelan unable to save Yuan, his mind already racing to formulate excuses for when he would have to report Yuan's death to Senior Bai. Yet, Kelan's face filled with disbelief as he witnessed the unfolding events. What he saw defied all expectations and left him momentarily paralyzed in astonishment.","The Immortal's attacks landed with unerring precision, each strike tearing holes through Yuan's body. Yet, to the Immortal's astonishment, the grievous injuries Yuan sustained healed instantly, akin to a demon's heaven-defying regenerative abilities. It was as if the very laws of nature bent to keep Yuan whole.","[Progress: 15%]","[Progress: 17%]","[Progress: 20%]","The merging of his physiques, which had been progressing at a snail's pace, began to advance rapidly under the immense stress Yuan's body was enduring.","\"Just what the fuck are you?!?\" the Immortal shrieked out loud, his face twisted in anger, but his eyes showed a hint of fear."]},{"number":1570,"title":"Chapter 1570 Progress","paragraphs":["\"Why won't you just die?! Die already, you fucking monster!\" The Immortal relentlessly assaulted Yuan with Immortal Qi, but regardless of the countless wounds inflicted, Yuan would miraculously heal all injuries within half a second.","[Progress: 22%]","[Progress: 25%]","[Progress: 30%]","<Your understanding of Immortal Qi has significantly increased>","Not only was Yuan's physique rapidly merging, but his comprehension of Immortal Qi was also deepening merely by being immersed in it.","Yuan even closed his eyes and started cultivating.","This bewildered everyone watching.","\"What the hell is he? This is beyond the realm of talents and what humans can achieve...\" Kelan swallowed nervously at the ridiculous scene before him.","\"And his regenerating ability rivals that of a demon. Don't tell me he has demonic blood flowing through his veins?\"","The possibility that Yuan might be a demon filled Kelan with wariness and profound anxiety, knowing the immense implications it would have.","Meanwhile, Bai Ning had her jaw tightly clenched, her expression more irritated than shocked.","'He can fight someone over eight realms above his own strength!'","Bai Ning was irritated that Yuan, the very person who had humiliated the Heavenly White Tiger Clan by defeating Bai Xutao, possessed far more talent than she did. Despite being a prodigy capable of battling opponents nearly two entire realms above her own cultivation and being hailed as one of the top prodigies of their era, she was akin to an ordinary individual before Yuan's talents.","However, even with their differences, Bai Ning wanted to fight Yuan, and that feeling was boosted by her competitive nature.","[Progress: 85%]","[Progress: 88%]","[Progress: 93%]","As the Immortal increased the intensity of his attacks, Yuan's merging progress advanced even faster.","\"You will fall here even if it's the last thing I do!\" The Immortal bellowed as he exerted his maximum strength.","The pressure from his aura was so intense that it seemingly filled the entire Purple Sea, causing the surrounding islands to tremble violently.","The Immortal was exerting so much strength that he somehow broke through some of heaven's restrictions on his cultivation, causing his cultivation to enter Divine Emperor.","The Immortal's aura pierced the heavens.","\"IMMORTAL MIST GATHERING!\" The Immortal roared, creating a massive lance in the sky that rivaled the size of Yuan's God of War's Astral Arts.","\"Let's see if you can regenerate from a completely obliterated body!\" The Immortal laughed maniacally before launching the massive lance at Yuan.","\"Do you need my help?\" Zi Xuan's voice suddenly resounded.","\"No, I'll be fine.\"","\"Is that so? Then I'll go back to sleep.\" Zi Xuan calmly said.","The massive lance arrived in front of Yuan the following moment.","\"HA!\"","Yuan released a powerful roar as he brought forth every ounce of power within his body.","For the first time in a long time, Yuan was going beyond his limit.","<Your understanding of Immortal Qi has significantly increased>","A faint but noticeable amount of Immortal Qi exuded from Yuan's body.","\"Immortal Qi? Impossible!\" Kelan cried out loud.","\"No... it's weak and incomplete, but it's undeniably Immortal Qi! That arrogant bastard is already able to comprehend Immortal Qi?! He's not even in the Divine Realm, much less the Immortal Realm!\"","Most people start comprehending Immortal Qi at Immortal Ascension realm, and only when they fully comprehend Immortal Qi would one be able to enter the Immortal Realm as a Bronze Immortal.","However, Yuan, who was still a mortal with a Spirit King cultivation, was already showing signs of comprehending Immortal Qi. If the world knew such a genius existed, many powerhouses would try to recruit him or outright erase him if he rejected them.","In the next moment, the lance struck Yuan's body. Yet, instead of piercing through him as usual, it froze in place, as if suspended in time, barely penetrating the surface like a needle hanging by a thread.","\"What?!\" The Immortal was shocked by what he was witnessing.","Despite Yuan's Immortal Qi being incomplete, it was still powerful enough to barely hold back the Immortal's Qi. [Progress: 97%]","[Progress: 98%]","[Progress: 99%]","\"DIE ALREADY!!!\" The Immortal bellowed as he detonated the lance, causing a massive explosion that shook the Fourth Heaven.","Profound Immortal Qi erupted like a shockwave, generating tsunamis that surged in every direction.","\"Junior!\" Kelan's heart skipped a beat.","'Damn it! I was too absorbed in their fight and failed to protect the newcomer! The Celestial Overlord and Senior Bai will skin me alive once they find out!' Kelan cried inwardly, feeling a strong urge to bury himself in a hole and never emerge.","\"Fuck! Don't tell me he died just like that! I never even got the chance to have a rematch with him!\" Bai Ning gritted her teeth in frustration.","\"Hahaha! I did it! I finally killed that fucking cockroach!\" The Immortal laughed out loud.","At the same time, several more individuals appeared at the scene. They were the Immortal's pursuers, and they arrived shocked, as they'd witnessed the moments before Yuan was caught up in the explosion.","Meanwhile, after enduring the Immortal's explosion head-on, Yuan's body was obliterated, leaving behind only a few scattered cells. Yet, he did not receive the death notification.","[Progress: 100%]","<Congratulations, your Heaven Refining Physique has successfully merged with Golden Immortal Physique, transforming into Heaven Refining Immortal Physique>","<Congratulations on evolving your Physique! You have become the first Player to evolve your Physique!>","Yuan's obliterated body immediately began to repair itself. As his form regenerated fully, his Dantian also underwent a profound transformation.","The invisible wall that had been blocking his cultivation advancement past Spirit King was finally lifted, and Yuan could feel his cultivation inching toward the next realm.","\"I-impossible...\" The Immortal muttered in a dazed voice, his expression filled with despair.","\"N-not human... he cannot be human with that kind of regenerating ability! Don't tell me he's a demon?!\" The pursuers quickly came to this conclusion.","\"I'll be damned...\" Kelan's entire body trembled in excitement.","\"...\" Bai Ning remained silent, but her bewildered expression spoke clearer than any words could."]},{"number":1571,"title":"Chapter 1571 Heaven Refining Immortal Physique","paragraphs":["<You have acquired the title 'An Evolved Physique'>","<You have acquired the title 'Physique Merger'>","Yuan inspected his body after acquiring the Heaven Refining Immortal Physique. His body was incomparably stronger than before, whether in strength or durability. If his body couldn't handle the Immortal's attacks previously, his current body would have no problem shrugging them off.","The difference was akin to comparing dried mud to steel. There were also several other changes that occurred within his body, but he had no idea what they could be for the time being.","\"Don't move, you demon!\" A loud voice with a hint of terror suddenly resounded, snapping Yuan out of his daze.","He shifted his head to look at the person who'd just spoken—one of the pursuers.","\"What did you just call me?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow.","\"There's no use hiding it! That ridiculous regenerating ability is unique to demons!\" Yuan was speechless, but he didn't blame this individual for mistaking him for a demon. After all, he would've probably done the same if he were in that man's shoes, as his regenerating ability was acquired through Demon Cores, so the pursuers weren't wrong.","\"I understand your confusion, but rest assured, I am not a demon.\" Yuan calmly said.","\"Shut up! Do you think I'm stupid or something?!\"","The pursuers outright ignored the Immortal, whom they had been chasing for months, to focus on Yuan, who was a much bigger threat to the Nine Heavens than the escapee.","\"I don't think you're stupid... for now. If I were a demon, I would have horns and a crystal, wouldn't I?\" Yuan exposed his torso so show that he had no demon crystal on his body.","\"You're definitely taking me for a fool! High-ranking demons don't have horns and crystals! They look no different than humans!\" \"So you're suggesting that I am a Demon Emperor who looks no different than humans? How could a Demon Emperor be a mere Spirit King? And why would I bother to risk exposing myself to fight that immortal?\" Yuan asked.","The pursuer couldn't find a logical explanation immediately and momentarily became speechless.","\"You're obviously hiding your cultivation! There's no way a Spirit King could emit Immortal Qi! I don't know why you're fighting with the escapee, but that doesn't prove you're not a demon!\" One of the pursuers exclaimed.","\"That's right! You're a demon hiding in human skin!\" Another joined.","Seeing how the group of immortals prepared to kill him, Yuan sighed, \"You guys must be quite weak if it requires four of you to chase after a single escapee. Come, I'll play with you.\" The group of immortals immediately exploded with anger after being provoked by Yuan.","\"If we can't capture him, kill him!\"","\"Kill me? Even though I'm a demon? You should probably get the Demon Sealing Clan instead.\" Yuan laughed out loud.","The immortals' faces flushed red before surrounding him in a formation.","\"Golden Lotus Prison!\"","The four of them worked together to quickly create a powerful formation around Yuan. Although they were only Tier 5 Array Masters, they were able to create a Tier 6 formation in the blink of an eye together.","Yuan suddenly found himself entrapped inside a golden lotus that slowly drained his spiritual energy.","When Kelan saw this, he thought about intervening, but he wanted to see how Yuan would deal with this situation first. As long as Yuan's life wasn't in danger, he decided to remain as a spectator.","However, with Yuan's regenerating ability rivaling demons, Kelan was no longer worried that he might die.","The immortals, aware that their chances of killing Yuan were slim despite the disparity in their cultivation, resorted to using a formation specifically designed to capture entities as resilient as Yuan.","\"Do you want me to destroy the formation for you?\" Yu Ning, who had been silently watching this entire time, suddenly spoke.","\"No, it's fine. I want to test out my new physique.\" \"Okay...\"","Yuan suddenly closed his eyes and took a deep breath.","The very next moment, the prison around Yuan suddenly began breaking down, almost as if it were slowly being devoured by an invisible force.","\"W-what the fuck?!\"","\"The formation's losing energy!\"","\"That's impossible!\"","\"T-that demon bastard is absorbing the formation's Immortal Qi!\"","\"What?! How is he doing that?! Techniques are sealed within the Golden Lotus Formation!\"","\"It must be one of his demon abilities!\"","\"H-hey! Escapee! Help us kill this demon, and we'll give you freedom!\" One of the immortals turned to look at the escapee.","\"Are you serious? Even if I want to kill him, you saw for yourself that I am unable to do so.\" The Misty Fox said.","\"That's only if you're fighting alone! If the five of us work together, there's still a chance!\"","The Misty Fox couldn't reject the possibility of freedom and agreed to help the immortals.","\"The more the merrier.\" Yuan smiled.","<Your understanding of Immortal Qi has significantly increased!>","After consuming Immortal Qi directly, Yuan's understanding of Immortal Qi skyrocketed, causing the Immortal Qi he exuded to become more apparent and profound.","'This is the perfect opportunity for me to understand Immortal Qi.' Yuan found a reason to fight these immortals.","The five immortals, each restricted to the Divine King, began bombarding Yuan with techniques infused with Immortal Qi.","To Yuan, enduring these hits with his bare body felt like being struck with a sledgehammer. However, unlike before, it wasn't enough to destroy his body and merely bruise it.","<Your understanding of Immortal Qi has increased!>","Moreover, whenever their attacks struck Yuan, his Heaven Refining Immortal Physique would automatically absorb some of the Immortal Qi, weakening the force of their blows and strengthening his body even further.","Suddenly, Yuan's aura surged, and his Dantian expanded.","<You have absorbed enough Qi for a breakthrough!>","<You have met the requirements for a breakthrough!>","<You have reached First Level Spirit Emperor!>","Amid the battle, Yuan had a breakthrough and finally escaped Spirit King, becoming a Spirit Emperor!"]},{"number":1572,"title":"Chapter 1572 Spirit Emperor","paragraphs":["The moment Yuan's cultivation entered Spirit Emperor, his aura surged so much that the immortals thought he'd skipped several levels in his breakthrough.","\"This bastard had a breakthrough in the middle of a battle! What a fucking monster!\"","\"Wait... does that mean he was actually only a Spirit King...?\"","The realization that Yuan, merely a Spirit King, possessed the prowess to fight them struck quickly. Their faces filled with terror as the full implications of his power dawned on them.","\"W-we cannot let him live, or he'll become an immense threat to humanity later!\"","\"Kill him! Use everything you've got!\"","The immortals frantically attacked Yuan, viewing him as a looming calamity destined to destroy humanity in the future.","Meanwhile, seeing Yuan breakthrough snapped Bai Ning out of her daze, and she suddenly approached the battlefield.","\"Stop!\" she shouted, her voice filled with commanding authority.","\"Who the hell are you?!\"","\"Are you this demon's accomplice?!\"","The immortals immediately became even more nervous. If Bai Ning turned out to be another demon, they'd have no chance of killing them.","However, Bai Ning retrieved a white and black medallion before throwing it at one of the immortals.","\"That is my identity!\"","\"This is... the Heavenly White Tiger Clan's medallion? And this name... you must be the Heavenly White Tiger Goddess!\" \"Are you here to help us subjugate this demon?! Thank the heavens!\"","However, Bai Ning shook her head and said, \"No, but I want to fight him, so get out of my way.\"","\"W-what? I understand that you want to fight him, but why must you do it alone? He's a dangerous entity—a demon that terrorized our world and all living beings within!\" \"Do I really have to explain myself to you?\" Bai Ning narrowed her eyes at them.","\"...\"","The immortals exchanged nervous glances with each other. Bai Ning's status was simply too exalted for them to ignore, but it was not as though they could let her fight the demon alone.","If she died, they would be held responsible, hence their perplexed situation.","Seemingly aware of their predicament, Bai Ning said, \"Don't worry, even if I die, you won't be responsible.\"","Bai Ning no longer paid attention to the immortals and approached Yuan, who hovered there calmly.","Without an ounce of fear in her eyes, Bai Ning spoke, \"Yo. Do you remember me?\"","Yuan nodded, \"You're the one who interrupted my fight with Bai Xutao.\"","\"You call that a fight? You were straight bullying my brother.\" \"Do you know why I did what I did?\" Yuan then asked.","\"No, and I don't care. The only thing that matters to me is you attacked someone from my family.\"","\"So you won't care even if he slaughters an entire city of innocent people?\" Yuan asked, his voice carrying a hint of coldness.","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Bai Ning responded, \"He will atone for whatever crime he'd committed, just like how you'll be punished for attacking a member of the Heavenly White Tiger Clan.\"","\"Is that so? What if the Immortal Monarch were in my shoes? What would you do then?\"","Bai Ning was taken aback by his sudden mention of the Immortal Monarch.","\"How dare you utter his sacred name with your dirty mouth?! The Immortal Monarch would never be in your shoes in the first place!\"","\"Really? The world's a big and mysterious place. What if I turn out to be the real Immortal Monarch?\" Yuan teased.","\"Blasphemy!\" Bai Ning bellowed before suddenly transforming, her aura skyrocketing.","\"I couldn't kill you in the Third Heaven because of my restricted cultivation, but it's a different story up here! Let's see if you can repeat what you did last time!\" Bai Ning's aura surged all the way to the peak of Divine King, surpassing the other immortals' aura.","\"This lad is not bad...\" Kelan nodded in approval after sensing Bai Ning's powerful aura.","\"No matter how high your cultivation is, you'll never be able to defeat me.\" Yuan casually shook his head.","\"Shut up and fight me!\" Bai Ning shouted as she started her assault.","Yuan didn't move to purposefully test the strength of her first strike.","Sha!","Bai Ning used her bare hands—her claws—to strike. Imbued with powerful Immortal Qi, her claws were strong enough to cut through Yuan's body. However, the damage was only superficial, and it didn't take more than a second for it to recover fully. \"Not bad, I suppose.\" Yuan calmly commented.","\"Shut up and fight me seriously!\" Bai Ning shouted.","\"Are you actually using Bai Xutao as an excuse to fight me? All you need to do is ask nicely, you know.\"","Bai Ning responded with another powerful strike, its pressure powerful enough to cleave the Purple Sea.","Five red lines resembling sword cuts spread across Yuan's chest but disappeared in the blink of an eye.","Despite Bai Ning's relentless attack, Yuan remained still, seemingly unwilling to fight her.","\"FIGHT ME, DAMN IT!\" she roared, her aura surging even higher.","\"Not until you admit that you don't care about the punishment and are only using it as an excuse to fight me.\" Yuan casually shrugged.","\"Fuck you!\" Bai Ning continued launching powerful strikes at Yuan.","Several moments later, her most potent attack managed to slice his body in half, but it was pointless and just a waste of Immortal Qi if she couldn't kill him.","\"I'm waiting...\" Yuan yawned, positioning himself as if he were lazily lying on a couch before a television.","Yuan's unwillingness to fight and his blatant mockery infuriated Bai Ning.","\"Fuck! Fuck! Fuck!\"","Bai Ning stopped fighting for a moment and cursed out loud. \"I don't care about Bai Xutao or the punishment for attacking a member of our Heavenly White Tiger Clan! I just want to fight you!\" she exclaimed with her face flushed red.","\"That's more like it. Don't you feel better just from being honest with yourself?\" Yuan chuckled.","\"Fuck you! If you still refuse to fight me properly, I'll make you regret being born!\" she roared.","\"I am a man of my word...\" With Number One Under Heaven in his grasp, Yuan suddenly charged at Bai Ning.","Seeing this, Bai Ning prepared to confront him with a wide grin on her face."]},{"number":1573,"title":"Chapter 1573 Beyond Human Capabilities","paragraphs":["When Yuan swung Number One Under Heaven at her, Bai Ning prepared to confront it with her claws, which were sharper and more durable than even Mythic-grade treasures. However, moments before they clashed, her instincts kicked in, causing her to avoid the sword instead.","Sha!","A powerful sword light swung past Bai Ning's claw and struck the Purple Sea behind her, splitting it in half.","Although the sword light didn't touch her, its aura grazed her hand, and that was enough to cut through her skin.","Bai Ning swallowed nervously at this and cried inwardly, 'If I hadn't avoided his sword at the very last moment, my entire hand would've been cut off! I have never seen such a powerful Soul Weapon before!' Seeing Bai Ning's nervous expression, Yuan looked at Number One Under Heaven and showed a bittersweet smile, \"You're too powerful.\"","After pondering for a moment, he put away the sword and retrieved Dragon's Soul again.","\"What is the meaning of this? Are you looking down on me?\" Bai Ning's brows deeply furrowed.","\"I mean, it's not like I am trying to kill you.\" Yuan calmly said.","\"Do you really think you have what it takes to kill me?! You're thinking too highly of yourself just because you manage to fight with a few ordinary immortals! Today, I, Bai Ning, shall teach you what a prodigy is like!\" Bai Ning roared before charging at Yuan, releasing a relentless assault on him.","Yuan parried all her attacks, but the impact from her strikes was far stronger than those of all the immortals combined, enough to push him back.","'So it wasn't just his sword that contributed to his prowess! This bastard must have a unique physique that rivals demons!' Bai Ning gritted her teeth as she used all her power, which she rarely did.","Hours passed, but Bai Ning couldn't see any opportunity to defeat Yuan. He was akin to an unsurmountable wall—one that could regenerate any damage in the blink of an eye.","'Is he really a demon?!' Bai Ning began doubting whether he was actually a demon.","Although she had never fought or seen a demon before, she'd heard plenty of rumors about them, especially how they terrorized the world with their god-like healing abilities—the same one Yuan was displaying at this moment.","\"Are you really a demon?!\" Bai Ning asked without stopping the fight.","\"What do you think?\" Yuan casually responded.","\"I think your healing abilities are ridiculous!\" \"Thanks.\" \"I am not complimenting you! It's so ridiculous that it's not helping your case!\"","Yuan chuckled and said, \"People will believe what they want to believe regardless of the facts, even if it's right in their eyes. There's no need to try to convince these people, as I would only be wasting my breath.\"","\"You will regret this in the future!\"","\"Are you worried about me? If so, thanks.\" Yuan chuckled.","\"Shut up!\"","Several more hours later, Bai Ning ran out of spiritual energy. Usually, she'd be able to fight for months, if not years, without exhausting her spiritual energy, but she had to use a tremendous amount of spiritual energy just to hurt Yuan.","Meanwhile, Yuan was still full of energy from absorbing her attacks, transforming it into his own energy.","\"How... are you... still so full of energy?!\" Bai Ning was in disbelief.","\"I just am. Anyway, it's been fun, but I have other things to do.\"","\"Where do you think you're going?!\" One of the immortals shouted at him.","Yuan fell silent and glanced at him through his mask.","After a moment of silence, Yuan suddenly withdrew Number One Under Heaven and charged at the immortal with his movement technique.","[Immortal Rendering Sword Strike!]","The immortal was caught off guard by Yuan's surprise attack and failed to react in time before being sliced in half.","However, the immortal didn't die and managed to survive with just his soul. Yet, Yuan swung his sword again, using nothing but his Enhanced Sword Aura.","\"Nooo!\"","The immortal cried out loud, his voice filled with fear.","Unfortunately, Yuan didn't spare another thought before cutting down his soul, killing him entirely.","Ding!","<You have achieved an impossible feat by defeating a Cultivator that was at least nine realms above you!>","<You have acquired the title 'Beyond Human Capabilities>","[Beyond Human Capabilities: When fighting a Cultivator, your base stats will be boosted by 100%]","[Defeat a Cultivator who is at least nine realms above you without using Heaven's Supremacy]","[Completed]","With two of the most challenging tasks completed, Yuan felt like he was making progress for Heaven's Supremacy.","\"What the fuck have he done?!\" Kelan was greatly shocked by Yuan's actions.","In fact, nobody there expected Yuan to suddenly kill one of the immortals there.","\"YOU SON OF A BITCH!\" The other immortals quickly reacted to the death of their companion, their faces flushed with anger. Yet, none of them dared to attack Yuan.","\"You will regret this, you damn demon!\"","Instead of fighting him, the immortals turned around and ran away.","As for the Misty Fox, he also ran away. Kelan appeared shortly after with a deep frown on his face.","\"You... why did you do that?\" he asked.","Yuan looked at him and calmly responded, \"Why not?\"","\"That man you killed belonged to the Nine Heavens Law and Order! Not only do they oversee the Nine Heavens Eternal Grotto, but they're also responsible for keeping order in the Nine Heavens! Their influence is second to the Celestial Emperor! And you just killed one of them!\" \"Is that so? I got unlucky, I guess.\"","\"...\"","Kelan suddenly turned to look at Bai Ning and said, \"Can you please leave us alone?\"","\"And who the hell are you to command me?\" Bai Ning frowned.","Kelan's body suddenly released an oppressive aura that filled the entire Purple Sea.","\"Please leave... while I am still asking nicely.\" \"...\" Bai Ning narrowed her eyes at him.","After a moment of silence, she turned to look at Yuan and spoke, \"This isn't over. I'll defeat you the next time we meet!\"","Bai Ning left the scene shortly after, leaving Yuan and Kelan alone in the middle of the Purple Sea."]},{"number":1574,"title":"Chapter 1574 Nine Heavens Law and Order","paragraphs":["Once they were finally alone, Kelan raised his hand and showed his faction's symbol, as long as his rank.","Yuan's curiosity was piqued at the sight of Kelan's symbol and rank. He raised an eyebrow and inquired, \"What brings a high-ranking figure like you to the Fourth Heaven? I doubt it's a simple task like catching an escaped immortal.\"","Yuan pretended not to be part of the Celestial Overlord to see Kelan's reaction.","\"There's no need to be on alert. My name is Kelan, and Senior Bai asked me to watch over you because he was worried that your fight with the immortal might go awry.\"","\"Oh, is that so? I apologize if I had offended you in any way before, Senior.\" Yuan's attitude suddenly changed, becoming more respectable.","This dumbfounded Kelan.","'The way he treats his friends and foes are so vastly different. Even if I am someone slightly suspicious, he might not hesitate to cut me down.' Kelan thought to himself.","\"Anyway, even though nothing happened to you, and you even managed to slay an immortal—albeit the wrong one—I must apologize for failing to save your life multiple times due to how absorbed I was in your fight.\"","\"Your fight was truly mesmerizing and awe-inspiring. Unfortunately, you ended up killing someone you shouldn't have, and you even made it seem like you're a demon... or are you actually one?\" Kelan inquired, seemingly unclear on his identity.","Yuan smiled and said, \"Don't worry, I am definitely human.\"","Kelan sighed in relief and said, \"Thank the heavens. You would've made things really difficult for us if you were a demon. With that said, you'll probably still be hunted by the Nine Heavens Law and Order for killing their member, and rumors about you being a demon will spread.\"","\"Your healing abilities that rival a demon will concern many people, and they might treat you like a real demon, even if you're a human. However, the Celestial Overlords will do everything they can to protect you.\"","However, Yuan shook his head and said, \"Don't worry, I never intended to cause trouble for the Celestial Overlords. Even if they want to find me, they don't know my real identity yet, so they'll be chasing a phantom for a while.\"","\"You're unfathomably bold... Nobody could be as calm as you if they knew they were being hunted by the Nine Heavens Law and Order...\"","Yuan shrugged and said, \"Anyway, since I am safe, does that mean you'll return to the upper heavens now?\"","\"No, I'll stick around a little longer. After all, it's been so long since I visited the lower heavens. I also want to know more about you, Junior. And once you recover from your fight, let's have a spar.\"","Yuan nodded, \"Alright.\"","\"Then I'll see you later.\" Kelan left the scene shortly after, returning to Senior Bai to notify him of their situation.","Yuan returned to the Pavilion of Knowledge.","\"Yuan! You're okay!\" Xi Meili's face immediately brightened after seeing his return.","\"I told you I'd be fine.\" Yuan smiled.","\"How was it? Did you kill the immortal?\" she asked.","\"No, he got away, but I did kill an immortal.\" \"What...?\" Xi Meili raised her eyebrows in a puzzled manner.","\"It's a bit complicated, but this is what happened...\"","Yuan recalled the events that had occurred during his battle.","\"Heavens... what a mess...\" Xi Meili's eyes were wide open by the end.","Meanwhile, Kelan requested an urgent audience with Senior Bai.","When Senior Bai received this urgent request, his eyebrows rose.","Sometime later, he met up with Kelan, who was waiting for him inside his world.","\"Senior.\" Kelan respectfully bowed to him.","\"What's the matter? To request an urgent audience, did something happen to Yuan?\" Senior Bai went straight to the point.","Kelan nodded with a serious expression and said, \"A lot happened, so sit back and prepare yourself.\"","Senior Bai immediately swallowed nervously.","\"I watched our Junior fight the escaped immortal. It was quite something. He exceeded my expectations in every metric and more. This is how it went...\"","While Kelan recalled everything he had witnessed to Senior Bai, the same thing was happening elsewhere with the group of immortals that had confronted Yuan.","\"It's a demon, I tell you! We must contact the Demon Sealing Clan and the Demon Sealing Grotto as soon as possible!\"","\"This demon was unlike anything I've seen or heard! He wielded a sword and spear and had the aura of a beast!\"","\"He was only a Spirit King, but he could use Enhanced Sword Aura and fight several Divine Kings simultaneously!\"","The leader of Nine Heavens Law and Order listened to the information with a confused and bewildered look on his face.","\"A Spirit King that can fight an immortal with their cultivation suppressed to Divine King? Has demon-like regenerating ability? What kind of fucking creature are you guys making up? Did you guys get hit in the head too hard when trying to capture the escapee?\" The leader couldn't believe what he was hearing. This entity sounded like something that wouldn't exist even in exaggerated fiction.","\"This monster is real!\" The immortals insisted.","The leader sighed, \"Alright, I'll contact the Demon Sealing Clan and the Demon Sealing Grotto. Tell me everything that happened.\"","A few hours later, the leader of Nine Heavens Law and Order visited the Demon Sealing Faction's headquarters and requested an audience with Qian Chu, the current leader of the Demon Sealing Faction.","\"It's been a while, Demon Sealer Qian.\" Qian Chu casually nodded and said, \"I was told you have information on a powerful demon?\"","\"Unfortunately. My faction members encountered this demon in the Fourth Heaven while chasing after one of the Nine Heavens Eternal Grotto escapees. With that said, I am not certain this information is trustworthy. You'll understand what I mean in a bit.\"","\"A demon in the Fourth Heaven? This would be troublesome if true.\" Qian Chu muttered.","\"Alright, let's hear it. Tell me everything you know about this demon.\""]},{"number":1575,"title":"Chapter 1575 Unknown Demon","paragraphs":["The leader of Nine Heavens Law and Order began recalling what his subordinates told him with a somewhat stiff expression, almost as if he couldn't believe what he was uttering.","\"This demon was only a Spirit King when they initially encountered it but had a breakthrough toward the end, reaching Spirit Emperor.\"","\"However, even before reaching Spirit Emperor, this demon could fight with the escapee, who was restricted to the Divine King realm, even overpower them to a certain extent.\"","\"Once this demon reached Spirit Emperor, it was able to fight five Divine Kings simultaneously, even killing one of our members.\"","\"This demon wielded two different weapons, a sword and a spear, being exceptionally proficient with the sword—to the point where he could use Enhanced Sword Aura. Moreover, both of these weapons were Soul Weapons.\"","\"This demon's regenerating ability is also no joke, being able to recover within seconds after having their entire body annihilated.\"","\"Not only did they have a ridiculously fast regenerating speed, their body was also incredibly durable.\"","\"This demon wore a mask, but it had no visible horns or unique skin color, a common trait amongst demons. Furthermore, it had the aura of a beast.\"","\"...\" Qian Chu listened to the information of this potential demon with raised eyebrows.","He'd studied and encountered more than anyone within the Demon Sealing Clan, yet he'd never encountered a demon that could wield Soul Weapons, much less two.","While demons are naturally powerful and could fight humans with higher cultivation than itself, not even a Demon Emperor could fight someone eight realms stronger, let alone five at once.","The most ridiculous claim about this demon was that it could use Enhanced Sword Aura. Demons specialized in blood techniques and their own bodies, and there had never been a record of a demon using Sword Aura, much less Enhanced Sword Aura.","If Qian Chu had to be honest, he would outright refute these claims. However, there was no reason for the Nine Heavens Law and Order to fabricate such information, especially since their leader had personally shown up to share it. The details were simply too elaborate to be a joke.","\"So, what do you think? Ridiculous, right?\" The Nine Heavens Law and Order leader said with an embarrassed face.","\"However, I have verified the information myself. My members have no reason to lie about this, and they looked genuinely shaken by their encounter with this demon.\"","Qian Chu quickly replied, \"I would be lying if I said that I don't doubt such information, but if a demon with this sort of capabilities were to truly exist, our world would definitely be plunged into another chaotic era—perhaps one that's even more chaotic than the last one.\"","The Nine Heavens Law and Order leader swallowed nervously after hearing such words, and he said, \"Regardless of if this entity is a demon or a ghost, we must find it and ensure that such a thing won't happen.\"","Qian Chu nodded and said, \"I will have all of my Supreme Demon Sealers and Master Demon Sealers look into this demon.\"","\"Thank you! I will also contact the Demon Sealing Grotto so we can work together. The sooner we deal with this threat, the better!\"","Although the leader knew these two powers rarely collaborated and, more often than not, clashed with each other, they were not in a position to be picky. If this demon turned out to be the real deal, they might have another war with demons.","Qian Chu didn't object to the leader's idea to involve the Demon Sealing Grotto, knowing they would inevitably learn of the situation and intervene, regardless of the Demon Sealing Clan's stance.","The Nine Heavens Law and Order leader didn't linger and immediately went to the Demon Sealing Grotto.","Qian Chu also summoned all of the Supreme Demon Sealers and Master Demon Sealers to an urgent meeting, something that has not happened since he became the leader of the Demon Sealing Clan.","The demon sealers were taken aback by the sudden summoning. Filled with a mix of anticipation and a touch of dread, they swiftly assembled at the headquarters.","At the meeting, Qian Chu revealed the situation to the demon sealers, who responded with skepticism rather than shock or fear. \"I know what you're all thinking, but the leader of the Nine Heavens Law and Order personally delivered this information to me. Regardless if this entity is a demon or something else, it raises too many concerns and must be looked into.\"","\"Do we have a description of this demon?\" Someone asked.","Qian Chu retrieved a large scroll and revealed a painting of Yuan on it.","\"This was created by those who encountered the demon. It has all of the details they could recall. Study it and memorize it.\"","While the Demon Sealing Clan was having their meeting, the Demon Sealing Grotto was also preparing to hunt this demon. After hearing how ridiculously capable this demon was, they decided to make hunting it their number one priority.","Over the next few days, hundreds of powerful demon sealers would be sent to the Fourth Heaven.","Meanwhile, Senior Bai had trouble standing once Kelan recalled everything to him.","\"Dear heavens... are you sure you weren't hallucinating? Yuan only became a cultivator a few years ago... How in heaven's name is he already fighting immortals? Even if their cultivation was suppressed, their experience should've made an insurmountable difference. Or are you telling me that he'd managed to acquire what others need tens of thousands of years to learn in just several years? Do such terrifying talents truly exist in this world?\"","\"Trust me, I know how you feel, and I witnessed it first-hand. He's the real deal—a real monster.\" Kelan sighed.","He continued, \"What should we do now? Although the Nine Heavens Law and Order aren't aware of his identity now, they eventually will.\"","Senior Bai pondered for many minutes with a serious expression on his face before speaking, \"I'll seek guidance from the Celestial Overlord. Don't utter a word of this to anyone else before I return.\"","\"Naturally.\" Kelan nodded."]},{"number":1576,"title":"Chapter 1576 Leaving the Pavilion of Knowledge","paragraphs":["After he left, Senior Bai immediately sought an audience with Xu Jiaqi. Once they met, Senior Bai informed her of everything Yuan had done.","\"He's already capable of fighting Divine Kings despite being only a Spirit King? I mocked him for his slow cultivation speed not long ago...\" Xu Jiaqi wore an astonished expression on her beautiful face, something that rarely happened.","\"Moreover, they're not ordinary Divine Kings, but real immortals with vast experience.\" Senior Bai sighed.","He continued, \"Anyway, his monstrous talent is one thing. Killing a member of the Nine Heavens Law and Order is another. I'm afraid they might give him—us trouble in the future.\"","\"About that... the Nine Heavens Law and Order have already acted.\" Xu Jiaqi suddenly said.","\"What?\" Senior Bai's eyes widened at this new information.","\"The leader has already contacted the Demon Sealing Clan and Demon Sealing Grotto, and these two powerhouses have dispatched their experts,\" Xu Jiaqi explained.","\"Isn't that really bad? What should we do?\" Senior Bai asked.","Xu Jiaqi pondered for a moment before speaking, \"We won't do anything until we need to. Let's just see where this goes.\"","\"Are you sure? What if it's already too late by then?\"","\"Are you still underestimating Yuan after all this? He won't go down so easily, and we'll have more than enough time to react. Kelan will be with him, as well, no?\"","Senior Bai nodded, \"Kelan wishes to remain in the lower heavens a little longer.\"","\"Permission granted. Make it his mission to protect Yuan, too. However, don't spoil him. Only act when absolutely necessary.\" Xu Jiaqi said.","\"I understand.\"","\"We also have a member within the Demon Sealing Clan. I'll notify him of the situation.\" Xu Jiaqi added.","Senior Bai nodded.","After talking a little longer, Senior Bai returned to Kelan to pass Xu Jiaqi's decision to him.","Meanwhile, the Nine Heavens went into turmoil after news that the Demon Sealing Clan and the Demon Sealing Grotto had dispatched most of their experts in some kind of expedition.","\"Fuck, are we going to war with demons again?\"","\"No, they are looking for a single demon.\"","\"What? They dispatched so many people for a single demon? Did they find the Demon Emperor that escaped previously?\"","\"Apparently, this one is even more dangerous.\"","\"How long has it been since the Demon Sealing Clan's been this active?\"","\"It's been thousands of years... Unfortunately, their activity isn't something to be celebrated but dreaded.\"","Somewhere in the Demon Sealing Grand Library, a beautiful woman sat before a scroll with a ponderous face.","\"I wonder how the founder's doing... Hopefully, I'll get to see him again soon.\" Yan Hara muttered to herself as she stared at the scroll with the demon's description.","As a Master Demon Sealer, she was also dispatched to the lower heavens.","Meanwhile, Yuan and Xi Meili spent several more hours at the Pavilion of Knowledge before leaving.","\"Are you leaving already?\" Xuan Kun asked them when he noticed them exiting the room.","\"Yes, we've finished reading all of the materials.\" Yuan nodded.","\"I see... I hope it was helpful to you.\"","\"It was. I learned some new things about the Immortal Monarch and his companions—mostly about the Nine Divine Supremes.\"","\"If you ever need information on anything, don't hesitate to visit our Pavilion of Knowledge. Here is our medallion. There are other 'Pavilion of Knowledge' in other places with different names, but they all serve the same purpose. Our Pavilion of Knowledge happens to be the first one to be founded.\" Xuan Kun handed him a purple medallion with an image of a pavilion and the word 'Knowledge' engraved into it.","\"Thank you.\" Yuan accepted the medallion and tossed it into his spatial ring.","Xuan Kun shook his head and said, \"No, I should be thanking you. Because of you, we know the Immortal Monarch is still alive out there somewhere. You have no idea how much this means to me—to many beast clans in the Nine Heavens.\" \"What does it mean?\" Xi Meili asked out of curioisty.","\"Well, for starters, there will be a massive movement to find the Immortal Monarch soon.\" Xuan Kun revealed with a serious face.","Yuan raised an eyebrow and inquired, \"And what will they do once they find him? The Immortal Monarch's era ended long ago.\"","\"The Immortal Monarch's era may have ended, but some—many still revere him. He is akin to their god—a being above humans and beasts. His return will have unfathomable significance that I cannot even begin to comprehend.\" Xuan Kun spoke with a dazed look on his face.","\"...\" Yuan didn't know how to react to that and remained silent.","As they made their way downstairs, their presence caught Bai Ning's attention, who also appeared to be leaving.","\"Where are you going after this?\" Bai Ning asked him.","\"I don't know.\" He shrugged.","\"What about you?\"","\"I have to return to my family temporarily to report some things. Did you not notice the disturbance from earlier?\" she asked with a raised eyebrow.","\"I felt many powerful ripples, but I am not the type to stick my nose in other's business.\" Yuan replied with a smile.","\"Good on you. It was a mess out there.\" Bai Ning sighed.","\"Oh? What happened?\" he asked with a curious face.","\"A fight between immortals and some crazy bastard—the same bastard that beat my brother.\" Bai Ning clenched her fist as she recalled him.","\"The masked individual? He was there? Did you avenge your brother?\" Yuan asked with a worried face.","Bai Ning merely sighed at his question, her expression darkening with every passing moment.","\"I see...\" Yuan wore a look of understanding and didn't inquire further.","\"Well, I hope you'll get to avenge your brother next time.\"","She vigoriously nodded, \"I won't let him escape a third time!\"","\"Then I'll see you later.\"","After bowing to each other, Yuan left the Pavilion of Knowledge with Xi Meili, who tried hiding her face by looking away from Bai Ning.","Bai Ning stared at Xi Meili's back as she walked to the exit.","'She looks a little familiar... but from where?' she wondered inwardly."]},{"number":1577,"title":"Chapter 1577 A Hundred Million","paragraphs":["Once Yuan and Xi Meili left the Pavilion of Knowledge, they disappeared into the Purple Sea. Bai Ning left shortly after and returned to her clan in the upper heavens to update them on the situation.","\"Where are we going now?\" Xi Meili asked Yuan as they soared across the Purple Sea.","\"A place that will allow me to kill a lot of magical beasts,\" he calmly said.","\"Why?\" Xi Meili raised an eyebrow.","Although divine beasts and magical beasts are beasts, magical beasts are typically simpleminded and instinct-driven animals mutated through spiritual energy, so divine beasts don't feel anything even if magical beasts are slaughtered. In fact, divine beasts often slaughter and consume magical beasts, which is akin to humans cultivating with spirit stones and monster cores.","\"I need to kill a hundred million entities...\" he sighed.","\"A hundred million?!\" Xi Meili's jaw dropped at this astonishing number that would take years of constant grinding.","\"I would love to ask why you'd need to kill so many, but I'm a little afraid to do so...\" Xi Meili swallowed nervously.","Yuan chuckled and said, \"You just asked. Anyway, it's a quest—something I need to do to become stronger.\"","\"You're already powerful enough to kill immortals. I cannot imagine how much more powerful you can become.\" \"No, I am not powerful enough to kill immortals. I only managed to kill that one because his cultivation was restricted. If I had to fight him at full power, he'd easily kill me.\" Yuan shook his head at reality.","\"Still, I don't think anyone else out there can boast of defeating someone nine realms above their own strength.\"","\"With so many experts from the upper heavens showing up, I will need to become strong—much stronger if I want to protect you and everyone.\" A glint of determination flickered within Yuan's eyes.","\"We could've asked Xuan Kun, but we had already left the Pavilion of Knowledge.\" Xi Meili then said.","\"It's fine. I intend to return to the others first. We can figure out the rest afterward.\" After returning to the Cultivators' Haven, where Meixiu and the others are in seclusion, Yuan said to Xi Meili, \"You can return to training if you want. I'll be away for a few days.\" \"I've had enough training for now. I'll take a look around the city while I wait for your return,\" she said.","Yuan nodded, \"Stay safe.\"","She chuckled, \"Don't worry, I doubt many Bai Xutao are out there.\" Yuan logged off the next moment.","Once he returned to Earth, Yuan went to relax inside the bathroom by soaking in medicine. Even though the medicine no longer had any effect on his body, it still felt better than an ordinary hot bath.","After getting out of the bathroom, Yuan noticed a card placed on the desk beside the bed.","He picked it up and read its contents.","[Chairman Lee has contacted us on... The Great Battlefield has finished with its renovations and will resume Faction Wars soon. Our Faction War with Fiery Garden of Hell has been scheduled.]","\"Two days ago, huh? Luckily, I finished my business in Cultivation Online earlier, or I would've missed the Faction War,\" he mumbled to himself.","The Demon Sealing Faction and Fiery Garden of Hell was scheduled to begin in three days.","He went to the training grounds to see if anyone was there, but it was empty.","Everyone was busy with their training in Cultivation Online.","With nothing else to do, Yuan went to the balcony and started playing the zither to pass the time.","A few hours later, Meifeng knocked on the door.","\"You can enter.\"","Meifeng walked straight to the balcony and said, \"You saw the note, right?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Do you really intend to fight the Faction War alone?\"","\"Yes, but I'll need you there to be the ruler,\" he calmly nodded.","\"Of course, I'll be there.\"","\"I'll make my way to the Eternal Lotuses now. I'll see you at the Great Battlefield.\"","Sometime later, Yuan disappeared into the clouds, speeding toward the Eternal Lotuses' headquarters.","When he arrived, the guards at the entrance instantly recognized him and said, \"Our leader is expecting your arrival, Player Yuan.\" Yuan followed one of them inside and was led directly to Bai Lianhua's room.","\"Welcome, Yuan. I've been anticipating your match since Miss Meifeng told me about it two days ago.\" Bai Lianhua greeted him with a bright and beautiful smile.","\"If I was any slower with my business in Cultivation Online, I would've missed it and disappointed you.\" Yuan smiled.","\"But you didn't. Anyway, Yu Rou is in her room.\"","Yuan nodded.","\"Ah, before you go to her, I'd like to thank you again for all your help. The resources you've given us greatly benefited every member of our faction, and our faction's prowess skyrocketed in a short time.\" \"That was the purpose to begin with. Maybe you'll be able to get your revenge on the Fiery Locust Swarm soon.\"","Bai Lianhua's eyebrows suddenly raised, and she said, \"Unfortunately, that may no longer be possible, as the Fiery Locust Swarm had been disbanded after their rank was stripped and their leader and a majority of their members had been banned from participating in further Faction Wars for using drugs during their match with the Demon Sealing Faction.\"","\"Oh, right. I forgot they did something like that.\" Yuan chuckled.","\"Fiery Queen and her faction also faced ridicule since the Fiery Locust Swarn was under them.\" Bai Lianhua added.","\"So they must be extra pissed off right now. This is great. It'll make our match even more entertaining.\"","Yuan left to meet with Yu Rou shortly after.","The following day, Yuan traveled to the Great Battlefield with Yu Rou and Bai Lianhua.","When he arrived, Meifeng was already waiting for him—alongside the other members of the Demon Sealing Faction. This time, every member was present. However, none of them would be participating in the Faction War and were there as mere spectators."]},{"number":1578,"title":"Chapter 1578 Fighting the Fiery Garden of Hell","paragraphs":["\"I was really hoping you didn't show up so we could have some fun,\" Wang Ming remarked as Yuan and his group arrived.","\"Sorry, but I really need to do this alone,\" Yuan said with an apologetic smile.","\"It's fine, but we have the next one!\"","\"Of course.\"","As they made their way to the arena, their group drew the attention of everyone they passed, like a group of celebrities.","\"Look! The Demon Sealing Faction is finally here!\"","\"It looks like their entire faction will be present for this Faction War!\"","\"That's only natural. They're against the Fiery Garden of Hell, after all. Even Player Yuan won't be able to fight so many players alone.\" \"Who knows? With the new changes, anything's possible.\"","\"No, it'll definitely be much more difficult for Player Yuan if everyone can use deadly techniques.\"","\"I'm sure Player Yuan has some ridiculously powerful attacks that can wipe out thousands of players in the blink of an eye.\"","\"Even if that's the case, I doubt he would be able to use those techniques too much before running out of Qi.\"","The people speculated and debated on their Faction War, unaware that Yuan was planning to fight the Fiery Garden of Hell alone.","Meanwhile, the Fiery Garden of Hell was already gathering inside the new and improved arena.","The arena was expanded several times its original size, and hazardous areas, such as a river of real lava and deadly traps, were spread throughout it.","The arena itself could easily accommodate ten million players at once, so there was plenty of room for even the largest factions to go wild.","Due to the formation that prevents death and serious injuries, the technique evaluation was no longer required, making Faction Wars more accessible and exciting.","A record number of people showed up to spectate the Faction War between the Demon Sealing Faction and the Fiery Garden of Hell, not to mention the number of people watching from home and other places.","At this moment, more than half of the world tuned in to watch the Faction War—to see how the Demon Sealing Faction would deal with the Fiery Garden of Hell and its impressive number of players.","\"I've been waiting for you, Yuan!\" Chairman Lee's face brightened like a lightbulb after seeing Yuan and the rest of the Demon Sealing Faction.","\"Do I have to do anything before we can start the Faction War?\" Yuan asked.","\"No, we can start once it's time.\" Yuan nodded and said, \"Then I'll make my way to the arena.\"","\"Good luck, brother.\" Yu Rou said to him.","The others followed, but Chairman Lee's eyebrows raised when the Demon Sealing Faction also started saying it.","Seeing Chairman Lee's puzzled face, Wang Ming said, \"Only Yuan will be participating in the Faction War. We're just here as spectators.\"","\"W-what?! You intend on fighting the Fiery Garden of Hell alone?! All 600,000 of them?!\" Chairman Lee's eyes widened with shock as he asked Yuan.","\"Yes, I do.\" Yuan calmly acknowledged.","\"B-but... that's...\" Chairman Lee was at a loss for words. He couldn't imagine how someone could fight so many people at once—not even someone like Yuan.","Yuan smiled and said, \"There's a reason I created the formation. Of course, I wanted to make Faction Wars safer for everyone, but it's also so I can fight with fewer restrictions.\"","\"...\"","Chairman Lee still couldn't find any words.","Yuan continued walking to the exit, quickly disappearing from the waiting room. Meifeng followed him since she had to be the ruler.","\"He's serious?\" Chairman Lee uttered in a dazed voice.","\"He never jokes around in these sorts of situations.\" Wang Ming chuckled.","Sometime later, Yuan appeared in the arena. When the spectators saw this, the entire stadium erupted with cheering.","However, the cheering quickly quieted once the spectators realized only two members from the Demon Sealing Faction were present.","\"Huh? Where's the rest of the members?\" Someone asked out loud.","\"Maybe they couldn't show up, just like the last Faction War?\"","\"That's impossible. I saw the entire Demon Sealing Faction at the airport. They're definitely here.\"","\"So where the hell are they? The match's about to begin in ten minutes.\"","\"L-look over there! The rest of the Demon Sealing Faction members are in the spectator's area!\" Someone suddenly shouted, his arm pointed at a specific location in the stadium meant for VIPs.","\"No way... they're here as spectators? Does this mean Player Yuan wants to fight the Fiery Garden of Hell alone?! That's crazy!\"","\"Hahaha! His arrogance knows no bounds!\"","\"Are the Fiery Garden of Hell aware of this?\"","\"We'll find out soon.\"","Yuan, who showed up alone in the arena to face the Fiery Garden of Hell, shocked every spectator watching. Nobody knew what he was trying to achieve or what his thought process was, but many people were mad.","\"Fuck! I can't believe I woke up early for this shit!\"","\"I can't believe I actually bet money on the Demon Sealing Faction's victory! What was I thinking?!\"","After realizing that Yuan planned to fight the Fiery Garden of Hell alone, many people became desperate. They gambled the rest of their money on the Fiery Garden of Hell's victory, hoping to recoup some of their losses.","Meanwhile, Fiery Queen had someone scout the arena using a scouting technique. \"What? Only Player Yuan is on the field, excluding the ruler?\" Fiery Queen couldn't believe what she was hearing and had the scouter do it again.","Yet, the scout reconfirmed that Yuan was alone.","\"That bastard actually dares to face us alone? How much does he intend to look down on me?!\" Fiery Queen gritted her teeth in anger instead of feeling relieved that he was alone.","Five minutes before the match, a familiar voice resounded through the broadcasting speakers.","\"Hello, everyone! It's me, Yan Xiaoxiao, and I will be the commentator for this Faction War!\"","\"Before we start, I would like to announce that the highly anticipated 'Demon Sealing Faction Interview' will be released after this Faction War is concluded, so stay tuned for that!\""]},{"number":1579,"title":"Chapter 1579 A Display of Overwhelming Prowess","paragraphs":["Chapter 1579 A Display of Overwhelming Prowess","\"Now then, as you can see for yourself, it appears that Player Yuan intends to fight the Fiery Garden of Hell by himself! That's one to 600,000 players! What kind of secret trick does he have up his sleeves to have so much confidence?!\" Yan Xiaoxiao spoke with excitement. She was one of the very few people who weren't angry at Yuan and even believed in him.","\"Before we begin the match, allow me to give you all a brief explanation of the new rules.\"","\"Due to the generosity of a profound expert in formations, the Great Battlefield has gone through several renovations that will enhance our players' experience and our entertainment!\"","\"With this formation, we will no longer have to worry about accidental deaths, allowing the players to truly go all out with their powerful techniques!\"","\"However! While players won't die even if a sharp sword strikes their neck, they will still feel some of the pain, so it's not completely risk-free!\"","\"Although players can no longer die, they will still carry a badge that represents their life, and if broken, they will be disqualified. A player will also be disqualified if they are knocked unconscious, which may happen if they suffer enough damage.\"","\"We will now briefly demonstrate the formation's functions.\" Two individuals appeared inside the arena and, before hundreds of millions of spectators, began hacking their sharp swords at each other's bare bodies without any hesitation or holding back.","Many powerful blows later, not a single life-threatening injury could be seen on their body. Besides a few bruises, they looked otherwise completely fine.","\"As you just witnessed, this formation is very reliable!\" Yan Xiaoxiao commented as the two demonstrators left the arena.","The crowd cheered loudly, causing the entire stadium to tremble.","Sometime later, Yan Xiaoxiao received word that the Faction War would officially begin.","\"Alright, you've all been waiting for long enough! The Faction War between Demon Sealing Faction— Player Yuan and Fiery Garden of Hell will begin now!\"","A flare shot straight into the sky before exploding into a blue mist, signifying the start of the Faction War.","Once Fiery Queen saw this, she pointed toward the direction of Yuan's castle and shouted in a commanding voice, \"Teach that arrogant bastard what happens when he underestimates us, the Fiery Garden of Hell!\"","However, before the 600,000 members of the Fiery Garden of Hell could go anywhere, they halted their advancement and stared at the massive figure in the distance with bewildered expressions.","Meanwhile, Yuan activated God of War's Astral Arts the moment the match began.","\"W-what the fuck is that?! It's huge!\"","\"A giant! It's a giant!\"","The spectators watched with wide eyes and mouths as Yuan controlled the avatar, sweeping the arena with a golden sword.","Seeing this, the players on the field dropped their weapons and immediately began running away. Yet, none was able to out run the sword.","The moment the avatar struck the ground, the entire Great Battlefield shook violently, and a deep fissure appeared in the arena.","Before the Fiery Garden of Hell members could even leave their base, over 300,000 players were removed from the Faction War with a single strike.","In the blink of an eye, Yuan had annihilated half of the Fiery Garden of Hell's players.","The spectators were speechless. Yan Xiaoxiao was speechless. There was not a single person watching who wasn't shocked by what they had just witnessed.","Once she snapped out of her daze, Yan Xiaoxiao commented, her voice filled with excitement, \"HEAVENS! WHAT A POWER PLAY! Player Yuan disqualified 301,283 players with a single strike the moment the match began! How will Fiery Queen and her faction respond to this?!\"","After the sudden attack, Fiery Queen sat on her buttocks with a dazed look on her face as she stared at the golden giant that overlooked them from above like a god, feeling like an ant. \"I-it's not over! He must have consumed most, if not all, of his energy on that one attack!\" Fiery Queen eventually recovered.","The very next moment, not wanting to finish the Faction War too quickly, Yuan deactivated God of War's Astral Arts.","Fiery Queen misunderstood this and became convinced that Yuan had exhausted all of his energy.","The remaining Fiery Garden of Hell players struggled to get back on their feet before advancing toward Yuan's castle again.","However, before they could take more than ten steps, a beam of light suddenly appeared from the direction of their destination.","This beam of light contained an immense amount of spiritual energy, and everyone struck by it was instantly knocked unconscious. The same thing happened to those hit by the God of War's Astral Arts.","Suddenly, another 50,000 Fiery Garden of Hell players were removed from the battlefield.","\"M-my god! What on earth was that laser technique just now?! I have never seen—\" Yan Xiaoxiao cried out loud.","Before Yan Xiaoxiao could even finish her sentence, Yuan launched another Heaven Splitting Sword Strike at the Fiery Garden of Hell, defeating another 32,000 players in the blink of an eye.","Several more Heaven Splitting Sword Strikes appeared shortly after, giving Fiery Garden of Hell no room to breathe as they were bombarded with powerful techniques from across the arena.","Less than a minute had passed since the match began, yet Fiery Garden of Hell's impressive 600,000 player number had been reduced to just 100,000.","The spectators were unsure of what they were witnessing, but as Yuan's overwhelming abilities became apparent, a palpable fear began to spread among them.","\"If it weren't for the formation, he would've killed half a million people just like that...\"","\"What kind of monstrous power is that? What if he suddenly decides to use it for evil? Who could stop him then?\"","These kinds of questions began to arise in people's minds. They feared that Yuan was too powerful, that he wielded unchecked and uncontrollable power that could spell the end of the world if he chose to end it."]},{"number":1580,"title":"Chapter 1580 A Display of Overwhelming Prowess(2)","paragraphs":["\"Queen! What should we do?! We're completely powerless right now and are no different than sitting ducks waiting to be slaughtered!\" One of the Fiery Garden of Hell members suddenly cried out loud.","Fiery Queen didn't immediately respond. She surveyed her surroundings with a dazed look, taking in the devastated scene. Over eighty percent of her forces had been defeated in less than a minute, but they still had 100,000 players remaining. If Yuan had exhausted all of his energy, they still had a good chance of defeating him.","\"There's no need to despair! We may have lost a lot of players, but we are still 100,000-strong! Player Yuan's definitely exhausted his Qi this time! This is our chance to defeat him once and for all!\" Fiery Queen shouted.","She pointed in Yuan's direction with a whip in hand and continued, \"Advance!\"","The players quickly scrambled to their feet and started running toward Yuan's castle for the third time with their eyes peeled open for incoming attacks.","\"He's stopped attacking! I think he's really out of energy! We need to hurry and reach him before he recovers!\"","\"Move! Move your asses! We cannot allow him to recover even slightly!\"","The Fiery Garden of Hell began advancing like madmen, almost as though they were racing each other to see who reached Yuan first. Even if they don't have the capability to defeat Yuan, they could still hope to delay his recovery.","However, unbeknownst to them, Yuan still had plenty of spiritual energy. In fact, he'd been holding back the majority of his strength this entire time.","If he'd used his full strength—or even half of it, the players wouldn't have survived it, even with the formation's protection.","Seeing how desperately the Fiery Garden of Hell was trying to reach him, Yuan sat on the ground before completely lying down, looking like he was going to take a nap.","\"What in god's name?! Player Yuan appears to be taking a nap in the middle of the war! Did he run out of energy after using so many powerful techniques at once?!\" Yan Xiaoxiao exclaimed.","\"He really loves to show off, doesn't he?\" Wang Ming chuckled at this scene.","\"He's just bullying them at this point.\" Shi Lang shook his head with a slight smile.","The arena was so massive that it took the fastest player in Fiery Garden of Hell nearly twenty minutes of straight sprinting to finally reach Yuan.","\"That bastard's asleep?!\" The player almost couldn't believe his eyes when he saw Yuan casually resting on his back, seemingly without a care in the world.","The player immediately thought about launching a sneak attack, but he quickly became doubtful whether Yuan was actually asleep or not.","'What was I thinking? Unless he knocked himself out after exhausting himself, there's no way he would actually be asleep. This is obviously a trap!'","However, even if it was a trap, the player couldn't stand there and do nothing while Yuan continued to recover his energy. He had to do something.","The next moment, after taking a few deep breaths, the player made his move. Using his movement technique, he closed their distance almost instantly.","With a dagger in his grasp, the player aimed for the badge hanging by Yuan's waist.","However, when the player reached Yuan, he saw that Yuan's eyes were suddenly opened, and they were staring right into his eyes.","The player felt an incredible chill throughout his entire body, almost like he was suddenly swimming naked in ice water. Unfortunately, it was already too late to stop, and the adrenaline in his blood made him move even faster.","\"Die for me, you monster!\" The player roared as his dagger inched closer to Yuan's life badge.","Right as the dagger was millimeters away from touching Yuan's badge, the player suddenly found himself unable to move even the slightest, almost as if he was frozen in time.","Before the player could even react, Yuan casually smacked him in the face, sending him flying across the arena until he hit another player several minutes away.","\"Where the hell did you come from?!\" The player struck by the one who got hit cried out loud.","However, the player couldn't respond, as he was knocked unconscious. Eventually, Fiery Queen and the rest of the players reached Yuan, who was no longer napping on the ground but hovering in the air instead.","\"What took you so long? I fell asleep waiting for you.\" Yuan said as his gaze stared at Fiery Queen.","\"Shut up!\" Fiery Queen bellowed with an enraged expression.","\"Keep acting arrogant, but we all know that you've already exhausted your energy!\"","\"Oh, really? What gave it away?\" Yuan smiled.","\"Unless you have unlimited Qi, there's no way you're not exhausted by now!\" \"But I had plenty of time to rest.\"","\"Hah! Who are you trying to fool? You wouldn't be able to recover completely even if we gave you an entire day!\" Yuan laughed, \"Fiery Queen, you don't learn, do you? How many times do I have to teach you this lesson?\"","\"W-what lesson?\" Fiery Queen frowned.","\"That you'd never be able to defeat me!\"","Yuan activated God of War's Astral Art again.","The golden giant returned and even looked bigger than before.","Fiery Queen and the other players' faces immediately darkened, and their hearts all dropped at the same time.","\"Fiery Queen, let this be my last warning to you. If I have to deal with you again, it won't be so peaceful.\"","Yuan proceeded to bombard Fiery Queen and the remaining players with a barrage of attacks. Each time the golden giant swung its sword, the entire island would shake, and a new fissure would open up in the ground. After destroying almost the entire arena, Yuan deactivated the technique and descended before Fiery Queen, who he'd purposefully left alone.","Fiery Queen stared at him with a dumbfounded face. She opened her mouth, but no words came out.","In the end, Yuan destroyed her badge without uttering another word."]},{"number":1581,"title":"Chapter 1581 Controversies","paragraphs":["Fiery Queen stared at her destroyed badge with a dazed face. Although she sustained almost no physical damage during the Faction War, the damage dealt to her mentally was immense and profound.","This overwhelming sense of defeat and helplessness made her recall their previous confrontation and how he slaughtered all of the exiles. Tears began flowing from Fiery Queen's eyes, but Yuan did not linger to watch her weep and was already walking away.","Despite the Demon Sealing Faction—Yuan's overwhelming victory, nobody in the crowd cheered, and the place was so silent that a pin drop could be heard from miles away.","Eventually, Yan Xiaoxiao broke the silence by announcing the winner, \"T-the winner of this Faction War is Demon Sealing Faction! Or should I say Player Yuan, who single-handedly defeated 600,000 players by himself!\" Yan Xiaoxiao quickly appeared in the arena and sprinted to Yuan, fearing that he might leave before she could interview him.","\"Congratulations on the Demon Sealing Faction's second victory! With this momentous victory, the Demon Sealing Faction is now ranked 5th in the world! I'm sure the speed of your rise broke several records, but we can talk about that later. Right now, I want to know what you have to say!\"","Yuan grabbed the microphone and spoke calmly, \"I see a lot of disappointed people in the audience. Were you expecting something else? I'm sorry if I disappointed you, but I warned you the last time—never bet against me.\" \"Anyway, I've had enough fun of Faction Wars for now, so I will no longer be participating in them. With that said, if you wish to challenge the Demon Sealing Faction, I'm sure the other members will be more than willing to entertain you.\"","Yuan returned the microphone to Yan Xiaoxiao before walking out of the arena.","The spectators remained silent, trying to comprehend what they had just witnessed. Given the absurdity of everything, many wondered if they had somehow logged into Cultivation Online without realizing it. Although the members of the Demon Sealing Faction tried to look calm, they were also inwardly shocked. They had never seen Yuan fight so fiercely, even during their training.","\"I knew there was a wide gap between us, but I didn't think it was this ridiculous...\" Shi Lang muttered in a dazed voice. \"Forget about the Faction War. He can probably conquer the world with those techniques.\"","\"I wouldn't doubt it.\" Wang Ming smiled.","After the Faction War concluded, topics on the subject began spreading online like wildfire.","[Even though the Faction War ended already, I still cannot believe it ended so fast.]","[I waited an entire month for this Faction War, and the Fiery Garden of Hell was defeated in less than half an hour—only because Player Yuan waited 20 minutes for them to reach him!]","Controversies on whether Yuan should be allowed to participate in future Faction Wars also began filling up the internet.","[Player Yuan is too powerful! He needs to be banned from future Faction Wars to keep things entertaining and fair!]","[Player Yuan is too much! He's too arrogant! Fiery Queen did not deserve to be bullied like that!]","Most spectators who watched Yuan's Faction War felt an indescribable sensation after the match. It was a feeling they were not familiar with. Gradually, they began to recognize that feeling as existential fear.","After witnessing someone who was beyond their understanding, they began to question the purpose of their own existence. However, unwilling to accept their inferiority, these people banded together to drag down the one who had made them feel that way.","[Player Yuan was definitely using drugs to enhance his strength!]","[Ban Player Yuan!]","[Remove the Demon Sealing Faction from the rankings!]","Countless calls for the Cultivators' Association to ban Player Yuan and the Demon Sealing Faction flooded the internet. The sentiment only intensified over time, with more and more people echoing the same demand.","Chairman Lee, under pressure not only from the public but also from the Legacy Families and other powerful backgrounds, found himself in a difficult position.","The Legacy Families and Ten Great Families have always wanted to get rid of Yuan, but they have never had the opportunity to do so until now.","Soon, even government agencies from around the world got involved. Due to Yuan's prowess, which they perceived as a threat, they had no choice but to intervene.","However, the governments had no interest in the Cultivators' Association or the Faction Wars. They only had one thing in their sights—Yuan himself.","Shortly after the Faction War had concluded, every single government agency in the world got together. They watched the Faction War between Yuan and Fiery Garden of Hell from beginning to end before they started their conversation.","They started the conversation by revealing all of their information on Yuan, from the day he joined the orphanage to the current day.","Although the government hasn't acted until now, they have been gathering information on Yuan since the day they realized he was Player Yuan just in case of situations like this.","\"This person clearly has enough power to threaten not just a country but the entire world. He's too dangerous to be wandering around without any supervision.\"","\"Then what do you suggest? That we chain him down? Who here has the power to do that?\"","\"I do not know what has to be done or what can be done. I only know that something must be done before he gets out of control!\" \"He's currently living within the Dragon Spiral Mountain, right? Perhaps we can get the Lord to deal with him.\"","The room fell silent for a moment. The Lord's identity as a divine beast was no secret among government agencies, but only those with the highest level of clearance knew about it.","\"If it's the Lord, he definitely has the power to control Yuan. No... he might be the only entity in this world who can do so.\"","\"But would he even help us?\"","\"The Lord is a reasonable entity. I'm sure he'll understand our worries.\""]},{"number":1582,"title":"Chapter 1582 Yuan’s Offer","paragraphs":["\"Brother... is there anything you can do about this?\"","Inside her room, Yu Rou shoved her phone at Yuan's face, showing him all of the negative things being said about him with a concerned face.","After the Faction War, wanting to spend a little more time with his sister, Yuan left with Yu Rou and Bai Lianhua while the others returned to the Dragon Spiral Mountain.","Yuan glanced at the topic being made about him and shrugged, \"What do you want me to do? Tell them to shut up?\"","\"I don't know, but they're demanding you to be banned from future Faction Wars! And it's not just a few individuals!\" Yu Rou said with a worried face.","\"I kind of agree with them. I'm simply too powerful. Any Faction War with my participation will be a guaranteed victory for the Demon Sealing Faction by a landslide. I don't intend to participate in more matches unless necessary, so this ban won't really affect me that much.\"","\"But I enjoy watching you kicking everyone's ass! Faction Wars will no longer be the same for me after seeing your performance today! They won't be as entertaining!\"","\"Senior Sister, you should say something too!\" Yu Rou turned to look at Bai Lianhua, who was leaning on the wall with a perplexed expression on her face.","\"I don't know what to say. I doubt the Cultivators' Association would ban him because of this, but I have a feeling that the Ten Great Families will add to the pressure. There's no chance in hell they'd let this opportunity to drag Yuan down slip away.\"","Suddenly, Bai Lianhua received a call on her private cellphone. \"Hello? Father?\" It was her father, Bai Mengyao, calling.","\"Yuan? Yeah, he's with me. Why are you asking?\"","\"Huh? Seriously?\"","Bai Lianhua's face became filled with shock.","\"Okay... I'll tell him...\"","After hanging up, Bai Lianhua turned to look at Yuan with a heavy gaze.","\"What's wrong?\" Yuan asked.","\"I was right. The Ten Great Families are working together to pressure the Cultivators' Association to put a ban on you. However, that's not what's most concerning. Apparently, government agencies around the world are wary of your capabilities and have gathered to discuss your existence.\"","Yuan raised an eyebrow at this news.","\"The government? What are they worried about? That I might take over the world or something?\" he spoke in a joking tone.","Yet, Bai Lianhua nodded and said, \"Yes, precisely that. They are worried about the prowess you displayed today. As of this moment, they see you as an unpredictable disaster waiting to happen.\"","\"Even if you swear that you won't take over the world, they won't feel safe until they have you under their control.\" \"So what do you think they'll do to me?\" Yuan suddenly asked.","Despite being on the government's watchlist, Yuan didn't seem to be all that concerned. \"Well, they'll most likely try to put a leash on you—control you. However, they won't approach you directly and will most likely...\" Bai Lianhua paused midway and turned to look at Yu Rou with a worried frown on her face.","\"They will most likely approach Yu Rou and those close to you first. Only once they have enough leverage over you will they finally approach you,\" Bai Lianhua sighed.","\"Is that so?\" Yuan looked at Yu Rou and asked, \"Want to spend some time with me in the Dragon Spiral Mountain? At least until everything calms down. Nobody will be able to bother you while you're with me.\"","\"Of co—!\" Yu Rou closed her mouth just as quickly as she opened it. She wanted to agree, but she had her own obligations at the Eternal Lotuses and couldn't be selfish anymore.","She turned to look at Bai Lianhua, seemingly asking for permission.","Bai Lianhua smiled and said, \"Go spend some time with your brother. You barely left this place since you joined our faction over a year ago. It's about time you switch sceneries—not to mention the situation. This is also for your safety.\"","\"Thank you!\" Yu Rou nodded.","Yuan looked at Bai Lianhua and said, \"You know, the Dragon Spiral Mountain has enough room for the entire Eternal Lotuses to relocate. The spiritual energy there is also much denser than here, so you'll all benefit from being there.\"","Bai Lianhua was momentarily stunned by his suggestion. After snapping out of it, she said, \"I know it's incredibly expensive to live there—if you even get approved by its landlord. There's no way they'd let so many people move there at once.\"","Yuan smiled and said, \"I happen to be very close with the landlord, so we should have no problem getting you guys settled there. Of course, this is only a suggestion—an offer. You don't have to take it if you don't want it.\"","Unlike before, Bai Lianhua didn't immediately reject his offer. Living inside the Dragon Spiral Mountain would not only provide them with security but also benefit their cultivation. However, the most important factor was that she would get to be neighbors with Yuan.","Seeing Bai Lianhua seriously pondering moving her headquarters to Dragon Spiral Mountain, Yuan gave her another push, \"You also won't need to worry about living expenses since that'll already be taken care of.\"","After a moment of silence, Bai Lianhua replied, \"Can I give you an answer later? I need to speak with the others first. This decision is too big for me to decide alone.\"","Yuan nodded, \"Sure.\"","\"Then I will immediately speak with the others.\" Bai Lianhua didn't waste any time and gathered all the faction members before telling them about Yuan's offer.","\"We get to be neighbors with the Demon Sealing Faction and Player Yuan? I agree!\"","\"I heard that only the elite of elites are allowed to live there! I also agree with our relocation!\"","The members were quick to give their opinions on the matter, and everyone agreed to move to the Dragon Spiral Mountain because they would only benefit from it."]},{"number":1583,"title":"Chapter 1583 Controlling Yuan","paragraphs":["\"That was fast.\" Yuan smiled when Bai Lianhua returned to the room much faster than he'd anticipated.","\"Well... everyone's eager to move...\" Bai Lianhua replied with a bashful smile.","\"Then it's settled. You guys can make the move whenever. I'll speak with the Lord once I return.\"","Bai Lianhua nodded, \"Okay. Thank you for giving us this opportunity.\"","Yuan left with Yu Rou a few hours later.","As Yuan and Yu Rou made their trip back to the Dragon Spiral Mountain, government officials were already there to speak with the Lord.","However, before they could even reach the Lord, they had to deal with the manager first. Even as government officials, they couldn't enter the Dragon Spiral Mountain without her approval.","\"What is your reason for visiting?\" Liya asked them with a nonchalant look on her face.","\"We have some urgent matter that requires the Lord's attention. This world's balance is in jeopardy, and we believe the Lord is the only individual who can deal with it.\"","Despite hearing this information, Liya remained uninterested and said, \"I will need more information than that, or are you implying that I don't qualify enough to hear it?\"","The government officials exchanged glances with each other before giving a nod.","One spoke a second later, \"We believe a certain individual has too much power and could be a potential time bomb strong enough to destroy this world if not controlled. He's currently wandering the world unrestricted as we speak, and we'd like the Lord to do something about it.\"","\"Who is this individual?\" Liya narrowed her eyes.","\"He used to go by Yu Tian, but he's known as Yuan right now, and he's a resident at the Dragon Spiral Mountain.\" Liya raised an eyebrow upon hearing this familiar name.","After realizing the situation, Liya couldn't help but crack a chuckle.","The government officials raised their eyebrows at Liya's reaction. Although they had met and spoken with her plenty of times, they had only seen her poker face, so it was an incredibly weird feeling to see her laugh, even if it was just slightly.","\"Ahem.\" Liya cleared her throat and spoke, acting like nothing had happened, \"You need the Lord to control this Yuan individual, correct? I'll lead you to the Lord right now.\"","\"Already?\" The government officials couldn't believe how fast they gained entrance. Typically, they would have to wait for Liya to contact the Lord before getting a response.","\"Don't tell me the Lord is already aware of the danger Yuan proposes to the world?\" One of them speculated as they passed the gates, entering the Dragon Spiral Mountain.","\"Maybe that's why she laughed at us—because they are already working on it.\"","Sometime later, these government officials reached the peak of the mountain.","\"Wait here for a bit,\" Liya said to them before disappearing for a few minutes.","While they waited, Liya went to notify the Lord of their visit.","\"Government officials? What do they want?\"","\"That's a surprise.\" Liya smiled.","\"...\"","The Lord found Liya's behavior to be unusual and immediately became suspicious. However, he didn't question her any further and said, \"Bring them to me.\"","\"Of course.\"","Liya left to bring the visitors to him.","A few moments later, the government officials stood before the Lord's cave with their heads lowered so much their chin was kissing their chest.","\"What are you all waiting for? This is an urgent matter, right? Go ahead and tell him what you told me.\" Liya spoke up when none of the government officials dared to speak without permission.","The officials felt something was off about Liya—almost like she was entertaining herself with their situation.","\"W-we greet the Lord of the Dragon Spiral Mountain. Today, we have an urgent matter to discuss.\"","\"There is a particular individual we believe requires your attention. This individual possesses unfathomable power that threatens not only the balance of this world but also the world itself. He hasn't done anything requiring immediate action, but we believe it's only a matter of time, and at the speed he's growing, we should move as soon as possible before he becomes truly uncontrollable.\"","\"This individual is a resident at the Dragon Spiral Mountain. He used to be called Yu Tian but is now widely known as Yuan, and we need you to put a collar on him...\"","The moment Yuan's name was uttered, the atmosphere in the Dragon Spiral Mountain changed, and a dreadful pressure appeared at the peak of the mountain, forcing all of the government officials to kneel on the ground.","\"L-Lord?! What is the meaning of this?!\" The government officials screamed in horror as the bones in their bodies began cracking.","The pressure disappeared a few seconds later, but the officials remained on the ground with their bodies still screaming from pain.","\"I refuse.\" The Lord uttered in a cold voice a moment later without explaining any further.","Despite their pain, the officials tried to change his mind.","\"Please! You're the only existence in this world who can control a monster like him!\" \"The world needs your help, Lord!\"","\"Why are you refusing to help us?! At least give us an explanation!\"","\"I will not repeat myself, nor do I owe you any explanation. Now get the hell out of my face before I lose my temper again!\" The Lord roared, blowing them away with the force of his voice. \"But—\"","\"The Lord has spoken. Unless you want to leave this mountain as a corpse, I suggest you leave now.\" Liya stepped forward and interrupted.","The government officials gritted their teeth in frustration and began descending the mountain. Due to the pain in their body, they had to support each other as they slowly limped away.","\"Why didn't you try to stop them or convince them that Yuan isn't dangerous?\" Liya asked the Lord after the officials left.","\"You think they'd listen to me? Humans are foolish and cowardly creatures, especially when their power and control are threatened.\" The Lord sighed. \"Anyway, this was bound to happen sooner or later. Let's wait and see how he'll deal with this.\"","Liya silently acknowledged."]},{"number":1584,"title":"Chapter 1584 A Villain","paragraphs":["\"Fuck! Why did the Lord refuse to help us?!\"","\"Could he be afraid of Yuan?\"","\"That's impossible! The Lord has an unfathomable cultivation! He could easily kill someone like Yuan!\"","\"Whatever his reason is, we cannot leave without any results. Our supervisors will eat us alive if we return emptyhanded.\"","\"But what the hell are we supposed to do?\"","The government officials stopped moving and decided to sit by the road to think. They were also in too much pain to walk and took this opportunity to heal. After some time, they considered returning to the peak for another attempt to convince the Lord, but no one actually dared, fearing that the Lord would kill them for such audacity.","\"There's nothing we can do here. I'm sure our supervisors will understand. Let's get out of here before there's a misunderstanding.\"","\"Yeah. It's not like we can argue with the Lord.\"","The officials got back on their feet and began descending the mountain again.","Sometime later, they noticed a handsome young man coming up the mountain from a distance.","Despite his youthful appearance, he had a profound aura and exuded the presence of an expert.","\"T-that's—!\"","\"Look over there!\"","\"It's Yuan!\" The government officials immediately halted their steps when they recognized the young man to be Yuan—the very person they were trying to put under control.","Yuan noticed these individuals long before they even saw him and had plenty of time to ponder how he should interact with them, if he even should.","Once they were only several feet apart from each other, Yuan stopped in front of them with a friendly smile on his face.","\"Judging by your suits, you must be with the government. Did you already finish your discussion with the Lord? How did it go?\" he asked.","\"W-what are you talking about?\" The officials' eyes widened with surprise, almost as if they couldn't believe what they were hearing.","Yuan pretended to look confused and said, \"Hmm? I thought you were here to see whether you can get the Lord to deal with me or something along that line. Was I mistaken?\"","\"You!?\"","The government officials' faces darkened after hearing his words. However, they quickly realized the gravity of their situation.","If they respond incorrectly and offend Yuan, it might trigger what they feared could happen.","\"I-I think there's been a misunderstanding. We—our supervisors are not trying to 'deal' with you. We just want to make sure you don't accidentally destroy a city or the world...\"","\"Wow, that's quite the assumption there. How did you come up with such a conclusion? Is it because of my performance during the Faction War?\"","\"That's...\"","Before the officials could respond, Yuan continued, \"Or is it because of the Ten Great Families? Are they telling you that I am dangerous and need to be dealt with?\"","\"Well, it doesn't really matter. Tell your supervisors that I have no intention of being controlled, nor do I have any plans on overthrowing the government—as long as you know your place and don't touch my friends and family.\"","\"In case they don't want to listen, tell them that what they'd witnessed during the Faction War was only a small fraction of my full strength. If they want to see me prove it, they can go ahead and continue messing with me.\"","The government officials trembled upon seeing Yuan's cold smile. They couldn't imagine Yuan possessing more power than what they'd already witnessed, but they didn't doubt him.","Yuan suddenly walked forward until he was standing right in front of them.","\"Are you afraid of me?\" Yuan placed his right hand on the official's shoulder and could immediately feel the man trembling in fear.","\"There's no reason to fear me... at least not yet. As long as the government doesn't overstep its boundaries, I won't do anything to you guys.\"","Yuan gave the man's shoulder a gentle pat before walking past them and disappearing into the formation.","All of the officials fell to their knees once they could no longer sense Yuan's presence. Their bodies began sweating profusely, and their legs felt like tofu, almost as though they'd just escaped a near-death situation.","None of the officials spoke to each other, as they all had their own thoughts to figure out. Sometime later, they stood up and left the Dragon Spiral Mountain.","They would not utter a single word until they returned to their supervisors, informing them of the Lord's response, as well as Yuan's warning to them.","Meanwhile, Yuan met with the Lord, who had watched his conversation with the officials.","\"You sounded like a villain back there. Are you sure that's how you want to appear?\" The Lord asked him.","Yuan shrugged, \"They are the ones who branded me as one first. It wouldn't have mattered how I acted since I would still be a villain in their eyes.\"","\"Anyway, I didn't come here to talk about them. The Eternal Lotuses, who is in an alliance with my Demon Sealing Faction, would like to move their headquarters to the Dragon Spiral Mountain. My sister is there, and I would like to keep her close to me for now. Do you think that's possible?\"","\"Of course, that's possible. Even if we don't have room, I'll make sure there's room. In fact, I have been thinking about clearing out the mountain so it's exclusively used by you and those close to you.\"","Yuan was surprised to hear this and quickly said, \"There's no need to do that for me. What am I going to do with an entire mountain, anyway? I am fine with what I currently have, so just keep things the way they are.\"","\"I understand.\" The Lord nodded.","After chatting a little more, Yuan returned to his residence and contacted Bai Lianhua.","\"Yes, I have received the Lord's approval, so you can move here whenever you want.\" \"Then we'll move there in a few days. I'll see you then.\"","\"See you.\"","Bai Lianhua immediately started the process after hanging up."]},{"number":1585,"title":"Chapter 1585 Releasing the Interview","paragraphs":["\"Who the hell does that arrogant little brat think he is, threatening the government!?\" Government agencies around the world were enraged when they were informed of the situation. They couldn't believe that they were being threatened by someone who barely just reached adulthood. Yet, that wasn't even the most irritating part.","The fact they couldn't do anything about it was what truly infuriated them to the core.","The Lord refused to help them for some reason, and Yuan lived inside the Dragon Spiral Mountain, making things even more complicated than they already are.","If they wanted to deal with Yuan, they had to wait until he left the Dragon Spiral Mountain. Otherwise, they risk offending the Lord of the mountain by conducting their business within his sacred land.","The Lord possessed power and authority that far surpassed any other organization or individual in the world. The only saving grace for humanity was the Lord's indifference toward humans as long as they didn't mess with him.","Many decades ago, the government tried to subdue the Lord. However, they quickly found out how foolish their actions were when the Lord effortlessly killed everyone responsible without leaving the mountain.","Of course, the government tried nuclear weapons, but those were also rendered useless before they could even get close to the mountain.","After the old government was annihilated by the Lord, a new one formed and signed a peace treaty with the Lord.","The contract stipulated that they would not interfere with the Lord or any activities within Dragon Spiral Mountain, declaring the place an independent power. This meant that the laws governing the majority of the world were irrelevant within Dragon Spiral Mountain, and all business conducted there could not be judged by outside standards.","\"I want the Dragon Spiral Mountain to on a 24-hour surviellance! Notify us immediately whenever Yuan leaves!\"","\"But what are we going to do once he leaves? Ambush him? We don't have the power to do anything to him!\"","\"We can figure that out later! For now, I want everything on him—from what he eats to breakfast to when he shits it out! If we cannot deal with Yuan, we can always target those around him. Contact the Demon Sealing Faction members and try to recruit them to our side. Be cautious and discreet.\"","\"...\"","The entire room went silent after such an impossible task was given.","It was already impossible enough to enter the Dragon Spiral Mountain, so how were they going to spy on Yuan to get information on him?","The entire room went silent after such an impossible task was given.","It was already impossible enough to enter the Dragon Spiral Mountain, so how were they going to spy on Yuan to get information on him?","\"I guess we can try to convert someone that's already close to him on our side, but that has its own risks. What if they feed us incorrect information? What if they expose us?\"","\"There's no such thing as risk-free in our line of work. Everything has a risk. The only question is whether or not we're willing to accept such risks.\"","The room fell silent again.","Eventually, they agreed to try to convert someone from the Demon Sealing Faction.","Meanwhile, Yan Xiaoxiao just finished editing her interview with the Demon Sealing Faction and sent a copy to Meifeng to get it approved.","At the Demon Sealing Faction, Meifeng watched the interview with Yu Rou and Yuan together.","\"It's very well made and puts a good spotlight on the Demon Sealing Faction, which will definitely help us when everyone is trying to drag our name through the mud,\" Meifeng commented after watching the interview.","\"Do you think it'll stop people from talking badly about my brother?\" Yu Rou asked with a slight frown on her face.","\"Unlikely, since most of the people speaking ill of Yuan are probably hired actors paid by the Ten Great Families and the government. This is very common practice for those who want to lower another's reputation.\"","\"There's no need to worry about me, Yu Rou. Whether my reputation is good or bad, it won't change anything.\" Yuan said to her.","\"I know that, but it's still frustrating to see people badmouth you every time I open up the internet...\" she sighed.","Yuan suddenly placed a hand on her head and ruffled her hair. \"Brother?!\"","\"Don't waste your energy over something like that. It's not worth it.\" He looked at Meifeng and continued, \"Anyway, you can let Yan Xiaoxiao know that she can release the interview whenever she wants.\"","Meifeng nodded and immediately sent a message to Yan Xiaoxiao.","Not even a minute later, Yan Xiaoxiao posted the interview on her personal website and social profiles, instantly gathering tens of thousands of views.","In less than half an hour, the interview garnered over a hundred million views, becoming a sensation on the internet.","At first, there were many positive comments, praising the Demon Sealing Faction's unique lifestyle and the members' trust in Yuan.","However, once the Ten Great Families and the trolls heard about the interview, they bombarded it with the usual negative comments.","Yet, because these comments were made under Yan Xiaoxiao's profile, her immense fanbase was immediately enraged, considering it an attack on Yan Xiaoxiao herself.","Thus, the trolls and Yan Xiaoxiao's fanbase began a war with each other. Later that night, Yu Rou approached Yuan and said, \"Let's sleep together tonight!\"","\"I don't mind, but...\" Yuan showed his room to her, where another individual was already sleeping on his bed.","\"Oh, right. You sleep together with Chu Liuxiang.\"","Yu Rou proceeded to stand there in silence, seeming in deep thought.","\"I have been wondering about this for a while now, but why isn't Meixiu sleeping with you, too? Isn't she also your lover? I don't think it is fair to make her sleep in a separate room when Chu Liuxiang sleeps with you.\"","\"Well... it's not like I am forcing her to be in a separate room. I also don't want to force her to sleep with us, so I'm just waiting for her to say something.\" Yuan said with a bittersweet smile.","\"Is that so?\" Yu Rou mumbled.","After another moment of silence, she said, \"I changed my mind. I'll go sleep with Meixiu tonight since it's been a while.\"","Yuan nodded, and Yu Rou knocked on Meixiu's room the following moment."]},{"number":1586,"title":"Chapter 1586 Eternal Lotuses’ Relocation","paragraphs":["Once Meixiu answered the door, Yu Rou greeted her with a bright smile, \"Meixiu, it's been a while since we've really spoken with each other! Let's sleep together tonight.\"","Although she was a little surprised, Meixiu agreed with a slight head nod, \"Sure. Come inside.\"","\"Goodnight, brother.\" Yu Rou said as she strolled into the room.","\"Goodnight.\" Meixiu also said.","\"Goodnight, you two.\"","Once the door closed, Yuan returned to his room to sleep, as cultivating was pointless nowadays.","Due to the Celestial Emperor's curse and his high cultivation base, his cultivation would go nowhere, even if he cultivated for years straight. Of course, he could always consume monster cores, but he had no reason to increase his cultivation on Earth any further. After all, he already had more than enough power to conquer the entire world if he so desired.","Meanwhile, inside Meixiu's room, Yu Rou muttered as she sat on the bed, \"Wow, this is a really comfortable bed.\"","\"Anyway, how have you been doing, Meixiu? Is my brother treating you right?\"","Meixiu nodded with a smile, \"I've been doing great, and Yuan's treating me fine, too.\" \"Really? If that's the case, why are you still sleeping alone while Chu Liuxiang is sleeping in the same room as him?\" Yu Rou looked at her with doubtful eyes.","\"I'm satisfied sleeping in my own room, and he does come sleep with me once in a while.\"","Although she didn't mention it, she'd actually heard Yu Rou's conversation with Yuan outside her room earlier.","\"That's not good enough! We've been together since childhood, so you're like a second sibling to me—an elder sister! I will not allow you to lose to someone else!\"","\"Lose...? But I am not losing... at least, that's not how I see it.\" Meixiu showed a stiff smile.","After all, she was the first one to be accepted by Yuan. Yu Rou sighed and said, \"Although I wasn't too surprised when I learned that you and my brother paired up since I knew it'd eventually happen, do you have any idea how shocked I was when I found out that he got a second lover?\"","\"Is it really that surprising?\"","\"Of course! I didn't know he was capable of doing that! Anyway, you should start sleeping in the same room as my brother. I know you want to.\" Yu Rou winked at her.","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Meixiu spoke in a low voice, \"What about you?\"","\"Huh? What about me?\" Yu Rou raised her eyebrows.","\"Don't you also love him?\"","Yu Rou was momentarily stunned by such a question, but she quickly snapped out of it and chuckled, \"Of course I do. He's my one and only brother, after all.\"","Meixiu gently shook her head.","\"You know that's not what I mean...\"","Yu Rou's body trembled slightly, clearly not expecting Meixiu to question her in such a manner.","\"I know, but you should also know that we're siblings.\"","\"But you're not blood-related. That changes everything.\"","Yu Rou shook her head and sighed, \"While that's true, it's our perspective that truly matters. I love him very much, and I'd do anything for him, but I don't know if I am ready—or will ever be ready—to treat him as anything other than my brother.\"","\"Is that so...\"","Seeing the dejected look on Yu Rou's face, Meixiu decided to stop talking about this subject.","After a moment of silence, Meixiu sat on the bed and said, \"Tell me about what it's like at the Eternal Lotuses.\"","\"Sure.\"","After closing the light, the two of them lay underneath the blankets, and Yu Rou started recalling her experience at the Eternal Lotuses.","Once Yu Rou was finished, Meixiu spoke about her adventures with Yuan and her progress in Cultivation Online.","They ended up talking all night, only falling asleep once the sun began rising.","Over the next few days, in order to know those around Yuan better, Yu Rou would spend most of her time chatting with the members of the Demon Sealing Faction.","On the third day of Yu Rou's stay at the Dragon Spiral Mountain, Bai Lianhua and the rest of the Eternal Lotuses were finally ready to move their headquarters.","Early in the morning the following day, Bai Lianhua and the entire Eternal Lotuses showed up at the bottom of the Dragon Spiral Mountain with several trucks full of items, from furniture to decorations.","Yuan went to greet them alone.","\"So, how does this work?\" Bai Lianhua asked.","\"The manager is making her way here now. You can ask her in a bit.\"","Liya showed up several minutes later and said, \"There are several unoccupied properties. Since your circumstances are unique and we haven't prepared a place for you, you can go ahead and pick the one you like best.\"","\"Once you have picked your property, you can start moving your stuff.\"","Liya looked at Yuan before handing him a notebook and said, \"Since you recommended them, they're your responsibility. Everything you need to know is inside that notebook.\"","Without further explanation, Liya turned around and disappeared.","\"Are we really welcome here?\" Bai Lianhua swallowed nervously after seeing Liya's cold behavior. Yuan chuckled and said, \"Don't worry about her. She's naturally grumpy like that. You'll get used to it very quickly.\"","\"I can hear you!\" Liya's angry voice resounded in an echo.","Sometime later, Yuan brought Bai Lianhua and several high-ranking members inside the Dragon Spiral Mountain to look at the available spaces listed in the notebook Liya gave him.","Most of the property in the lower and middle areas of the mountain was already occupied, but there were still plenty of options available. In the lower area, two large mansions remained, while the middle area had three. As for the upper area, five homes were still unoccupied.","\"The disparity in spiritual energy between the lower and middle areas is immense. I cannot fathom what it'd be like in the upper areas,\" Bai Lianhua remarked as they entered the middle area.","\"I never even thought such quality of spiritual energy was possible on Earth...\" Another commented.","\"This place is a cultivator's heaven...\""]},{"number":1587,"title":"Chapter 1587 Boot Camp","paragraphs":["A few hours have passed since Yuan started showing Bai Lianhua and the others the available properties within Dragon Spiral Mountain. All of the buildings were luxurious manors that were even bigger than Bai Lianhua's family home.","While the upper area was more spacious, it was the higher spiritual energy quality that truly mattered. In the end, Bai Lianhua chose to live in the upper area while also staying as close as possible to the Demon Sealing Faction's residence.","\"Here is a list of our rules. I doubt you will cause any trouble for the Dragon Spiral Mountain, but it's better to be safe than sorry.\" Yuan handed him a list of rules that was placed inside the notebook.","Bai Lianhua accepted the list and spoke with a serious expression, \"Don't worry, I will make sure we don't embarrass ourselves.\"","Yuan smiled and said, \"If you want, I can create a formation around your home that will prevent all commotion from leaving, so you won't have to worry about being too noisy to your neighbors.\"","Bai Lianhua nodded, \"That would be great. Thank you.\"","Sometime later, Bai Lianhua signed the contract and began sending the trucks up the mountain.","Once all of the items were laid out in front of the house, the members started moving them inside.","Yu Rou showed up to help with the move since she was also part of the faction.","Many hours later, once the moving was finished, the Eternal Lotuses began preparing for a massive feast to celebrate their new home, to which the entire Demon Sealing Faction was invited. \"Before we get this feast started, I would like to give a special shoutout to the one who made this all possible—Yuan.\" Bai Lianhua gestured for Yuan to go onto the stage, where she was standing.","The feast was held in the training ground, which was the most spacious. The stage they were standing on was the same one they used for sparring in their old location, something they decided to transport to their new home. Once Yuan was on the stage, Bai Lianhua continued, \"In three, two, one—\"","\"Thank you, Yuan!\" Everyone from Eternal Lotuses shouted.","\"Do you have anything to say to us?\" Bai Lianhua asked Yuan once the noises calmed down.","Yuan nodded and said, \"Since we're in an alliance, it's only natural for us to help each other. Now, getting you all settled near us is only the first part. For the next part, I want to help you all grow stronger, and when I say stronger, I don't mean give you powerful techniques.\"","\"I have already spoken to my faction about this, and we want to train you personally. Thus, we will have a 3-day boot camp session at the end of every month, where we will train you to become stronger than all of the other factions.\"","\"Of course, this boot camp is not mandatory and not for everyone, but for those of you who wish to stand above the rest, it's your best chance of that.\"","The Eternal Lotuses members exchanged glances with each other, their gaze filled with intrigue yet worry.","\"Since the month is already ending and you just moved here, we won't start until next month, but we will give you a one-day trial later so you know what to expect come next month.\"","\"With that said, let's enjoy ourselves.\"","The feast began shortly after, with everyone stuffing their mouth with food and drinks.","The feast continued into the night and even past midnight.","Once the feast ended and everyone cleaned up the scene, the members of Eternal Lotuses began cultivating in their new environment.","They knew the spiritual energy there was abundant and that their progress would be much faster than before, but when they finally experienced the difference firsthand, they were all profoundly shocked and elated.","\"Hahaha! Although it's not as good as Cultivation Online, this is still multiple times faster than before!\"","\"With this much spiritual energy, I should enter Spirit Master in no time!\"","\"No wonder why people rush to ascend in Cultivation Online even if they're severely under-leveled! This is worth the risk!\"","None of the members of Eternal Lotuses were able to sleep that night, as if they were addicted to cultivating.","Two days later, Yuan and the rest of the Demon Sealing Faction showed up at the Eternal Lotuses' residence with weapons in their grasp, looking like they wanted to start a war.","\"If you wish to participate in the trial, go to this side. Otherwise, go to this side.\" Bai Lianhua instructed her members.","In just a few moments, every member of Eternal Lotuses went to the participating side.","\"Good.\" Bai Lianhua nodded in approval at their response.","\"Now, we'll divide everyone into groups based on their cultivation base,\" Wang Ming instructed as he stepped forward. \"Spirit Warriors will be in one group, and Spirit Masters will be in another.\"","A few minutes later, four different groups were formed from several thousand people. The first group contained about a thousand Spirit Apprentices, while the second group had around triple that amount of Spirit Warriors.","The third group had only several hundred Spirit Masters, and the last group had around fifty Spirit Grandmasters.","\"Alright. Group one and group two will divide into smaller groups and follow me.\" Wang Bingbing raised her hand, gesturing for them to follow her.","Hong Xiuquan, Chu Liuxiang, Meixiu, Wang Xiuying, and Xi Murong also followed her.","\"I will take group three.\" Shi Lang said.","\"And group four is with me.\" Wang Ming said.","\"What about me? Are you going to train me?\" Bai Lianhua asked Yuan while pointing at herself.","\"No, she'll be doing the honors.\" Yuan gestured to Li Jinxi.","\"Hello... You're Li Jinxi, correct?\" Bai Lianhua greeted her with a respectful bow.","\"Yes.\"","\"I'll be in your care.\"","Li Jinxi silently nodded.","\"By the way, in addition to the sound concealing formation, I also covered this place with a second formation that's just like the one used at the Great Battlefield to prevent accidental death, so you don't need to worry about dying.\" Yuan suddenly said.","\"I-is that so...?\" Bai Lianhua responded with a stiff smile."]},{"number":1588,"title":"Chapter 1588 Boot Camp(2)","paragraphs":["\"P-please! Spare me!\"","\"You call this training?! This is more like torture!\"","The members of Eternal Lotuses quickly realized just how terrifying and outrageously difficult their boot camp was after only a few minutes. They were constantly being beaten and tossed around like ragdolls by the members of the Demon Sealing Faction.","\"What's wrong?! Are you giving up already?! We've just started!\" Wang Bingbing shouted at them like a drill instructor in military boot camp.","\"Did you think it was going to be easy?! If this is too much for you, give up! However, don't complain if your peers leave you in the dust!\"","While not every member of the Demon Sealing Faction screamed, not a single one of them was going easy on the members of Eternal Lotuses.","In less than ten minutes, over ten percent of the participants tapped out, refusing to continue the boot camp trial. It was simply too much for them to handle.","\"If you think this is bad, my training is several times worse than what you're experiencing now. Everything has a price, and this is the price for wanting to get strong fast.\" Shi Lang said as he wasted everyone in group three.","Meanwhile, Bai Lianhua was also being tossed around by Li Jinxi.","'It's like I am fighting a relentless monster! She's not giving me any room to breathe, much less attack!' Bai Lianhua cried inwardly as she was tossed left and right by Li Jinxi's heavy strikes despite blocking them.","Half an hour later, seventy percent of the participants gave up.","\"What do you think? Want to give it a go?\" Yuan looked at Yu Rou, who was watching the training with him.","\"...\"","After a moment of silence, Yu Rou nodded and said, \"Yes, but I want you to train me, brother.\"","\"If you think I'll go easy on you because you're my beloved sister...\" Yuan showed her a cold smile that sent shivers throughout her entire body.","\"That's not it... nor do I want you to go easy on me. I want you to train me because I want to be trained by the very best, even if it'll be many times more painful.\" Yu Rou spoke with clenched fists.","\"As expected of my sister.\" Yuan's smile became warmer, and he continued, \"Alright. I'll train you, but don't you dare complain to me later about it being too difficult.\"","\"Don't look down on me, brother. I am no longer the pampered little princess I was before.\" Yu Rou spoke with a serious expression.","\"Follow me.\" Yuan brought Yu Rou back to his residence since the training ground there was already fully occupied.","\"Are you ready?\" Yuan asked her once they were at the training ground.","\"I am.\" Yu Rou nodded.","\"Then let's get this party started.\"","In the following minutes, Yu Rou experienced complete hopelessness as Yuan delivered a beatdown she would never be able to forget.","If it weren't for the protection formation, she would've died over a hundred times every few minutes.","Of course, Yuan didn't just silently beat her. Once Yu Rou started getting used to it, he began correcting her mistakes and giving her opportunities to counter him.","Time felt exceedingly slow for the members of Eternal Lotuses since they were constantly in pain. The trial boot camp only lasted three hours. Yet, by the end, everyone felt like they had been tortured for three days straight.","There were no visible injuries on the participants, but as if their bodies had memorized the pain, they would occasionally feel the sensation of phantom blows striking them even long after the training ended.","\"Will this really help us get stronger...? I feel like we're just being practice dummies...\" One of them voiced her concerns.","\"What would they gain from lying to us? Let's just trust in the process.\" \"I am already exhausted from just three hours... I don't know if I can endure three whole days of this torture, even if it's just once a month.\"","Sometime later, Bai Lianhua gathered all of her members.","Yuan had to carry Yu Rou back because she was so utterly drained that even the mere act of lifting a finger seemed insurmountable.","\"So, what do you all think of the boot camp?\" Yuan asked everyone there with a calm smile on his face.","\"...\"","After a moment of awkward silence, someone responded, \"It was really difficult...\"","With the floodgates opened, more and more of them started complaining.","\"Difficult is an understatement!\"","\"Are you sure you're not just torturing us for fun?!\"","\"How will this help us get stronger?\"","After listening to all of the complaints, Yuan spoke, \"Since I can only prove its effect with results, let's do this. If you have endured three sessions of boot camp straight without very clear and satisfying results, I will give you an Ancient-grade technique or treasure as an apology.\"","After hearing this, the audience's faces immediately lit up with excitement. However, once they recalled their experience during the trial, their expressions quickly turned dreadful once more.","Seeing this, Bai Lianhua stepped forward and said, \"Once again, participation is not mandatory. However, if you wish to rapidly advance and rise above the crowd, this will be the most effective method. Personally, I will be participating in the boot camp. In the last three hours, I have gained more experience than in the past year.\"","\"You may not see any improvements right now, but that doesn't mean you haven't improved at all.\"","\"Take your time to think this through. You have plenty of time until the next session,\" Yuan told them.","After the gathering, the Demon Sealing Faction returned to their residence while Yuan went to the peak of the mountain to pick up Ji Ran, who had been restoring the Lord's cultivation for the last few days.","\"As always, thank you for the assistance.\" The Lord thanked Ji Ran.","\"I am only doing my duty.\" Ji Ran responded.","Once he returned to Yuan's Dantian, Ji Ran went into a deep slumber to recover.","\"How are you doing in the Nine Heavens?\" The Lord suddenly asked Yuan.","\"Things are getting complicated, but I'm doing fine otherwise.\" \"Complicated? How?\" The Lord inquired, his interest piqued."]},{"number":1589,"title":"Chapter 1589 Silhouettes (End of Arc)","paragraphs":["After hearing the Lord's inquiry, Yuan said, \"Well, some people think I am a demon because of my regenerative abilities, and I can't really blame them, either.\" \"A demon, huh? That's quite troublesome.\" The Lord mumbled with a frown.","\"It's fine for now since they don't know my identity, but it won't stay like that forever.\"","\"Is that so... How about your progress finding the Dragon Spiral Mountain?\" The Lord then asked.","Yuan's eyes widened after being reminded of the Dragon Spiral Mountain—the one that existed within the Nine Heavens.","\"I actually forgot about that...\" Yuan said.","In order to travel to the Nine Heavens with his real body, he must find and activate the teleporter, which exists in a second Dragon Spiral Mountain somewhere between the Fourth Heaven and the Seventh Heaven.","\"I might need to make a second trip to the Pavilion of Knowledge...\" he muttered.","\"Even if you find it, I would be surprised if the gate is still functional.\" The Lord suddenly said.","\"What makes you think that?\"","\"I would be hard-pressed to believe the Celestial Emperor hadn't tampered with it since it might affect his plans. After all, we would be able to travel there with our real bodies, and I am not sure if that's part of the Celestial Emperor's plans.\"","\"That makes sense...\" Yuan mumbled. \"I guess we'll find out once I go there.\"","\"By the way, why are there two Dragon Spiral Mountains, and what are their purposes? They were created before the Divine Heaven became the Nine Heavens, correct?\"","\"There are actually three Dragon Spiral Mountains in existence, and they were created to honor the Dragons of Origins, each representing a Dragon of Origin.\"","\"The one we're on right now was heavily damaged during the divide and used to be much bigger and grander. The second one was completely destroyed after a certain incident long before the divide. The third one should be safe, but as I said, I wouldn't be surprised if the Celestial Emperor did something with it.\"","\"Oh, in case you're interested, our Dragon Spiral Mountain is meant to honor the Dragon Ancestor. The Great One's mountain was the one that got demolished. The last one is for Dragon Goddess Yeyou.\"","\"Anyway, other than being used to honor the Dragons of Origins, they were also used as a means of travel by the beast clans—mostly dragon clans.\"","\"The Divine Heaven was an unfathomably vast world before the divide, so these teleporters were important for travel back then.\"","Yuan nodded and said, \"Makes sense. The Nine Heavens is still massive even though it's split into nine different realms. There are teleport formations in almost every city nowadays, too.\"","Sometime later.","\"Anyway, I will update you when I find the Dragon Spiral Mountain,\" Yuan said to the Lord before returning home.","After dinner, as they walked back to their room, Chu Liuxiang suddenly stopped in front of their room and turned to look at Yuan, who was right behind her.","\"Lulu?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow.","\"I heard what Yu Rou said a few days ago, you know?\" she said.","\"About it being unfair to Meixiu that only I get to share a room with you despite both of us being your partner.\"","\"That's—\"","Yuan tried to respond but was immediately stopped by Chu Liuxiang, \"I already spoke with Meixiu about it, and I asked her if she wanted to move in with us. We have plenty of room in the bed, after all.\"","\"I agreed.\" Meixiu's voice resounded from behind.","Yuan turned around to see Meixiu approaching them with a resolute expression on her slightly rosy face.","\"Is that so...\" Yuan mumbled with a smile on his face.","\"As for my old room, we can use it for... you know...\"","\"For when we want to do more than just sleep together.\" Chu Liuxiang, who was much bolder, finished Meixiu's sentence.","\"Are you okay with that?\" Meixiu asked Yuan.","He quickly nodded, \"Of course. Why wouldn't I?\"","That night, Meixiu moved most of her belongings into Yuan's room, and the three of them slept together. Meixiu and Chu Liuxiang decided to continue their training since they were close to a breakthrough.","The next day, they logged into Cultivation Online together.","Meixiu and Chu Liuxiang decided to continue their training since they were close to a breakthrough.","Yuan prepared to revisit the Pavilion of Knowledge to ask about the Dragon Spiral Mountain.","However, before he could go anywhere, a familiar figure appeared before him.","\"You... how did you find me?\" Yuan asked the tall and bulky figure in front of him.","\"As a Commander, I have the location of every faction member below me at my palms,\" Kelan calmly explained.","\"Did you just come back from your world? I have been waiting here for a few days now.\"","\"Yes...\" Yuan was a little speechless since this was the first time he was greeted in such a manner.","\"Since you know I'm from Earth, it's safe to assume you're not cursed.\" Kelan nodded, \"I am from the upper heavens, after all.\"","\"Anyway, whatchu up to now?\"","\"Why does it sound like you'll be following me?\" Yuan asked with raised eyebrows.","\"Because I will—for your protection. If you aren't aware, the Demon Sealing Clan and the Demon Sealing Grotto decided to send their top Demon Sealers to hunt you down after hearing about you.\"","\"They're moving faster than I'd anticipated...\" Yuan mumbled.","\"That's just how dangerous they deemed you...\" Kelan sighed.","\"Oh well. I'll deal with it when the time comes. Anyway, do you happen to know a place called the Dragon Spiral Mountain?\" Yuan suddenly asked, changing the subject.","Kelan raised an eyebrow and said, \"How do you know that place? Aren't you from the lower heavens?\"","\"So you do?\"","\"Of course. It's a pretty famous place in the Seventh Heaven—sacred, even.\"","\"I see... so it's in the Seventh Heaven... I guess I don't have to worry about it for a while.\"","\"Why are you asking?\" Kelan asked.","\"Just curious. I learned about it from the Pavilion of Knowledge.\" Yuan said.","\"Anyway, you asked what I am going to do now, right? I am going to hunt some magical beasts. Do you know a good hunting spot?\" he continued.","Kelan shrugged. \"You're asking the wrong guy. This is my first time in the Fourth Heaven.\"","\"I thought so. Then I'll go ask around.\"","Meanwhile, somewhere in the Nine Heavens, two silhouettes were chatting away while surrounded by a chaotic energy that would kill even Immortals.","\"Did you hear? The Demon Sealing Clan and the Demon Sealing Grotto have sent the majority of their top Demon Sealers to the lower heavens! This is our chance to make a move!\"","\"Finally! We have been waiting for this moment for countless years! Once we summon the Ancient, the Demon Clan will rule over this world again!\"","\"Where's Demon Emperor Carnage? I haven't seen him for a while now.\"","\"I have no clue, but he was uttering some nonsense about the Divine Paragon before disappearing. He'll show up once we start the summoning ritual.\"","\"Then let's begin. I cannot wait to take my revenge on the Demon Sealing Clan.\"","\"Without the Divine Paragon, they're just a bunch of nobodies.\"","\"Even if the Divine Paragon were still here, he'd be no match against the Ancient! Hahaha!\"","\"Hehehe...\"","These two silhouettes soon vanished, their laughter echoing eerily until they were completely gone."]},{"number":1590,"title":"Chapter 1590 Endless Beast Den","paragraphs":["\"A place with a lot of magical beasts, huh?\"","An information broker pondered Yuan's inquiry. After a brief pause, he said, \"I know of the perfect place. It's called the Endless Beast Den, and as the name suggests, an inexhaustible horde of magical beasts constantly emerges from its depths.\"","He continued, \"Nobody knows why this is happening, but it's a very famous location for cultivators to train. The only downside is that the magical beasts there never drop cores. That said, there are always people there training all year round.\"","\"Due to its popularity, unless you belong to a powerful sect or have an influential background, you will have trouble hunting there without being confronted by others.\"","\"Where is this place located?\" Yuan asked.","After receiving the location, Yuan paid the information broker several spirit stones for his services.","\"Thank you for your business.\" The information broker bowed to Yuan.","\"To think the Fourth Heaven would also have a place like this...\" Kelan muttered a moment later.","Yuan looked at him and asked, \"Is there a place like this in the upper heavens?\"","\"Yes, there are many. Some say the Heavens birthed them, while others claim they come from another world—one that is ruled by magical beasts. Unfortunately, all we know for certain is that no matter how many of them you kill, there will always be more.\"","\"Sounds like the perfect place for me...\" Yuan smiled.","Before they made their way to the Endless Beast Den, Yuan went to pick up Xi Meili, who had been visiting every restaurant in the city. \"Oh, you're back already?\" Xi Meili was in the middle of stuffing her mouth with food when Yuan appeared before her.","Yuan smiled and said, \"Take your time.\" While they waited for Xi Meili to finish her meal, Yuan explained the situation to her.","\"I see... the Endless Beast Den, huh? This is my first time hearing about such a place, so this is going to be a new experience,\" she said.","\"By the way, who's your new friend?\" Xi Meili asked with her gaze on Kelan.","\"I'm Kelan, and under the orders of my superiors, I am here to protect him.\"","\"He's from the same faction as me, the Celestial Overlords,\" Yuan said.","\"You need protection?\" Xi Meili looked at Yuan with raised eyebrows.","He was powerful enough to kill someone nine realms above his own cultivation. What could possibly threaten him in the Fourth Heaven?","\"Because of your friend's rash and reckless action, he's now being hunted by the Demon Sealing Clan and the Demon Sealing Grotto, who thinks they're hunting a powerful demon.\"","\"How powerful are they?\" Xi Meili asked.","\"They're experts that specialize in demons, but they're also some of the most powerful cultivators in the Nine Heavens since the ones coming after Yuan are top Demon Sealers. However, as long as I am here, they won't be able to do a thing to Yuan.\" Kelan patted his chest with a confident aura around his large body.","\"...\"","Yuan stared at Kelan with a pondering expression. After a moment of silence, he asked, \"I have been wondering about this for a while now, but you're unusually large. Are you related to giants or something?\"","Kelan's eyes widened with surprise after hearing Yuan's question, and he immediately responded, \"You... you know about giants?\"","\"Why do you look so surprised? Are they supposed to be a secret or something?\" Yuan asked.","\"No... but their race went extinct countless years ago, and barely anyone remembers them anymore, even in the upper heavens. You're also the first one to ask me such a question. Everyone else just assumes my size is due to a unique physique.\"","\"So you're a giant...?\" \"...\"","Kelan didn't immediately respond and appeared to be pondering whether he should tell the truth or not.","Eventually, he sighed, \"I'm not a giant, but I do have giant blood flowing through my veins.\"","\"Huh? How does that work?\"","\"Just like how some humans inject themselves with the blood of a beast to gain unique powers, I was injected with giant blood,\" Kelan said.","One of the main reasons humans hunted dragons in the past was to harvest their powerful bloodlines to use for themselves. \"Giants went extinct countless years ago, right? How did you acquire their blood?\" Xi Meili asked, her eyes filled with interest, as this was her first time learning about the existence of giants.","\"Though they may have gone extinct, remnants of their blood still exist, albeit in extreme rarity. In fact, you're more likely to encounter dragon blood than giant blood in these times,\" Kelan remarked.","\"My family happened to have some in their possession, and it was used on me due to my high compatibility.\"","\"Anyway, enough about me. Tell me more about yourself and your world, Yuan.\" Kelan looked at him.","\"Sure, but I have one more question. The superior who told you to protect me... was it Senior Bai?\"","Kelan nodded, \"Yes, but it was also a request from Celestial Overlord Xu.\"","\"I see...\"","Yuan proceeded to introduce himself from scratch.","Sometime later, the three of them left the restaurant and made their way to the Endless Beast Den.","After traveling for several days straight and using multiple teleporters, they finally arrived at the Howling Mountain Valley.","In this region, a dozen mountains pierced the clouds, and loud howling echoed from every direction.","\"There's a lot of magical beasts here, alright,\" Kelan said after sweeping the place with his divine sense.","Yuan quickly located the Endless Beast Den with his divine sense and flew straight there.","The Endless Beast Den was a vast cave nestled within one of these mountains, from which magical beasts constantly emerged.","Right outside the Endless Beast Den lay a spacious, suspiciously empty expanse of land. It seemed as if someone had purposefully cleared the area to create a training ground.","Moreover, there were already several hundred people there, all of them engaged in fights with magical beasts."]},{"number":1591,"title":"Chapter 1591 Endless Beast Den(2)","paragraphs":["After arriving at the Endless Beast Den, Yuan silently observed the scenery from the sky. Despite the presence of hundreds of people, most wore similar robes, indicating they belonged to the same sect. The rest exuded a confident and arrogant aura, suggesting they hailed from influential backgrounds.","Most of these people were between the Spirit Lord and Spirit King, with only a few in the Spirit Emperor realm.","There was a single Spirit Sovereign at the scene, but he was not training and appeared to be overseeing the disciples to ensure their safety.","The Spirit Sovereign cultivator turned to look at Yuan once he noticed their presence.","'First level Spirit Emperor at such a young age. Not to mention that tall man beside him. He must come from an influential background.' The Spirit Sovereign immediately recognized Kelan as Yuan's bodyguard due to his unfathomable aura, even though his cultivation was restricted to the peak of Spirit Enlightenment.","\"The strongest beast here is only at the peak of Spirit King. What could you possibly gain from fighting them? At your current level of strength, it wouldn't matter even if you killed a million of them.\" Kelan said to Yuan.","Yuan retrieved the Starry Abyss and said, \"I am going to strengthen my Soul Weapon.\"","Of course, this wasn't his only reason for being there.","Xi Meili then spoke, \"I am also going down there. This will be good training for me.\"","She was bored of training alone inside a confined space, and there are some things you can only learn through real experience.","\"How long do you plan on staying here?\" Kelan asked.","\"Who knows? Until I am satisfied, I guess.\"","Yuan and Xi Meili descended to the ground and started their hunting the next moment. As for Kelan, he decided to take a look around the Fourth Heaven.","His Divine Sense was powerful enough to cover the entire Fourth Heaven, so he could watch over Yuan no matter where he was. The only reason he decided to follow Yuan around was to chat, but now, with Yuan busy training, he decided to do some exploring. With that said, he made sure not to travel too far.","The area outside the Endless Beast Den was divided into three zones: the outer area, where there were the fewest beasts; the middle area, where the number of beasts was moderate; and the zone closest to the cave, which was filled to the brim with beasts.","Xi Meili went to the outer area to warm up. Meanwhile, Yuan headed straight to the zone closest to the cave. He landed right outside the entrance, where dozens of powerful beasts were gathered.","Yuan's sudden appearance surprised the few who were training near him. They wanted to call him out, but before they could even open their mouths, Yuan slew all of the magical beasts around him, killing each of them with a single strike.","After snapping out of their daze, they called out to him, \"Hey! Who do you think you are? We have this spot reserved for 30 days!\"","Without looking at them, Yuan said, \"Don't worry, I'll leave enough for you guys.\"","\"That's not the point! We paid a fortune for this spot!\"","Yuan finally turned to look at them and said, \"Someone owns this place? Who did you pay?\"","\"The Three Grand Sects has joint ownership of this place. You're not allowed to train here unless you're a disciple of their sect or pay for a spot,\" one of them explained.","Hearing this, Yuan looked around and asked, \"Are we inside their sect right now?\"","\"No...\"","\"Then do they own this land?\"","\"I don't think so...\"","\"So they're making people pay to hunt wild magical beasts in a territory that they don't even own. What kind of nonsense is that? Well, I am not going to play by their rules. If they have an issue, they can come to deal with me themselves.","Even as they conversed, magical beasts continued to emerge from the Endless Beast Den.","Yuan returned to killing magical beasts shortly after without giving the others any more attention.","The Spirit Sovereign overseeing the place frowned when he saw this. He'd initially thought Yuan already had permission to train there, but after hearing their conversation, that was clearly not the case.","And seeing that Kelan had disappeared somewhere, the Spirit Sovereign decided to approach Yuan.","\"Young man, if you do not have permission to train here, I must ask you and your friend to leave.\"","\"And who are you?\" Yuan asked without stopping his movement.","\"I am Elder Hao of the Grand Spring Sect, one of the Three Grand Sects that holds authority in this area.\"","\"So what? Are you here to ask me for money?\"","Elder Hao sneered and said, \"I don't like your attitude. We don't need your money. Leave before things become difficult.\"","\"You're the one making things difficult here. I am merely hunting magical beasts in the wild. Who are you—the Grand Spring Sect—to monopolize this? If anything, I should be getting paid for this. If you don't want unauthorized people coming here, why don't you build a sect around here or something?\"","Yuan continued killing magical beasts without stopping as he spoke to Elder Hao, who was already fuming in anger by now.","\"You must think you're invincible because you have an influential background! Unfortunately for you, no matter how influential you are, the Three Grand Sects are still above you! I will give you three seconds to get out of here before I force you!\"","Bang!","Yuan suddenly unleashed some of his aura, filling the entire Endless Beast Den with tyrannical pressure.","\"You will force me? I'd like to see you try.\" Yuan stopped hunting to glare at Elder Hao, who subconsciously started backing away from him.","Despite Yuan's clearly lower cultivation base, Elder Hao did not dare to underestimate him, as the pressure being exuded by him was stronger than even their Sect Master."]},{"number":1592,"title":"Chapter 1592 Three Grand Sects","paragraphs":["\"Are you trying to pick a fight with the Three Grand Sects? Do you have any idea what kind of trouble you're getting yourself into?\" Elder Hao growled in anger, realizing he had backed away from a junior.","Yuan casually shrugged, \"No, not really, since I am not from around here.\"","Elder Hao frowned at such words and asked, \"Are you... from the upper heavens?\"","By now, most of the sects in the lower heavens are aware of people from the upper heavens descending.","Since it was almost impossible for someone of Yuan's caliber to be unrecognizable, there was a good chance he came from the upper heavens. \"The opposite, actually. I came from the Lower Heaven.\"","Elder Hao's face immediately darkened.","\"Since you managed to climb all the way to the Fourth Heaven, your abilities and talent are unquestionably up there. However, you're simply too arrogant if you think you can offend the Three Grand Sects.\"","\"Since you're new here, let me educate you. The Three Grand Sects are the strongest and most influential sects in the Fourth Heaven! We have been in this position for millions of years! We are unshakable!\" \"Thank you for the information, but that doesn't change anything, unfortunately.\" Yuan shrugged.","Elder Hao trembled with anger, enraged that a junior would look down on the Three Grand Sects to such an extent. The Three Grand Sects were highly respected and revered by everyone, and he had never encountered anyone who refused to show them any respect.","Yet, Elder Hao didn't dare to attack Yuan.","'I won't be able to defeat him alone. I need backup.'","Thus, without saying another word, Elder Hao turned and disappeared into the distance. Seeing this, Yuan resumed his training. The others were left speechless by the results, but if Elder Hao couldn't deal with him, they had no chance. Reluctantly, they returned to their own training.","Over the next several days, Yuan killed thousands of magical beasts. However, that was far from enough to complete his task. At this rate, he'd need to spend over a hundred years at the Endless Beast Den just to complete it.","'I underestimated this task due to its simplicity... One hundred million... this might actually take the longest to complete...' Yuan sighed inwardly.","He suddenly turned to look at the cave where all of the magical beasts were emerging from.","Ever since he showed up at the Endless Beast Den, he'd been getting a weird feeling coming from the cave, almost as if it was beckoning him.","However, he'd already examined the place with Divine Sense and Divine Gaze, yet he only found an empty cave. As for the magical beasts, they simply pop into existence like magic.","Suddenly, several powerful presences appeared, filling the entire Endless Beast Den and interrupting Yuan's thoughts.","Yuan turned around to see four individuals staring at him from the sky. One of them was Elder Hao.","\"You left to bring your friends?\" Yuan smiled at them.","The group descended to the ground in the next moment, silently glaring at Yuan with profound frowns etched on their faces. These individuals were all in the early Spirit Enlightenment realm.","\"You must be the one looking down on our Three Grand Sects. Identify yourself.\" The middle-aged man standing at the very front said in a demanding tone.","Yuan tilted his head and said, \"I don't recall looking down on anyone, though. I do think it's weird you guys are monetizing this place.\"","\"With an endless number of magical beasts flowing from this cave, if people stopped training here, you'd need to hire people to constantly clean up this place, or it will quickly fill the Fourth Heaven with wild beasts, so everyone training here is actually doing this world a service.\"","\"Regardless, I believe it should cost nothing to hunt wild magical beasts.\"","\"I don't care what you believe. You will regret offending the Three Grand Sects.\" The middle-aged man sneered.","Yuan raised an eyebrow and asked, \"And how are you going to do that? By ganging up on me? I don't think it will look good on the Three Grand Sects if people hear that you'd ganged up on a junior.\"","\"Who said we're going to gang up on you? I alone am enough to deal with a brat like you,\" the middle-aged man said as he released his cultivation.","\"Which sect are you from?\" Yuan asked.","\"Grand Elder Du of the Grand Mystic Sect,\" the middle-aged man introduced himself.","\"I'm just a nobody from the Lower Heaven. I'll let you make the first move.\" Yuan spoke with a confident smile on his face.","\"Arrogant little bastard...\" Grand Elder Du's face immediately flushed red in anger, and his aura surged exponentially.","\"Profound Mystic Strike!\" Grand Elder Du extended his palms, shooting a powerful blast of spiritual energy at Yuan.","Seeing this, Yuan placed his arms behind his back and confronted the blast with his naked body.","Bang!","The ground trembled violently from the impact, reducing the area around Yuan to rubble. Yet, amidst the destruction, Yuan stood unscathed.","\"What?!\" Grand Elder Du and the others were greatly shocked by the results.","Although Grand Elder Du had no intention to kill Yuan, he definitely wanted to teach Yuan a lesson that he'd never forget.","The attack was strong enough to break most bones in a Spirit Sovereign, yet Yuan came out unscathed while being a Spirit Emperor.","Elder Hao had warned them that Yuan was far more powerful than he appeared, but none of them could have anticipated the extent of his strength.","\"I didn't feel that, so I'll give you another chance.\" Yuan suddenly said.","Yuan's provocation immediately infuriated Grand Elder Du, causing him to abandon any thought of going easy.","\"You'll regret this, brat!\"","\"Grand Mystic Typhoon!\"","Grand Elder Du created a massive typhoon of spiritual energy around Yuan.","\"This is your last chance to apologize because this will really kill you!\" Grand Elder Du warned.","Despite Yuan's arrogant behavior, he admired Yuan's talents and didn't want to destroy them in such a fashion."]},{"number":1593,"title":"Chapter 1593 Rift","paragraphs":["\"Whoa! Run away! If you're caught up in that, you're dead!\"","Grand Elder Du's Grand Mystic Typhoon was strong enough to kill every entity there, and not wanting to get caught up in their mess, the people at the Endless Beast Den began running away.","\"We've only been here a few days, and he's already angered someone? He's really talented in that regard, as well.\" Xi Meili chuckled slightly before returning to her training.","She had no doubt that Yuan would be able to handle a few Spirit Sovereigns alone and was not worried for his safety in the slightest.","\"Don't force my hand, young man! This is your final warning!\" Grand Elder Du warned Yuan for the final time.","\"If you're that worried for me, why even bother attacking me in the first place? Just get this over with so I can return to my training.\" Yuan said, sounding a little bored.","\"What a pity!\" Grand Elder Du shook his head and increased the rate at which he gathered his spiritual energy.","A few moments later, he released all of that built-up energy, unleashing the technique.","The massive typhoon immediately collapsed on Yuan, consuming him and everything around him. The magical beasts swallowed by the technique were instantly torn to shreds, and their blood scattered everywhere, causing it to rain blood.","Grand Elder Du panted afterward, completely out of spiritual energy after using that one devastating technique.","\"A-are you sure it was okay to kill him when we don't even know his identity? A talent like that surely didn't come from nowhere. What if he lied about coming from the Lower Heaven and actually came from the Upper Heavens?\" one of the other individuals brought by Elder Hao asked in a slightly worried tone.","\"I think it's a little too late to ask those questions now, Grand Elder Lu,\" another individual said.","Grand Elder Du nodded and said, \"Grand Elder Tang is right. We're way past that now. I didn't want to kill him, but he left me no choice.\"","\"You make it sound like I had a sword against your neck or threatened your life.\" A familiar voice suddenly resounded.","\"W-what...?\"","\"T-that's impossible!\" Grand Elder Du exclaimed after hearing Yuan's voice, shouting so loud that his saliva went everywhere.","Whoosh!","As if cut by a sword, the typhoon suddenly split perfectly in half.","Once the typhoon dispersed, Yuan could be seen standing in his original location without so much as a single blemish on his body.","\"Y-you must have used a life-saving treasure! There's no other explanation!\" Grand Elder Du cried out loud, not daring to believe that Yuan had endured his most powerful technique with his bare body.","Without responding, Yuan suddenly took a step forward and disappeared into thin air.","When he reappeared, he was standing right in front of Grand Elder Du with a domineering aura around him.","Before Grand Elder Du could even respond, Yuan swung his arm, backhanding Grand Elder Du in the face and sending him flying.","\"?!?!\"","Seeing this, the other two and Elder Hao immediately went into a combative stance. Yuan glanced at them and said, \"I will only attack those who attack me first, so if you wish for me to attack you, let me know. Otherwise, I'm going to resume my training.\"","Grand Elder Lu and Grand Elder Tang exchanged glances with each other. They were all Grand Elders, second to the Sect Masters of the Three Grand Sects. They had never been disrespected in such a manner, much less threatened by a junior.","They were both Spirit Sovereigns, an entire realm above Yuan in terms of cultivation. Logically speaking, they should be able to deal with him without even breaking a sweat. Yet, neither of them felt like they could defeat him.","As for Elder Hao... if he thought he could defeat Yuan, he wouldn't have requested help from three experts.","\"If you're not going to do anything, I will resume my training now. Don't worry, I will make sure I don't bother the others while I am training as long as they don't bother me, and I will leave as soon as I am satisfied.\"","After uttering such words, Yuan turned around and continued hunting magical beasts without a care in the world, leaving the Grand Elders speechless.","\"Maybe we should just leave him alone... It's not like he's bothering anyone...\" Grand Elder Lu mumbled.","\"Huh? You want to let him go after he spat on our faces? If we don't do anything, the Three Grand Sects will become a laughingstock once news begins spreading!\" Grand Elder Tang looked at her with wide eyes.","Grand Elder Lu turned to look at Grand Elder Du, who was lying on the ground unconscious several miles away after receiving Yuan's slap.","\"Let's attack him together! I bet he's only acting tough!\" Grand Elder Tang said with a serious frown on his face.","\"But I only came here to spectate...\" Grand Elder Lu sighed.","\"Do you have any idea how much our images will hurt if we back down now?! Not only will we be forfeiting to a junior, but we even allowed him to disrespect the Three Grand Sects! I'd be surprised if we remain Grand Elders if we leave without doing anything!\"","Grand Elder Lu clenched her teeth after hearing Grand Elder Tang's persuasion, but she couldn't refute his words.","\"Alright... let's attack him together...\" she eventually agreed.","Grand Elder Tang nodded in acknowledgment.","The next moment, their aura began surging when they started gathering spiritual energy for their technique.","\"...\"","Yuan noticed what they were trying to do, but he simply ignored them and continued his training, acting as if they weren't even there.","His indifference and blatant lack of respect infuriated the Grand Elders, causing their aura to skyrocket.","The Grand Elders unleashed their techniques simultaneously a moment later, and their combined techniques crashed into Yuan and the Endless Beast Den.","The impact violently shook the ground, causing a powerful earthquake.","Additionally, the mountain with the Endless Beast Den exploded.","\"...\"","The entire place became dead silent as everyone stared at the destruction with wide eyes. The only individual who wasn't paying attention was Xi Meili, who was still focused on her target.","Suddenly, a powerful wind with a vacuum effect emerged, drawing in the dust and rubble.","Once all of the dust was gone, everyone could see that a rift had appeared where the Endless Beast Den once existed.","\"What is that?\" Grand Elder Lu asked.","\"No idea... but that wasn't there a moment ago...\" Grand Elder Tang said. \"Anyway, where did that brat go? Did we vaporize him?\"","\"Wait... there's no more magical beasts appearing...\" Elder Hao suddenly noticed this.","\"What? Is it because we destroyed the mountain?\" Grand Elder Lu immediately began panicking.","\"That's not possible! This isn't the first time the Endless Beast Den has been blown up, and the beasts continued to appear despite that!\" Grand Elder Tang quickly said.","\"Yuan...?\" Xi Meili suddenly halted her training when she noticed that Yuan's presence had suddenly disappeared.","When she saw the rift, she immediately thought Yuan had entered it and quickly approached it. However, before she could get close, the rift closed, vanishing into thin air."]},{"number":1594,"title":"Chapter 1594 Yuan’s Disappearance","paragraphs":["After realizing that Yuan had completely disappeared, Xi Meili immediately transformed and approached Grand Elder Lu, who was stunned by her transformation.","\"You bastards! What did you do to him?! Where did you take him?!\"","Xi Meili grabbed the stunned Grand Elder Lu by the collar of her robes and roared, disregarding the difference in their cultivation.","\"It's a dragon!\" The people there were incredibly excited to see someone from the Dragon Clan there, as dragons were incredibly rare within the Fourth Heaven.","\"W-wait! We aren't responsible for the rift!\" Grand Elder Lu exclaimed, clearly nervous about Xi Meili's identity.","\"Bullshit! You were the ones who attacked him!\" Xi Meili refused to believe that they were not responsible for Yuan's disappearance.","\"Please let her go. Although we attacked him, we didn't create that rift.\" Grand Elder Tang grabbed Xi Meili's wrist and spoke with a deep frown.","\"I swear on my soul that we didn't purposefully create that rift! This is the first time I've seen or heard of anything like that, too!\" Grand Elder Lu shouted.","However, Xi Meili refused to let her go.","Suddenly, another voice resounded, \"Let her go. They're not responsible.\" Xi Meili turned around to see Kelan descending toward them.","\"Che.\" Xi Meili reluctantly released Grand Elder Lu, who quickly stepped back.","\"Who are you?\" Grand Elder Tang asked Kelan with a worried frown. Just by Kelan's formidable aura alone, he could tell that he was not someone they could offend.","Kelan, who made a swift return after noticing Yuan's presence had disappeared, revealed his Faction Symbol and said, \"I am Kelan from the faction Celestial Overlords.\" \"The Celestial Overlords!?\" The Grand Elders were greatly bewildered by this information.","Although the Celestial Overlords primarily operated within the Upper Heavens, their reputation and influence were immense enough to reach the Fourth Heavens.","'What the hell is such a bigshot doing in the Fourth Heaven?! And he's even a Commander!' Grand Elder Tang cried inwardly.","As mighty and influential as the Three Grand Sects were, they were no different than ants before the Celestial Overlords. With just a single command, even someone at the rank of Commander like Kelan could wipe out the Three Grand Sects, and nobody would even question them. That was how powerful the Celestial Overlords were.","\"This humble junior greets the Commander! Please forgive my earlier disrespect!\" Grand Elder Tang quickly bowed, his tone laden with reverence. Grand Elder Lu immediately followed suit, mirroring his deference.","Seeing that Kelan hadn't responded, Grand Elder Tang quickly continued, \"Please let me explain—\"","Kelan immediately interrupted, \"You don't need to explain anything. I have been watching from the beginning, so I understand the situation fully.\"","\"Do you know why Yuan disappeared?! If he was taken by the rift, where did it take him?!\" Xi Meili urgently asked Kelan, her voice filled with desperation.","'That young man has connections with the Celestial Ovelords?! We're doomed!' Elder Hao cried inwardly after connecting the dots.","Kelan looked at Xi Meili and responded, \"I don't know where he was taken, but I have some speculations.\"","\"Although nobody really knows where the magical beasts come from, people have speculated that they come from another world—one that is filled with endless magical beasts. As for why they're being sent to the Nine Heavens, we don't have the slightest clue.\"","\"The rift that took Yuan... I have heard about it before. They rarely appear when an 'Endless Beast Den' is destroyed. Many people have entered such a rift to explore the unknown and find out where the magical beasts are coming from, but nobody has returned so far, and people eventually stopped entering them.\"","\"What?! Nobody has managed to return?! Are you certain about that?! But Yuan—!\" Xi Meili didn't dare to finish her sentence.","Kelan understood what Xi Meili was trying to say and gritted his teeth in anger. He was tasked to protect Yuan and failed miserably so quickly.","\"I'll need to contact my superiors. Maybe they will know what to do...\" Kelan eventually said.","\"Y-your superiors...?\" The Grand Elders swallowed nervously after hearing such words.","The only ones ranking above a Commander are Overlords and Celestial Overlords. Should an individual of such stature descend to the Fourth Heaven, it would undoubtedly provoke an immense commotion.","\"What should I do...?\" Xi Meili asked.","\"Just stay here and wait for my return. Who knows. Maybe Yuan will return while I am away.\" Kelan said before disappearing into the horizon.","\"I-I must contact my Sect Leader!\" Grand Elder Tang exclaimed, his entire being soaked in sweat.","\"M-me, too!\" Grand Elder Lu said.","Shortly after the two Grand Elders left the scene, Grand Elder Du woke up from his slumber.","Seeing this, Elder Hao immediately rushed to his side.","\"W-what happened to me? Where am I...?\" Grand Elder Du looked at his surroundings with a dazed face.","Grand Elder Du quickly came to his senses and jumped up, \"Where's that little bastard?!\"","\"Grand Elder! We have an emergency!\" Elder Hao cried out loud once he reached Grand Elder Du's side.","\"Huh? Elder Hao? What's the matter?\"","\"We need to return to the sect and speak with the Sect Leader!\"","\"Why? What happened?\" \"I don't have the time to explain! We need to leave immediately!\" Elder Hao didn't say anything else and flew away.","Grand Elder Du looked around but couldn't see either Yuan or the other two Grand Elders.","'They must have dealt with that little bastard and left already.'","With that in mind, he also left the scene shortly after.","The people training at the Endless Beast Den had to stop their training because no more magical beasts spawned, not to mention their situation.","In the blink of an eye, the Endless Beast Den was devoid of people, falling completely silent for the first time in thousands of years.","Meanwhile, after being sucked in by the rift, Yuan found himself in an unfamiliar territory.","\"Where...am I?\" he muttered in a dazed voice as he surveyed his surroundings."]},{"number":1595,"title":"Chapter 1595 A Foreign World","paragraphs":["After quickly surveying his surroundings, Yuan found himself in the middle of a wilderness filled with oddly shaped, tall trees unlike any he had ever seen before. The sky was an ominous orange with a hint of red, and not a single cloud marred its expanse.","A unique and unmistakable stench of blood filled the air, reminiscent of the battlefield during his time as the Evil God. However, it was not the scent of human blood but that of beasts.","Beastly howls echoed from every direction. In fact, Yuan could sense tens of thousands of magical beasts in the area. Their strength varied greatly, ranging from the level of Spirit Apprentice to the Divine Realm.","\"Brother Yuan... where are we?\" Xiao Hua came out of his Dantian and asked, her face filled with curiosity and worry. \"I have no clue...\" Yuan shook his head.","Yu Ning's voice resounded a moment later, \"Young Master... I don't know where we are, but this place is so massive that my Divine Sense cannot see all of it. Moreover, I could not find a single human being. This place is filled to the brim with magical beasts. Also...\"","\"...It appears that many powerful magical beasts are quickly approaching our direction, and they all seem frenzied, like starved beasts.\" \"...\"","After a moment of silence, Yuan looked at Xiao Hua and said, \"Xiao Hua, return to my Dantian for now.\"","She nodded and immediately returned to his Dantian before asking, \"What about you?\"","\"This is just my guess, but I think they are likely drawn by my scent—the scent of a human, a rarity in this place that seems to be filled with magical beasts,\" Yuan speculated.","\"You're right about that.\"","An unfamiliar voice suddenly resounded behind Yuan, startling him.","'What?!'","Like a startled cat, Yuan instantly leaped away and readied himself for combat. However, his eyebrows arched in surprise upon seeing the individual who had just spoken.","Standing right where he had just been was a little girl who appeared even younger than Xiao Hua. She had pitch-black hair that cascaded down her back like a waterfall, reaching the ground. Her eyes were clear and filled with intrigue. Yet, despite her human appearance, she exuded an aura that felt anything but human. Moreover, she was completely naked.","\"W-when did she get there? No... how long has she been there? Even now, despite looking at her with my very eyes, I cannot sense her presence, almost as if I am staring at a ghost,\" Yu Ning exclaimed in a shocked voice.","Yuan narrowed his eyes on the little girl. He also failed to sense her presence, even at this very moment. Fortunately, she didn't appear to be a threat to them for the time being.","\"Who are you?\" Yuan decided to ask her.","\"Are you sure you want to worry about me right now? You'll be dead in a few moments once the others arrive,\" she said.","Yuan gritted his teeth. The magical beasts approaching them were all in the Divine Realm. Yu Ning also warned him of magical beasts at the level of immortals that were too far for his Divine Sense to pick up.","\"Since they're here because of my scent...\"","Yuan's aura suddenly surged, and his body began to transform.","The little girl's eyes widened with awe as Yuan entered his dragon form.","\"You smell like a dragon now, but you had a vastly different scent just moments ago—one that I have never encountered before. Is this what humans are? I have only heard about your species but never met one,\" she inquired, her eyes brimming with interest, almost like that of a child visiting the amusement park for the first time.","Hearing her question, Yuan became certain that she was not human.","\"Sorry, but I need to leave this place for now...\"","Not wanting to wait for the magical beasts to arrive, Yuan used his movement technique and swiftly left the scene.","\"...\"","The little girl silently stood there.","A few moments later, a red beast resembling a jaguar emerged. Initially, it didn't notice the little girl, but when it finally laid eyes on her, a terrified expression crossed its face, and its body trembled with immense fear.","Without any hesitation, the jaguar turned around and ran away with its tail tucked between its legs.","This scene repeated several more times for the beasts that showed up at her location until the little girl disappeared into thin air like a ghost. Sometime later, after running for days without stopping, Yuan finally came to a halt.","\"This should be far enough,\" he mumbled, feeling relieved that none of the magical beasts chased after him.","He lifted his head to look at the sky, which had remained unchanged despite the passage of many days.","\"Just where in the world are we...?\" he sighed out loud.","\"We're currently at the Enchanted Forest.\" A calm and familiar voice responded to Yuan's sigh.","\"What the—?!\" Yuan jumped after being startled again.","His eyes widened with surprise after seeing the little girl had managed to follow him.","'Yu Ning, can you sense her cultivation base...?' he asked.","'No... I cannot sense anything about her... It's like she doesn't even exist,' she quickly replied.","After a moment of silence, Yuan asked the little girl, \"Enchanted Forest... where is that in the Nine Heavens?\"","The little girl slightly tilted her head and said, \"Nine Heavens? I don't know of that place.\"","\"W-we're not even in the Nine Heavens...?\" Yuan swallowed nervously after learning this information, though he was not entirely certain of its credibility. After all, it was possible that they were still in the Nine Heavens, but the little girl might not be aware of it.","He looked at the little girl and continued asking, \"Then do you know what this world is called?\"","\"What a weird question,\" the little girl said. \"But I'll entertain you. This world is called the Primal Expanse.\" \"Primal Expanse...?\" Yuan repeated in a dazed voice.","'Have you heard of this place? Yu Ning? Xiao Hua?' he asked them.","'No...' they both replied simultaneously.","'Well, I'll be damned...'"]},{"number":1596,"title":"Chapter 1596 Primal Expanse","paragraphs":["After taking a moment to digest the possibility that they had been transported to another world outside the Nine Heavens, Yuan turned to look at the mysterious naked little girl and asked, \"Do you mind telling us a little about the Primal Expanse?\"","Since the little girl had been answering his questions without any issues, Yuan figured it wouldn't be an issue to continue asking her questions.","This time, however, she said, \"I do mind. It feels like I am being used, and I don't like it.\"","\"Sorry... that wasn't my intention. What do you propose, then?\" Yuan quickly apologized to her.","\"I want you to answer some of my questions now,\" she proposed.","He nodded, \"That seems fair. What do you want to know?\"","\"Where did you come from? Your presence appeared out of thin air.\"","\"I came from a place called the Nine Heavens. I don't know how I got here, but I was sucked inside a rift and arrived here before I realized it.\"","The little girl took a moment to digest this information before asking the next question, \"You're a human, right? Does this Nine Heavens have a lot of humans?\"","\"Yes to both questions.\"","\"Where is the Nine Heavens?\"","\"Sorry, but I don't think I can answer that question—not because I don't want to. Since I don't know where we currently are, there's simply no way for me to pinpoint the Nine Heavens.\"","The little girl tilted her head in a puzzled manner and said, \"But I already told you. We're at the Enchanted Forest within the Primal Expanse.\"","\"Well, you see...\"","Yuan took a moment to think about how he'd go about explaining the situation to her.","\"This is actually my first time hearing about a place called the Primal Expanse, and I am not sure if it's a place somewhere within the Nine Heavens or outside—like another world. That's why I wanted to know more about the Primal Expanse, so I can figure that out.\"","\"I see.\" The little girl mumbled.","After a moment of silence, she spoke, \"I have never heard of the Nine Heavens, but the Primal Expanse is a world of its own.\"","\"If you traverse beyond the sky and leave this world, you will only enter an empty, endless dark world we call the 'Infinite Expanse'.\"","Yuan then spoke, \"If the Primal Expanse is its own world, it's safe to assume that it's separate from the Nine Heavens.\"","He wondered if it was a situation similar to Earth and the Nine Heavens, where the Primal Expanse used to be part of Divine Heaven before the split happened.","\"So... humans are a rarity in this place, huh?\"","The little girl then said, \"A rarity is an understatement. Humans essentially don't exist in this world. According to legends, humans would occasionally appear in our world in the past, but it's been millions of years since we've had a human visitor.\"","\"So only magical beasts exist within the Primal Expanse?\" Yuan asked.","\"Magical beasts? What is that?\" The little girl asked.","Yuan raised an eyebrow and explained, \"In the Nine Heavens, beasts with spiritual energy that lack intellect and only act upon instincts are called Magical Beasts. Then there are Divine Beasts. They are as intelligent as humans and can even transform into one—like you.\"","The little girl fell silent again. After a moment of silence, she spoke, \"In the Primal Expanse, those who cannot speak and only act upon instincts are called Primals. I am what you call a Predator.\"","\"...\"","Yuan found their wording quite weird, but who was he to judge their world?","\"Primal and Predators, right? I will remember that.\"","Yuan fell silent afterward and wore a pondering expression on his face.","After connecting the dots, he was certain that the Primal Expanse and the Nine Heavens were connected in some way. After all, the very rift that transported him to the Primal Expanse appeared after the Endless Beast Den was destroyed.","'It's very likely the magical beasts that appear out of thin air came from the Primal Expanse. In that case, there must be a way to return to the Nine Heavens.'","He also wondered if Xi Meili had chased after him.","'Either way, there's no method to contact her while I am here. In that case...'","Yuan turned to look at the little girl and said, \"I will be right back.\"","He logged off Cultivation Online the next moment.","When he returned to Earth, both Chu Liuxiang and Meixiu were lying beside him.","He went to see if Meifeng was also in Cultivation Online.","When he couldn't find Meifeng, he used Divine Sense and immediately located her inside her room with the helmet on.","The others were also inside Cultivation Online.","With no other options, Yuan took out a piece of paper and began writing on it.","Once he was finished, he placed the paper beside the bed and returned to Cultivation Online.","\"Where did you go just now? Your presence completely disappeared. How did you do it?\"","Yuan was bombarded with questions the moment he returned to Cultivation Online.","'If she's questioning it, it's safe to assume the Celestial Emperor's curse has no influence here, or her cultivation is simply that strong.'","\"I'll answer your questions, but can you put on some clothes first? Even if you aren't human, it doesn't feel right when I look at you.\" After all, the little girl looked even younger than Xiao Hua. He hadn't mentioned it until now because he wasn't comfortable enough with her to make such demands, as it could offend her, who wasn't human.","\"Clothes? What is that?\" she asked.","Yuan pointed at his own robes and said, \"These are clothes—something you wear on your body to cover your skin.\"","\"Oh, those? I don't have any. And why should I wear them? I don't want to feel restricted,\" she quickly rejected.","Yuan sighed inwardly, 'I guess I'll just have to deal with it for now until we part ways.'","He didn't want to seem forceful and offend this little girl who was definitely much stronger than she appeared.","\"By the way, if humans don't exist and you've never encountered one, why are you in the form of one?\" Yuan asked a question that had been on his mind for some time now.","\"It's a popular thing to do amongst Predators, but I only took this form shortly after your appearance since I figured it would be easier to have a conversation with you,\" she said.","'Is this why she somewhat resembles Xiao Hua...?' Yuan wondered inwardly."]},{"number":1597,"title":"Chapter 1597 Weird Spiritual Energy","paragraphs":["\"By the way, my name's Yuan. What should I call you?\" Yuan said suddenly, recalling that he hadn't introduced himself.","\"You can call me Yingzi,\" she said.","'So they also have names here, huh?' Yuan mused to himself.","Given that names are primarily a human custom, he assumed that entities in this world might not follow such practices.","However, after thinking about it for a moment, he realized it wasn't that weird for them to have names since some of them also wear clothes.","'They must have learned a thing or two from the humans who have traversed this world in the past.'","\"Do you know what happened to the humans that came to this world before?\" Yuan decided to ask.","\"Most of them were killed and consumed,\" Yingzi responded without an ounce of pity in her tone.","She continued, \"As for those that survived, they were enslaved by Predators and studied.\"","Yuan shuddered at this information.","\"So there's a possibility that some humans may still exist in this world?\" he inquired.","Yingzi pondered for a moment before nodding, \"It's possible, but very unlikely. The last human to appear was several million years ago, and humans cannot live that long.\"","\"If they're an Immortal, they should be able to survive that long, though,\" Yuan said.","However, before Yingzi even responded, Xiao Hua's voice resounded inside his head, \"B-Brother Yuan! The spiritual energy in this place is very weird!\"","\"What?\" Yuan raised an eyebrow.","Yu Ning's voice followed: \"I can't believe we haven't noticed this until now. While the spiritual energy in this world may seem normal at a glance, it is actually incredibly difficult to absorb!\"","\"...\"","Yuan also hadn't noticed this change since their bizarre situation had completely occupied his mind. If Xiao Hua hadn't mentioned it, he probably wouldn't have noticed until much later.","However, when Yuan tried to absorb the spiritual energy around him to experiment, he didn't notice any difference.","\"Huh? Are you sure? I am absorbing it just fine, nor do I feel any difference when compared to the Nine Heavens.\"","\"Seriously...? But when I try to absorb it, I would only get about 1 percent of what I should... It's like trying to breathe while being choked.\" Yu Ning tried to describe her own experience.","\"It's the same for me.\" Xiao Hua said.","Perhaps this was the real reason why Yuan hadn't noticed anything. After all, he was absorbing the spiritual energy there just fine.","'If the others were also having trouble absorbing the spiritual energy in this place, even Immortals would slowly perish from a lack of spiritual energy...'","Yuan quickly understood why Yingzi claimed that humans couldn't live for so long. However, he couldn't figure out why he was able to absorb the spiritual energy there without any issues.","\"Hey.\" Yingzi suddenly called out to him.","\"Yes?\"","\"What does it mean to be human?\" she asked, her eyes flickering with intrigue.","\"Uhh... that's a really difficult question to answer... If I were to ask you what it means to be a Predator, how would you respond?\"","Yingzi pondered for a moment before responding, \"I don't know.\"","Yuan then said, \"The question of what it means to be human is deeply philosophical. I can't define what it means to be human universally since everyone differs. Whether it be our culture, morals, ethics, emotions, and even biology, none of that really defines us as human. If anything, I'd say it's our soul that makes us human.\"","\"Your soul...? I don't understand. I also have a soul, but I am not human,\" said Yingzi.","\"I guess it'd be more accurate to say the shape of our soul? I don't know.\" Yuan shrugged.","Yingzi fell silent again.","'What's she thinking now?' Yuan wondered.","A few moments later, Yingzi suddenly wore a look of enlightenment on her face, and she spoke, \"Then I'll observe you until I understand what it means to be human.\"","\"You want to observe me...?\" Yuan had a bad feeling about this.","'Does this mean she'll be following me as I explore this world?'","He wanted to politely refuse, but he had a feeling that she wouldn't care about what he had to say and would still follow him regardless. Moreover, he risked offending her by refusing her company, which might get him killed.","'Maybe this won't be as bad as I am imagining. She's been a great help thus far,' he thought, trying to be positive about the situation.","If it weren't for Yingzi, he probably would still be trying to figure out his location.","He spoke a moment later, \"If you want to understand what it's like to be human, you can start by wearing clothes. All of the humans in my world wear clothes throughout the day.\"","\"...\"","Yingzi frowned slightly at his suggestion, but it made sense.","\"I don't have any clothes,\" she reminded him.","'Xiao Hua, do you have extra clothes?' he asked her since they had a similar build.","Xiao Hua came out of his Dantian for a split second to hand him a pair of robes before quickly returning to his body to avoid attracting the beasts there with her scent.","However, even though it was only for a split second, the Primals nearby had already noticed Xiao Hua's scent and were rushing in their direction.","Seeing this, Yuan quickly handed the clothes to Yingzi and said, \"Here, you can wear this. Come find me when you're done.\"","Without explaining further, Yuan turned around and left the scene.","\"...\"","Yingzi stared at the black robes in her grasp with a profound expression on her face.","After spending several minutes staring at it, she reluctantly started wearing it.","While Yingzi struggled to figure out how to wear the clothes, numerous Primals arrived at the scene, drawn by Xiao Hua's lingering scent. However, their excitement quickly turned to terror as they noticed Yingzi's presence, and they swiftly departed.","Once she had managed to dress herself, Yingzi looked in the direction Yuan had gone and began chasing after him."]},{"number":1598,"title":"Chapter 1598 Sect Leaders of the Three Grand Sects","paragraphs":["A whole week has passed since Yuan was transported to the Primal Expanse. During this time, Xi Meili remained at the Endless Beast Den, anxiously waiting for Yuan to return.","Kelan went to speak with Senior Bai and explained the situation to him. Unsurprisingly, Senior Bai was extremely upset to hear this news. \"Forgive me, Senior Bai. I have failed my mission.\" Kelan lowered his head and apologized.","Senior Bai didn't respond for a long time before sighing, \"You're not at fault. I doubt I would be able to prevent it even if I were right beside him. Also, nobody could've expected a rift to appear. Follow me.\"","\"Are we going to...?\" Kelan swallowed nervously and asked.","Senior Bai nodded, confirming his suspicions, \"Yes, we're going to speak with the Celestial Overlord.\"","Sometime later, Senior Bai and Kelan stood before Xu Jiaqi, who was sitting behind her desk that was stacked with mountains of papers.","\"Didn't you just leave?\" Xu Jiaqi spoke without even looking at them.","Senior Bai responded, \"Sorry, but this is urgent.\"","\"I've been hearing that word a lot lately. What is it this time?\"","Senior Bai turned to look at Kelan, his gaze gesturing to Kelan to do the speaking for obvious reasons.","Kelan took a deep breath before falling to his knees and kowtowing.","\"Due to my incompetence, Yuan, who I had been tasked to watch over, was swallowed by a rift!\" he spoke in a shouting voice.","However, Xu Jiaqi merely raised an eyebrow and muttered, \"A rift? What rift?\"","\"The ones that rarely appear when an Infinite Beast Spawn is destroyed...\" Kelan clarified.","\"What?! How did that happen?!\" Xu Jiaqi exclaimed.","\"This is what happened...\" Kelan proceeded to recall everything that led to Yuan being swallowed by the rift.","Xu Jiaqi wore a deep frown on her face throughout the entire thing.","\"And that's how Yuan entered the rift...\"","Once Kelan was done, a profound silence filled the room.","After a long moment of silence, Xu Jiaqi stood up and began walking to the exit.","\"Where are you going?\" Senior Bai inquired.","\"I'm going to speak with an expert. Then, I am going to head down to the Fourth Heaven,\" she said.","\"Don't take this the wrong way, but even if we go down there, what can we do? Nobody has ever returned from the other side.\" Senior Bai shook his head.","\"...\" Xu Jiaqi halted her movement after hearing his words.","A moment later, she walked out of the room without responding.","Senior Bai looked at Kelan, who appeared to be on the verge of tears from fear, and said, \"Let's go.\"","\"Where...?\" he asked.","\"The Fourth Heaven.\"","While Xu Jiaqi disappeared somewhere, Senior Bai and Kelan made their way to the Fourth Heaven. However, due to Senior Bai's identity and position within the Celestial Overlords, more work and effort were required before he could be permitted to enter the Fourth Heaven.","Upon arriving at the Endless Beast Den, Senior Bai was surprised to see many experts there.","\"The Three Grand Sects, huh? How are they involved?\" Senior Bai asked Kelan.","Kelan didn't go into detail and only recalled the important parts when he explained the situation, so Senior Bai wasn't aware the Three Grand Sects were involved.","\"Actually, they were the ones who were fighting with Yuan,\" he explained.","\"Huh? The Three Grand Sects? Why?\"","Kelan explained how Yuan thought it was silly to monetize hunting wild magical beasts, which started the whole fight.","Senior Bai rubbed his eyes in a stressed manner and sighed, \"What a headache.\"","They descended shortly after.","A few days before Senior Bai and Kelan arrived at the Endless Beast Den, the Sect Leaders of the Three Grand Sects gathered there after being informed of the situation.","\"E-excuse me...\" The Sect Leader of the Grand Mystic Sect approached Xi Meili, who hadn't moved from her spot since Kelan left.","\"...\"","Xi Meili didn't respond.","Despite being ignored, the Sect Leader wasn't offended, or more precisely, didn't dare to be offended.","He continued, \"I am Du Daomi, the Sect Leader of the Grand Mystic Sect. I would like to apologize for what happened to your friend—\"","\"Save your breath.\" Xi Meili suddenly interrupted. \"We both know you don't care.\"","The Sect Leader immediately became speechless. After a moment of silence, he returned to the other two Sect Leaders.","\"It's pointless. We might actually make things worse if we try to appease her,\" said Du Daomi.","\"So what do we do? Wait for the people from Celestial Overlord to show up and kill us?\" The Sect Leader of the Grand Harmony Sect said.","\"Don't say that... the Celestial Overlord is a righteous faction. They wouldn't kill us over something like this... right?\" The Sect Leader of the Grand Defiance Sect said.","In addition to the Sect Leaders of the Three Grand Sects, those directly involved with the incident, such as the Grand Elders and Elder Hao, were also present.","\"Fuck... this is all your fault, Elder Hao. Why did you have to bother that young man?\" Grand Elder Du cursed, blaming him for everything.","\"Don't push your blame on me, Grand Elder! I was only doing my job! You were the one who initiated the fight!\" Elder Hao exclaimed.","\"So what?! I wasn't the one who destroyed the Endless Beast Den!\" Grand Elder Du turned to look at Grand Elder Tang and Grand Elder Lu, whose complexions were as pale as sheets.","\"I-I only wanted to spectate! Grand Elder Tang was the one who pressured me into attacking him!\" Grand Elder Lu pointed her fingers at him.","\"Shut up! I was only avenging Grand Elder Du and trying to save face for the Three Grand Sects! If you weren't so weak, Grand Elder Du, we wouldn't be here right now!\" Grand Elder Tang redirected the blame to Grand Elder Du again, going in circles.","They continued to blame each other for the next several days until Senior Bai and Kelan appeared before them."]},{"number":1599,"title":"Chapter 1599 Infinite Beast Spawn Rift","paragraphs":["When Grand Elder Lu and Grand Elder Tang noticed Kelan approaching them, they immediately alerted their Sect Leaders.","\"S-Sect Leader! It's the Celestial Overlord! They're here!\"","\"What?!\"","The Sect Leaders immediately froze after hearing this. They were too busy pondering how they could fix their situation to notice Senior Bai and Kelan's presence.","'Fuck! We messed up!' They cried inwardly.","However, they had no time to think and immediately greeted Senior Bai and Kelan.","They clasped their hands and lowered their body in a respectful manner, \"We greet the seniors from Celestial Overlord.\"","Kelan responded, \"If you're here to apologize or make excuses, you can save your breath. We're not here for you.\"","\"R-really...? You're not going to punish us? Even if it might cost me my life, I have to admit that we're partially responsible for what happened.\" Du Daomi lifted his head and said.","\"While you've admitted to being responsible, are you going to take responsibility? How are you going to do that?\" Senior Bai stepped forward and asked.","\"T-that's... we will no longer monetize the Endless Beast Den...\" Du Daomi said.","Of course, this decision was made on the spot without the other two Sect Leader's approval. However, neither of them objected to it.","Although no magical beasts are currently spawning, it was due to the appearance of a rift. Once a rift appears, no more magical beasts would spawn for at least ten years.","Senior Bai sneered at their approach to accountability. Despite what happened to Yuan, he could not bring himself to place the blame squarely on the Three Grand Sects.","If the rift hadn't appeared, what they did would only qualify as a skirmish since they wouldn't have been able to hurt Yuan, much less kill him.","The Celestial Overlords were a righteous faction, and causing trouble for the Three Grand Sects over this unfortunate incident would only tarnish their reputation.","The next moment, Senior Bai walked past them and approached Xi Meili.","\"How are you doing? I am Bai Linyu, a friend of Yuan.\"","'Bai Linyu?! The Sect Master of the Gates of Heaven?!'","Those from the Three Great Sects were greatly shocked and bewildered after learning Senior Bai's identity.","Senior Bai was a prominent figure not only in the upper heavens but also revered in the lower heavens for his virtue. To ascend the ranks of the Celestial Overlords, one must accumulate good karma through acts of righteousness, so one could imagine how much Senior Bai had done to reach his rank of Overlord.","Furthermore, Senior Bai was the Sect Leader of the Gates of Heaven, a top-tier sect that spanned across the Fifth Heaven, Seventh Heaven, and Supreme Heaven.","Not many sects from the upper heavens establish branches in the lower heavens due to resource constraints, but those that do are considered the elite of the elite.","\"Bai...? Are you the owner of the Myriad of Techniques?\" Xi Meili asked, as she recalled Yuan mentioning him to her before.","\"Yes, you're correct.\" Senior Bai nodded with a friendly smile on his face.","\"I see...\"","After a moment of silence, Xi Meili continued, \"Please tell me you know a way to save Yuan...\"","The smile on Senior Bai's face immediately disappeared, replaced with a perplexed expression.","\"Unfortunately, nobody has ever returned after entering the rift. However, my superior is currently seeking an expert's help, so there might still be hope. For now, we can only wait for my superior to show up.\"","Those from the Three Grand Sects felt their heart skip a beat after hearing this information.","Senior Bai was an Overlord of Celestial Overlords, so only a Celestial Overlord would qualify to be his supervisor.","\"S-Senior... does this mean a Celestial Overlord will make an appearance here...?\" The Sect Leader of Grand Harmony Sect asked Kelan with a nervous look on his face.","Kelan looked at him and said, \"Not just any Celestial Overlord, either. Lady Xu will make an appearance herself.\"","\"C-Celestial Overlord Xu Jiaqi?!?!\" Du Daomi fell on his buttocks after hearing her name.","Among the few Celestial Overlords in their faction, Xu Jiaqi stood out as the most prominent and influential figure. She also had a reputation for being incredibly ruthless and merciless. Just her name alone would scare even the most vicious Immortals out there.","\"Xu Jiaqi?! The Celestial Goddess?!\" Grand Elder Du cried out loud.","\"No... we're doomed...\" Elder Hao fell to his knees with a despaired look on his face.","\"...\" Kelan understood their emotions very well. In the Celestial Overlords, there was nobody more fearsome than Xu Jiaqi, and her involvement was reserved only for the most significant of tasks.","\"Since we're going to die anyway, I might as well ask. Who was that young man? And what's his relationship with the Celestial Overlords? To make the Celestial Goddess come down to the Fourth Heaven, he must be very important to her...\" Du Daomi asked.","\"I don't know about his relationship with Celestial Overlord Xu, but he's a good friend of Senior Bai and also a General within the Celestial Overlords.\"","\"A General?! But he looked very young!\" Grand Elder Du exclaimed in disbelief.","\"That's just how talented he was.\" Kelan shook his head, his voice filled with disappointment.","Grand Elder Du swallowed nervously as he recalled Yuan effortlessly defeating him despite having a much lower cultivation. This sort of talent was almost unheard of. Unfortunately, Yuan had gone inside the rift, and the chances of him returning were pretty much zero, so he was essentially already dead.","Meanwhile, Xu Jiaqi was engaged in a conversation with the expert she had sought out with some difficulty.","\"Is there a way to bring back someone who entered an Infinite Beast Spawn Rift?\"","This expert, a tall, beautiful woman with brown hair, tanned skin, and green eyes, was surrounded by many powerful magical beasts as she spoke, \"You should already know the answer to that question, so why waste your time coming here to ask me?\"","Xu Jiaqi silently clenched her jaw and narrowed her eyes, fixing the woman with a cold, piercing glare."]},{"number":1600,"title":"Chapter 1600 Yuan’s Message","paragraphs":["The beasts surrounding the woman instantly sensed the threat in Xu Jiaqi's gaze toward their master and bared their teeth in a defensive warning display.","In response, Xu Jiaqi's body emitted killing intent.","\"I don't have the time to joke with you today, Huyao.\" Xu Jiaqi uttered the next moment in a cold voice.","Sensing her killing intent, the beasts began to howl and roar, their cries echoing with aggression.","Seeing this, the woman named Huyao sighed, \"Stop it, you idiots. You know I won't be able to avenge you guys if you fight her and perish, right?\"","\"...\"","The magical beasts immediately calmed down after hearing her words. Huyao continued a moment later, \"To answer your question—no, there's no way to bring back someone who'd entered such a rift. Why are you asking? Did someone you know enter a rift? It's been a long time since I have heard of someone entering one of those.\"","However, Xu Jiaqi didn't respond to her inquires and was even walking away.","\"Leaving already? What's the rush?\"","\"If you don't have any helpful insights, I have no reason to stay here any longer.\" Xu Jiaqi said.","Huyao showed a mysterious smile and said, \"Actually, now that I think about it, there might be a way.\"","Xu Jiaqi instantly halted her movement and turned around to look at Huyao, who continued speaking, \"If someone as powerful and as capable as you enters a rift, perhaps you might find a way to bring them back.\"","The atmosphere in the room suddenly changed drastically as an overwhelming pressure was exuded by Xu Jiaqi.","\"I thought I said I didn't come here to joke around?\" Xu Jiaqi stared daggers at Huyao.","\"That's none of your business.\"","\"You made it my business by coming to me for advice.\"","\"Who said I was joking? Most of the people that went to explore the rift were run-of-the-mill Immortals. If someone like you were to explore the rift, there's a good chance you might make it back.\" Huyao explained with a brave smile.","\"...\"","Xu Jiaqi remained silent, her expression contemplative, almost as if she were seriously considering the possibility presented to her.","Huyao's eyes widened at this, and she said, \"Don't tell me you're actually thinking about it. Now I am really interested in this individual you're trying to save.\"","\"That's none of your business.\"","\"You made it my business by coming to me for advice.\"","\"You think you're giving me advice? You've only given me nonsense.\"","Huyao shrugged and said, \"Then let me tell you this. Even if you were to enter the rift to rescue this individual, you'd need to find a rift to enter. A rift only remains open for a few moments before disappearing, so you'd need to find a new one, which is only possible by destroying Infinite Beast Spawns, which has a very low chance of spawning.\"","\"Once an Infinite Beast Spawn is destroyed, you will need to wait at least a decade before you get another chance, and the last time a rift opened up was several thousand years ago.\"","\"I have no intention of entering the rift, but thanks for nothing.\" Xu Jiaqi left shortly after.","\"Never easy to please that woman...\" Huyao shook her head with a smile.","A few days later, Xu Jiaqi arrived at the Endless Beast Den. However, given her prominent status, she discreetly made her way into the Fourth Heaven to avoid drawing unnecessary attention.","This time, the Sect Leaders of the Three Grand Sects made sure to pay attention to their surroundings and noticed Xu Jiaqi's arrival almost instantly.","\"Who are they?\" Xu Jiaqi pointed to those from the Three Grand Sects with her gaze.","Senior Bai gave her a quick explanation of their involvement.","After learning of the full situation, Xu Jiaqi's gaze remained on them for a few moments, her thoughts unknown.","The Sect Leaders were so nervous that none of them dared to utter a word without Xu Jiaqi's permission, and even their greeting was done in silence.","In the end, Xu Jiaqi decided to ignore them and asked Senior Bai, \"Any news on Yuan or the rift?\"","He shook his head and said, \"Unfortunately not. What about your end?\"","\"Nothing useful,\" she sighed.","\"So there's nothing we can do besides wait for Yuan to return by himself?\" Xi Meili asked.","\"...\"","Xu Jiaqi silently nodded.","Overwhelmed by emotion, Xi Meili's composure shattered, and she began to weep, releasing a torrent of tears she had restrained for more than a week.","Seeing this, the urge to go after Yuan grew stronger inside Xu Jiaqi's heart.","However, just as they pondered how to comfort Xi Meili, they noticed several individuals approaching them from a distance. Four individuals, to be precise.","\"Hm? Those ladies are...\" Senior Bai recognized them, as he'd seen them at the Myriad of Techniques before.","They were Meixiu, Chu Liuxiang, Li Jinxi, and Lan Yingying.","\"W-what are you guys doing here?\" Xi Meili wiped her tears and forced herself to stop crying to ask them.","\"Yuan told us to come here,\" Meixiu said.","\"What? Yuan? How...?\" Xi Meili wore a puzzled look on her face, as did everyone else there.","\"Um... let's just say I have a method to contact Yuan even when we're far away from each other. Anyway, he wanted me to tell you not to worry about him.\"","\"W-wait a minute. Let's slow down a little. Who are you guys? And where is Yuan now?\" Xu Jiaqi stepped forward and asked.","\"They're Yuan's friends. I have seen them with him at the Myriad of Techniques on several occasions.\" Senior Bai quickly explained.","Meixiu nodded and said, \"But who are you...? We were only expecting Xi Meili.\"","She logged out of Cultivation Online several days after Yuan wrote the note. After reading it, she gathered the others and rushed to the Endless Beast Den to explain the situation to Xi Meili. However, only Xi Meili was mentioned in Yuan's note, and they weren't acquainted with anyone else there.","\"This may be our first time meeting like this, but I have seen you guys before with Yuan at the Myriad of Techniques, which I own.\" Senior Bai said.","\"They're from his faction, and they came here after what happened to Yuan.\" Xi Meili further explained.","\"I see...\" \"Anyway, hurry up and tell us about Yuan. Is he okay? What's his situation like?\" Xu Jiaqi inquired in an impatient manner."]}]);
